{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation","id":54288,"title":"IC [Exalted 2.5] Forging a Nation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-20T16:06:05-08:00","id":54288,"title":"IC [Exalted 2.5] Forging a Nation","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">The Puissant Amethyst Court of Raksha has invaded the nation of Novalesk. Situated along the eastern bank of the Rock River, several dozen miles north of the rivers fork with its Lesser sibling, this tiny Nation was caught in the midst of a brewing Civil War by the Fae and their Wyld-tainted minions. Briefly unified by the invading forces, the tiny nation's entire military might recently sallied forth and secured a narrow victory over the Fae. It won\u2019t be long before the Fae regroup and counter-attack. To make matters worse rumors abound of Novalesk's neighbors mobilizing their own forces for a possible invasion, as well as reported sightings of deathly Anathema in the nearby forests.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Long story short, the fecal matter has hit the oscillating unit.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">We join our heroes in the walled town of Grey Ice. This town, the northern-most town of any size in Novalesk, is ruled nearly exclusively by the Ptreas clan. The Ptreas have kept themselves out of the current civil strife for the most part, choosing to declare for neither of the front-runners for the time being. You are here, however, because Sea recently received intelligence from her superiors, indicating that a long-quiet Freehold to the north has begun mobilizing its own forces. The Crimson Panoply's projections indicate that, should they ally with the Puissant Ameythsts, the Raksha will be able to overrun Novalesk and its neighbors with ease, converting the entire area to Border- and Middle-marches with little effort. Sea's mission is to ensure that this Freehold does not ally with the Puissant Amethyst Court at any cost.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">So, what will you do?</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T18:46:24-08:00","id":54387,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will turn to Tear watching her beautiful white hair flit in the sunlight and say &quot;Will our presence be more needed in Novalesk, or should we focus our efforts on the freehold in the north? If we succeed in bringing the freehold on the side of Novalesk, we can stop the influence of the Raksha from taking over. If we fail, we will be leaving Novalesk open for attack. Is it better to defend Novalesk or try to stop the carnage early? I personally do not want to see another big war; wars always have a terrible cost. I would prefer to persuade the freehold to help us, but I will leave this up to you.&quot;<br /> <br /> He the turns to Tirien and says, &quot;You have the gift of the tongue. I am sure your skills will come in handy. You could possibly even stop this war. I doubt the Raksha will listen, but will most likely be able to convince the freehold to join us. Perhaps even the influence of your house can be of use here.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will then grab a drink, settle down in his favorite red-cushioned chair, lean back in it, prop his feet on a table, and wait for the others to make a decision.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 01-20-2014, 09:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T02:08:57-08:00","id":54541,"title":"","content":"A pervasive irritation has marked the Sidereal's day so far. She seats uneasily at her table, scrutinizing the patterns of Essence that surround her as a form of relaxation exercise. She does not answer the question right away, instead staring at the table.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have been gifted with a great number of skills,&quot; she begins, &quot;unfortunately, warfare is not one of them. If they have sent me rather than a Shieldbearer, it means we must avoid open conflict at all cost. But keeping raksha from allying with raksha is a daunting task, at best.&quot; She pauses, thinking, then looks in the general direction of her temporary companions. The Lunar... Well, she has never worked with Lunars in the past. &quot;We should go to the freehold as diplomats, that much is obvious. The raksha prize art and beauty, even if it is in a rather predatory way. Staying in this city, we are only waiting for them to come to us.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;No, the decision is obvious. We should go to them as a delegation - speak, negociate, sway them to either neutrality or alliance. All else failing, eliminate their leadership and escape.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T07:42:53-08:00","id":54657,"title":"","content":"Tirien, who was enjoying her tea, chuckles at this. <br /> <br /> &quot;Please, we could easily destroy the Freehold. Fae that appear near Creation are little worry. It's the ones you find in the Deep Wyld that'll rip your arms off with licorice and then sing a tune about it that sets your hair on fire. That being said, I agree in part with your proposal, Tears. If we could speak to the Lord or Lady of this Freehold and gain them as an ally, or at least, make them swear an oath of non-interference, then we can focus on the external forces that plague this city. If we have them as allies, well, then all the better. Fae craftsmen never need to sleep or eat; an excellent addition if there was one.&quot; <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T09:10:53-08:00","id":54705,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will sit up and say &quot;Well now there is a thought... a sword that would create a song to set something on fire... that would be very interesting...&quot; &quot;I guess it is decided though. Off to the freehold we go! We should just get a few supplies before we head out.&quot;<br /> <br /> He will then stand up, shove his hands in his pockets, and stroll out the door walking towards the main market. Right after stepping out the door into the sunlight he will turn and say, &quot;Oh. One of you will need to come pay for this. I have nothing on me at the moment after all,&quot; and then keep walking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T11:21:54-08:00","id":54773,"title":"","content":"Hyuga, and whomever will go with him, makes the short walk from your lodgings towards the town's forum. Once you arrive, you see that business is hardly booming. With the exception of a few tinkers and smiths selling and repairing weapons, there seems to be little business. Few merchants are selling foodstuffs or other staple items. A garishly-dressed red-headed woman with a sign declaring herself a guild-accredited merchant is attempting to sell her wares (Talismans Guaranteed to protect against Wyld Sorcery!), and a dirty, emaciated man is claiming that the only way for the nation to be saved from the Fae is to climb the &quot;Mount of Perfection&quot;. Huh. <br /> <br /> Okay. What now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T11:40:29-08:00","id":54788,"title":"","content":"Hearing about the talisman that protects from Wyld Sorcery, Hyuga carefully fingers one of the talismans checking its penmanship and potency (evaluating goods; roll int + beau = 3 successes) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376350/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376350/</a><br /> <br /> After checking the value of the talisman he will turn to the seller and ask, &quot;Wow..can these guild made talismans really protect you from Wyld Sorcery? How?&quot; while watching carefully for any signs of misdirection and lies (reading intent; per + inv= 2 successes) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376354/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376354/</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T14:57:37-08:00","id":54932,"title":"","content":"Upon seeing Hyuga approach, the merchant gives you a soft smile and says, &quot;Take your time!&quot;<br /> <br /> The talismans are circular iron discs, roughly as wide across as your palm. Tight Old Realm script is etched into both sides. An off-center hole with a leather cord serves to hold the talisman. It is clearly a work of fine craftsmanship. Whether, or not it's actually a mystical talisman, however, is debatable.<br /> <br /> When queried on how it works, she places her index finder on her chin and furrows her brow. &quot;It's quite difficult to explain...&quot; she says, &quot;But I can guarantee you that they definitely work.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga is quite convinced that they do work, but an explanation of how would be far to time consuming to be helpful. <br /> <br /> Tirien and Sea can see this, if they went with Hyuga<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The script on the talisman is a rather blunt order in Old Realm, telling any Fae who read it to GTFO</div></div> </div> </div><br /> And Sea only, if she went with Hyuga<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The merchant is using some sort of Social attack charm on Hyuga</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T16:21:18-08:00","id":55017,"title":"","content":"Tirien sighs at Hyuga's gruff manner. She then turns to the others, and says, &quot;I'm not takign any chances. I'll settle things on my own accord, and with my own resources. I'll be making my own money, and if anyone is interested, they can come with me.&quot;<br /> <br /> She'll stride out of the inn, and into the wilderness outside of the city. She'll search for any large game animals, with a Wits+Survival roll of 6, with 1 success. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376723/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376723</a><br /> <br /> Do I find anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T16:51:31-08:00","id":55036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=55017#post55017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien sighs at Hyuga's gruff manner. She then turns to the others, and says, &quot;I'm not takign any chances. I'll settle things on my own accord, and with my own resources. I'll be making my own money, and if anyone is interested, they can come with me.&quot;<br /> <br /> She'll stride out of the inn, and into the wilderness outside of the city. She'll search for any large game animals, with a Wits+Survival roll of 6, with 1 success. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376723/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376723</a><br /> <br /> Do I find anything?</div> </div> </div> </div>You find a 14-point bull Elk, which looks sickly. It seems like it might shuffle off the mortal coil soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T17:14:12-08:00","id":55049,"title":"","content":"Tierien karate chops the elk, breaking its neck. She then prays to the god of Elks, and then sets about cleaning the kill, and smoking it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376776/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376776/</a> I roll 4 successes on my attack to kill the Elk.<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376779/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376779/</a> I roll 1 success on my prayer roll. <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376779/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4376779/</a> Assuming a Wits+Survival roll to smoke and cure the meat, I roll 4 successes. <br /> <br /> How do I fare?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T17:34:14-08:00","id":55062,"title":"","content":"The elk attempts to run, but collapses, exhausted. Your strike swiftly puts the animal out of its misery. Howe'er; without proper tools, you only manage to successfully cook and prepare about a tenth of the 300-some pound beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T18:08:02-08:00","id":55078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=55062#post55062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The elk attempts to run, but collapses, exhausted. Your strike swiftly puts the animal out of its misery. Howe'er; without proper tools, you only manage to successfully cook and prepare about a tenth of the 300-some pound beast.</div> </div> </div> </div>:OregonTrailproblems:<br /> <br /> Very well. I will now look for a variety of tubers and spices, with my Survival+Wits of 6. I roll 5, 10, 10, 9. (Sorry, Invisible Castle seems to be down at the moment.) What do I find?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T21:05:12-08:00","id":55197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=55078#post55078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">:OregonTrailproblems:<br /> <br /> Very well. I will now look for a variety of tubers and spices, with my Survival+Wits of 6. I roll 5, 10, 10, 9. (Sorry, Invisible Castle seems to be down at the moment.) What do I find?</div> </div> </div> </div>You manage to find a small patch of wild turnips some distance from an overgrown hedgerow, which you dig up without issue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T21:18:13-08:00","id":55213,"title":"","content":"If Sea comes to the market I will try to talk to her about these wonderful charms that will help us against Wyld sorcery. They would be useful if we are heading to the freehold. They look to be of good quality.<br /> <br /> If Sea does not come to the market with me, I will ask the merchant how much it will cost for two charms. I will then try to use my skills as a blacksmith to make money repairing wares or helping some blacksmithers refine their works. I will head to which ever shop looks to have some broken wares lined up to be fixed (if any). Otherwise, I will try to convince a smaller stall to hire me for a short while in making a weapon ( char + soc= 0 successes; if they do not accept... I will try at another stall) (char +soc= 2 successes) (Can't link it because the site is down. Used a different dice roller for now).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T02:34:39-08:00","id":55346,"title":"","content":"The Sidereal remains silent, playing the part of the blind as Hyuga talked with the merchant - with not even a frown when she sensed the magic. When adressed, she picks up one of the small talismans, scrutinizing it for traces of Essence before committing to any purchase - and, proceeding to do the same, gauging the measure of the merchant. What kind of Essence-user would peddle minor wards on a marketplace?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">IC is still down. Got 3 sux on the roll to analyze the talisman and the roll to gauge the merchant's Essence level.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T09:17:27-08:00","id":55498,"title":"","content":"Tirien collects the turnips, and bakes them in her fire. She rolls one success on her Int+Craft(Wood) roll, to do so, then begins the final point of her mission. She'll locate some straight sticks, and pare them of bark, making skewers.<br /> <br /> She rolls 2 successes to create her skewers, and after taking some time to bathe and clean herself from her excursions, returns to town<br /> <br /> Finding some youth, she'll offer them a day's wages to carry her goods, and then, after entering the marketplace, she begins her cunning plan. She attacks the magnitude in the market with the social attack of &quot;Hunger for Elk and Turnips&quot; using Terrifying Lust Infliction rolling Charisma+Performance alongside her maximum use of 1st Charisma Excellency to roll 10 dice. She rolls 6 successes.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fae got you down? Your wife making gruel for dinner again? Why not quench that hunger with some delicious Elk on a stick! Today only, we'll throw in a baked turnip with every purchase of Elk on a stick, for FREE! Elk on a stick; It may not be Ambrosia, but it's pretty darn close!&quot; she says to her prospective clientele.<br /> <br /> How do I fare?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-22-2014, 12:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T10:26:25-08:00","id":55540,"title":"","content":"*Oh Lord, the currency tables in the Core are so convoluted. Plus, after doing the math, the dinar (lowest silver standard unit) is approximately equal to a Koku which is &quot;about equal to a month's wages for a peasant&quot;, and is the start-up cost for a small apple orchard. Which means it probably won't be in general circulation among the working classes. Arrrg.*<br /> <br /> The merchant smiles at Hyuga and states that the talismans cost a half-sestertius each, making them about equal in value to a day's labor for an unskilled worker. <br /> <br /> As far as Sea can tell, the talisman itself is not magic. The script on it, however, appears to have some sort of magical effect. A persistent charm, perhaps? You can't make out any other details at this time. The merchant herself, has roughly the same level of magical prowess as Sea (Essence 3). Her essence is Solar-Aspected, but whether she's a Solar, a Half-caste, a low-level Solar deity or a mortal whose essence was enlightened from a solar aspected source is indeterminable at the moment. <br /> <br /> Tirien's display brings some liveliness to the market, increasing trading all-round as passersby are drawn in. The guild merchant with whom Sea and Hyuga had been interacting sells several of her Talismans. Tirien quickly runs out of her wares, making a handful of sestertii after paying her hired help. It is not long before the market resembles a normal, if somewhat slow, day of trading.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T11:27:28-08:00","id":55578,"title":"","content":"Tirien will then use the money she earned to buy some tools; a skinning knife, a grill, and the materials to create a proper smokehouse. Would my handful of coins be able to do so?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T12:30:41-08:00","id":55611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=55578#post55578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien will then use the money she earned to buy some tools; a skinning knife, a grill, and the materials to create a proper smokehouse. Would my handful of coins be able to do so?</div> </div> </div> </div>You're able to purchase a small cart with a wood-fire grill (think glorified Hot-dog cart, and you'll be on the right track), and a collection of assorted cooking implements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T12:59:02-08:00","id":55630,"title":"","content":"Hyuga mumbles to himself, &quot;Taking two days to get enough for these charms seems like madness. Perhaps finding some steel and creating a nice sword or making a bow would be easier. That would make more than enough to pay for them then.&quot; He will then turn to Sea, and say, &quot;Can you help me find some steel or ore somewhere? Tools won't be needed to make it, but there is a lack of components. The money would be split of course. While we are at it, we can go get food to eat.&quot; <br /> <br /> Hyuga will head out into the woods to hunt and look for components for the sword. (wits + survival= 1 success for hunting for food) (per + awa= 5 successes (woo!) looking for materials; wood for carving, plants to make twine, steel deposits, etc.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T15:10:36-08:00","id":55730,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CitanHyuga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=55630#post55630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hyuga mumbles to himself, &quot;Taking two days to get enough for these charms seems like madness. Perhaps finding some steel and creating a nice sword or making a bow would be easier. That would make more than enough to pay for them then.&quot; He will then turn to Sea, and say, &quot;Can you help me find some steel or ore somewhere? Tools won't be needed to make it, but there is a lack of components. The money would be split of course. While we are at it, we can go get food to eat.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will head out into the woods to hunt and look for components for the sword. (wits + survival= 1 success for hunting for food) (per + awa= 5 successes (woo!) looking for materials; wood for carving, plants to make twine, steel deposits, etc.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Hyuga finds an old, burned-down building not far from the city's walls. It appears to have once been a small farmstead. In the dilapidated barn, you find a small collection of bronze farm tools. You could make several blades from their metal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T15:45:56-08:00","id":55755,"title":"","content":"After breaking down the bronze tools and salvaging the bronze, Hyuga will use his 1st Craft excellency (7 dice) and Craftsman Needs No Tools;(This costs 1wp and 14 personal motes). He carefully feels each portion of bronze, taps all around to listen to the quality of the bars, and continues hammering quickly and powerfully along the length of the bronze until it starts to resemble the shape of a sword. His hands seem to be a blur as he moves 12x quicker than most artisans. (I am assuming this is a resources 2 bronze sword). In a scant few hours (about 4 if it takes two days normally) he holds up a completed blade (craft[fire] + dex+bonuses= 18 dice; =10 successes+2 auto successes (from peerless paragon of fire)) Hyuga will test the sword's balance and sharpness. Once again, he has created a truly exceptional sword (over 5 threshold successes) worth at least resources 3.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T16:39:39-08:00","id":55795,"title":"","content":"The Joybringer simply stares, slightly baffled, as her companions start to spread everywhere and do menial work for... money? <br /> <br /> &quot;...but I have more than enough to buy the entire stand, talismans included...&quot; she mumbles quietly. Well, if it makes them feel better. &quot;Nah, I'll just stay here. I have things of my own to do.&quot;<br /> <br /> Now that she has the opportunity to be alone with the merchant for a bit, she turns towards her, curious. &quot;So, tell me. How did you lean to handle written magic? I can perceive your Essence. You are no mortal. Are you a god-blooded profiter, come to make some money off those poor people as they prepare for a fae invasion? I've seen that kind of people before. I don't appreciate them much.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T17:09:21-08:00","id":55822,"title":"","content":"The blade Hyuga crafts is truly an exceptional blade, well balance, and with an edge a razor would envy. Now, to find a buyer....<br /> <br /> The merchant laughs and beckons you into her wagon. Once out of sight, she grins, &quot;Pretty perceptive for a blind gal. I'm not a god-blood, though. I'm one of those pesky Anathema. A Deceiver, I think I'm called.&quot; At that, an Eclipse caste mark flares on her brow. <br /> <br /> She drops into a low chair, and looking pensive, places her index finger in her chin, &quot;And that's how I did the written magic. It's not really all that much, just a one-shot effect. Might make a Fae leave, might not. They're pretty stubborn for people who're supposed to be made out of the Wyld. Thing is, its the iron that's important. It'll ward off most of their Wyld Magic. But some people, even out here, don't believe that. Superstitious bunk, they say.&quot; She snorts &quot;Morons. So I make these little discs, write a little charm on them, and a few people are a little safer than they would be. Sure I make a tidy profit, but do you think that anyone around her would think they were any good if I went around giving them away for free?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T17:22:38-08:00","id":55833,"title":"","content":"@Omicron:<br /> <img src=\"http://s10.postimg.org/kcpff8xex/Guild_Lyfe.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Guild Lyfe, represent.<br /> <br /> Anyways, jabs at Sidereals aside, Tirien will begin her search for new foodstuffs anew. She'll take the remnants of her earnings, if any, left over, and offer the youth from before a job assisting with her cooking. <br /> <br /> She'll roll Wits+Survival to locate anything good. She rolls 2 successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T17:45:40-08:00","id":55848,"title":"","content":"I can neither confirm nor deny that this character was inspired by <a href=\"http://fireemblem.wikia.com/wiki/Anna\" target=\"_blank\">Anna</a> from Fire Emblem. <br /> <br /> Yeah, you don't find anything. Sorry. <br /> <br /> @Solar and Lunar entrepreneurs; this is rapidly approaching &quot;needing additional In-Game days to continue&quot; territory. Just so you know. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T17:50:49-08:00","id":55850,"title":"","content":"Very well. Tirien will retire for the day. She'll some reputable inn and make lodgings for the night, along with her new employee. After all, a Patrician in the Threshold needs to care for their underlings, correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T03:39:30-08:00","id":56030,"title":"","content":"Sea refrains the impulse to yell at the girl to hide that mark - she is not supposed to be able to see it, after all - and simply... Stares... Baffled... In that weid look of hers, where she is not quite looking at you but still in your general direction.<br /> <br /> &quot;Girl, you're insane. Why would you go and say that to a stranger? I mean sure, I'm blind - and that gave me gifts of perception others might not have - but I am far from the only one who could figure this out. You are too... Too...&quot; She groans. &quot;Trusting. Fortunately for you, I'm here to help. But do me a favor, will you? Don't go around advertising your exact nature to anyone who just has an inkling you might be an Essence-user. Pretend you're a god-blood or something.&quot;<br /> <br /> Gods, she can already feel the incoming headache. Too many wild cards to handle at once. <br /> <br /> &quot;But for your information, the proper title is &quot;Eclipse Caste,&quot; in case you'd rather not call yourself Deceiver all the time. And you're... Exactly the kind of person I need, yes.&quot; She rests her chin on her hand, thinking. &quot;Where do you come from, and do you have any plans? I could be of great help in ensuring your survival, if you would lend me a few service in preventing this region from being swallowed by the Wyld.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T10:33:27-08:00","id":56222,"title":"","content":"&quot;Not quite trusting,&quot; the Eclipse says, &quot;Calculating. This far away from the Realm? People are much more pragmatic about this sort of thing. They see an Anathema and think 'Can I get it to help me? If so, how? Is it likely to destroy my town? If so, how can I get it out and aim it towards something I want gone?' You seemed like the former. Reminded me of some 'Illumination' people I ran into a couple of months ago.&quot;<br /> <br /> The young solar affects a satisfied half-smile, &quot;And, guess what, I was right. You want something out of me. And you might be of help to me, too.&quot; <br /> <br /> She leans back, and small knife appears in her hand. She begins cleaning her nails with it, as she continues, &quot;The name's Sky Orchid. I'm a guild gal, born 'n' raised. As for my plans,&quot; she places a finger on her chin, &quot;I've got a shipment of iron spearheads waiting for me at Gunzota. Other than that... I've got some leads, but nothing specific right now. What is it you want my help with?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T15:08:24-08:00","id":56374,"title":"","content":"&quot;I do not know how much you know about yourself. Your use of Immaculate propaganda terms suggest not as much as you should, so let me say this: your Caste is blessed by ancient pacts made in the courts of spirits and the Wyld, and in the realms of the dead. You enjoy a form of... diplomatic immunity. I have gathered a group of like-minded companions who would like to save this country from the raksha; we intend to head to the nearest northern freehold, and attempt to convince them to ally with us, or failing this, to remain neutral when the Amethyst Court attacks.&quot;<br /> <br /> Sea's mind is racing as she speaks. If this Solar has already made contact - however briefly - with the Cult of the Illuminated, she might be able to obtain information from her; in any case, it suggests she is friendly enough to not have garnered hostility from her Gold Faction allies. Sadly, she is also a member of the Guild, which is a much less positive note, though she can at least be trusted to seek her own profit.<br /> <br /> &quot;The bottom line is: if you come with us to the northern freehold, your oaths of protection would be invaluable for us, guaranteeing that the Fair Folk do not attack if the negociations fail. I don't ask much - that you be here, mostly. However, if you would be so inclined to also help us in the negociation process itself, I would be more than thankful.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T15:53:20-08:00","id":56400,"title":"","content":"(Meanwhile, Tirien is teaching her charge the basics of Gateway...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T16:50:30-08:00","id":56426,"title":"","content":"&quot;That explains why all those elementals were so polite,&quot; Orchid murmurs. She perks up, &quot;Very well. I'll help you with your negotiations. In return, you and your companions owe me a single favor to be called in the future. You retain the right to refuse a request. Are these acceptable terms?&quot; <br /> <br /> With that she sticks out her hand, the caste mark on her brow twinkling. Orchid may not know much about what she is, but she understands her powers well enough. <br /> <br /> Will you take her deal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T17:52:43-08:00","id":56475,"title":"","content":"After thoroughly testing the blade, he will take it and a couple of wood blocks back to the market. If there are still people around and vendors, he will try to show off the superior quality of the blade. First, he will steady it on his finger to show the supreme balance, cut through the wood blocks ((3x)str+melee= 3, 4, and 2 successes), and then spin it through the air and around showing its light weight and balance (dex + melee = 1 success). He will also show off the wonderful designs on the hilt. <br /> <br /> He will continually try to convince people to buy this fine blade (whether they be a vendor or townsperson) (char + soc + 1 die stunt?= 1 success + 1 success).<br /> <br /> If no one is really at the market still, he will head back to the inn with it in tow and try to find Tirien and Sea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T18:49:08-08:00","id":56509,"title":"","content":"Sea stares at the hand like it's going to bite her, a look of worry on her face. Then, finally, she shrugs and shakes it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah, all right, I'll take that deal.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T18:59:45-08:00","id":56517,"title":"","content":"Hyuga finds the market nearly empty, as dusk is quickly approaching. He makes no sale.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FFD700\">Then Let It Be So</span>&quot; Orchid says, shaking Sea's hand, &quot;Now you should go prepare for our journey. I have to send a message to my associates to bring my shipment up themselves, and take care of a few other business matters. You and your companions will meet me here in the morning, yes?&quot;<br /> <br /> So, do y'all want to talk about the days events IC, or just move on to your adventure?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T19:02:22-08:00","id":56520,"title":"","content":"(Tirien is already disposed, although I suppose one can rouse her from her game.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T19:08:59-08:00","id":56524,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga will want to show off the excellent blade he made and probably talk to them a bit about what we are doing tomorrow (after selling his sword and buying the charms he assumes).)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T20:56:56-08:00","id":56562,"title":"","content":"(I'd skip to next, but I can do either.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T21:26:14-08:00","id":56572,"title":"","content":"After not receiving enough attention, Hyuga promptly gets ready to go sleep. (I'm fine skipping.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T10:25:44-08:00","id":56861,"title":"","content":"(Okay, moving on then.)<br /> <br /> Y'all meet Orchid at the market, and y'all leave town in her wagon around mid-morning. Your first day's journey is ... [rolls] ... uneventful. That evening, however, as you set up camp in a glade, a half-dozen horribly mutated barbarians swing from the trees and attack!<br /> <br /> Roll join battle, peeps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-24-2014, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T12:06:52-08:00","id":56915,"title":"","content":"Tirien sighs and readies herself. She rolls 2 successes, and then activates Claws of the Silver Moon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377079/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377079/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377079/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377079/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> (Oh, yeah, IC is back)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T12:52:10-08:00","id":56950,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh come <i>on</i>.&quot; They didn't even get time to, like, discuss. Tell campfire stories so she could do her Joybringer job and bound their little group through careful socializing. <br /> <br /> &quot;Well, Hyuga, I guess it's too bad you didn't keep that shiny sword of yours, uh?&quot; She adds as she pulls out her starmetal fans with a whirling motion, arms flowing gracefully like the Crane's wings. &quot;Barbarians. This close to the Scavenger Lands. I do not like this at all.&quot;<br /> <br /> (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377122/\" target=\"_blank\">1 sux</a>, first action will be activating Crane Form.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T16:21:58-08:00","id":57059,"title":"","content":"&quot;I've got my wavecleaver. The one I made is a sword for a mortal. This will do me better Sea.&quot; Hyuga will finger the hilt and swiftly pull it out as the barbarians swing in (join battle: 4 successes-- <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377341/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377341/</a> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T16:52:16-08:00","id":57073,"title":"","content":"Orchid summons up a slender daiklaive from somewhere, and adroitly dodges a barbarian's attack.<br /> <br /> The two of the barbarians attack Hyuga, jabbing with spears. He is barely able to draw his daiklaive in time to parry the attacks.<br /> <br /> Two of the barbarians attack Tirien, but they fail to connect as well.<br /> <br /> The last barbarian strikes at Sea; their face(?) shows shock as Sea easily parries its clumsy spear-strike.<br /> <br /> Okay, Hyuga goes, then Tirien, then sea and Orchid act simultaneously.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-24-2014, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T17:50:46-08:00","id":57107,"title":"","content":"After Hyuga's blade flashes out from its sheath and deftly swipes along side the two spears knocking them away, he will run his sword along the length of their spear, do a backflip off the wagon while spinning in the air (attacking both barbarians one time each. (attack +1 die stunt?= 5 suc +0 suc; for first <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377387/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377387/</a> 2nd: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377388/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377388/</a> = 9 suc +0 suc)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T18:17:22-08:00","id":57124,"title":"","content":"Hyuga's blade hacks through both barbarians with contemptuous ease, decapitating the first and bisecting the chest of the second. <br /> <br /> It is now Tirien's go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T22:59:43-08:00","id":57268,"title":"","content":"Tirien leaps up to deliver a sweeping jump kick, first catching the nearby ruins of a cottage wall to steady herself before delivering her attack. She rolls 5 successes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377603/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377603/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377603/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377603/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":".  ST IS A MEANY HEAD AND WON'T LET ME BRING IN HOUSES TO THE SCENE./joke 01-25-2014, 02:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T02:58:22-08:00","id":57327,"title":"","content":"Sea's first fan unfolds to watch the barbarian's spear, gently deflecting it as the Sidereal herself steps forward, whirls behind him, and the flat of her second fan meets the barbarian's back with enough strength to smash him into a nearby tree. The flowing sleeves of her own obscuring her movements to the last two baffled assaillants, she leaps on top of one's sword and smacks him over the head, then hops down in front of the last one - and smiles as Tirien hits him from behind; closing her right-hand fan, she simply thrusts it at his chest as her ally sends him reeling.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Flurry of three attacks, spending 1, 2 and 3 motes on the first Excellency respectively. Due to World-Shaping Artistic Vision I can trade stunt dice for target number reduction, and Crane Form doubles stunt dice. Assuming these three qualify as 2-die stunts, that's TN 4 on all attacks + 1 die leftover.<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377705/\" target=\"_blank\"><u>9</u> sux</a>, <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377707/\" target=\"_blank\">12 sux</a>, <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377708/\" target=\"_blank\">15 sux.</a><br /> Base damage is 12B, cannot roll over into lethal. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T11:09:55-08:00","id":57525,"title":"","content":"*Omicron- For future reference, when using TN reducers: I'll allow you to reduce your TN to 3, getting an Auspicious Success, with any TN reducer.*<br /> <br /> Sea's delicate seeming attacks send the barbarian's reeling, cracking bones. Tirien's charm-enhanced attack, however, catches her target in the back, carving a large furrow in their flesh. Orchid delivers a brutal flurry of backhanded slashes with her blade, gutting and then decapitating her opponent. <br /> <br /> Four of the barbarians are dead. The other two are unconscious, victims of Sea's nonlethal (albeit painful) attacks. <br /> <br /> I seriously have no idea why I thought these guys might be able to do any damage. Huh.<br /> <br /> Well, what will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T11:20:43-08:00","id":57529,"title":"","content":"Sea sighs satisfactorily as she drops her fighting stance. &quot;Well, that was a bit of a work-out.&quot; She doesn't say it, but she's happy with her companions' performance. They'll have her back in a fight.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now we wake one of the two live ones up, and ask where they came from. It's possible they answer to the Fair Folk and could gave us useful information.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T11:24:20-08:00","id":57533,"title":"","content":"Directly after Hyuga lands and sees the rest of the barbarians taken care of, he will say &quot;I wonder what they are doing on this road. At least they were easy to take care of.&quot; Hyuga will then sheath his sword and will try to investigate where these barbarians came from, why they attacked, and who they might be working for. (2 suc <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377959/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377959/</a>). (Also I forgot to roll conviction when I went to sleep so I rolled conviction now if you allow it : <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377961/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4377961/</a> 1 suc filling my WP)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T11:38:06-08:00","id":57544,"title":"","content":"*I just remembered that languages are kind of important in this game. Luckily, the entire Circle (and Orchid) knows Riverspeak, so unless otherwise stated, I'll assume that inter-party communication is handled in that language*<br /> <br /> Sea rouses one of her victims (the one with the cracked skull rather than the broken spine), after the barbarian was bound by Orchid. The barbarian is somewhat dazed and addled. &quot;Whazzat going on? Where is I?&quot; he asks is slurred Forest-tongue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T12:07:52-08:00","id":57559,"title":"","content":"Sea crouches next to the man, idly waving a fan in front of her face. &quot;You and your friends attacked us. We beat you. Now I wish to know why. Who do you answer to? How did you know we would be here? Answer, and you might be let go.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T12:27:48-08:00","id":57569,"title":"","content":"The barbarian blinks and groans in pain. &quot;Is warrior of Blazing Boar tribe,&quot; he says, &quot;servant of Shah of pursent amthirst. Didn't know would be here. Hunting. Foraging. Saw trail, saw camp. Only four people, no warriors. And have wagon, horses. Attacked, like chief would wanted.&quot; He groans again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T15:07:37-08:00","id":57672,"title":"","content":"Sea relays the information to any who would not speak Foresttongue. &quot;So, servants of the Court here already? That's no good. Who's that &quot;Shah&quot;?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T15:24:21-08:00","id":57680,"title":"","content":"&quot;Is a mighty lady,&quot; the barbarian says, &quot;protected tribe in the days of my fathers-fathers-fathers-father. Protected us from moon-beasts and moon-beast's beast-children. Lead us into new land. Strange land. There we grow strong. Lady says it was time to get new land. So we go. With other tribes too, servants of Shah's servants. Blazing Boar is servant of Shah and Shah alone.&quot; he seems to hold this as a point of pride, as if his tribe is his mistress' chosen people. &quot;Brought Shah's servants and Shah's beasts, Shah's servant's beasts, and Shah's moon-beast, too.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T20:09:11-08:00","id":57850,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think we should go see this Shah. I don't like the sound of this &quot;Moon-beast&quot; business,&quot; Tirien says testily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T03:44:18-08:00","id":58011,"title":"","content":"&quot;Right. The last thing we want is a Lunar who swallowed the rethoric of their craziest elders and went all barbarian. No offense.&quot; She taps her chin with her folded fan. &quot;On the other hand, it's a delay on our way to the northern freehold; by the time we reach the Puissan Amethyst, the freehold might have made the wrong choice. Tell me, barbarian, how far is this Shah?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T11:37:46-08:00","id":58206,"title":"","content":"The barbarian shrugs. Either he doesn't know, or he isn't going to tell. Both outcomes are likely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T13:02:42-08:00","id":58263,"title":"","content":"&quot;Listen to me,&quot; she says with that odd not-quite-staring expression, thrusting the fan at his chest to weigh on her words. &quot;Three of your friends are dead. One is broken. You are wounded. You are going to walk home alone, to tell of your abject failure in attacking a bunch of random, unarmed strangers. Maidens' sake, one of them was <i>blind!</i> And then you talked to these strangers, told them things you shouldn't have. You will live in shame, and then you will die miserable in some random battle or at the displeasure of your mistress. I can offer you something different. Tell us where Shah is, and anything else we find useful, and you can abandon your ways, go to the city, live a life of safety and health. I will give you names which will allow this. Which will make people care for you. You have a chance at something different. Seize it now. Or die a nobody.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Charisma+Presence roll, enhanced with the First and Fateful Excellencies (thanks to Heart-Brightening Presentation Style), and the Gem of the Courtesan's Calculations. 7m, 1wp for an Auspicious success: 14 sux, plus one per stunt die (please tell me what stunt this is worth; I can tell for combat stunt but social stunts I have more trouble). </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":67,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","user":"Omicron","date":". 01-26-2014, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T13:42:13-08:00","id":58290,"title":"","content":"Hyuga turns to Sea and says, &quot;Perhaps we can use him to bring this &quot;moon-child&quot; to us. We can leave him with information of the freehold we are going to. We can still reach our objective and investigate this &quot;moon-child&quot; possibly at the same time. We also have their name. I'm sure we can get around to it.&quot; (He doesn't know what you said to the barbarian) He will then turn to Tirien and say, &quot;Would that suffice for now? Bringing the possible problem to us might not hurt. Maybe it could even cause chaos in the freehold and hold them from making the alliance.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T14:30:08-08:00","id":58310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=58263#post58263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Listen to me,&quot; she says with that odd not-quite-staring expression, thrusting the fan at his chest to weigh on her words. &quot;Three of your friends are dead. One is broken. You are wounded. You are going to walk home alone, to tell of your abject failure in attacking a bunch of random, unarmed strangers. Maidens' sake, one of them was <i>blind!</i> And then you talked to these strangers, told them things you shouldn't have. You will live in shame, and then you will die miserable in some random battle or at the displeasure of your mistress. I can offer you something different. Tell us where Shah is, and anything else we find useful, and you can abandon your ways, go to the city, live a life of safety and health. I will give you names which will allow this. Which will make people care for you. You have a chance at something different. Seize it now. Or die a nobody.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Charisma+Presence roll, enhanced with the First and Fateful Excellencies (thanks to Heart-Brightening Presentation Style), and the Gem of the Courtesan's Calculations. 7m, 1wp for an Auspicious success: 14 sux, plus one per stunt die (please tell me what stunt this is worth; I can tell for combat stunt but social stunts I have more trouble). </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>*Lets see: Appealing to circumstances and logic. Appealing to emotions. Offering a carrot to go with the cudgel. I'd say that it's fairly solid 3-die stunt.*<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't know where Shah is,&quot; the barbarian shouts. He sounds like a child pleading to their parent, trying to get out of punishment. &quot;Been gone from tribe for six-and-ten days. Went with <br /> one of Shah's servants to strange place there,&quot; he points in a general northerly direction. &quot;Shah's servant say we not wanted in strange place, so we leave. Hunt. Forage. wait for Shah's servant to come back. Don't know anything else!&quot; <br /> <br /> He's crying at the end. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T15:22:29-08:00","id":58352,"title":"","content":"Well, that was fairly useless. Sea sighed. &quot;All right, Hyuga, Tirian, do you two feel like going to look for this &quot;strange place?&quot; Might be a demesne or Manse or other place of interest we would not want the Fair Folk to get a hold of. Or we could keep our route to the freehold and worry about that later. Either way I don't think sending this one to Shah is the best course of action..&quot; They might not want to give them time to prepare for the arrival of a group of Exalted. <br /> <br /> Then, she helps the barbarian stand up, patting him on the back reassuringly and giving him some advice. She'll give him her official name, that of a few minor contacts in Novalesk, and lays a minor Charm on him through the Presence in Absence Technique to keep him from being rejected first-hand for his freakish appearance. Then, she goes to get his unconscious companion up, checking he's not permanently crippled, and will send them off. Hopefully it'll be enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T19:00:16-08:00","id":58467,"title":"","content":"The second barbarian is permanently crippled. Without the aid of magical healing, he will never be able to walk unsupported again. He will be be able to walk, however, and he hobbles off to the south with his comrade. <br /> <br /> Orchid enters her contemplative pose as she says, &quot;Maybe the strange place is referring to the Freehold? I mean, that the barbarians weren't welcome implies that there's inhabitants of some sort. I'd wager a silver talent that the servant he was talking about was some sort of envoy whose trying to get the Fae on their side.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T10:30:32-08:00","id":58853,"title":"","content":"Tirien says, &quot;I make a point of not gambling with money lenders. No wager. However, I am interested in what this &quot;Strange place&quot; is.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T11:32:46-08:00","id":58939,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, if that &quot;strange place&quot; is important and if it might be the freehold we're looking for anyway... Yeah, we'll go in that direction. Tomorrow. We stopped to rest, didn't we? I suggest we bury those corpses so they don't rise as hungry ghosts, then move a bit further to make our camp. Tomorrow we live for the north.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T11:59:42-08:00","id":58969,"title":"","content":"Hyuga stops and says, &quot;Well then we can continue on to the freehold as I was saying... and it seems as if the trouble will find us right away. Maybe it was a bit better to send them somewhere else....&quot; He will then start to craft a make-shirt shovel from some small metal instruments, vines, and some wood. (Craft wood + dex= 1 suc <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4381572/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4381572/</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T12:32:16-08:00","id":59008,"title":"","content":"Orshid glances at Hyuga, making his shovel, and pulls a spade out of her wagon, chuckling to herself. It takes some time, but you are able to dig graves for the barbarians while Orchid moves camp to a smaller clearing to the north. <br /> <br /> The next morning, after Orchid makes a small votive offering to Mercury, you set out towards the north. Your journey is... relatively uneventful. Nothing of particular note happens that day, though you notice that Orchid is definitely using Ride charms to increase your movement speed. In the late afternoon of the next day, you come upon a strange ... city of impossible geometries. From the outside the city looks to have a perfectly circular wall, roughly a half mile in diameter. Looking above it, there are way too many towers and spires in there to actually fit. Plus, the trench surrounding the city looks to be infinite in depth, as there's no sign that it has a bottom. When you attempt to cross the sole bridge, a bolt of lightning cracks down from the cloudless skies. A figure, bedecked in glimmering armor, a plethora of strange weapons, and a floppy red hat appears before you. They unsheathe one of their blades and shouts, &quot;What business have you in the dockyard, erg, desk, erg, Domain of Esstrayan, kevin?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T14:39:59-08:00","id":59152,"title":"","content":"&quot;That is so, Fae.....You are a Fae, right? Would you take us to your master? Or will we have to <i>make</i> you do so?&quot; Tirien asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T16:39:57-08:00","id":59264,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am Ba Rai, Master of Song and Steel,&quot; the Fae says, sheathing their blade, &quot;Lord, erm, Lady Esstrayan welcomes the children of the gods, provided you oath to uphold ..&quot; <br /> <br /> The Fae cuts off when its eyes fall on Orchid, &quot;Oh, sun-child envoy. Very well, I shall take you to my Lord erg, Lady, kevin.&quot;<br /> <br /> You follow the Fae into the city. It's streets are as strange as the towers above, with buildings and stones of gossamer and unearthly metal. Everywhere you look, the city's psychedelic inhabitants are moving and working; however, as far as you can see they are all currently engrossed in the industry of War. Ba Rai leads you to a large hall, and sees to the tending of your transportation. Ba Rai then pushes open the doors to the hall. <br /> <br /> A petite green-skinned man in an ornate dress is involved in a heated debate with what appears to be a living Tiki. Seeing you enter the hall, the green skinned man waves the Tiki off, and it storms out, smoldering (both literally and figuratively). As you approach the green-skined man says, &quot;Ah, Ba Rai, well done, old girl! You brought guests, just when our cousin was beginning to bore me. My guests, I am Lady Esstrayan, master of this Freehold. What Story has brought you here?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T16:58:07-08:00","id":59280,"title":"","content":"Hyuga seems to be a bit taken aback, but he quickly says &quot;These lad- erm &quot;men&quot; and I were looking to talk about the Puissant Amethyst Court of Raksha and Novalesk's situation.&quot; (Hyuga will get have a big grin after calling them men.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T17:22:35-08:00","id":59298,"title":"","content":"Sea scowls at Hyuga. What kind of silly joke is that? She shakes her head disapprovingly, and steps forward, bowing deeply.<br /> <br /> &quot;Lady Esstrayan. As you can see, the incidents of life have seen fit to deprive me of the ability to fully enjoy the wondrous sight of a city such as yours; nonetheless I hear its song, and I feel its pavement under my feet, and I smell its life; and I dare say, in front of this city Heaven itself would pale.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's a lie and they both know it, but the point is not deceit, the point is to be a polite host, and offer superlative flattering, as one is expected to do. <br /> <br /> &quot;The Story which brought us here is one of trepidation and hope. We have come on behalf of Novalesk, to extend the hand of friendship. Long have the Beautiful Ones and mortals known tensions between each other, and we want to resolve them once and for all; hard times are ahead of us all, and in unity we would find strength. For these are dark times, and darkening still; who knows what lies behind the corners of tomorrow? My lady, I am Sea of Tears, and this is Hyuga, and this is Tirien, and this is Orchid. We claim no title, save that of peaceful envoys.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T17:35:03-08:00","id":59310,"title":"","content":"Tirien frowns. Men dressing as women? Clearly this Fae is ignorant of the truth of things. Men act as men and women as women. Surely, the Empress wouldn't lie to her and her family, right?<br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed. Greetings, Lady Fae. I am Ledaal Tirien, envoy. I am pleased to make your acquaintance,&quot; she says, performing the best courtly curtsy she can muster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T18:12:30-08:00","id":59347,"title":"","content":"Esstrayan laughs, &quot;Your friend, he makes a wonderful joke!&quot; and then makes a polite nod to each member of the Circle as they are introduced. <br /> <br /> In response to Sea, Lady Esstrayan says, &quot;Oh, I'm certain the splendors of the Celestial City make my humble home seem but a hovel by comparison. Though never before have I been host to such a fine creature. It is as if the Maiden of Peace walked through my gates herself.&quot;<br /> <br /> As you say, it's a lie and everyone knows it, but Esstrayan is clearly enjoying the game. <br /> <br /> &quot;I know well of the troubles outside our borders. This nation of Novalesk wars with my cousins, who seek a return to the Crusade of dear old Balor. They seek to draw me into it, not remembering that I was here when the sun-children ruled these lands,&quot; Esstrayan flashes with anger for a moment, waving in the path the departed Tiki went, &quot;they threatened me with war lest I join them. They bribe, and whine and beg and threaten. Bah.&quot;<br /> <br /> Esstrayan calms down a bit, and says, &quot;as much as I loathe them, they offer something I do desire. An end to boredom. Ancient pacts with the sun-children bind me here. The have no weight anymore, but what I allow them to have. But my boredom is not sufficient cause to change my Story, no? But if I were answering the call of my troubled kin. That would be cause sufficient.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So, I help them,&quot; Esstrayan continues with a flit of his hand, &quot;I do something I do not wish to, but I get something I want. If I sit idle, I do not do something I dislike, but I get nothing. The best course of action is to get something you want by doing something you like, yes?&quot;<br /> <br /> The subtext is clear. You want Esstrayan to help, you're going to have to give him a reason to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T18:26:44-08:00","id":59359,"title":"","content":"Tirien remembered what her mentor told her about Fae politics, and how their factionalism is largely predicated on their desires to feed coinciding with their hobbies. This band of Fae, if they did come from the Age of Dreams, they probably are older and more dangerous than the Fae from before. <br /> <br /> &quot;There is a way around this,&quot;Tirien begins, &quot; You can fight for us. That way you retain your oaths to the Solars, and you also gain a measure of entertainment.&quot;<br /> <br /> She then claps Hyuga on the shoulder, &quot;Mr. Joker here is a Solar. If you uphold your oaths, and swear fealty to him, then we could offer you the emotions of Novalesk, the lifeblood your kind so enjoys, in exchange. However, you must swear to not ravish any people or devour any souls. Is that acceptable?&quot;<br /> <br /> While saying this, Tirien rolls 5 successes to convince the Fae &quot;Lady&quot; of her idea.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4382040/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4382040/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4382040/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4382040/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T21:30:42-08:00","id":59475,"title":"","content":"Esstrayan seems positively livid, &quot;Do you think that I would allow myself to be trapped in the irons of fealty to a sun-child once more? Alliance. Partnership. Treaty. Those are the best you can hope for creation-born.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T21:48:55-08:00","id":59487,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will say, &quot;It is clear you do not like my kind. What did you have in mind for a win-win situation? I cannot offer you full freedom, but many things can be done for you. What is it you wish for? I could help you create an artifacts that will make your boredom go away for more than just a short while. Just name it and I am sure I can find a way soon enough. As you well know, the sun-children poses a great amount of power. Would you not want a possible favor from one such as myself? I do not wish to become foes either. I can do so much more than cure your TEMPORARY boredom unlike the Amethyst Court, who you seem to dislike as well. Why not help us and get more in return? I am but a mere craftsman of great knowledge and am no commander and do not pretend to be one. I do not need to control you, but I will not forgive such actions such as ravishing or devouring of any creation-born in Novalesk. If you choose to do so, I will make you more bored than you could possibly imagine. It is all up to you. Help us and gain, or defy us and be forced into a horrible world of boredom and nothingness.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Hyuga will channel his conviction on this: Their whole goal is to stop them from joining the other side after all. 1-die stunt? (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4382283/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4382283/</a> =3 suc + 2 suc)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I feel like invisible castle is WAAAYYY too nice in its rolls lol. My phone was always mean to me as a roller before. One time I rolled 17 dice and got a quadruple botch. I swear I could roll 3 dice and never lose on this roller XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 01-28-2014, 12:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T05:27:09-08:00","id":59712,"title":"","content":"&quot;It seems your issue is boredom. But when the Amethyst washes over this land and turns it back into Wyld-chaos, boredom will be all that you know. Because, after all - if what you wanted was the endless but meaningless child's play of Chaos, you could have gone back to the Wyld. You are not one for crusades against reality; rather, you enjoy this world of shape as a foil and a source of endless amusemnt. You are not alone in this.&quot; <br /> <br /> Sea whips out one of her fans, agitating it iddly in front of her face as she looks around, taking in the impressive city. <br /> <br /> &quot;My companion offers boons. Tools, objects, constructs of divine Solar skill. I can offer boons of my own. I can offer you a <i>holiday </i>- like the gods themselves. Each year the brightest people of Novalesk would gather and perform for your pleasure, competing for the most innovative idea or story, and offering both praise and prayer. Of course this is merely what would happen in a time of peace - right now, what I offer you is the tale of the unlikely hero saving the kingdom in its hour of direst need by her intervention, when the Amethyst Court only has to offer you, what... the tale of an underling, her possession claimed by a greater warlord, taking a background role and soon forgotten by all?&quot;<br /> <br /> She smiles wrily, her pearl-white teeth half-glimpsed behind her unfolded fan. &quot;And, to sweeten the pot, I will add for you a performance of a fan-dance never seen before, and never seen again, in this very court and for your eyes only; or if the princess would rather we win his favor by defeating his shining knight and ravishing his goodwill, that can be done as well, a duel between Ba Rai and one of us, a once-in-a-lifetime demonstration.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">First things first: Conviction roll for the previous night, to regain Willpower. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4382523/\" target=\"_blank\">Success</a>.<br /> Now, a Presence roll to convince Esstrayan. Much like with the barbarians, 1st and Fateful Excellency for an auspicious success: 14 sux + any from stunts, 7m 1wp.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T09:23:21-08:00","id":59884,"title":"","content":"Tirien looks puzzled and flushed, embarrassed that her seemingly iron-clad agreement was shot down so easily. She then regains her composure,<br /> <br /> &quot;I will assist in whatever capacity, you need, Sea. I am trained in the Courtly arts as well,&quot; she relays to her comrade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T11:44:02-08:00","id":60001,"title":"","content":"Esstrayan hears your new offers and laughs, &quot;You play the game so strangely. So interesting! A test, a ploy, the moon-child's offer was, yes?&quot;<br /> <br /> He pauses for a brief moment, as if in contemplation, &quot;Constructs I have aplenty. Spoils gained and relics found by my roving Dragoon in a millennium of journeys. But your offer is intrigues me. A tale of an unlikely hero, who is adored and immortalized by those he saves. A tempting offer. I accept, but with one alteration. You spoke of how my city compared to that of the city of the gods; I would like to see how they do indeed compare. Rather than make a performance for me, once this war is concluded, speak to your superiors on my behalf. Obtain for me an invitation to visit the Celestial City. Or make an honest attempt. I know you cannot guarantee success.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T12:03:38-08:00","id":60014,"title":"","content":"Sea opens her mouth in silent surprise at the proposal, but after a moment of reflection, she nods. &quot;This is a huge request, but... Well, we've had demons and ghosts there before. Why not one of the Fair Folk? I agree to your terms, Lady Esstrayan.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T12:19:46-08:00","id":60032,"title":"","content":"&quot;That's right, Sea. Make us proud, &quot;Tirien says, smiling to her Circle-mate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T12:27:29-08:00","id":60043,"title":"","content":"Hyuga gives Sea a pat on the back. &quot;I knew you could do it. You just needed a little help is all. I think this is a wonderful arrangement.&quot; He will then turn to Lady Esstrayan and say, &quot;Indeed I cannot craft something on the scale of heaven. That is a big task to get you in, but we can manage. Thank you for your support! You won't regret it!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T12:51:24-08:00","id":60057,"title":"","content":"Esstrayan claps his hands together, &quot;Splendid! Ba Rai, inform Tao Mei that we are at war with the Pussiant Amethyst Court. Have him craft a battle strategy at once.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ba Rai bows, and walks from the hall, only to return a heartbeat later. Esstrayan returns his gaze to you. <br /> <br /> &quot;My Strategos should have a battle strategy crafted by morning. Relax and enjoy the hospitality of my humble home for the night. As a gesture of good-will, Ba Rai will accompany you. All the doors in the city are open to you, even those of my Treasure-rooms and my personal Forge. Now, if you'll excuse me, I have to speak to my cousin's envoy.&quot; <br /> <br /> With that Esstrayan stands and departs from the Hall. What will you do now?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T15:33:49-08:00","id":60184,"title":"","content":"Tirien will look around for a library. Do I need a roll to do so?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T15:36:27-08:00","id":60188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=60184#post60184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien will look around for a library. Do I need a roll to do so?</div> </div> </div> </div>That depends. Are you looking for something in particular? Yes. Just looking around to see what's there? No.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T17:06:42-08:00","id":60236,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will walk off towards the personal forge. He could possibly use some inspiration from a (hopefully) unique forge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T17:32:00-08:00","id":60252,"title":"","content":"Sea decides to visit the Treasure-room; once she has done so, she will simply visit the city, enjoy what can be found there, talk to the people, and get a general impression of the mood and culture of the freehold's inhabitants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T21:44:48-08:00","id":60446,"title":"","content":"*Oh, sorry, Dietaku. Disregard my reply to your last post. I read it as you looking around IN a library rather than looking FOR a library, my bad*<br /> <br /> Ba Rai lead each of you to the requested destinations in turn, dropping you off one by one. After you're dropped of at your location, you each notice Ba Rai entering and exiting the scene at regular intervals, which is strange. Why is she just walking into and out of whatever room you happen to be in? What about the others in the Circle?<br /> <br /> Tirien is dropped off at a building which is rather simple (given the surroundings) on the exterior, upon entering, however, you see that this building suffers from non-euclidian geometry, having bookcases in odd directions (including all four ceilings), as well as it being significantly larger on the inside than the outside. A vaguely humanoid spider with steel-colored hair wrapped into a bun greets you in a matronly voice, asking if she can help you find a particular book, or something on a specific subject. <br /> <br /> Hyuga is taken to Esstrayan's forge, which is as strange as the city. The forge-fire is a five-dimensional mass of psychedelic energies, and a large number of the tools look out of place. There's a collection of musical instruments there, as well as some paint-brushes, combs, a strange set of four foot long scissors... and those are just the tools you can recognize.<br /> <br /> Sea and orchid are taken to the treasure-room. The place looks more like an underground city than any sort of vault you've seen. Ancient Wonders of the Lost Age (Is that a Warstrider?) sit around casually mixed along with the lesser wonders of the Age of Strife (a simple, [relatively] unadorned jade diaklaive sits on a pile of gems) and the strange and exotic creations of the Wyld.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T11:49:55-08:00","id":60951,"title":"","content":"Tirien will ask for anything on First Age tactics or campaigns, and then ask for any manuals of military techniques and sturctures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T17:06:00-08:00","id":61171,"title":"","content":"The spider-librarian scuttles away, returning a few minutes later with a strange crystal that, when hit with a stick, tells the tale of a Fae kingdom that battled against a giant quicksilver octopus, before it was eaten by the beastie, leaving no survivors. She also brings you a large tome entitled: <i>The Proper Deployment of Experienced High-Value Strike Forces in Times Of War, and the Proper Maintenance and Training Thereof in Times of Peace </i>by someone named &quot;Tow*r**g **lc*n&quot; (The cover is slightly water-damaged, preventing you from making out the entirety of the authorial name). The book's prose is horrible, and its diction overly complicated, but it does appear to be a sound tactical manual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T17:11:02-08:00","id":61174,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will investigate what many of these tools might be for. He will pick them up, try to use them, move them all around and examine them closely. He will also try to analyze some artifacts to see what they do. (inv + per = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384264/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384264/</a> 1 suc) (analyze artifacts: int + occ= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384265/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384265/</a> 1 suc &gt;&gt;)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T17:24:43-08:00","id":61184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=61171#post61171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> &quot;Tow*r**g **lc*n&quot;l.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://i880.photobucket.com/albums/ac10/Dietaku/1365193507712.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> you glorious bastard.<br /> <br /> Tirien will memorize what she reads as best she can before perusing the treasure room. She'll look for any Moonsilver artifacts. She rolls Per+Awareness with 2 successes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384274/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384274/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384274/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384274/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T18:07:44-08:00","id":61198,"title":"","content":"The Joybringer <i>stares</i>. For a long while.<br /> <br /> It's even more incredible to her, as her Sight allows her to understand the incredible power and Essence of the relics sorted here.<br /> <br /> She slowly turns to whoever accompanied her here, and asks:<br /> <br /> &quot;Where. The hell. Did you get all that.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T18:41:17-08:00","id":61229,"title":"","content":"Hyuga attempts to understand the strange tools of the place, but cannot make heads or tales of anything. Ba Rai says that most of the ones you can't make sense of have something to do with the counteracting the sub-motonic quantum tunneling effect in order to manipulate gossamer on any sort of permanent basis. <br /> <br /> As far as Tirien can gather, the author of the tactical manual advocates utilizing highly-trained strike forces in order to deliver demoralizing strikes against enemy supply lines, intelligence assets and leadership. If these strikes are successful, the author claims, the enemy force will either disband, or be an easy target for a traditional military strike. <br /> <br /> Tirien arrives at the forge in time to hear Sea's question.<br /> <br /> &quot;We were not always this few, kevin&quot; Ba Rai responds, &quot;we were once a great Court, as mighty as any in Rakshastan. When the sun-kin waged war upon us, our greatest wasps, widgets, works were brought here. When our Lady was sworn into servitude, only four of our nobility remained, mighty Warriors all. Lady Esstrayan, who wields the Sword in the shadow of the Stave. Tao Mei, who wears the Ring ascendant before the Sword. Ba Rai, who wields the Sword high upon a Ringed fist. And Lui Fan, who carries the Sword brandished along the Way. Our tale was stormed, strained, shaped by War. To entertain our lord, erg, Lady, Lui Fan storms across the Waypoints, bringing Lady Esstrayan's war to our kin. At times I play the part of the knight errant and join her. These are the spoils that war, and the trinkets found along the Way. All brought with a story. All to slake my Lady's boredom.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ba Rai waves a mailed fist at the expansive vault, and says bluntly, &quot;It has been a long war.&quot;<br /> <br /> Seeing Tirien beginning to look through the vault, Ba Rai says, &quot;Lord, erg Lady Esstrayan would bid you take A Token of her hospitality, were she present, kevin.&quot; <br /> <br /> So far, Tirien's only moonsilver find is a hollow fist-sized acorn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T18:46:12-08:00","id":61230,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well. accept this present, humbly,&quot; Tirien says, cupping the large Moonsilver acorn in her hands.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T18:54:41-08:00","id":61237,"title":"","content":"After being completely confused by the contents of the forge, Hyuga will wander to the storeroom hoping to find much less... intensive.... artifacts. Perhaps that would be a better place to study some.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T18:55:58-08:00","id":61239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CitanHyuga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=61237#post61237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After being completely confused by the contents of the forge, Hyuga will wander to the storeroom hoping to find much less... intensive.... artifacts. Perhaps that would be a better place to study some.</div> </div> </div> </div>What, in particular, would Hyuga be looking for in the Vault?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T19:12:33-08:00","id":61244,"title":"","content":"He will look for any artifact that is not a weapon and preferably made out of orichalcum. It should be an object that he can hold in his hands and that has some sort of spell/charm effect added to it (if he is being shown or if he can roll to notice it).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T21:22:43-08:00","id":61297,"title":"","content":"So far, Hyuga finds an orichalcum ring, and an orichalcum music box of some sort. Will you continue looking or are you good with one of those?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T21:45:22-08:00","id":61306,"title":"","content":"[OOC] I am good with those. [IC] Hyuga will attempt to analyze the ring by chanting rituals he has heard (in old realm even though he does not know what they mean) and flaring his anima (5m). He will roll it around in his hand and press it against his caste mark whilst chanting then analyze its markings and put it on his finger and attune to it (analysis of ring: int+ occ+ 1d-stunt?= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384647/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384647/</a> 8 suc + 0 suc) After he has attuned to and analyzed the ring, Hyuga will attempt to analyze the music box (int+occ= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384648/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4384648/</a> 4 suc)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":"01-30-2014, 10:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T04:03:38-08:00","id":61448,"title":"","content":"&quot;Would you allow me to write down a list of all your treasures? I am sure my superiors in Heaven would be most interested to learn of these treasures. This might prove beneficial to Lady Esstrayan when she comes to visit Yu Shan - perhaps trade could be arranged.&quot;<br /> <br /> While saying this, Sea scrutinizes the room for any starmetal Artifact, as they are especially rare and precious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T07:33:47-08:00","id":61536,"title":"","content":"&quot;When you have a moment, Sea, can you divine what this does?&quot; Tirien asks, holding her acorn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T08:42:41-08:00","id":61567,"title":"","content":"&quot;I can try,&quot; she says, holding the acorn to her face and scrutinizing its Essence pattern; it's moonsilver, so it should be malleable - she presses it, rolls it, tests its reactivity. <br /> <br /> (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4385147/\" target=\"_blank\">1 success,</a> a resounding failure.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T10:02:52-08:00","id":61605,"title":"","content":"Upon analysis, Hyuga discover that the ring requires no commitment of essence; instead, it holds an essence charge of a single mote. The music box is more difficult to analyze; it seems to invoke some sort of emotional effect, and it requires an essence charge (not attunement) to operate. Other than that, *shrugs*. <br /> <br /> Sea manipulates the acorn, but is unable to parse out the effects of the artifact or a proper method of activation. However, while handling the acorn, Sea cuts the tip of her thumb on the inch-wide hole on the top; further examination reveals that the rim of the hole is a exceedingly sharp blade, and there are faint bloodstains along it, and inside the acorn. <br /> <br /> While Sea is examining Tirien's treasure, Ba Rai wanders off into the vastness of the vault. By the time you finish she has returned, carrying with her an ironwood case, similar to those that would be used to carry musical instruments. Ba Rai says, &quot;If I make a suggestion to the star-child. So time ago, between,&quot; her brow furrows in concentration as she calculates time, &quot;fifty and five hundred years ago, Lui Fan and I encountered one of the children of the broken Primordials. We slew it, but in the fighting, it claimed to have slain one of your kin. We took this from the remains.&quot; <br /> <br /> She opens the case revealing a spindle, comb and shears, all made of starmetal encrusted with garnets, sunstones, emeralds, amethysts, and aquamarines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T10:57:21-08:00","id":61617,"title":"","content":"Sea hands the acorn back to Tirien with an apology for her failure to understand its purpose - though she points out the cutting edges - and picks up the starmetal tools, puzzled and filled with a strange sense of wonder. &quot;Strange items, to carry into battle against a behemoth...&quot; She manipulates them, hoping to have more luck than with the acorn - even tries putting the comb to her hair, uncautiously - and smiles as she meets more success. (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4385241/\" target=\"_blank\">5 sux</a>) &quot;Do you have any idea what they do?&quot; <i>She </i>does - but it'd be foolish not to ask.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":67,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","user":"Omicron","date":". 01-30-2014, 02:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T15:49:44-08:00","id":61795,"title":"","content":"&quot;No, not one of their War-beasts,&quot; Ba Rai says. She seems to be looking for the proper words, &quot;The Primordials and the Unshaped of my kind are similar in composition. Each has a set of Emanations, one of which embodies their Heart. However, the Emanations of the Primordials have Emanations of their own. It was one of these, an Emanation-Emanation.&quot;<br /> <br /> The items are tools, designed to facilitate Fate manipulation. Collectively, they provide you with the capability to weave Fate strands from ambient essence, untangle the tapestry of Fate, and manually terminate astrological workings. Mechanically speaking, you need to commit 3m to attune to each individual tool. You must be attuned to all three for any of them to function. Since you can Create Fate strands for your astrology rolls, they become infinitely easier (-1 TN on all Craft [Fate] rolls), you can also manually alter the effects of an existing astrology using Craft[Fate] (shuffle points between duration, scope and frequency, and change the activated effect [cannot change an Ascending Destiny into a Descending and vice versa]) and you can remove any astrological effect by manually destroying the targeted Fate strands. The shears can also be used as a weapon with the following profile: Speed 4, Accuracy +3, Damage +3L/3, Defense +2, Rate 3, Tags M, O, Th. <br /> <br /> Ba Rai indicates that no one in the freehold knows what the artifacts do; any attempts by a Raksha to attune to the end ... <i>badly</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:52:03-08:00","id":61831,"title":"","content":"Tirien lets out a laugh at Ba Rai's explanation and Sea's indiscretion at the tool's abilities.<br /> <br /> To test the acorn, Tirien pricks her finger, and lets her own blood pool in the empty portion of the interior. She lets it sit for a moment, then laps it up. She;ll try to shift shape, then.<br /> <br /> Does anything happen?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T17:02:48-08:00","id":61839,"title":"","content":"&quot;A demon. A demon of the Second Circle. Impressive victory for your people,&quot; Sea says with a note of admiration. She puts the tools back in her box.<br /> <br /> &quot;You would have no way of using these tools; they are designed to alter Fate, and as such are only useful in the hands of people who have that power, which includes certain gods... And the likes of me.&quot; She bows solemnly to Ba Rai. &quot;I would consider it a great favor if you allowed me to retrieve these items and return them to Yu Shan, and in the meantime to make use of them myself; they are precious instruments for the Fivescore Fellowship, and their return will be met with great joy.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:00:21-08:00","id":61877,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will ask Ba Rai if there are scrolls that tell how some of these artifacts were made or how they were used in battle. If so, Hyuga will memorize them automatically (using his memory stone). &quot;I can't imagine what use it could be to store but a single mote in this ring. Even a mortal would be hard pressed to find a use for it. This music box seems like it could come in use though. Ba Rai, do you know the exact effects of this box? I know it manipulates emotions in some way, but I don't know exactly how.&quot; Hyuga will then turn to Tirien and say, &quot;Let me take a look at that artifact for you&quot; and will put out his hand expectantly and almost impatiently. If she hands it over he will analyze it (int + occ= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4385610/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4385610/</a> 8 suc (woo!)) and tell her what it does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:27:01-08:00","id":61897,"title":"","content":"Tirien laps her own blood, and then attempts to change shape, turning into ... herself. Test failure. <br /> <br /> Ba Rai nods at Sea's statement. &quot;Ah. That explains much. And you misunderstand my suggestion. I anticipated the desires of the star-child. I believed you would desire such a thing, to be returned to your kind as a token from my Lady Esstrayan, kevin. But to be more clear, yes, it is allowed.&quot; <br /> <br /> When questioned by Hyuga, Ba Rai shrugs, saying that she knows little of many of the treasures stored here, especially the creation-made ones, as an overwhelming majority of them are spoils of war. <br /> <br /> Hyuga discerns that the acorn requires a significant amount of blood (1L heath level's worth) charged with a large amount of essence (10m) to operate. If this blood is poured into the acron, and then onto the ground, a small unit of short-lived soldiers will arrise. <br /> <br /> &quot;Are we done here?&quot; Ba Rai asks, as Orchid arrives, grinning and dragging an ornate jade grand-daiklaive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:29:17-08:00","id":61899,"title":"","content":"(Gotta love Orchid)<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, I'm done here. Thanks be to you and your Lady,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:43:43-08:00","id":61909,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well then... if you don't mind me taking these then I suppose so. I am starting to get some more ideas...&quot; Hyuga starts to mumble to himself and thanks Ba Rai.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T21:30:56-08:00","id":61985,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thank you, sir knight.&quot; Sea of Tears lsmiles slightly, but inside she is grinning. This is proving to be a most wonderful day indeed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:26:26-08:00","id":62292,"title":"","content":"Ba Rai bows, &quot;I am but a husk, helpful, humble, Servant, kevin. The hour is getting late. I shall escort you to your chambers.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, space appears to distort around you, morphing into an ornate, if strange, sitting room, with a buffet of otherworldly dishes laid onut on one wall. Ba Rai waves towards four doors, saying, &quot;You will find bedchambers within. If you have need of anything, you merely need to ring.&quot; A small table, with a large red buzzer appears by the door, before Ba Rai steps into the floor and disappears. <br /> <br /> If there is anything you wish to discuss in privacy, now would bee the time to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T12:34:07-08:00","id":62380,"title":"","content":"Tirien motions to the others, while gathering food onto a plate, &quot;I'm not entirely sure that the Puissant Sanctum Fae aren't gone. Fae have this nasty tendency of being exactly where it is inconvenient,&quot; she says, thoguhtfully munching on some food.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T10:43:36-08:00","id":62991,"title":"","content":"&quot;You're right. On the other hand - these Fae have been much more well-inclined towards us than I would have expected. I'm afraid that spying around trying to see what the Puissant Amethyst are up to might risk upsetting this good inclination. Do you have any idea how we should go about making sure they don't ruin our arrangements?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T11:03:13-08:00","id":63003,"title":"","content":"&quot;Without wards or powerful sorcery, there really isn't way to truly ensure so. My best advice is to be prepared to fight at all times,&quot; Tirien replies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T19:57:03-08:00","id":63254,"title":"","content":"&quot;Perhaps I should go take a look through the treasure room again? I am sure there might be some sort of artifact with the ability to make our conversations private for sure. I don't have enough time or the materials to make one myself right now after all.&quot; <br /> <br /> Hyuga will turn to Tirien and say, &quot;I am always prepared to fight. My sword never leaves my side. I am quick to move into battle. It seems that you three were a little slow earlier with the barbarians.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will then try to find his way back to the treasure room.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T15:07:13-08:00","id":63608,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wait!&quot; Orchid shouts as she tackles Hyuga. &quot;I don't know how exactly my presence here keeps us safe, but I've dealt with Fae before. I there's something that they hate more than people screwing around with their hospitality, I haven't seen it.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Since discussion seems to be... not happening, I'm just going to move on)<br /> <br /> Ba Rai collects you next morning, and takes you back to the Hall. Esstrayan is present, bedecked in delicate armor of all the colors of the rainbow (and many that aren't). He's speaking with a tall, broad man with rough features, looking very much like a caricature of a Shogunate Taimyo. A large surface floats several feet in the air. As you approach you see that it is a scale model of Novalesk and the surrounding area, complete with tiny cities, towns, and a flashing gold tower, which you presume represents the freehold. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, my guests!&quot; Esstrayan says with a smile, &quot;Come! Tao Mei&quot; he gestures towards the tall man, &quot;has come up with a battle strategy.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tao Mei nods in greeting before launching into his explanation, his voice deep and resonant, &quot;Honored guests. Here we have the nation of Novalesk, the current target of the Puissant Amethyst Court. The enemy is currently clustered here-&quot; a phantom army of tiny barbarians and Raksha appears on the map &quot;-on the Northeastern bank of the Granite river. The mortal forces have so far kept them from reaching the other side en masse. The Amethysts will have either begun infiltrating their Fae warriors across the river to strike from behind, or will soon. Our objective for the time being is to keep the mortals from being overrun.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The mortals have proven that they are capable enough to deal with their ilk among the enemy's ranks. It is up to us to do the same. However, supply lines are crucial. The enemy kin have large groups of mortals on which to feed to maintain their Essence, while we have but this Freehold. My proposal is thus,&quot; Tao Mei pauses for a moment while a pair of glowing blue dots appear between the freehold and the enemy army, &quot;these are the locations of two uncapped demesnes. Ba Rai and I can convert them into Freeholds in a very short time. Liu Fan will link their Ways here, giving us a defense in depth in addition to increasing our Essence resources. I will remain there while Lui Fan and Ba Rai begin our counter offensive. Ba Rai will patrol the west bank of the river, keeping any of our kin from slipping past the mortals, while Lui Fan strikes from behind.&quot;<br /> <br /> As Tao Mei speaks, you see three phantasmal knights leave the gold tower, and place miniature towers on the blue dots. One of them stays behind as the other two depart; one to marches up and down the western river bank, the other circles around to the east of the enemy army. <br /> <br /> &quot;Lui Fan's mission will be to strike down the enemy's mortals, thereby depriving the enemy of their primary essence source. She will only strike enemy kin if they are alone and victory is certain.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Aw, that won't be any fun,&quot; a voice from the ceiling says. You look up to see a young girl, of perhaps ten years in age, with a moonsilver eyes and an orichalcum grin standing on the ceiling as if it were the floor. Tao Mei stares daggers at her. Literally. <br /> <br /> &quot;The objective is not to have fun, Lui Fan,&quot; Tao Mei says. He turns to the Circle, &quot;This is not a war that we can win alone. Our objectives are to harass and contain the enemy, reducing their Essence resources and buying time for the mortals to regroup and recover. Unless the enemy redeploys their forces to assault us here, we can contain them for perhaps a month or two. If they do redeploy, we can hold them here forever,&quot; a corner of Tao Mei's mouth moves upward for a split second, &quot;but I doubt the Shah will be that stupid. You will have to ensure that your mortal forces get reinforced and resupplied in that time.&quot; <br /> <br /> Esstrayan gives you one of his toothy grins, &quot;Well, what do you think?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T19:06:47-08:00","id":63686,"title":"","content":"&quot;A fascinating proposal, Sir. If I may, why not bluff the Shah out of their hole. Challenge them with a newcomer to claim their lands. Then, while their focus is on the &quot;Challenger,&quot; take out their mortal vassals. If doen well, this can accomplish the task of decapitating the Puissant Amethysts and also deprivethem of a cosntant stream of essence,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T20:15:23-08:00","id":63712,"title":"","content":"&quot;A clever plan,&quot; Esstrayan says, &quot;but the Shah was once a Staff Emanation of one of Balor's lieutenants. None here, save myself, has any hope of victory against her alone.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tao Maei nods in agreement, &quot;And if her army is in a position of strength, she'll be able to maneuver into a favorable position for the challenge as well. It would be a better idea to challenge her once we have whittled them down and your mortal armies are once again strong.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T20:35:04-08:00","id":63727,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well, then. I suppose we can go with the original plan. I'm sure I can think up something,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T22:13:25-08:00","id":63772,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will stop to think then say, &quot;I suppose that will work for now. It may well change once we get into action. but it is good to have a starting plan.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T06:52:04-08:00","id":63940,"title":"","content":"&quot;I cannot help but notice that this war plan ends with you holding two new freeholds on the region's border,&quot; Sea points out. &quot;But I imagine it's a suitable outcome.&quot; She thinks for a moment. &quot;Logistics are not my area of expertise, but I have other specialties. If you allow it, I would like to select a few of your numbers who will face the Court in direct combat; I should be able to lay certain Charms on them which should help cause sudden rout among enemy troops. Then I will craft a victorious Destiny for the mortal troops of Novalesk. Beyond this... I am down to talking well and fighting elegantly.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T12:08:21-08:00","id":64190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=63940#post63940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I cannot help but notice that this war plan ends with you holding two new freeholds on the region's border,&quot; Sea points out. &quot;But I imagine it's a suitable outcome.&quot; She thinks for a moment. &quot;Logistics are not my area of expertise, but I have other specialties. If you allow it, I would like to select a few of your numbers who will face the Court in direct combat; I should be able to lay certain Charms on them which should help cause sudden rout among enemy troops. Then I will craft a victorious Destiny for the mortal troops of Novalesk. Beyond this... I am down to talking well and fighting elegantly.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You see them standing before you,&quot; Esstrayan says, waving at his vassals. &quot;All of our additional Raksha are commoners, and a vast majority of them are Workers and Entertainers, not Warriors. Once we have obtained the new Freeholds, I will begin crafting new Vassals, but I would not have you waste your time on them. If you wish to levy the blessings of the gods upon my Warriors, I would bid you do so upon these three.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T12:17:23-08:00","id":64197,"title":"","content":"&quot;I cannot offer any blessings save that of my military acumen, &quot; Tirien says, &quot; I think I shall focusing on making the mortals within Novalesk more competent. Actually, and I'm sure I'll hate myself for this later, Orchid, is there any way to make a loan with your organization? We will be in need of resources in order to accomplish our goals.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T12:45:17-08:00","id":64225,"title":"","content":"Sea nods, then quickly goes over the plans again. &quot;So, Lui Fan and Ba Rai, then. Right;&quot; She focuses a brief moment, and a soft azure glow washes over the room. Then she begins to sing. It is a low, but dark tune, a wordless humming with ominous accords, a promise of the drums of wars and of Saturn's shears. It wraps slowly around the two warriors, like an uncomfortable cloak wrapping around their shoulders and whispering deathly promises in their ears.<br /> <br /> Then the glow fades, and Sea of Tears stands panting, her whole figure softly glowing. &quot;On the moment when the enemy first sees you, they will be struck with terror. I cannot promise that it will be enough to send them in a rout, but it should at least shake them.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Presence in Absence Technique, to hang on both Ba Rai and Lui Fan a Presence-based social attack aiming at inflicting an Intimacy of &quot;Abject Terror&quot; on their opponents. Both are Charisma+Presence with the First Excellency, Gem of Courtesan's Calculations, and Fateful Excellency, as well as channeling Compassion, for a total of 19 successes + stunts. Total cost is 22m, 3wp, 2 Compassion channels. This is going to take quite some time to recover, so let's hope it's worth it.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T14:34:21-08:00","id":64314,"title":"","content":"Orchid says, &quot;I'm not sure. I'm not part of the big merchant families or any of the banks. Me being in the guild would certainly quicken the process... I'm going to have to talk with my contacts. But since I'm going to head downriver once this is done anyway, I'll look into it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ba Rai nods in thanks, and Lui Fan just stands there on the ceiling, grinning. They look to Esstrayan, who nods and grins, waving them from the scene. The Fae sweep out of the room, and Esstrayan says, &quot;You had best prepare to leave. Ba Rai shall see to your transportation.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that Esstrayan sweeps out himself. A frog-like fae hobbles over, and leads you to Orchid's wagon, Ba Rai standing nearby. You see a large crystalline tower fly out of the Freehold above the walls, while a mass of Homonculi and Goblins march through them. You think you can make out Tao Mei atop the tower, while Lui Fan appears to be in the midst of the army, atop a gold-and-silver horse. Ba Rai draws one of her blades, and flips it about and places its hilt to her lips, playing it as a flute. She plays a short melody before throwing it to the ground, shouting, &quot;Arise, Dragokaiser!&quot; <br /> <br /> The blade morphs and expands, growing in a manner of seconds into a monstrous many legged draconian form. Ba Rai mounts the beast, and motions you to do the same. Once you are mounted, Dragokaiser beats its many wings, lifting you up into the air. It maneuvers over the wagon and, after grabbing the wagon (and Orchid's distressed horses), it zooms off. You see familiar countryside flash below you, and in a bare hour, Ba Rai sets a mile or so outside of Grey Ice. She raises a sword in salute before flying off the way you came. <br /> <br /> Orchid rides you into town, telling you that she's going to head south towards Novalesk, and then head down towards Gunzota, where she has some contacts. She asks if you want to come with her to the capital city, or if you have business to attend to here first. A significant portion of the leadership of Gens Ptreas is here, after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T17:18:16-08:00","id":65244,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well that was... wow.&quot; Sea climbed down from the enormous fae-dragon and reached the ground on wobbly feet. &quot;Yeah. Not doing that again.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;I don't think it's wise for me to introduce myself to Gens Ptreas with quite as much honesty as I did with the fae. My current identity is that of a simple musician, and I can't advertise myself as Anathema; I'm going to need someone to be the public face of our group if I go meet the rulers.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T21:15:06-08:00","id":65376,"title":"","content":"During the trip Hyuga will be attempting to understand the sword that they just rode on. He will ask &quot;Where did you get this mighty sword? This is quite interesting. Do you have any idea what it is made of? I really can't tell what it is. Can it do other things? Have you ever seen another artifact like this one?...&quot; Hyuga will keep rambling and asking questions while not pausing as he is very interested. After a few minutes he will run out of things to ask and wait to hear all the answers. At the same time he will run his finger over the great beast, trying to feel what is is made of. He will bring up a surge of essesnce to arc down his arm is great twists of golden display until the essence concentrates in his hand causing bright golden symbols of different tools to appear on the back of his hand causing him to be able to use his hands as the tools (craftsman needs no tools). As the hammer mark runs on his hands, he will tap the creature listening to the sound it creates. When the chisel appears on his hand he will try to see under a scale (without ripping it off or anything). He will continue to run his essence throughout the area and use different tools to test the creatures properties. Finally, he will try to meditate and think of all the exotic ingredients he has ever seen (or know that are used in different functional artifacts) and see which match up with the properties of this creature. (As I do not know whether to use int+occ or int+craft, I will roll both) (int+ occult= 4 (+stunts) suc <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4392317/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4392317/</a>) (int+craft+1st craft excel-10 die= 13 (+stunts) suc <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4392318/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4392318/</a>) (total of 17m +1wp if using craft; 7m +1wp if using occult)<br /> <br /> <br /> Once we set down, Hyuga will watch the creature as it flies off almost mesmerized as he thinks of a way to create a sword similar to that. After the creature goes out of view, he shakes his head and joins the conversation. &quot;I am so used to traveling that I would prefer to move along, but if you need me here I am willing to stay. I could be the &quot;face&quot; you need.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 02-05-2014, 12:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T22:20:32-08:00","id":65412,"title":"","content":"Retrospective: when queried by Hyuga, Ba Rai responds, &quot;Dragokaiser is a Deep Wyld Horror, one of the grand Sword shaping weapons of our kind. His construction was a work of Gossamer, the crafting of Dreamstuff and the Essence of Rakshastan into permanent form...&quot; And similar things which boil down to this: Dragokaiser is a powerful Raksha weapon, the equivalent of a Warstrider, Daiklaive, and Familiar all rolled into one. There are many weapons like him, but each one is a unique creation, and most are significantly weaker. As far as you can perceive, the beast is made of something that combines the properties of stone and a light metal. <br /> <br /> Now, back to the present:<br /> <br /> Orchid looks at y'all quizzically, asking &quot;So you want to stay here...?&quot;<br /> <br /> (OOC: I'm confused as to what you want to do. You seem to be saying that you want to initiate contact with Gens Ptreas, but I'm not entirely sure.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T06:50:11-08:00","id":65637,"title":"","content":"(Well, I don't know what there is to find in the capital city, so Gens Ptreas sounds like a good bet. And unless I am mistaken, they are where we are now, so probably going to stay? I'll hold off on IC reaction until I'm sure I haven't misunderstood.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T08:26:49-08:00","id":65713,"title":"","content":"&quot;We need to get the powers that be to accept our control of the Military. I do believe us seeing Gens Ptreas would be wise,&quot; Tirien says, &quot;Besides, I have a member of their clan as my footman.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T09:59:55-08:00","id":65785,"title":"","content":"Okay a brief synopsis of what you could expect going to the capital:<br /> <br /> The capital city of Novalesk is home to both the Boule, the legislative body of the nation. Seats are granted to Gentes based off of their proportion of the overall population. Additionally, the capital is home to several (nominally) non-partisan entities, such as the Strategoi (the overall military commanders), the Academy of Sorcerous Wisdom (a state-sponsored school of thaumaturgy and sorcery), and the Temple of Origenes (Temple to the City-Father, and headquarters of the nation's administrative bureaucracy). <br /> <br /> Going to the capital now will get you access to representatives of all Gentes, and other important people besides. However, getting to actually speak with them and getting them to work with you will be difficult without a local sponsor. Getting sponsored by Gens Ptreas would open many doors to you, but close others. <br /> <br /> So, its a trade-off; have more time to muck around in the power-players in general, or spend some time now to get a specific sponsor, which will make navigating those social circles easier?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T13:13:25-08:00","id":65905,"title":"","content":"Sea ponders the possibilities.<br /> <br /> &quot;My own status might grant me influence over the City Father; he is a god, and should recognize the authority of Heaven which I represent. If not, he may be <i>made </i>to recognize it. Once we have him on our side, he could help entreat us to the rest of the Gentes. On the other hand, this city is the closest to the Fair Folk freehold; if we can't manage to get the Ptreas to willingly cooperate with the fae, this whole thing comes crashing down. We need, at least, to secure the Ptreas's goodwill and to make sure we're on the same page when it comes to the raksha.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So I guess my conclusion is, we should stay here and introduce ourselves to Gens Ptreas. If we succeed with enough time on our hand, we'll head to the capital city and obtain an audience with the City Father. Any objection?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T17:51:40-08:00","id":66123,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will say, &quot;Y--y-yeah... what Sea said. That sounds about right. That would be the wisest action now.&quot; <br /> <br /> Hyuga will then start walking toward the city mumbling to himself about where he could find exotic ingredients.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T11:27:31-08:00","id":66602,"title":"","content":"&quot;I agree, to Gens Ptreas, then. Plus, even if we fail, I have a backup plan,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T14:13:39-08:00","id":66709,"title":"","content":"Alright. Orchid waves as she leaves, shouting that she'll look for you once she's back in town. Once you regain contact with Tirien's footman, he tells you that the House elders generally hold audiences and interviews in the mid-afternoon of each non-Holy-day. This practice was established to give individual members of the Gens a formal method to contact their leadership, to voice their concerns, opinions, and generally keep the elders in touch with their extended family. The only people who are expressly forbidden from requesting an interview are the members of other Gentes; many a foreign merchant or envoy has made use of the practice in the past. You have enough time to grab a hot meal and get the road-dust off you at the public bath-house before interviews start. The large hall which Tirien's lackey points you towards is packed with people. <br /> <br /> As you enter, A tall, balding middle-aged man, who is holding a large slate asks for your names, and reason for wishing to see the elders. How will you respond?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T15:11:44-08:00","id":66775,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm Hyuga. This is Sea and Tirien.&quot; Hyuga will point to them as he says their names. &quot;I think Sea would be better at explaining, so I will let her talk.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T18:33:59-08:00","id":66873,"title":"","content":"Sea's demeanor has greatly changed, as these public interactions require her to use a Resplendent Destiny lest she be forgotten as soon as she leaves the room - and her Destiny has rather drastic demands on how she should act. As Hyuga points at her, she blushes and bows respectfully, more like a meek servant than a great negociator, &quot;I-I am but a musician, Hyuga. Sea of Tears, if it please you, s-sir.&quot; Then she smiles, warm and bright. &quot;I have come here following Lady Ledaal Menos Tirien, of whom I am a humble servant. My lady?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T22:10:22-08:00","id":66991,"title":"","content":"Tirien gazes at her companions, and rolls her eyes,&quot; I am Ledaal Monos Tirien of the Scarlet Dynasty. I am seeking an audience in order to raise a military and save your nation. I seek your support; not only because I feel that your nation should be free to defend itself as it feels most fit to do so, but also because your boy Pteras Dero has served admirably as my employee, and I wish to honor this service by approaching you first,&quot; She says confidently, patting the boy on the shoulder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T12:20:21-08:00","id":67328,"title":"","content":"The man raises an eyebrow, but gestures towards a much younger man, and whispers something in his ear. The young man bows to him before turning to you and saying, &quot;Please, follow me.&quot;<br /> <br /> He leads you to a small, comfortably furnished room. Your guide says, &quot;Please, make yourself comfortable. Someone will be with you shortly.&quot; <br /> <br /> Nearly half an hour after your guide dropped you off, an elderly man enters. He is stooped and frail, and looks to have not been a tall or strong man, even in his prime. A few long, wispy strands of hair frame his face. Despite his appearance of infirmity, his eyes are still clear and sharp. He nods to each of you in turn, while he lowers himself into a comfortable chair, placing his cane in his lap.<br /> <br /> &quot;I hear you are here to assist with our troubles, Dynast,&quot; he says, &quot;Perhaps you would like to tell me how?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T07:51:00-08:00","id":69073,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's quite simple. I am a tactician of some repute. If I have your permission, I would be willing to create an army to counter the threat of the Fae. I know as well as you that their attack is not a question of if, but when. To this end, my pride and my honor as a member of Her Most August Majesty's family, cannot allow the destruction of a city by the Fae, and will gladly aid you as I can. All I need is your support in this,&quot; She says, standing proudly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T11:01:51-08:00","id":69221,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, yes, that's all well and good,&quot; he says, waving a hand, &quot;But let's get down to brass tacks here. How can you aid us? What support do you want? And what do YOU get out of this? You must be snorting Bright Morning if you think we're going to hand military powers to a complete unknown, especially one from the Imperialistic Scarlet Dynasty.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T15:00:50-08:00","id":69448,"title":"","content":"&quot;Truth be told, I could conscript your entire town if I wanted, but I feel it is better if you all defend yourselves. To this end, I want you to give me the resources and arms to maintain a legion of troops. In return, I will place myself under your command, and after the war is over, I will return this force back to you, to do with as you wish. Leave recruitment to me; I have a way with people over such things. After all, what is more noble than defending your homeland?&quot; Tirien says, being forced to tip her hand somewhat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T16:46:45-08:00","id":69498,"title":"","content":"&quot;A Legion, huh? That's all?&quot; the old man says, his voice dripping with sarcasm, &quot;If I had a legion, this whole mess would have been solved already.&quot;<br /> <br /> He shakes his head as if to clear it. &quot;Perhaps it would be simpler if I explained our history. Our nation was founded in the days following the great contagion. Our ancestors lived in a kingdom to the east, in what is now the Wyld. The population was ravaged by the Contagion, to the point that the Fae simply ignored the measly band of survivors the the environmental terrors of the Wyld. So we began travelling West. So many of us fell. Of the hundreds of thousands who once lived in our kingdom, barely a hundred survived.<br /> <br /> &quot;But one of the survivors was Beloved of the gods. Her name was Myrinne, and she was a architect, scholar and leader without peer. Our histories say that she was blessed by the hand of the Sun, gifted powers to save our people. Within twenty years under her leadership, the ragged band of survivors had built the town of Novalesk, and it was a prosperous town. Nearly fifty years after the contagion, she traveled downriver towards Nexus, and was never seen again. But she bore three children, each with one of her gifts. Nikoloi, the eldest, a skilled scholar and sorcerer. Zopyrus, the younger, a skilled diplomat and leader of men. And Ptreas, the youngest, a skilled worker of stone and earth. The three eldest Gentes of Novalesk are founded on these bloodlines, and took the names of our founders in imitation of the families of the Dragon-blooded.<br /> <br /> &quot;Despite its age, my Gens has a mere eleven thousand members, giving us only six of the fifty votes in the Boule. It would depopulate our entire family to build a legion. Nikoloi and Zophyrus, are significantly better, but even they would be hard pressed to put an entire legion into the field individually. Which is just as well, as the two are a step away from being at each others' throats at the moment. We could muster a measly five-hundred trained spearmen. Double that if we convinced our cadet families to contribute. But I still haven't heard anything from you or your lackeys that makes me feel like I can trust you, Dynast.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T21:33:58-08:00","id":69619,"title":"","content":"Tirien blinked. These people had lineages as esteemed as her own, and no less storied. She considered her words carefully, and then bowed.<br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize deeply, Ser. I was unaware of the storied lineage that your house commands, as it seems we are cousins of a sort; my clan being formed in that selfsame catastrophe. To make amends, I will be perfectly honest with you; I have become disillusioned with the Realm. The Great Houses, once bastions of morality and integrity of Law, are now slack, fattened with excess and debauchery. However, I am a thinker, and cannot sit still, and so I have sought a nation I could make great with my abilities. I believe that Novalesk is this nation, and so, I would seek to defend her. Thanks to little Dero here, I have sought you out, as your clan's industry has impressed me. I believe, together, we could not only defend Novalesk, but also make it greater than before. I envision that Novalesk could become a power, not only in the River Province, but also making her weight known across the East and even to the Realm. And above all of this, Gens Pteras could be at the helm, if we act quickly and assume command of the defensive efforts. So, what do you say, Ser, will you trust a woman who seeks nothing more than what you do, but also to make your nation and your clan great?&quot;<br /> <br /> Tirien will channel her conviction behind her words, adding her charisma excellency to its maximum to roll 13 dice to convince the Patriarch of her sincerity and her plans' merits. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4400213/\" target=\"_blank\"> 11 successes</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-11-2014, 12:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T00:06:57-08:00","id":69661,"title":"","content":"While Tirien begins talking, Hyuga will pick up stones and pieces of the earth. He will then pull out his music box and think the word &quot;trust&quot; intently. As soon as Tirien finishes speaking, Hyuga will say, &quot; You must TRUST us. We are here to help.&quot; Hyuga will then pay motes into the music box trusting that it will do the job he wants. As soon as the music begins to play, he will start to imagine a nice resources 1 vase (<a href=\"http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/Byzantine_-_The_%22Rubens_Vase%22_-_Walters_42562.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedi...ters_42562.jpg</a>) and then begin crafting. First, he will shape his essence into an image of the vase he wants to create. As he starts to move his hands, golden threads of his aura will begin to swirl and wrap around his hands like a misty, translucent golden gauntlet. His caste mark and anima will start to flare. Each time he starts to continue the process of making the vase, the sounds of the tools can be heard (though they do not actually appear). Hyuga will move the vase gently, and deftly in a circle like it was on a wheel and being to shape it (at 12x normal speed).<br /> <br /> As soon as this vase is finished (at resources 2) he will show it to the man as the music box continues playing (assuming it can even last that long). &quot;We are not that unlike your founders. We wish to protect you; not harm you. We have already secured additional forces to help. I know this town is important to you and we want to help you defend it. We are running out of time and options. Please listen to what Tirien has to say for the town's sake. It may be your only hope. Please trust us.&quot; Hyuga will then close the music box<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga is using Craftsman needs no tools, 1st craft excellency (6 die), and is channeling conviction. (6+6+2+ stunts= 7 suc + stunts; <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4400460/;\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4400460/;</a> creating a resources 2 vase instead of 1.) On the part of convincing him... (char + soc &gt;&gt; + compassion channel + stunts= 4 suc + stunts; <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4400481/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4400481/</a>)<br /> Total: 13motes + 3wp + mote cost for music box XD </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 02-11-2014, 05:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T15:23:30-08:00","id":70078,"title":"","content":"@Hyuga: You're in a nice sitting room; there's not going to be any random pieces of dirt and stone just sitting around. I will allow you to have bits an pieces of bronze from your original scavenging expedition, so you can get the job done that way.<br /> <br /> As Hyuga starts charging the music box, it slowly begins playing a dirge-like song. You are hit with a deep-seated feeling of despair for a brief moment before it winds down [I presume you don't want to continue charging it after not getting the expected emotional effect?]<br /> <br /> For Sea's eyes only<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">As the music box activates, you can see that its active essence patterns are eerily similar to the Celestial Circle Spell &quot;Cantata of Empty Voices&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Hyuga's display and Tirien's words clearly shock the man. He pales for a moment, before rubbing his temples. &quot;I ... I need time to think&quot; He says. He gestures Dero over, and instructs the boy to get out a worn, but well crafted Gateway board, and he requests that Tirien play him in a game.<br /> <br /> @Dietaku: If you accept, roll (Int+War).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T18:37:42-08:00","id":70220,"title":"","content":"Tirien claps her hands and sits to play. She uses the classic Sternian Gambit, whereby the general leaves their flank exposed so as to draw in their opponent's core into a pincer attack. She rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4401651/\" target=\"_blank\"> 3 successes</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T20:33:53-08:00","id":70253,"title":"","content":"In the background Hyuga will whisper to Sea. &quot;So, I did not exactly expect that to happen with the music box. I know with your weird &quot;sight&quot; you might have noticed something. Was I using it wrong? Or did you notice anything about the patterns of essence?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T10:45:29-08:00","id":70697,"title":"","content":"The old man counters Tirien's gambit with a Modified Nefarin's Fall, concentrating his powerful pieces in the center while using his numerous weaker pieces on the flanks to force a sacrifice of more valuable pieces. A relatively passive opening makes way into a brutal mid-game, with pieces being captured with nearly every move. In the endgame, only a handful of the old man's pieces survive, but they are the most powerful ones, and he manages to eke out a narrow win over Tirien's more weaker but more numerous survivors. <br /> <br /> &quot;I have played this game all my life, and I've learned that you can tell much of a person by how they play. You played well, but your game lacked guile. I feel you being honest with me.&quot; he looks over to Dero, &quot;and my grandson has a good head for people. I trust his judgement in this.&quot; <br /> <br /> He grabs a large peace of vellum, and pens a document granting the bearer formal patronage from Ptreas Nikon, High Elder of Gens Ptreas. He signs it, and stamps a large wax seal next to the signature. <br /> <br /> &quot;This will open doors to you in the capital. You need to get support there, from the other Gentes, and the Strategoi. They're the only ones who will be able to get together an army in time.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T11:15:23-08:00","id":70725,"title":"","content":"During this time, Hyuga makes sure to watch every move on the board and check out the entire document and seal. He will be using his memory stone to record those in his memories exactly as they were.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T06:39:46-08:00","id":71949,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thank you for your understanding and trust. You will not regret this. We shall save your city. We must be off.&quot; Hyuga will then take the document and get ready to head out.<br /> &quot;Let us make haste, girls.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T21:48:02-08:00","id":72464,"title":"","content":"&quot;Indeed. :Let's waste no time; We need to head to the capitol. Thank you for your kind words and consideration, though, Ser,&quot; Tirien bows to the patriarch in parting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T10:35:05-08:00","id":73258,"title":"","content":"Nikon nods his head in acknowledgement as you leave. <br /> <br /> So, you want to head towards the capital, huh? How are you going to go that? You could try walking, hopping a ride in a wagon or boat heading downriver. Or perhaps you want to try a more exotic method?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T10:50:44-08:00","id":73263,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hey Tirien. I've heard that you silver children sometimes change forms like that sword. Perhaps you can turn into a dragon or something that could take us? That would be awesome...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T11:09:39-08:00","id":73798,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't know what you're talking about! HAHAHAHAHA!&quot; Tirien said, taking Hyuga aside.<br /> <br /> &quot;We're both Anathema, remember? Besides, I can't transform into anything larger than a horse. Unless you want to ride on a giant, electric salamander...&quot; She mutters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T17:12:19-08:00","id":73971,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think he has realized I am one by now. I did flare my anima after all. It probably reminded him of his founders. If he were going to do something, he would have already. But an electric salamander huh? I suppose making a sword be electric would be easier than transforming... quite an idea... too bad you can't turn into something bigger than that though. Anyway, I suppose we need to find transport since Orchid already left. What do you like to travel by? I prefer air when possible, but I doubt we should for this. Maybe hire a guild caravan?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T17:32:41-08:00","id":73979,"title":"","content":"Tirien frowns, &quot;I'd prefer to travel by ferry, It would be faster, in any case,&quot; Tirien says, uneasily looking for any incoming ninja Wyld Hunt assassins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T17:35:23-08:00","id":73981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=73979#post73979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien frowns ... looking for any incoming ninja Wyld Hunt assassins.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, I wouldn't do that to you.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T15:28:12-08:00","id":74598,"title":"","content":"&quot;I suppose a ferry is as good as any. We should head out. We don't want to leave Orchid waiting too long. I do hope a wyld hunt doesn't find us though.&quot; Hyuga will then wait a few minutes for his anima to die down completely then head out into the business district of the city and look for a good place to get transportation. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Per + awareness= 3 successes (invisible castle is down again...) </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T10:34:10-08:00","id":75054,"title":"","content":"Tirien asks Dero if there's any ferry in the city to the capitol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T12:21:29-08:00","id":75129,"title":"","content":"Dero explains that there are large ferries that head downriver. They primarily handle cargo, but most captains will take on passengers to make a bit more coin. Faster passenger boats run up and down river, but they're significantly more pricey.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T18:18:22-08:00","id":77435,"title":"","content":"As Hyuga's anima vanishes, he turns to the others and says &quot;I think we should take a passenger boat. The faster, the better. If one of you can pay, that would be great. Otherwise I can sell this sword at the market and get some coin.&quot;<br /> <br /> If noone is able to pay, I will attempt to sell the sword at the market (and wouldn't mind help with that..)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T21:50:04-08:00","id":77469,"title":"","content":"Tirien says, &quot;I'll handle this,&quot; and then takes the sword. She walks into the city marketplace, and then, proffering the sword upon Dero, says, &quot;Look at this man. Isn't he the spirit of this city? An child of Earth, and now, a man ready to defend his interests from outsiders. Isn't that all we want in these uncertain times? To protect your own? Well, now, thanks to you can! Thanks to the famed swordsmith Hyuga, you too can own such a piece of craftsmanship! However, supplies are limited!&quot; With that, Tirien bows, and flourishes at her servant to show off his new accouterments.<br /> <br /> She'll activate Terrifying Lust Infliction to make the crowd desire the sword, and she'll roll Cha+Performance with full Charisma Excellency, to roll 10 dice. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4408515/\" target=\"_blank\"> 5 suxx.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T17:59:36-08:00","id":77938,"title":"","content":"But where the hell was Sea? And most importantly, why did everyone seem to have forgotten she was ever there?<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, that's Arcane Fate for you,&quot; the Sidereal thought while grabbing her things from a hostel. She shrugged off her Resplendent Destiny while in the company of Nikon to examine more closely this fascinating music box, but had unfortunately been entirely unable to understand its function or purpose; normally she would have made it a priority, but she did not have time. So she'd slinked off, written a report for her superior in Yu-Shan, packed some things, and now she was trying desperately to find her companions.<br /> <br /> Who, thankfully, were not all that hard to find. Hyuga's strange obsession with grabbing any material in range and making a sword to sell in a few minutes was working in her favor, though she was worried it might cause undue delays at some later point. Right now though, the easily-forgotten Serenity was waving a hand and approaching.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hm, guys? What are you doing? If you're trying to catch a boat to the capital, I can pay. I have more money that I need. Seriously. I get <i>paid </i>for putting myself in unlikely situations with fae and barbarians, thank the stars.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T13:57:32-08:00","id":78565,"title":"","content":"Yi had entered Grey Ice nearly a day earlier with all the aplomb of a beggar and exactly as much fanfare. (Which is to say he saw more disgusted looks than he did people and was spit at by the one in fifty who didn't have something better to do.) He had planned for this, cultivated it in fact, through the blunt tactics of letting his garments appear dirty and of poor quality, walking with the weariness of one who has walked several miles without sleep, and actually asking for money on account of his having none. All in all, impersonating a vagrant by being one was a fairly effective strategy.<br /> <br /> He had not looked this way for the whole of his journey, but events at Gunzota Redoubt had convinced him that the eyes of Lookshy were still present and vigilant even out here at the tangential edge of their sphere of interest. It impressed him, and raised a small flush of pride, that the City had extended its reach so far.<br /> <br /> The city he found did not compare favorably to the City, especially after the reminder of Lookshy's influence. Its fortifications ranged from deplorable to nonexistent, its stocks of arms and materiel were laughable, and, inexcusably, the fea's fifth column of fear and doubt had been allowed to garrison itself. Whatever the risk to himself, his dignity as a human being would not permit him to allow these people to continue as they were.<br /> <br /> He walked out into the marketplace, noting again the sluggish commerce, and began to sing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ashira l'Invicti ki ga-oh ga-ah&quot;<br /> <br /> It was a prayer, and an ancient one, found engraved in the rusted bronze tang of weapons as old as the Shogunate if not more so. For the longest time he had not known what the markings meant, written as they were in neither Old Realm nor any of the seven tongues of men. Yet as he had reflected back on his life while imprisoned something like memory had come over him and he had known the meaning.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will praise the Unconquered, for he has triumphed greatly.&quot;<br /> <br /> The song began softly, almost hesitantly. The first time it had been sung the victory it praised was still so new, so unbelievable, that even those who had won it were in wonder of what they had done.<br /> <br /> Then it grew stronger, louder, more sure. At the final verse he sung out with all his strength and the echoes of his voice seemed to ring with the tiny voices of ten thousand little gods who remembered the first golden dawn when Sol alone rose into the sky.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Activating a combo of Gathering the Congregation with Mastery of Small Manners, my Charisma based version of Heartfelt Honorific Opportunity and the Second Socialize Excellency. The combo is enhanced with a Compassion channel and I am activating the Guan of Heaven's Sun.<br /> <br /> 20m 3wp<br /> <br /> Final Roll is Charisma 3 + Socialize 5 + Specialty in Social Change 1 + Compassion 4 + 3 Artifact = 16 dice: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4410141/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> + 3 die stunt: <a href=\"http://&amp;quot;&#91;COLOR=#A0A0A0\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4410412/&quot;</span></span>[/COLOR]]1 success</a> + Second Excellency 2 success = 8 successes.<br /> <br /> The attack is unexpected.meaning anyone without a surprise negator has an MDV of 0. My effective appearance is 7 which should ping even people with a negator with the -3 MDV modifier.<br /> <br /> Anyone who can see me (which includes dematerialized spirits if there are any) who doesn't spend 3wp(assuming the 0 mdv if they aren't surprised its 1+ every three successes over MDV) (or activate a charm) to resist is now a social unit under my direction.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-26-2014, 01:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T16:19:55-08:00","id":78759,"title":"","content":"Tirien whipped the market into a frenzy, each person trying to get Hyuga's blade. Her attempt is for not, however, as the rocks and stones of the marketplace begin singing an antiphon to the Ignis Divine. The market rallies around an apparent vagabond (Yi). The sole exceptions are that one hobo preacher you saw in the market earlier (The one ranting about the Mount of Perfection), and a small pocket of his apparent followers. And an unassuming Northern man with golden eyes who bumps into Sea. He apologizes in a heavy Haslanti accent, before walking off. Sea notice him turn back towards the market and waves, his hand spayed in the Mudra of the Rising Smoke. Hm. I wonder what his deal is. <br /> <br /> Yi's Social attack is now dodge-able for Hyuga, Tirien and Sea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 02-24-2014, 07:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T16:34:13-08:00","id":78784,"title":"","content":"Tirien was not expecting the shockwave of air, sound, and light at the arrival of the newcomer. Instead of the clamor of people fawning over her words, she found another powerful wordsmith, who was assaulting her with their ideals. Quickly covering Dero's eyes and ears to protect her one servant from the predations of the newcomer.<br /> <br /> She then snaps, demanding a phat beat from Dero. Digging deep into her past, reminded of the long summers her mother decided to visit her cousin in the Cynis family, with their trio of daughters around Tirien's age. Tirien had never met any group so intent on being petty to her, their sole pursuit in those weeks being bullying her. They didn't do it with fists or clubs, but with bawdry songs and dances that brought her no end of embarrassment, and the worst of it, even her mother joined in. Such indiginity! it was these venomous songs that Tirien decided to draw on. <br /> <br /> &quot;What, look, at that peasant there, his face covered in mud<br /> no coin in his purse, and no grace of the Dragons in his blood.<br /> He comes to my house, calling out for sugar and cream,<br /> But he's there harassing my maids like he's in a dream.<br /> What should I do? Let him run so loose and wild?<br /> Act the part of the perfect host, demure and mild?<br /> NO, says I, as the Sword rises in the East.<br /> I have tossed the Gauntlet, now speak your piece,&quot;<br /> <br /> Tirien sings, gyrating to the beat, as the stragglers of the crowd gather round her.<br /> <br /> (She'll activate Hard-Nosed Denial Style to defend against the Paens of Yi, while she ripostes Yi's attack with her own; using Terrifying Lust Infliction to rouse a primal desire in Yi to participate, and thereby leave the meager social unit Tirien has accumulated alone. She'll roll her max possible dice roll, comboing her Charisma Excellency to roll Cha+Presence for 10 die. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4410558/\" target=\"_blank\"> 6 suxx.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T17:18:20-08:00","id":78828,"title":"","content":"&quot;Why do I even bother.&quot; Sea's arms fell lim at her side as she glared at the entire marketplace and everyone with him. &quot;See? This is why the Bronze Faction has so many more numbers! They don't have to deal with this crap!&quot; And now she was grasping her temples and frowning as if under the intense pressure of the world's most terrible headache. &quot;Why are they even so many of you on this random marketplace in the north! And him! He used a Resplendency, I'm sure of it! And you! Your caste mark is showing!&quot; <br /> <br /> Now she was literally banging her head against the wall, which thanks to her natural Exalted resilience failed to do anything. &quot;I! Hate! This! Place!&quot; And then she stopped because there was no point, and scanned the marketplace for traces of the Northerner's Essence patterns, before setting after him. It'd give her a distraction while the others did... Whatever it was they were doing.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T18:52:04-08:00","id":78931,"title":"","content":"Whilst Tirien attempts to engage Yi in a rap battle, Sea zeroes in on the Northerner's essence signature. He's clearly enlightened, but his essence is unremarkable. So uniquely, magnificently unremarkable as to be completely familiar. <br /> <br /> Sea follows the Northerner into an alleyway behind a tannery. He's waiting for you there, and he pulls off his tiny spectacles and his Resplendent Destiny, transforming the short frail Assistant Professor of Astrology at the Scriptorium of the Northern Sky into the tall, athletic Harbinger, Steel Wing. <br /> <br /> As you recall, Wing is a member of the Convention on Air, a rather unzealous member of the Gold Faction, and a practitioner of the Crystal Chameleon style. <br /> <br /> He nods to Sea with a toothy grin, and says, &quot;Hey, Sea. I guess you got my message.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T18:57:10-08:00","id":78935,"title":"","content":"Yi raised his hands for quite and turned to the woman across the square. His look was neither angry nor annoyed. It was at best disappointed. He did not shout, but his voice carried well enough.<br /> <br /> &quot;Will you continue this fiddling while Creation burns, so concerned with your own aggrandizement that you ignore its salvation? Did whomever choose you make so poor a choice? If you want to hear my peace, than here it is.&quot;<br /> <br /> He turned away from her and back toward the crowd.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am shamed to see you acting as you are acting. I am shamed to see my people think no better of themselves than this. Do you think that hoarding your money and avoiding your neighbors will throw back the hosts of Faerie?<br /> <br /> Where is the sound of hammers falling like rain to make implements of iron. Where is the chaunt of priests to call down the blessing that is your due? Where is the rituals of the thaumaturges to raise wards of thistle? Where are the shouts of training as you ready to defends your homes and families? Where is the toil of the masons to raise high the walls and strong the beams about you that the fey in their vanity should array themselves in challenge of them? Where, O people, is any sign that you are more than beasts mutely awaiting your fate!<br /> <br /> Here is a truth, so mighty it has troubled the dome of the sky: you are better than this, better than the fear and apathy that consumes you. Hell is mired in the squalor of regret that binds it impotent more than any chain. The Wyld looks on us in envy, knowing our passions are so mighty that they shake the earth and raise up our works to such grandeur that Fate itself bows to our ambitions.<br /> <br /> If you heed nothing I have said, heed this:<br /> <br /> We have the power to change the world, if we will but act.<br /> <br /> You have the power to change the world, and I suggest you start doing so.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Terrifying Lust Infliction fails against Yi's DMDV of 9.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T19:55:01-08:00","id":79010,"title":"","content":"&quot;Did I? I honestly can't keep track. This country is under attack by the fae while forming an alliance with the fae while having Solars sprout up everywhere inside its borders while having Lunars come here and... I need a holiday when I'm done with this, which I won't get, because we're the sort that doesn't ever get holidays.<br /> <br /> The good news is, I found some priceless Fate-crafting tolls, lost long ago by one of our host in battle against the Wyld. And before you ask, I'm not giving them back for now. I need them if I am to save this place.&quot;<br /> <br /> She briefly peeks from outside the alleyway to watch the state of the vocal confrontation, before shaking her head wearily.<br /> <br /> &quot;Okay, I'm being rash. Sorry. It's a pleasure to see you. I formed a small circle - three people including me, nothing really - and we were about to go to the capital city meet up with an Eclipse Caste, but now there's a new Solar here and aaaargh. Tell me at least you're not bringing new orders or new trouble because I really don't need that in my life right now.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T20:49:37-08:00","id":79065,"title":"","content":"Tirien brought up her hand, silencing Dero, and walked over to the newcomer. <br /> <br /> &quot;There are few who can resist my appeals to their urges. Very, very interesting... Your words suggest to me that you are Exalted as well. Are you Star-Chosen? Another Lunar? No, I imagine, with your song, you'd be one of the Lawgivers my mentor had such choice words about. Something about ,&quot; Why We can't have nice things,&quot; or to that effect. In any case, might I inquire why you're here? If you're here to set up shop by yourself, I'm going to have to ask you to leave. Politely. My associates and I have decided to take charge here. However, if you're interested in joining forces, well, maybe we can work something out. Ah, forgive me. my manners. I am Monos Tirien of the House of Ledaal. Might I have your name?&quot; The Lunar says, bowing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T20:55:51-08:00","id":79073,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will be bouncing back and forth between the two in awe of what is happening. &quot;I don't know what it going on. It does seem to be major though. I suppose Tirien must need some sort of help.&quot; Hyuga will play off of his positive intimacy for his circle mates (Tirien) and starts trying to repeat the rap she said looking entirely foolish. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> He gains a measly 2 sux. ( <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4410808/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4410808/</a> ) </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T10:59:50-08:00","id":79448,"title":"","content":"*I'm just going to let you guys in the marketplace talk it out*<br /> <br /> Wing raises an eyebrow, &quot;They must be running you ragged. I was referring to me running into you back there. And, no, I'm not bringing more orders. I had to run some messages to Ayesha. Convention of Essence Use business, you understand. Seems like they take the '<i>Celestial Relay of Sagacious Knowledge' </i>titletoo literally.&quot; He clearly means that he's being used as a glorified mailman for factional business. <br /> <br /> &quot;Since I was heading in the general direction, they wanted me to let you know that another Solar was heading your way. I tried to make it before you ran into them, but I guess Mercury had other plans. While I'm here, though, I'll let you know that I've got orders muck around in Fallen Lapis for the next few months. The higher-ups decided that someone should clean up that mess, try to halt the spread of the shadow-lands there and such. They figured if someone was going to take care of that it might as well be someone they can pull in and out at a moments notice. So if you need backup in he next few months, I'll be in the neighborhood. Now, want help cleaning up this mess before I head out?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T17:20:58-08:00","id":79777,"title":"","content":"The beggar gave the lackey attempting to parrot the lunar a brief look without any acknowledgement in it. Then he turned toward Tirien and looked her directly in the eye.<br /> <br /> &quot;Responsibility.&quot; Yi said in answer. &quot;You meant to say that you have decided to take responsibility. If you are here mearly to rule, you are neither qualified nor deserving to do so. The one who is responsible for the people having food on their tables, securing their safety that they do not live in fear of attack, and ensuring that corrupt officials and cruel policies do not drive them to lawlessness; that is the one who deserves to 'take charge', not whatever strong man is able to stand on their necks.<br /> <br /> May heaven have mercy on them if what I saw before I acted is your idea of proper governance, and may it have mercy on you if you mean to leave things as they were. These people deserve better than a failed patrician looking to become a despot to compensate for familial shortcomings.&quot;<br /> <br /> Internally, Yi was berating himself. He had acted far too openly to maintain a low profile and he was picking a fight with someone likely far more capable than he at combat. Submission to the mighty was only proper, but far too many of them abused their positions and failed to uphold the duty their station required of them. The people deserved good rule as much as the Exalted deserved good loyalty, and if these would not grant them that then he would.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T08:13:42-08:00","id":80237,"title":"","content":"Tirien's face is a mask for a moment, and then laughs, &quot; True, true. It is the responsibility of those who rule to do well for their subjects. Sadly, poor Dero here is not getting paid because our prospective clientele is all worshiping you...&quot;<br /> <br /> Tirien's fist whips out to meet Li's face, the sound of air cracking resounding with the sound of the impact.<br /> <br /> &quot;You have insulted my honor and the honor of one beholden to me. I challenge you to a duel of Coup, Solar,&quot; Tirien says coldly, her caste mark faintly shining.<br /> <br /> (Tirien strikes at Yi with a punch of <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4412273/\" target=\"_blank\"> 9 suxx.</a> using her Dex Excellency at max capability to show off her prowess and ruffle the wandering priest a little.)<br /> <br /> (Tirien also rolls JB at <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4412309/\" target=\"_blank\"> 2 uxx.</a>).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-26-2014, 12:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T09:32:04-08:00","id":80296,"title":"","content":"Tirien's hand connects with Yi's face, causing him to stagger back a few steps. <br /> <br /> Yi's social group looks on expectantly, and somewhat uneasy. From what Yi has been able to determine from his limited time here, the populace of Novalesk follows a rather martial ethic. Declining this challenge may cause your social group to fall apart. (Mechanically, the extras will have a reason to spend WP to resist your UMI)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T13:46:36-08:00","id":80476,"title":"","content":"&quot;I did not insult your honor, I questioned your intentions. Your honor is your own affair and if my poor words are sufficient to cause it injury, than it is unworthy of you. However...&quot;<br /> <br /> As Yi drew his sword there was a pure tone like a singing bowl. The gleam of orichalcum and bronze shone briefly and mirror bright. Yet the flash of sun and sky against it did not fade so that when fully drawn it seemed pattern of molted gold caught in a shard of azure. Two words stood out clearly on each side as Yi took a half step back and readied himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;... if this this how you propose to rule with grace and wisdom, no magic will save you or your works.&quot;<br /> <br /> For those who can read Old Realm<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The words on one side read, &quot;Without Action&quot;. On the other side they read, &quot;Without Non-Action.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> With a snap he brought his sword into a guard position.<br /> <br /> &quot;Do what you feel you must, but leave these people out of it. They have done you no harm and deserve none in return.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Join Battle: <a href=\"https://&#91;COLOR=#A0A0A0]&#91;FONT=Helvetica Neue]&#91;SIZE=12px]http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4412359/&#91;/SIZE]&#91;/FONT]&#91;/COLOR]\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a><br /> <br /> Readying a weapon and activating the reflexive charm Protection of Celestial Bliss for 3m.<br /> <br /> DV is now 8 (9-1 for drawing and readying a weapon) though I can activate Dipping Swallow Defense or Bulwark Stance t bring it back up to 9 and both of those are reflexive.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T14:31:35-08:00","id":80508,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of course, do you think me a barbarian without sense of civility? These people are not guilty of any crime, save perhaps being unlucky,&quot; Tirien says, assuming a wide fighting stance, hands outstretched.<br /> <br /> Tirien will activate Claws of the Silver Moon as her action, relying on her stance to hold until she can act again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-26-2014, 05:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T15:15:10-08:00","id":80549,"title":"","content":"Exthalion: Unless there is an error on your Charsheet your JB dicepool should be 1, not 3. <br /> <br /> Since readying a weapon is speed 5, and Claws of the Silver Moon is Speed 4, it's Tirien's go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T15:17:16-08:00","id":80552,"title":"","content":"I was including two stunt dice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T15:20:18-08:00","id":80556,"title":"","content":"Alright. In the future, include somewhere in the post how many Stunt Dice you're including in your roll, okay? Just wanting to avoid confusion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T15:56:23-08:00","id":80583,"title":"","content":"Tirien lunges forward, stabbing with her claws at Yi, striking with <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4412605/\" target=\"_blank\"> 10 suxx.</a> after using her Dexterity Excellency to add 4 dice to her attack pool. She also would roll 5 dice/ 2 Overwhelming for damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T16:09:22-08:00","id":80591,"title":"","content":"Unless Yi activates a charm, Tirien will hit and deal a ping. If he's going to do so, now would be the time to say it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T18:06:13-08:00","id":80665,"title":"","content":"As soon as Tirien lunged, the beggar was already in motion. with a whirling spin he ran his sword along the ground kicking up a cloud of dust. The light of his sword illuminated the flying motes, causing it to appear, for an instant, like a tongue of flame. With a ringing clang his sword parried the Lunar's claws, clearing the air with a ozone laden wind.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Two dice stunt resulting in <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4412691/\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a> Also, activating Dipping Swallow Defense for 2 mote to remove the -1 DV penalty. End result is a DV of 10 and thus a failed attack.<br /> <br /> Edit: Errata has clarified that stunts add directly to DVs and do not need to be rolled. So no activating of Bulwark Stance.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-26-2014, 09:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T18:26:30-08:00","id":80682,"title":"","content":"Redacted pending revision.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 02-27-2014, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T21:28:28-08:00","id":81408,"title":"","content":"Okay. Yi's maneuver moves Tirien's arm to the side, causing her strike to narrowly miss his torso.<br /> <br /> You both act simultaneously now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T22:20:40-08:00","id":81425,"title":"","content":"Hyuga recovers from his pathetic attempt to rap and shakes his head trying to clear his mind. He will flick his cape over the side of him causing it to look like a small flame overtaking his body for a brief moment. Slowly he will walk forward and draw his golden sword flicking it about slashing back and forth in small quick actions as the golden essence leaves small streaks in the air. He carefully steps through the watching crowd without hitting or touching anyone.<br /> <br /> In a short second, Hyuga will quickly dash from the outside edge into the middle of the small battle with his sword swinging in a golden arc as essence swirls gently down the blade. A small shield of blue seems to appear from the refracting light off the deep blue hearthstone set in the hilt. (Assuming I make it on time with my JB roll...) The blue shield and arcs of essence seem to divert Tirien's attack slightly as it passes him towards the man so that he easily deflects the blow.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tirien, we do not have time for this. We need to make haste. Since when have you been so quick to lose your temper? Is your honor such a fragile thing? I thought you were stronger-willed and more honorable than this. This little spat means nothing. And you sir, are doing nothing but using words. We are taking action. You have no reason to insult her so. She is being more of a leader than you right now. You judge without even knowing what is happening. You are just using words right now as some leaders do, but now that is not enough. You have great skills that could be useful for helping protect this land. Why not take action with us? We are going to head an army to battle to cripple the foes and save the people of this town. Your words alone will not get this done. So for the sake of everyone here, either join us or get out of our way so we can protect this town with REAL action.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga rolled join battle while channeling compassion. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4413976/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4413976/</a> for 7sux +1sux (2-die stunt?) He is performing a defend other action on the man after dashing in and is using dipping swallow defense to bring his DV back up. +1 from stunts? So 5 +1 parry DV if the stunt holds to deflect. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":".  Gah! Did not notice the new post by Noodle till after I posted this. Was on the page too long :/ If this can't be done then I can revise it. 02-28-2014, 01:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T08:19:56-08:00","id":81602,"title":"","content":"Tirien stares at Hyuga, but then frowns.<br /> <br /> &quot;He's right. We don't have time for this. The people of Novalesk are in danger, and even the pride of one such as I comes second to this, the words of a vagrant priest or no. I ask for your forgiveness and your aid in this, Ser Lawgiver. Your words, as infuriating as they are, carry great weight, and you seem quite adept at using them,&quot; the Lunar says, bowing deeply at Yi.<br /> <br /> (Tirien will channel her Conviction to add to a Valor roll to cease her vendetta. She rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4414246/\" target=\"_blank\"> 2 suxx. </a> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T11:36:15-08:00","id":81695,"title":"","content":"The beggar kept his guard up, eyes shadowed by his broad hat.<br /> <br /> &quot;I would be more inclined to consider your words favorably if your weapon was not still drawn on me and your companion was not posturing to make your call for a duel a lie of entrapment.<br /> <br /> As for you...&quot;<br /> <br /> He shifted toward Hyuga though did not open himself to Tirien and there was an edge in his tone.<br /> <br /> &quot;I see a town waiting passively for death so I fire in them a spirit of action. I see a stranger claiming to have taken control with no more more warrant than a mention of associates and a dynast's name so I ask what proof she can give when the city was being strangled by fear. I am violently struck and challenged to a potentially fatal duel so I beg that no innocents be harmed.<br /> <br /> Now, you break the Code Duello by drawing arms on me, make claims of your intentions with no proof besides your blade, and ask me to trust these people to those who use honor as a ploy, do violence to those who question them, and demand submission or flight at swordpoint. Do you really expect me to trust you enough to lower my weapon, much less to trust you with the future of these people? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T13:01:48-08:00","id":81744,"title":"","content":"&quot;I do not recall ever having claimed to control anything. We are merely helping the people in this town. You put your own expectations on us and tried to control my mind. I do not appreciate such actions.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We are making our move to take care of the problem now. Also, I agree that Tirien was a bit out if hand, but you did seem to disrespect her, even if that was not the purpose. You supposed that she would attack others even though it was meant to be a simple coup between you two. I do not know what code you live by with the coup, but I have more important things to take care of as does this one here,&quot; Hyuga says as he gives a small glare to Tirien.<br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize for those actions taken by Tirien and even tried to stop her from striking you. You can remain here and talk with the people if you so wish, but I have plans to fix the problem at its roots. I will be leaving to do that now. If you wish to learn about our &quot;proof&quot; and what we do then you can follow and see. I do not carry such proof you can see here.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But why do you even question our intentions? I am not questioning yours, but invited you to do something more concrete and join us. These people have been living with this problem for a long time and are stronger than you seem to believe. Now we must be on our way. You can choose to follow and see our proof or remain here talking to the populace. It is your choice. Good day to you.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, Hyuga will walk towards one of the passenger ferries to see how much it will be. With that he will remember that Sea would be able to help with that and summons her over.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":".  Making this a bit easier to read... 02-28-2014, 08:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T16:58:22-08:00","id":81819,"title":"","content":"Yi looked at Hyuga without a word then began to laugh. It wasn't a chuckle, but the sort that shook his whole body. At last he got himself under control, though the color still flashed on his sword.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyone who becomes that indignant at the very least believes in what they say. I still question your competence, but not your intentions. If your honor will accept it, I am willing to call this duel a draw. Further, if you can speak for your companions, I am willing to work with you.&quot;<br /> <br /> He glanced at the departing swordsman.<br /> <br /> &quot;On three conditions. First, you stop striking me without much better provocation. Second, that you remind me to peacebond my tongue when its edge is uncalled for. Third, that he learn to take a breath every few sentences so his words don't all come out as an unbroken mass. Will that be acceptable, daughter of Luna?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-01-2014, 12:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T07:13:45-08:00","id":82094,"title":"","content":"&quot;That is acceptable,&quot; Tirien says, dispelling her claws, &quot;Let us strive for peace and harmonious cooperation between the Chosen of Heaven,&quot; she says, extending her hand .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T15:03:04-08:00","id":82337,"title":"","content":"He sheathed his blade, the glare fading as he did so and nodded his head toward Tirien. &quot;I am called Yi Zhinan. If we are to work together, there is something I must know first. Do you mean to do harm to Lookshy or its interests? If your answer is no I will gladly aid you. If your answer is yes, I will part from you in peace. This point is not negotiable&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-01-2014, 10:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T19:22:25-08:00","id":82453,"title":"","content":"&quot;I hold no ire towards the Seventh Legion or its home city.So, to answer you question directly, I mean them no ill will,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-02T11:22:48-08:00","id":82711,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well then. I believe you were making plans to depart? I will set the crowd to war preparations as was my intention. Where should I join you afterwords?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T14:02:39-08:00","id":83450,"title":"","content":"&quot;We were going to the docks to get a ferry towards the Capital, so that would be the most sensible place to rendezvous,&quot; Tirien says,&quot; Although at present, we have no coin to pay for it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T17:35:56-08:00","id":84303,"title":"","content":"He sighed, &quot;See what you can do to arrange passage, I will lend you what aid I can should your efforts fail, but there are few who can deny me what I ask of them.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T09:48:59-08:00","id":85418,"title":"","content":"Dero indicates that during the shuffle, he 'procured' the necessary funds. He gives no details as to how exactly he procured them.<br /> <br /> Wing sees the kerfuffle resolve itself, and turns to Sea, &quot;Well, that seems to have worked out. Best of luck with the extra Solar.&quot; He then pulls a handful of silvery-white crystals out of a pouch, and tosses them into a puddle. He steps into the puddle, and gives Sea a brief wave before sinking into it as if it were a sea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T17:46:16-08:00","id":85737,"title":"","content":"&quot;Good man, Dero,&quot; Tirien says, patting the boy on the head, &quot; I'll see you at the docks. Dero and I need to negotiate our passage. <br /> <br /> (Tirien will then walk to the docks, as directed before by Dero's grandfather.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T19:00:12-08:00","id":85776,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sea! Sea! Where are you? We need to get tickets! Let's go! You know I can't pay for it right now.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T21:04:27-07:00","id":89230,"title":"","content":"<i>By Heaven, let their accomplishments be greater than they are!</i><br /> <br /> Yi turned to his crowd, face intentionally blank of emotion. &quot;I am going to do something that has not been done for an age. It is something that is so counter to the ways of the world that even the thought of it is alien to gods and men. I am going to trust you. Already you have heard my condemnation of the helplessness I found here. Now, make my words a fire in your breasts so hot that it tempers the brittleness of mortality into the substance from which gods are forged.<br /> <br /> Go now, and prove worthy of this trust.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that he turned away and headed for the docks. The display with the Lunar would not be long in reaching the ears of the Seventh Legion and he had best be gone by the time it did. He followed after the lunar, and her lackeys, attempting to discover the ship they meant to charter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T14:55:38-07:00","id":90431,"title":"","content":"Yi's crowd is dispersing. They appear to be filled with righteous zeal. Instead of being depressed and anxious about the oncoming horde, they are passionate and enraged. Definitely a plus, but how long will it last?<br /> <br /> Tirien and Dero make their way to the docks, and using the funds Dero 'procured' they manage to negotiate passage for five to Novalesk-city. The captain, a one-eyed, salty looking woman, informs them that they'll be shoving of in two hours, so if you have any business here, now would be the time to do it.<br /> <br /> Also, the trip will take about two days, so you could (hypothetically) do something in that time. letting me know how your PC will spend the time would be nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 03-13-2014, 10:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T15:03:07-07:00","id":90438,"title":"","content":"Tirien will push Dero through Realm social boot camp. His ambition and skills are good, but he needs to learn how to walk the walk, as it were. So, she'll train his charisma up.<br /> <br /> (Tirien herself will train up her Presence and Dodge abilities.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 03-14-2014, 02:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T21:10:33-07:00","id":90627,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will practice spinning his blade creating the blue shield that he did earlier to help block Tirien's attack. He will create many patterns of arcing golden and light blue paths of light that trail slightly creating short-lived works of art in the air. He will continue to wrap himself in ribbons of essence and surround himself with images of shields and swords. <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> He is going to train for the charm &quot;protection of celestial bliss&quot; for these two days. He will only have one more day to practice it after to learn it. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T23:56:12-07:00","id":92153,"title":"","content":"Noticing the other Solar waving his blade around, Yi observed for a moment before he spoke up. &quot;That isn't the way to go about it. You are not bringing something new into existence, like you did with the shield, but making a statement of what is already so. 'As the sun is unassailable in the sky, so am I beyond my enemies.' It is a thing not of motion, but of stillness. Though all the world shift and change, you are eternal and unmoved.&quot;<br /> <br /> He paused for a moment remembering his own first dance with the sword.<br /> <br /> &quot;Rather than use the sword, brandish it. Make each motion its own statement of your ability. Even if one flows into the next, make each an individual sign of your quality. The sun does not flicker, but every second is an affirmation of its light.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T22:08:24-07:00","id":92651,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmmm.. I see, I see. The sun is ever enduring. I suppose I should be in that state as well. I should meditate on the sun. Thank you for the advice. I would love for you to teach me. Perhaps there are some things that I could share with you as well.&quot; Hyuga will then sit down with his blade across his legs while he meditates focusing on his presence and his sword.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T11:03:46-07:00","id":92882,"title":"","content":"&quot;I would first have to know what skills you possess before I could even contemplate learning any of them. I can not know what I do not know without recourse to others who do.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T11:22:43-07:00","id":92890,"title":"","content":"&quot;It seems you are my greater when it comes to swordsmanship, but I can teach you about the art of crafting. I can show you how to mend broken things like the sun helping to perfect a plants life. Using your essence, I can teach you to build objects using your hands as the only tools required. My trade as a blacksmith (craft fire) is unparalleled and I can teach you many of its secrets. I can share the knowledge of the tools you have inside of you that you can bring out with just a mention of its name just as if you were working in a master's workshop. Finally, I can teach you to train your body like an ox making it stronger like a true blacksmith. What do you seek to learn?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> The charms I can teach are Crack-Mending technique, Craftsman needs no tools, words-as-workshop method, peerless paragon of fire, and ox-body technique. I also have the first and third crafting excellencies. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T13:53:32-07:00","id":92965,"title":"","content":"&quot;I have heard it said of the anathema, that in their impatience they did not wait for their wonders to ripen and hastened each work to completion. If you know this skill I would learn it. I am not untrained in mystic artifact, and have felt first hand the frustration of long labor to little gain.&quot;<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">CNNT</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T14:04:09-07:00","id":92968,"title":"","content":"&quot;Certainly. The sun waits for none. It arrives in the sky when it chooses to. Such is the sun's power for creating great works of art as well. You must focus on yourself being the tool that is needed. Those measly metal instruments cannot compare to the power of the sun. They are merely a handicap to the Sun's chosen. Just know that your sun-seared hands are enough. Your artifact will come soon as you want it. Focus your essence into your hands and picture what you want done with the artifact. Once you focus on the image of the artifact you want, your hands will do all the work. Your creation will see light all the sooner. You must believe in the power of the sun in your hands.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T20:41:16-07:00","id":95376,"title":"","content":"&quot;And that, is the stabbing fork, it goes next to the soup spoon,&quot; Tirien says, doing puhsups with one hand, flipping every so often, as Dero ponders the myriad of hastily scrounged spoons, knives and forks arrayed around him,&quot; The entire point is to make people not want to stab you when you stab them first,&quot; she points out in her acrobatics.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T09:49:44-07:00","id":95708,"title":"","content":"A short time later, in the guise of a different pauper, Yi walked the town observing the fruit of his efforts. Yes, now was the time to strike, while the iron was still hot. He came upon a man sitting in the street, likely a true beggar.<br /> <br /> &quot;Say, what was all th' holler'n round 'bout th'r&quot; he gestured toward the market. &quot;a piece back?&quot;<br /> <br /> The man shot him a look and said nothing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Catchy, true as dirt. How'd it get along?&quot; Without waiting for a reply he hummed a few bars a little poorly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Strange as strange that gibberin' though. Can't a preacher speak normal like so as we can understand 'im? All that hollerin for the gods alone never did much for me.&quot;<br /> <br /> That at least brought a twitch the other beggars mouth.<br /> <br /> &quot;One of them whatchcallem thaumurges was jabbering on 'bout it meaning something, though I still say, my own self, that it aint no good if no one but thaumurges know it.<br /> <br /> She said, 'I will praise the Unconquered, for he has triumphed greatly.'<br /> <br /> Now, 'tween you and me, I don't see how any unconquered needs much extra praising. If'n he's unconquered I recon everybody know about it already. 'Sides what's a guy like that gonna do with praisin'? Praisin' don't make you unconquered. If I were unconquered I'd have it up to here with praisin'. I'd want stuff done right, done proper like you know? Shows me that them praisers were doing something with not being conquered, doing something worthy being unconquered for. Can't think of no better praisin' then that.&quot;<br /> <br /> They sat together for a time when Yi stood up.<br /> <br /> &quot;Seein' as this here is your spot, I'l just leave ya' to it. Don't want to spread the wealth when you ain't got none, am I right?&quot;<br /> <br /> As he walked away the beggar stood up a little straighter, and almost unconsciously started humming the tune that a ragged preacher had sung not so long ago.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Using Wise-Eyed Courtier Technique to establish the belief that people must work for their own salvation without passively waiting for others to save them.<br /> <br /> Supplementing the attack with Heartfelt Honorific Opportunity (My charisma based version) to make the attack unexpected. Given the magnitude of 2 and the now nonexistent DV of the leader (who I assume is mortal anyway) I just need to get two successes on a Charisma + Socialize roll. The total cost is 6m 2wp. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4433836/\" target=\"_blank\">Here is my roll</a>, 5 successes by my count. (Charisma 3 + Socialize 5 + 2 dice stunt. If it is a 3 dice, please let me know so I can adjust my stunt reward accordingly. Also, please let me know if this stunt accords with my motivation which is an automatic upgrade.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T18:25:48-07:00","id":96099,"title":"","content":"What ho! The Magnificent Tale continues!<br /> <br /> @Exthalion: Yes, that does seem to be in accord with your motivation, so upgrade. <br /> <br /> Yi's little diddy spreads like wildfire among the town. Your journey downriver is slowed slightly by a unseasonably harsh storm, but you arrive in Novalesk-city roughly on schedule. Dero, who is still wondering why one has a different fork for stabbing and for plucking eyeballs, indicates that a tall building nearby is the Temple of Origenes. The other places you may want to go, such as the Hall of the Boule and the Academy of Socerous wisdom, are all further inland. <br /> <br /> WHAT DO?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T20:39:38-07:00","id":96150,"title":"","content":"<i>I know my message took, but I hope they do not forsake wisdom for their fervor. Salvation is a process, not an accomplishment. There is no glory in being destroyed in the quest for it, only broken homes and broken hearts.</i><br /> <br /> Yi reviewed his companions. He was still wary of them, but there was something worthwhile there. &quot;I will secure divine aid. Please do try to neither burn the city down nor provoke the Wyld Hunt into coming while I am gone.&quot; His tone was still abrasive, but there was a hint of a smile on his lips.<br /> <br /> [Going to the Temple of the Origenes. A description would be appreciated.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-21-2014, 11:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-22T11:13:05-07:00","id":96428,"title":"","content":"Those of you who head towards the Temple find it to be a broad stone building. I looks to be at least four stories in height, and looks to be taller due to the massive stone base on which it rests. The building and its base are both of a dark brown-grey stone, and appear to have simply been grown from the earth, rather than built. It's appearance is neither similar to the simple monastery-temples of the Immaculate Order or the ostentatious cathedrals found in certain portions of the Threshold. It is a solid building, looking to be as much of a fortress as a temple. Solid, practical, and lacking ostentation. Much like the people who worship there. <br /> <br /> The interior of the temple is much like the exterior. It is decorated almost entirely with statues and tapestries; the only metal you can see are coins in the many votive offering bowls, and the weapons in the hands of the temple guards. There appear to be a relatively small number of priests, perhaps a score at most, milling about the temple, identifiable by their deep green stoles. Each stole has a variable series of blue and red stripes at the ends, perhaps indicating their duties or rank. The temple is filled with many people, and their quiet murmurings combining to make a solid buzz of background noise. In a far corner of the temple, you notice a temple Sorcerer conjuring food; the reactions of those within the temple appear to indicate that this is not an unusual occurrence. A small boy in tattered clothing runs straight into Yi, his mother, a ragged middle-age woman, pulls him aside and apologizes profusely. While she shuffles her son out the door, you notice that the basket she's carrying holds a loaf of bread, several pinkish ovoid wafers, and a handful of small denomination coins. <br /> <br /> All in all, you get the impression that the gods and priests within the temple genuinely care about spreading the wealth that enters their doors around the community. Or they are incredibly savvy, knowing that doing so earns them a great deal of favor with the lower classes. Or they are incredibly clever, and are doing both. <br /> <br /> A young priestess approaches you. Her stole bears a broad red and a narrow blue stripe; the most common combination you've seen. She asks if there is there is anything she can do to assist you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-22T18:00:16-07:00","id":96612,"title":"","content":"(Tirien will go to the Hall of the Boule)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-23T09:08:07-07:00","id":96912,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga will head towards the Academy of Sorcerous Wisdom)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-23T18:48:35-07:00","id":97175,"title":"","content":"Yi looked at the young woman, trying to remember what he had been like at that age. Images flashed before his mind of scrolls hung from the ceiling for quick reference, codicies open on every reasonably flat surface, and piles of lose papers covered with hastily written notes, half finished essays, and reminders of everything from page references to the need to eat<br /> <br /> <i>I worked so hard and hated everyone around me so much, was it really worth it?</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Is there a quiet shrine or altar where I may pray to the god in solitude? I am on a spiritual journey to bring providence and felicity to all under Heaven, and have prayed at many temples already for the blessings of the gods. I wish now to do proper honor to the god.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T17:50:26-07:00","id":97918,"title":"","content":"(At the Hall of the Boule) <br /> The hall of the Boule is a large, hexagonal building, built of a light-grey stone. Aside from its size, there is not anything particularly special about its construction. Dero leads you past several entrances, urging you towards a specific entrance on the north-eastern face. Above the entrance, you notice Gens Ptreas' house Mon. Dero indicates that each Gens has a specific entrance to their chambers. A pair of guards bar your passage, but they allow you through when shown Nikon's document. Once through, you find yourself in a large waiting room. There are a half dozen large offices surrounding room, with about the same number of smaller offices. Presumably, these are the offices of Ptreas' representatives and the representatives of their cadet houses, respectively. <br /> <br /> A balding portly man steps out of one of the offices moments after you enter, grumbling something about &quot;Damned-able Zophyrus wheedling&quot;. He glances in your direction, and with a shocked expression, heads over to you.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ptreas Artemeon Derontikles, what are you doing here?&quot; He demands. Dero, mildly embarrassed introduces his uncle, Ptreas Nikoloin Isaakos, fourth Representative of Gens Ptreas in the Halls of the Boule.<br /> <br /> (At the Academy)<br /> The Academy, is strangely enough, a park. A carefully landscaped park, occasionally interspersed with tall, narrow towers, themselves attached to each other with long, delicate walkways. Gazing from the outside, you see that the only people walking around on ground-level are caretakers, who are tending to the park's careful landscape. Taking a step into the Academy, you feel a spike in ambient essence. The Academy is a Wood-aspected manse. Once you step through, a spirit, eerily reminiscent of a humanoid Mantis materializes in front of you.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Academy is not accepting applications at this time,&quot; the spirit says in a clicking voice, &quot;Good morning&quot;<br /> <br /> (At the Temple)<br /> The young priestess smiles at Yi's request. &quot;Of course sir. We understand that there are those who require privacy to commune with the divine.&quot;<br /> <br /> She leads you towards one of the building's corners, were what appears to be a small nook turns back onto itself, revealing a narrow hallway dotted with doors. Each door has a simple curtain in front of it. A small basket of matte black stones stands nearby atop a small wooden table. The priestess says, &quot;Simply place one of these stones on the floor outside your chosen room. That will indicate that it is taken.&quot; With that, she bows and leaves. You notice several stones on the floor, and taking one from the basket, you do as the priestess suggested with your chosen room. <br /> <br /> Inside the room, you find a simple altar, lit from above by a skylight. On the altar, there is a small bowl of unlit incense, and foot tall wooden statuette of a robed man, holding a staff and with a short, broad blade on his belt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T20:11:27-07:00","id":98024,"title":"","content":"&quot;Good day. I am sorry, but I was not looking to enroll at this time. I was just curious what was here. It seems to be quite beautiful. I though maybe that someone might be able to help me recognize what this box is.&quot; Hyuga will pull out the music box that he used before. &quot;It seems to be use some type of magic, but I am not sure what. I was hoping there might be someone here that can help me identify it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T20:53:09-07:00","id":98050,"title":"","content":"<i>Well, let us see if this god is worthy of the devotion shown him.</i><br /> <br /> As though shrugging off a cloak, Yi's ragged garments fell away. In their place vestments of marramas and samite shone as bright as polished silver and molten gold. His orichalcum guan flashed as though he was crowned with the sun. He looked at once a priest and a king, each title demanding and deserving of the other. He rubbed a set of crimson prayer beads fashioned from coral then snapped his fingers causing the incense to light. It was a parlor trick, but one that worked surprisingly well for most people. Then he began an ancient Old Realm mantra, raising his voice in a singing chant,<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">On the infinite Wyld and the abodes set therein,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">On that essence which turns all things to glory,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">We meditate, as Princes most highly Exalted,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">That we may be worthy of the task laid before us.</span></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> In Old Realm it was known simply as the hymn, and written at the beginning of many surviving documents. In some cases it was almost unreadable, embellished with such calligraphy that it became an ornate seal of the Anathema's government. Yi had often wondered if that was not a sign of their ruin, that they made their core prayer into a meaningless icon instead of an object of reverence. It was a risk to open with it, some text noted almost casually that great gods had come even before it was finished to await the pleasure of the Lawgivers. While his intention was merely to signal his desire for a direct audience, he could not entirely drive the image of the ancient symbol of the Old Realm from his mind.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">First, <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4444857/\" target=\"_blank\">this roll</a> allows the Guan of Heaven's Son to activating raising my effective appearance and charisma by 3 dice.<br /> <br /> Next, going to make a prayer roll. The goal is to request a visitation from the god and to favorably incline him toward me.<br /> <br /> Charisma 3+3 + Performance 5 + 1st Excellency 8 + Stunt 2 + Compassion 4 = 25 dice against difficulty 5. (Base 7 -1 from the resource 1 incense -1 from being a Zenith and thus a priest).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4444859/\" target=\"_blank\">I rolled 9 success.</a> (And grumbled about the 12.5 successes that should have generated on average <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)<br /> <br /> Total cost: 8 personal motes, 1wp, 1 compassion channel</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-25-2014, 03:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T15:41:50-07:00","id":98717,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> The spirit makes a clicking noise, gazing upon your daiklaive. It says, &quot;You are one of those. I shall inquire as to whether the Artificery staff has a moment. Please head towards the second entrance to your left. I will meet you there as soon as I have an answer.&quot;<br /> <br /> The spirit disappears, and you head towards the designated entrance, mindful of the wrought-iron fence. Moments after arriving, the spirit re-appears. &quot;You are fortunate,&quot; it says, &quot;One of the staff will see you now.&quot;<br /> <br /> The spirit points towards the nearest tower. &quot;Head towards that tower. Stay on the path. Any deviations from the path will be met with immediate force.&quot; And with that, it disappears again. <br /> <br /> Once inside the Tower, you are met by a heavily scarred woman with flaming red hair. She is missing her left eye, and her left arm appears to have been constructed from semi-molten obsidian. Regardless of her somewhat grim appearance, she appears to be genuinely pleased to see you. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, the Scavenger Lord,&quot; she says, &quot;I hear you have a magical mystery, eh?&quot;<br /> <br /> Taking hold of the music box, she examines it for a few moments, humming to herself. &quot;Quite the marvel I must say. Haven't seen anything quite like it before, which means my students haven't either. It'll be good practice for them.&quot;<br /> <br /> She waves for you to follow her up a set of stairs. &quot;Where did you get your hands on it?&quot; she asks casually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T15:50:15-07:00","id":98727,"title":"","content":"(Temple)<br /> Yi's prayer is met by a deep silence. The silence inches on for nearly a minute, before a voice says, &quot;Has anyone ever told you that you're a pompous, melodramatic arse?&quot; Looking for the source of the voice, Yi's eyes settle upon the statuette, which appears to have become animate. <br /> <br /> The statue bows dramatically, and says, &quot;Great Chosen of Sol Invictus, High Priest of the Ignis Divine, Right Hand of the Daystar, and all of those other titles. How might I be of service to you today?&quot;<br /> <br /> It straightens itself, saying in an aside, &quot;I apologize for not appearing personally. The ambrosia doesn't form if I'm out there, though, and this is one of the busiest hours of the day. If you desire a face-to-face conversation, however, it can be arranged.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T16:12:20-07:00","id":98743,"title":"","content":"&quot;Several, in fact, have said something to that effect. They tend to be the ones I dislike least as those willing to be honest about something as personally important as what they think of me can usually be trust to give equally honest opinions about the far more abstract concerns of dealing with whatever is about to destroy the world this week.I suppose I shall have to put you in the same category, renamed from dislike less to like more in honor of your presence of course.<br /> <br /> A conversation in person would be preferable, though I remain flexible on it. Your sanctum is far more then just your home and I would not presume to enter or seek entrance without your explicit and willing invitation. To offer you something to consider, hopefully more wholesome to the intellect then my previous offering...&quot; he gestured at the still burning incense, &quot;I have come to negotiate for your assistance in the current incursion from Rakshastan and hopefully your future friendship and partnership in dragging this nation out of the Age of Sorrows.<br /> <br /> If you would like me to be less direct and more obeisant, I will endeavor to do so, though I have found it takes far more time and results in far less clarity then I normally prefer. Again though, I would not presume to ignore the etiquette appropriate before a being as enlightened and divine as yourself. &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T16:55:18-07:00","id":98773,"title":"","content":"Seeing her shot at talking to the bigwigs, Tirien bows deeply, and introduces herself.<br /> <br /> &quot;Greetings, Ser. I am Ledaal Monos Tirien of the Scarlet Dynasty. I come, having heard of the trials befalling your fair nation, and would like to assist in creating an army to counter them. I have already spoken to your clan patriarch, and he agrees with my messages. I have a message to give to you and your fellow representatives of Clan Ptreas,&quot; she says, &quot;Dero here has been invaluable in our negotiations, and I would like his involvement as my assistant if at all possible.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T17:28:18-07:00","id":98809,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will bow and follow her. &quot;Hello, my name is Citan Hyuga, a traveler in these woods. This was a treasure that was taken and placed in a certain wyld zone's treasury. I assume it was a relic from a battle before the rise of the Empress. It was given to me for certain reasons. I am currently trying to find a way to help in the protection of Novalesk. I had a feeling this artifact might help with such battles and sought an expert in such matters. It looks like it might help with your training of students as well. I have dabbled in the occult and am an artificer, but I am no magician myself.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T17:41:22-07:00","id":98819,"title":"","content":"(Temple)<br /> The statue makes a thoughtful noise. It taps its chin for a few moments, then says, &quot;I think we can talk.&quot; It snaps its fingers, and an otherworldly door appears on one of the walls. <br /> <br /> Should Yi enter the door, he finds himself in a strange place; a small island, the size of a modest homestead, floating in a starry vault. A large house, modestly decorated (by divine standards) dominates the landscape, but Yi is himself standing in a substantive garden. In a nearby gazebo, a robed man waves you over. He is not of any particular height or weight. His robes, however, appear to be woven of some silvery-white metal, and he holds in his hand a stave of Green Jade, covered in hypnotic patterns of Starmetal. Once you are close enough to make out his features, you notice that, in general, he would not be particularly out of place on the streets of Novalesk. Save for the fact that his features are a bit too symmetrical, and his is skin without blemish, belying his divine nature. He motions you to take a seat at the cluttered table beneath the gazebo.<br /> <br /> &quot;Apologies for the mess, honored Lawgiver,&quot; the god says casually,&quot;I was trying to catch up on some paperwork.&quot; He passes his hand over the table, and the cluttered papers fly out into an organized stack before disappearing with a small pop. A few scattered pieces of ambrosia dot the table, and he frowns slightly. He pushes them into a nearby basket, clearing off the table. He dips his hand into a small bowl hanging above the table, and then sprinkles the liquid onto the table, creating an elaborate tea set complete with a varied assortment of pastries and sweetmeats. <br /> <br /> &quot;As you likely gathered, I am Origenes, god of both the nation of Novalesk and its founding city,&quot; the deity says as he pours himself a glass of steaming tea, &quot;and you are a Zenith Caste, one of the high Priests of the Most High.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I forget myself. Please help yourself,&quot; Origenes gestures to the assembled 'feast', &quot;You offer help, which, in this current hour of crisis, is a shower after the drought. What I want to know, however, is your price.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T17:54:56-07:00","id":98827,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> <br /> Isaakos raises an eyebrow at mention of the scarlet dynasty, but allows Tirien to finish.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't see how I can be of much help,&quot; he says, &quot;The Boule has the power to call the Gens' to place their troops at the command of the Strategoi, yes. But with the current domestic situation, Nikoloi and Zophyrus would stonewall the measures. Unless the capital was itself at risk, they're more likely to aim for each other than the Fae right now.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Other than that, the Strategoi hold the power to raise independent forces. But the Capital troops are nearly all on our borders now. Without a core of veteran troops to train and temper the masses, those levies would be little more than an undisciplined rabble.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 03-25-2014, 09:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T18:48:03-07:00","id":98850,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> &quot;Interesting&quot;, the woman responds. She leads you into a small, meticulously organized workshop. A young girl, in her mid-teens at most, looks up from a table. From the layout of the room, and the young girl's surprise at being disturbed, you gather that she is probably an apprentice artificer working on her journeyman project, and this is her 'personal' workspace. <br /> <br /> &quot;Madame Maia,&quot; the girl says, bowing slightly.<br /> <br /> Maia returns the greeting with a nod and says, &quot;Thalia. I would like you to examine this artifact&quot;<br /> <br /> Thalia takes the music box and begins handling examining it intently. She dons a strange headpiece with dozens of independent lenses, and, grabbing a pair of small jade tools, pries the lid open. <br /> <br /> &quot;There appears to be a series of motonic-kinetic capacitors,&quot; Thalia says, &quot;Indicating an influx of essence is required to operate the device.&quot; She flips a pair of lenses into her eyes, &quot;Judging from the number, I estimate between thirty and forty motes to bring the device to full operation, depending on the efficiency of the mechanisms. Given the cleanliness of the construction, I would lean closer to the lower estimate.&quot;<br /> <br /> She flips through several more lenses, &quot;The internal mechanisms are constructed primarily of Orichalcum, with Soulsteel placing an easy second. The actual mechanisms of operation are functionally identical to that of a kinetic music box. The engravings are unlike that which would create music however. It appears similar to a sorcerous formula.&quot; Thalia gets up, removes her headpiece, and heads over towards a small bookcase. She sorts through for a moment until she finds the book she was looking for, and leafs through for a moment. Heading back towards the music box, she replaces the headgear and examines the box again. She makes a content noise.<br /> <br /> &quot;The formula is consistent with the emotional induction patterns found in <i>The Black and White Treatises</i>. Given the Soulsteel construction, it is likely that this is a negative emotion. Perhaps a spiritually draining effect?&quot; <br /> <br /> Thalia shakes her head. &quot;I'm afraid I can't be more specific than that, ma'am. The only other thing I'm certain of is that there are no discrimination patterns in the formula. The device will effect anyone or anything within its area of effect. Given the construction, I would say that the area is based off of line of sound. I advise strongly against experimentation on-site.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia nods, her expression thoughtful. She looks over to Hyuga, &quot;That what you expected, Scavenger-boy?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T19:32:56-07:00","id":98876,"title":"","content":"&quot;Heh. Not bad. Thalia, is it? You seem to be quite a capable student. It does indeed produce quite a dreary sound. I did not use near enough motes to get its full effect. You said that it had some patterns like one in <i>The Black and White Treatsies?</i> Could I perhaps see that book for a short minute?&quot; Hyuga will nod towards the book. &quot;Those are quite the glasses you have there too. Perhaps I should try to make something like those. It would certainly help me craft some new useful artifacts. It is too bad that I do not have the time to wait and learn much more from this place. It is quite amazing. I thank you for your analysis. It seems that this box will have its uses. Thank you again for your help!&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will bow and then turn to Madame Maia. &quot;I appreciate your willingness to help in this matter, Madame Maia. It seems you have quite capable students as well. Perhaps I will eventually come upon something that may actually be a challenge for your students. This artifact didn't seem to even put up a fight. If I find another, I would love to come back and share it. Is there anything I can do to pay back your generosity in the future? Oh.. I do not have much money, so I will not be able to pay anything like that at the moment. I would be happy to later when I have the chance if that is what you wish.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will turn back one more time to the student. &quot;May the blessings of the Unconquered Sun shine brightly upon you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will then turn once again to Madame Maia making sure to flash the orichalcum ring on his hand so that she can see it very well.<br /> <br /> Hyuga will wait to do anything further until she responds or beckons him anywhere. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> If I am allowed to peek through the book real quick, I will use my memory stone to place as many of those patterns and the included text as possible in my memories. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T19:59:06-07:00","id":98889,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh nothing too onerous: Only for the earth to render up such bounty that men believe they have wandered into Heaven, for all your statues and images to proclaim me ordained as coequal god of the nation and its king, and all the secrets of the First Age in clear and concise language.&quot;<br /> <br /> There was a few heartbeats where silence reigned.<br /> <br /> &quot;Forgive me, my wits seem to have fled for a moment. Perhaps they were sampling the repast. Terribly flighty things, I have found entire cities where they went to roost somewhere and never returned. In greater seriousness, the more mundane analogs of those things would be quite helpful. I will not me so gauche as to demand a price for my efforts, I would seek to aid this nation without your aid should you refuse to grant it.<br /> <br /> Though I am weakening my own negotiating position, all I really came for was to gain the political support of your priesthood in mobilizing the martial and productive energies of the nation to combat the Fey. Anything beyond that is surplus benefit. That said, the degree of support you give me can be strongly translated into additional benefit for you. More desirable environmental conditions will lead to an increase in the wealth of the nation, larger population, and, of course, a greater quality and quantity of sacrifice. Strong support will allow me to better direct the people for things besides war, such as geomantic and infrastructural engineering as well as shrines and temple refits back by Exalted excellence. As for your wisdom and experience, both in First Age and other matters, I am willing to express my gratitude anew with each act of assistance on your part.<br /> <br /> In a blatant attempt to improve my side of the bargaining, I am associates with a Descending Sun and Changing Moon with similar aspirations for benefiting the nation. They are both capable combatants and my own skill at the craft of the Copper Spiders is not lacking.&quot;<br /> <br /> He spread his hands in an accommodating manor while glancing sidelong as the basket of ambrosia as though noticing how small it was in comparison to the salaries of Celestial deities. (Though in truth he was unsure of how significant it really was).<br /> <br /> &quot;So, do you believe we can do business?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T20:19:05-07:00","id":98900,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> Thalia hands you the book. As Hyuga leafs through it, Maia says, &quot;The girl is indeed a capable student. I suppose it's to be expected; her father runs this Academy. She's been neck deep in sorcerous formulae and artifact schemae since before she could walk. I doubt half of my faculty would be able to give you half of the information she did.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia looks to Thalia, &quot;Continue with your project.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia beckons you out, and leads you back down the stairs, &quot;Only my students need call me Madame. Hearing it from anyone else makes me feel old. Simply Maia, please. I hoped something unusual would throw her off, but she's got too much of her father's instincts for that. Don't worry about the cost. It cost us nothing material, and relatively little time. Besides the girl got to see something new, and I got to see how she reacted to it. It was an important learning experience for us both.&quot;<br /> <br /> Upon flashing your ring to Maia, she grasps your hand to get a better look. &quot;I've seen such devices before,&quot; she says, &quot;They were designed to allow the unenlightened to utilize essence technologies. Moreover, they declared the owner's allegiance to the Anathema.&quot;<br /> <br /> She releases your hand before continuing, &quot;I would hesitate to wear such a thing so openly if I were you. While few here have much hatred or fear of the Anathema, there are many who would view it with suspicion, to say the least.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia shakes her head, apparently clearing it of those darker thoughts, &quot;Well Scavenger-boy, if you have no pressing matters, I can take you on a quick tour of the campus. Or I know of a nice pub nearby, where you can regale me of stories looting ancient ruins and fighting foul monsters. Who knows, if you impress me, I might even be able to get you a job here. I am rather close to the Chancellor.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T21:08:27-07:00","id":98922,"title":"","content":"(Temple)<br /> &quot;My priesthood throw in behind you? Their clout with those in power is not quite as much as you would hope. Unfortunately, neither is mine. Officially, the political role of the temple is merely observational, letting the politicians know when something may run into ... questionable Heavenly legality,&quot; Origenes says with a sigh, &quot;Unofficially, it fulfills a nonpartisan advisory role, but whether or not anyone listens is dependent upon the administration. Of which we have none, at the moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;If you get one of the powers to make a move I may be able to help, though. A motion in the Boule. A declaration by the Strategoi or one of the Gentes. Get one of them to make a move, and I'll throw my personal support behind it. I'm sure you noticed in my temple that we provide material support for the less fortunate,&quot; Origene's expression turns almost devious, &quot;I will admit, it is not entirely out of compassion. Such actions are me reinvesting my income, to put it metaphorically. By doing so, I help the community thrive, and it grows larger and more thankful towards me. And I gain back what I put in fivefold.<br /> <br /> &quot;But I digress. This has gained me, personally, a large amount of sway with the lower classes. Should I throw in behind a measure, those who proposed it and those who support it will benefit from my popularity with the masses. The others will have to think twice before opposing it,&quot; he shrugs, &quot;I'm not saying that it will cause all to support the measure. But anyone who would be neutral, and perhaps some others as well, would support to keep popular opinion from swinging against them.&quot;<br /> <br /> Origenes smiles faintly, &quot;In the other matters, I can likely be more useful. I do have significant financial resources. I'm not saying that I can foot the cost of the war, but I can certainly contribute to the War-chest. I also have some contacts in the city's Salles and Dojos. It won't get you an army, but it will get you some individually powerful people.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T21:55:41-07:00","id":98939,"title":"","content":"&quot;I could go for a drink about now. It has been quite a while. I would be happy to share some stories with you.&quot; Hyuga will follow her to the bar and stick the ring on his hand into the pocket amd wrapping his cloak tightly around him.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, I do not loot many tombs or get in many epic battles. I prefer to make my artifacts if possible. I trust them and connect with them better that way. The only exception is this sword. That was my best story of all.&quot; Hyuga will pause in thought for a short while, thinking about the events that day in the village. He was beginning to forget them, but this brought them all back to the surface. A slightly more grim look appeared on his face for a second or two, before regaining his usual composure.<br /> <br /> &quot;One day... before &quot;Twilight&quot; I was staying in a village many sun-downs from here. It was quite a peaceful place though they did have many beast-man tribes bother the area. Having lost my parents, I decided to help them so they would not lose their families. I helped by crafting weapons for them to defend themselves I had just starting roaming and it was the first place I stayed at in the east. I have been a blacksmith since my younger years and was just starting to travel to &quot;broaden my horizons&quot; as my master would say. I began to try to find ideas for new works of art to craft as my master had insisted. I lost my family when I was quite young and the master was all I had, but we all must move on one day.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will pause and take a drink before continuing on. &quot;There was a girl there that I had gotten to know. She was like family to me. In the end, I decided I needed to move on again for the sake of my learning. Right as I was leaving, an attack was happening on the village. I heard many screams and knew that just having weapons was not enough for them. I had to go back. It was then that I saw my friend Chloe killed by an anathema. A dawn caste I believe. Eventually.. I will find him and pay him back...&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will take another drink and wait a minute to finish his story.&quot; At that point, I don't know what I was thinking, but I lunged at him. He stopped me with relative ease. He taunted me and then tried to kill Chloe's mother. I attacked again trying to use his sword, THIS sword in fact, and failed. I couldn't even lift it. I knew I was going to die then, but the Unconquered Sun had other plans. He eventually had me by the throat. Out of luck and the Sun's great blessing, I managed to kick the sword whilst dangling in the air. Somehow, I just knew how to do it. I failed to pick the blade up, but I knew that somehow this would work. I felt as if secrets were pouring into me about this artifact. It managed to slick a huge gash in his arm and he dropped Chloe's mother. At that moment, the Sun's real blessing came upon me and blinded him. I managed to get another sword and cut him deeply in that moment of confusion. In his pain, he ran off dropping this sword. The sword that saved Chloe's mother and myself.&quot; Hyuga will finger the blade slowly thinking about that moment. After a moment of silence, Hyuga will sit up looking a bit perkier and down his drink.<br /> <br /> &quot;That really is my only mildly entertaining story. I have battled some fae, killed some beast-men, and defended myself from barbarians on my travels, but nothing major really. I managed to get the ingredients to forge this armor in those travels, but it was not as grand an adventure as I had hoped.&quot; Hyuga will pull his cloak away slightly revealing a part of his orichalcum armor.<br /> <br /> &quot;I suppose your adventures must have been more grand.&quot; Hyuga will then sit back and listen to her.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga will attempt to make the story as interesting as possible. Char+ performance= 2 + 2-die stunt? = 2 +0 sux <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4446030/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4446030/</a> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":"03-26-2014, 12:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T21:58:29-07:00","id":98940,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah, my sheltered upbringing works against me again. I had assumed everything beyond the shores of the Inland Sea was enthralled by local gods who ruled as tyrants with the support of their enslaved or equally wicked subordinates and their inbred dynasties in mockery of the true Princes of the Earth. Please remind me to correct my immaculate tutors one of these days. I do think they actually believed some of that.<br /> <br /> Before we continue, I would like your analysis of the current political and power situation in the city and nation. No need for up to date gossip, but enough that I can make informed decisions about who to approach and what sort of moves I can or should make.<br /> <br /> As for specific promises, I will right now swear before heaven and earth that If you provide me the wealth of your treasuries I will pay you back with twice its material worth, half in new donations and half in direct sacrifices. After the war of course. I hope you don't mind my forwardness, but there is something of a time constraint in the short term.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-26-2014, 01:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T09:26:39-07:00","id":99226,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ser Isaakos, do you know what would happen when the Fae invade. It won't be just about taking a few human hostages; it will be full-on butchery. They'll steal souls, devour dreams and corrupt the very land itself to suit their needs. The only way to stop them is to nip them in the bud. These Fae are the worst, who cannot even be reasoned with or dissuaded by altering their legends. However, if we act quickly, we can stop this and even make Novalesk a power in this region,&quot; Tirien says, an aura of majesty emanating from her,&quot; I will discuss this with the Strategoi, but I had hoped that the Ptreas clan would assist me, being the dutiful sons of Novalesk that they are.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tirien rolls Cha+Presence to convince Isaakos to join her cause. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4446308/\" target=\"_blank\">she rolls 6 suxx.</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T15:00:53-07:00","id":99528,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> &quot;My adventures?&quot; Maia says, clearly surprised. &quot;I haven't gone on any adventures. Though I can see why you'd think so. Me having all of these,&quot; she waves self-consciously towards her heavily scarred left side. &quot;I suppose I can tell you how I got them. Tale for a tale.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia orders a fresh round of drinks and grows pensive, clutching her refreshed drink, &quot;It was about fifteen years ago, back when I was scarcely older than my prodigal student. I was a journeyman at the academy, studying the Art of Warding. Chancellor Feiro was mentoring me, and wanted me to summon a demon for a practical exam.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;A gethin,&quot; she continues, her sole remaining eye growing slightly glassy at the memory, &quot;sneaky little lizards, about the size of a dog. About as harmless as demons come. Chancellor thought it would be a nice, easy practical. And it would have been, if I had done my calculations right. Instead of summoning a gethin, I summoned the Sire of the Gethin, Octavian, the Living Tower.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It was a bit of a shock, to put it mildly. He was pretty pissed for some reason, so he swung at me with this giant metal bar. I tried to block it with my left arm. It ... didn't work. Then all I can remember is some sort of blast, and waking up a couple of days later. The Chancellor bound and banished the demon, but I got caught in the blast, burning the entire left side of my body. The physicians were able save my life, but they couldn't save my eye or arm.<br /> <br /> &quot;Feiro looked over my calculations. Turns out that I forgot to carry a one. One tiny math error caused all of this. He was baffled though, said that the ritual should have just failed. He's even tried it a few more times over the years, but its never had an effect,&quot; Maia grumbles, &quot;But I'm getting off course. I was determined to get my eye and arm back, but i would never be able to afford sorcerous rejuvenation. A magical prosthetic would be almost as expensive, if I didn't build it myself. So I transferred to the Artificery, and worked like I was possessed,&quot; Maia's voice has become distant, lost in the memories, &quot;Then, combing through the archives, I found an ancient codex on golem construction. The proper preparation rituals, construction methods, binding tables. Everything.&quot;<br /> <br /> She locks eyes with Hyuga for a brief moment, before looking away, somewhat embarrassed, &quot;I'm part Fire Elemental, and most golems work by binding an elemental into a shell as a power source. So I hatched a plan. I built an arm, and worked for years, modifying the formulae, and refining my alterations. Checking and double-checking. After nearly five years of work, I ritually bound my own elemental essence to this.&quot;<br /> <br /> She holds up her left arm displaying the delicate artifice of its construction, &quot;It's just as nimble as my other arm, and has better reflexes, but I can't find a way to make sensory feedback. Otherwise I would have replaced my eye too.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia sits back into her chair, and eyes her now-empty drink, shrugging, &quot;So that's pretty much it. The grand tale of my great fall and rise to the dubious heights of academia.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T16:51:32-07:00","id":99583,"title":"","content":"(Temple) <br /> &quot;They are right, in some cases,&quot; Origenes laughs, &quot;Such nations exist. They're not exactly common, but not exactly uncommon either, if you catch my meaning. I prefer to avoid such vulgar violations of Celestial law, though.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;As for the current domestic situation. The Fae caught us in the midst of a ... delicate political situation. The previous Archon, our head of state, left us rather expectantly. Gens Nikoloi and Gens Zophyrus each offered a candidate, with their long-standing political allies immediately throwing in behind them. Each faction has more than enough votes keep the other from ratifying their choice, even with the undecideds.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Nikoloi's candidate is Nikoloi Mari Vellius. He's a career bureaucrat, a man with decades of experience dealing with the political situation here in the Capital. He would be a strong candidate under most circumstances, as he has a reputation as an honest man and the experience to get work done. But things aren't quite usual. About two seasons ago, a young member of Gens Althea, one Althea Sanna received the grace of the Danaa'd. Althea is a long-standing ally of Zophyrus, so they threw behind her. She might be a strong candidate as well, were she not less than two decades old, with absolutely no practical experience. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ptreas and Spyrus have neither declared for a side or put forward a candidate of their own. Both are small, though, and lack sufficient numbers, even together, to break the stalemate,&quot; Origenes raises a finger and a brow, &quot;but many members of the other Gentes are hoping that one of them might be able to produce a compromise candidate. From their inaction, neither of them feel like they have a good person to do so.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Aside from the Gentes, there major institutions of the nation are my Temple, the Academy of Sorcerous Wisdom, and the Strategoi, each serving as the core of culture, learning and the military for the nation. I've already told you of how I factor into the politics. The Academy is nominally non-partisan. However, a significant percentage of the citizenry has spent at least some time studying there, even if only for a season or two. Tacit support from the Chancellor would gain a significant amount of favor from the upper classes for a candidate. Nikoloi Fiero is relentlessly apolitical, though, so good luck with that.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Strategoi serve as the military masters of the nation. They administer to and lead the Capital troops, who are at the beck and call of the state itself, rather than the Gentes. Unfortunately, those forces were the first to meet the Fae and their minions in the field, and suffered from it. The survivors from those battles are still in the field, attempting to regroup. There are currently two Strategoi, Spyrus Eugene and Zophyrus Vasil. Vasil's a fierce house loyalist, but luckily she's leading the Capital troops in the field, and out of the picture.&quot;<br /> <br /> Origenes begins rubbing his beard-less chin in thought, &quot;Now, if I wanted to break this stalemate, and I knew the nation was at risk, I would convince the two neutrals to place their troops at the hands of the Strategoi. The Strategoi hold the power to raise levies, independent of the houses or the Boule. With a core of veteran household troops to temper the untrained levies, this new legion rushes to the aid of their comrades in the field and fights off the Fae. A brilliant Ptreas or Spyrus commander distinguishes themselves in the fighting, gaining the respect of the military, the admiration of the masses, and the gratitude of their god.&quot;<br /> <br /> Origenes sighs, &quot;But sadly, I'm not allowed to be a political actor. So it would be up to someone else to pull of this feat. Or to convince one of the Gentes to withdraw their candidate. Either or.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T16:59:05-07:00","id":99587,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> Isaakos shrugs, &quot;My father has already decided to back you. Who am I to argue with his wisdom? If you desire, I can accompany you to the Strategos. Unless you want me to introduce some new legislation, there's not much else that I can do to help you, myself.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T18:33:52-07:00","id":99632,"title":"","content":"&quot;In my opinion, your adventure seems much more grand. I cannot imagine even seeing Octavian. I have only heard rumors and stories in books. It must've been really hard on you though. I was wondering about your incident though... it has never been able to be recreated using your exact specification correct? I've heard that sometimes yellow jade is created by mistake sometimes and is never able to be recreated... but this type of summoning is not anything like that correct? It seems to me as if there may have been some sort of tampering.&quot; Hyuga will look into the distance thinking for a few seconds. &quot;But what do I know? You are the expert in these matters.&quot; Hyuga will take a gulp of his drink once more. <br /> <br /> &quot;You know... I have never really thought about creating life or limbs through genesis crafting. I suppose that would help save and better more lives. I am no doctor though. I know almost nothing about medicine and the body. Perhaps there is a way to create some artifacts like the ones they had in the first age. I've only heard rumors about many of them, but I think it might be able to help with things such as that. It wouldn't be organic, but it would have the same effect. Perhaps if we find an artifact able to do that, you can find some secret to create a bionic version.&quot;<br /> Hyuga will pause for a moment and start to think about some of the patterns and information from the text he saw in the B&amp;W Treatsies.<br /> <br /> &quot;Just thinking about it, I came across some very different and interesting artifacts in the fey's land. A sword even became a dragon like creature that seemed to have life of its own. Perhaps they may even hold a secret that can unlock that mystery. I really want to discover more about it. Perhaps then I will find an artifact that can stump even you and your students... ahahahahaa.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Well... I will be seeing more of some fey artifacts soon. I have to help defend Novalesk from a fey invasion of a particular group. We came here to gather some support for the war. We don't have enough forces to hold off the fey on the front while we take care of some business behind the scenes. I am glad that the music box may be of help for that and I thank you for the information.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will finish off his drink. &quot;I suppose that I cannot forget my duty. I suppose I should look for my companions. I am sure they must have made contact with an authority that can help us turn the tide of the battle. I would love to keep in contact with you though. I know not what magic capabilities you posses, but if you are able, you can call on me anytime. If not, I will come back eventually even if I must use my own two feet. I would love to bring back more puzzles, ideas, and share more stories later on. For now, I must help stop the fey invasion. I thank you for this chat and the help you have provided me Maia. You may have even helped me to turn the tide of this war.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will then stand up and bow to Maia. &quot;May the Sun be with you at all times.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T21:36:05-07:00","id":99734,"title":"","content":"Yi sighed, absently pouring himself a cup of tea. &quot;Nothing can ever be simple can it. I will see what I can do to sort out this problem. Do I have your agreement on the treasury?&quot;<br /> <br /> He looked out at the sanctum for a moment before he said anything more.<br /> <br /> &quot;There is one other thing, a semi personal matter. Would you be open to additional... meetings of this sort from time to time. It would be presumptuous to say I am your peer and not entirely correct to say I cannot stand my associates, but I do feel a greater rapport with you then I have with anyone for quite some time.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-27T07:48:18-07:00","id":100007,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you could introduce me to the Strategoi, that would be most excellent, Ser,&quot; Tirien says, bowing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-28T14:16:49-07:00","id":100874,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> &quot;It's been fun,&quot; Maia says, a lopsided smile on her face. &quot;And you'd better bring a decent challenge next time.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'll talk to the Chancellor. let him know that another players' at the table. Don't know if he'll help you, but he may throw something your way, if he thinks you're helping.&quot; <br /> <br /> Okay. How do you intend to regroup with your compatriots?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-28T14:39:29-07:00","id":100880,"title":"","content":"(Temple)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, yes.&quot; Origenes says, &quot;we are in agreement. Though I wonder how one who came to my city so destitute would come by such bounty. But I imagine a wealth of possibilities are open to the Heralds of the Most High.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;As to your personal request: Of course,&quot; he says with a warm smile, &quot;I can open a door for you anywhere in my Temple. You have but to call.&quot;<br /> <br /> Something about Origenes expression gives you the impression that this offer is not entirely motivated by the personal rapport you've developed. Perhaps he wants to use you as leverage to get a promotion? It would seem in line with how he handles his domain, after all.<br /> <br /> Origenes reopens the door to his sanctum, allowing Yi to leave.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-28T15:31:56-07:00","id":100906,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> Isaakos nods and leads Tirien through the halls of the Hall. You pass several armed checkpoints while following Isaakos, though with his presence, you are allowed through with a minimum of fuss. Eventually you make it to a large war-room. Chaos abounds, as a vast array of uniformed people hurry about their business. In the middle of this storm is a broad, grizzled man. Unlike the others in the room, he is wearing armor, a set of jade Lamellar. He is unarmed, but as he moves about a large table, you notice that he keeps at least one weapon within easy reach at all times. Isaakos leads you through the press rather easily, and the man seems somewhat surprised by your presence. <br /> <br /> &quot;Issakos,&quot; he says, &quot;I didn't miss an appointment, did I?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;No, Eugene, you didn't,&quot; Isaakos replies.<br /> <br /> &quot;Then tell me why you're here, and be quick about it,&quot; Eugene growls, &quot;I've got a dozen things that need to be done yesterday. Not the least of which is these reports that the Fae are fighting each other.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;This is Ledaal Monos Tirien. My father beleives that she may be able to assist in the situation,&quot; Isaakos turns to Tirien, &quot;This is Strategos Syprus Eugene&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-28T16:39:22-07:00","id":100951,"title":"","content":"&quot;You don't have feel bad about using me. I know you likely wouldn't anyway, but just in case you did. Most relationships in this world are people using each other for as long as the other is useful. True friendship is a thing beyond price in part because it is so rare. As for the money, by the end of the day I could pay all the expenses of the government out of pocket. Credibility is far harder to purchase though, and priceless masterworks suffer a little when you try to divide them into reasonably fungible pieces.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that he rose gracefully and his outfit again shifted. It resembled the glorious raiment he had worn before, though woven of the same material as Origenes. It lacked intricate adornment and embroidery, though the cut and quality remained fashionable. If before he had seemed a Priest-King, now he was but a priest though one worthy of respect and deference.<br /> <br /> As he departed, emerging back into private room, he hurried out with a determined air to the great idol of the temple where he grasped the jadite and steel staff in the statue's hands. With a rustling of its robes it moved, releasing the staff into his hands and forming the mudras of no-fear and favor with the now empty appendages. Yi could have sworn he saw the statue wink and he whispered, &quot;I'll bring it back.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning, he noticing the young priestess from earlier and said in a clear voice, &quot;I have spoken with Origenes and hold the mandate to save this city and nation. Ready me an escort with authorization to release temple funds and a knowledge of the city, there is much work to do and time grows increasingly short. Have the escort meet me, I am headed for the Academy of Sorcerous Wisdom.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without another word he turned and began walking.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spending one mote to activate Mastery of Small Manners so that I don't accidentally commit blasphemy and to incline people to accept what I am saying. If a roll would be required and they wouldn't just accept the miracle let me know.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> On his way to the Academy, Yi began to draw a lot of attention. The light that shone on the world was not the light that shone on him. The dust his passing raise caught the light like tongues of flame. His glory was like a flash of lightning, and just as subtle. He did not walk, but arrived, with the presence and aloofness of a thunderstorm rolling down from the mountains. Every color of flesh and garment was richer, more intense, more <i>real</i> then anything the people had seen. Yet more then all of this, was his bearing. He walked with the dignity of a god among men and the authority of a king of kings. Upon arriving he interrupted the mantis before it could even begin talking.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am here with divine backing, an obscene amount of money to spend, and the assumption that this academy has the staff and resources to do something about converting both of those into sorcerous and thaumaturgical weapons and material for use against the fey. If this is true, please find me someone authorized to discuss it. If not, please let me know now so I can find someone who can.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I can make rolls to back this up, but I figure most people's response when someone is walking around with the visibly recognizable icons of the city god and acts like they have authority is to assume he is right. I also have an effective Appearance and Charisma of 6 and 5 in Performance and Socialize which per the descriptions in Core seems to apply I would be dragging half the city out of infatuation anyway at this point.<br /> <br /> All of this is building up to a Socialize Roll to get me Influence and once I have that, a Bureaucracy Roll to get me Backing.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-28-2014, 08:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T20:49:55-07:00","id":101717,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ser Eugene, I am Ledaal Tirien. I have been trained and educated in legionary combat. I have come to Novalesk, hearing of the unrest, and sought to give you assistance. Since, of course, you are most likely wary of me, let me assure you that I have no ulterior motives apart from desiring to see Novalesk and her children succeed. As a patrician, I am more or less a second-class citizen in my homeland, and desiring to use my skills, have come seeking my fortune here. In short, I am at your disposal, &quot; she says, bowing, &quot; I have a Letter of Marque from Gens Ptreas vouching for my legitimacy as a Metic resident, and, if hired, would like lodgings for my manservant as well, if you please.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T10:47:39-07:00","id":102029,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will head out to the center of the city and try to see if any crowds are gathering. &quot;They must be around here somewhere. Whenever they talk, crowds seem to gather. Perhaps someone will have seen them,&quot; Hyuga mumbles to himself. &quot;If not, I am sure that Tirien will have headed to the most important building in town. I suppose I will just have to ask a citizen if they have seen them or where the most important building is if I do not see them.&quot; <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga will roll per+ awareness= 1 sux <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4451488/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4451488/</a> :/. And if he doesn't find a huge crowd, char+ inv= 1 sux &gt;&gt; <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4451490/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4451490/</a> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T14:08:18-07:00","id":103632,"title":"","content":"(Temple/Academy)<br /> Yi's trip to the Academy is met with a large degree of shock and awe, though not quite as much as you might expect. Perhaps the populace is a tad jaded when it comes to the supernal? <br /> <br /> Anyways, by the time Yi makes it to the Academy, he has attracted a significant number of hangers-on, which attracts Hyuga's attention. The mantis-demon is somewhat shocked by your proclamation, and informs you that it will confer with the Chancellor, to see if he has time to speak with a Temple Representative. By the time the demon returns, Hyuga was able to work his way through the crowd to join Yi, and the young priestess managed to catch up to Yi. The priestess is followed by a pair of heavily armed and armored temple-guards. She nods her head to Yi, saying that Heirophant Kai'phas had provisionally authorized her to release funds. <br /> <br /> The demon indicates that the Chancellor has made time for you, and requests that you follow it. It leads you to the nearest tower, while a trio of Blood-apes materialize to prevent the crowd from following. You are lead through the eclectic pattern of latices of several towers, before being set back down in the middle of the Academy. There you find a strange grove of trees, a robed man singing softly whilst a familiar (to Hyuga) heavily scarred woman speaks to him. As you approach, the demon snaps it's mandibles, making a sound similar to a clicking tongue. This grabs both of their attentions. <br /> <br /> The man tells the demon to attend to its normal duties, and approaches you, Maia in tow. His skin is pale, with a bluish-tinge, the air around him smells faintly of ionization, and his long bead moves as if caught in a breeze that you cannot feel. Yi's time in Lookshy has taught him the significance of these signs; this man is clearly an Air aspect of immense power.<br /> <br /> &quot;An unfamiliar priest.&quot; he says, looking at Yi. &quot;A warrior-artisan,&quot; he looks to Hyuga, &quot;who is apparently familiar with a member of my staff. She warned me that a new player was at the table, but I had not expected you to start playing so aggressively so soon.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Nikoloi Feiro, Chancellor of this Academy and Blessed of Mela. Who are you, and what business do you have with me this day?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T14:16:59-07:00","id":103635,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> &quot;I have skilled commanders enough, patrician,&quot; Eugene says, &quot;Ones whose judgement and loyalty I can trust well enough. What I lack is soldiers. My forces in the field are gutted, and the Gentes won't release to me their troops because of the civil strife. So unless you're Chumyo White born-again or you're offering me a couple hundred of those renowned Realm legionaries, I fail to see what good I can do with you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T15:20:25-07:00","id":103668,"title":"","content":"&quot;An honor, Prince of the Earth.&quot; Yi said nodding his head as one would in recognition of an equal.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Yi Zhinan, of late champion and representative of Origenes god of this nation and city. As the domestic and military situation currently stands, the Fey will have victory, and my charge is to prevent this. To that end I have come to upset the status quo and aggression seems a suitable tool for doing just that.<br /> <br /> This Academy is the greatest concentration of Thaumaturges and trained artisans in Novalesk, and so I have come to commission you to produce thaumaturgical wards and weapons in quality and quantity sufficient to outfit an army. They will be necessary when our forces again clash with the Fair Children if we have any chance at victory.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-02T07:48:44-07:00","id":104043,"title":"","content":"Tirien's face maintains its half-smile mask, but inwardly, she frowned. She knew that this would most likely happen, but without introductions and going through the usual posturing, this sort of thing, she'd never get anywhere. She turns to Dero for a second, and gives him a knowing look.<br /> <br /> &quot;This is how you get things done. Well, without murdering someone,&quot; she thought. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, of course, you do, Ser General,&quot; Tirien says, bowing deeply to the Strategoi,&quot; I am merely offering my services to assist. &quot;All things in their place under Heaven,&quot; and all that. If given a month or so, though, I could train your soldiers, be they man, women, gods or elementals, in the arts of the Realm Military. My lineage has a history of military excellence in Her Majesty's service, after all. In addition, I have two proposals for you: Let me demonstrate my acumen to you, and let me recruit a talon of new soldiers. I'll train them in Realm tactics, and you can use us as you see fit. Of course, a mere talon of troops would be nothing to the might of your nation here, what with your affluence of Essence users. If need be, I'll even finance the creation of such a unit myself. My second proposal is, I also have allied myself with a troupe of Ancient Fae knights who have patrolled this land peacefully since the Age of Dreams. Before I came to the capital, I sought their aid out, as they view this region as their homes, and are loathe to share with these newcomers. If you accept my aid, I would see it fit to call them to aid you. Is this acceptable?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T12:54:11-07:00","id":105029,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will bow to the chancellor and then wave to Maia and ruffle the hair on the back of his head. He will then move to let Yi talk and pull Maia off to the side. &quot;Hello Maia, I suppose I should have stayed with you. I would have found my friend either way. It is nice to see you again though.&quot; Hyuga will give an embarrassed smile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T20:30:01-07:00","id":105338,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> Maia smiles at Hyuga and says, &quot;Yes, it seems that way, huh?&quot;<br /> <br /> The Chancellor strokes his long beard with a blue-veined hand, &quot;Such bold actions will win you no friends. Too many are invested in the status quo to let you disrupt it without a fight.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sighs, &quot;But the god has apparently granted you his blessing, and that counts for something. I would not expect him to use you to save his nation and then cast you aside. He's too clever for that by half. And that means that you're more than just a wandering priest. Curious.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Still, you offer a way to save my nation, and that counts for much. I would be glad to sharpen a blade to be wielded against the Fae, but I must be sure that the blade I sharpen will not cut back towards my nation. If you have a plan to bring peace and stability to our nation, speak it.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T20:37:43-07:00","id":105344,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fae Knights, you say?&quot; Eugene says, somewhat confounded, &quot;I've received reports of Fae engaging barbarian units, but I thought they were in error, or were indications of divisions in the enemy ranks. Perhaps these are your Knights. If you can give solid descriptions of your allies, perhaps our forward units can liaise with them for mutual support.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-05T16:54:38-07:00","id":106614,"title":"","content":"&quot;Were I a stranger to the race of man, it would not surprise me that Status Quo was the name of the highest of the gods. At the very least it has a very great number of very pious devotees who would no doubt continue to argue who should be seated first at table when the house was on fire.<br /> <br /> As for my plan, its broadest strokes belong to Origenes to whom I must give proper due. I am to persuade, and have no doubt I have charisma and leverage enough for the task, the uncommitted gens to release their private troops to form the veteran core of a new army which is to be supplemented with a new round of levies. Commissioning your academy is a matter of my own initiative, though I have Origenes approval, moral and financial, to act in such a fashion.<br /> <br /> The army and all your work will of course be placed at the command of the Strategoi, I will have no command over any armed forces.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-05T20:22:55-07:00","id":106684,"title":"","content":"&quot;One wears a red cap, dons the armor and mannerisms of a knight errant, and rides a battle-beast in the guise of a large, multi-limbed dragon. She also has....interesting verbal tics. Another wears the garb of an army commander from the ancients days of the Shogun, while another is a small girl not yet in her womanhood, with eyes of Orichalcum and teeth of Moonsilver. Their master is called Lady Estrayan, and they reside in a freehold not far from here,&quot; Tirien said to Eugene.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-06T08:36:13-07:00","id":106916,"title":"","content":"&quot;So Maia, do you think we will be able to fully fit all of the soldiers to help in the battle? Will you need any help with that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T13:57:10-07:00","id":107665,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> &quot;An odd thing to hear from a Lookshan. Your homeland has fought for centuries to maintain the status quo in the River Provence,&quot; the Chancellor says. <br /> <br /> &quot;And to be honest, I am far to content with my seat at the table to let the house burn down around me. Yet, there are other factors I must consider. My house is already frustrated at my lack of support in the current succession. Only my consistent lack of support to any political faction has kept them from attempting to have me removed. If I were to support this course of action, I would likely be removed from my position. Which is something that both of us don't want to happen. This Academy is the labor of my life, and I won't be able to help you if I'm no longer in charge here.<br /> <br /> &quot;The only way I would be able to provide the services you desire is if the request were to come from the Strategoi. Were it to come from anyone else, even the Temple, it could be seen as a political move. I can begin production at a smaller level, in anticipation of an order from the Strategoi, but unless I get one in three or four days, I will need to stop.&quot;<br /> <br /> In response to Hyuga's question, Maia glances to the Chancellor, who nods slightly. She says, &quot;Maybe? It depends on how quickly the Strategoi can get us an order, and when this new army is marching. If we pull everyone who can work on warding charms and the like? We may be able to outfit a thousand troops in the next two weeks. Unless you're an adept in the Arts of Enchantment and Warding, I doubt you'll be able to help on our end.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T14:22:08-07:00","id":107698,"title":"","content":"(Strategoi)<br /> &quot;That does match the description of the Fae we've seen fighting the others.&quot; Eugene glances over to Isaakos, &quot;I trust that I have greater support from your Gens that just the word of a Dynast, no matter how well supported?&quot;<br /> <br /> Isaakos purses his lips, &quot;I can offer you one hundred spearmen. I will speak to my fellows in my Gens and our cadets. We may be able to offer three hundred more in the next several days.&quot;<br /> <br /> Eugene taps his finger on the table. You can almost hear the gear whirling in his mind, the calculations of risk and reward.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't trust you, Dynast. But I will give you the chance to prove yourself trustworthy. I will see to your quartering, and that for your manservant. Will that be all?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T15:01:56-07:00","id":107728,"title":"","content":"Yi smirked at being called a Lookshan but did not correct the man. He smirk became a frown as the Chancellor continued.<br /> <br /> &quot;Whatever the faults of my city, I will say this in its favor; it is much easier to get things done. I say that as someone who started at the bottom with no family connections.&quot;<br /> <br /> He shock his head and sighed.<br /> <br /> &quot;You will have the Strategoi's order by the end of the day. Provided he does not find someone else to pass responsibility to. There is however one other matter I had hoped to bring up which may still be a useful expenditure of Origenes money.<br /> <br /> What provisions can you make for a more universal education system in the nation? As an ideal though initial goal, the whole of the population would be literate and possess basic mathematical proficiency. I have personally observed the advantages that this would bring about. At the very least it would allow for far easier detection of intellectual talent in the population which could produce a dramatic increase in the number of Thaumaturges and trained professionals.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stood up and made ready to depart.<br /> <br /> &quot;Please begin production and meditate on my second proposal. I will return after I have dealt with the prosecution of the War.&quot;<br /> <br /> He turned to his companion. &quot;I believe I will soon be encountering Tirien again. You may accompany me if you like.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that he turned on his heel and began walking for the Hall of the Boule, trailing his young priestess and a few hangeroners as he went.<br /> <br /> When he arrived he stopped, noting the multiple, guarded entrances. <br /> <br /> <i>Always there must be something. It would be faster to just kill them, and no one would even question me about it later</i><i>. Ah but for that tiny hitch that it would be wrong.</i><br /> <br /> He turned to the priestess.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is there some provision for entering, or must I call forth the power divine to whelm them utterly?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T18:36:09-07:00","id":108836,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fair enough. I'll prove myself. I thank you, and if you don't mind, could you direct us to the Academy of Thaumaturgy in the city? I have to pick up a certain scholar who is sure to be babbling about metallurgy and swordcraft to anyone he can find. Come along, Dero, We can pick up chocolate on the way,&quot; Tirien says, calling her sidekick to her. <br /> <br /> Along the way, she'll pick up some sweets for Dero and herself, partially because she's hungry, but also to rub into Yi and Hyuga's faces.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T20:38:41-07:00","id":108905,"title":"","content":"It is approaching sundown as Yi and Hyuga approach the Hall of the Boule. As Yi is about to query the priest as to how to enter the Hall, Tirien exits, Dero in tow.<br /> <br /> (What a coincidence! ... Wait, weren't there Sidereals running around? That means there's no such thing as coincidence! You're all being subtly manipulated by a set of Divinely-empowered Oracle-manipulators!)<br /> <br /> Dero indicates that the lodgings which Strategos Eugene offered to you are not far from the Hall; they are a (Bed and Breakfast, for lack of a better term coming to me at the moment) used by visiting dignitaries or by local bureaucrats and military officers when they have to work late. There is permanent housekeeping and security staff there; you will be as safe and well cared-for as possible. Also watched, but what can you do, right?<br /> <br /> Judging from the time, and that you're all together, Dero suggests you head there and settle down for the night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T20:46:06-07:00","id":108912,"title":"","content":"&quot;I told the head of the academy that he would have word from the Strategoi by the end of the day. I do not neglect my word. If you will be of assistance in meeting with him please begin doing so. If not, I will make my own arrangements as I had already resolved to.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T20:50:00-07:00","id":108917,"title":"","content":"Tirien shrugs, &quot;I'm not sure how much help I would be. Despite being able to talk to Strategos Eugene and him accepting me under his command, he made it more or less clear that he doesn't seem to like or trust me. However, if you're dead set on this course, I can accommodate your course of action.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T21:49:12-07:00","id":108956,"title":"","content":"Yi nodded to Tirien. &quot;I would be most appreciative. One the one hand, failure to keep a promise in something as small as this is a poor indicator for more important situations. On the other, time has already grown quite short.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T09:47:40-07:00","id":109377,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well, then. How will we go about this? I can try to get you in officially, or covertly,&quot; Tirien asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T10:40:25-07:00","id":109428,"title":"","content":"&quot;You recall what happened when first we met. The distinction will hardly matter. Which does remind me, I am going to need to see representatives of the neutral gens tomorrow to convince them to release their troops into the strategoi's command. Then I am going to have to arrange for a lot of very public prayers...<br /> <br /> I am going to need a secretary. Again. Oh Heaven, please don't let my last one find out. I would never hear the end of it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T16:46:10-07:00","id":109711,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well. I'll need to hunt for some sellswords tomorrow anyways. In any case, we ought to get going,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T21:22:57-07:00","id":109817,"title":"","content":"Dero indicates that he will wait for you outside. The young priestess tells the guards that you need to speak to the Strategos, on urgent Temple business. The Capital Troops demand that the Temple guards be left outside, but the way they state it, and the tone of the priestess' acceptance indicate that this is a rote action, Standard Operating Procedure. <br /> <br /> Yi's appearance and the Priestess' presence quickly smooth the wheels of your passage to the war room in which Tirien spoke with Strategos Eugene earlier. The Strategos is still there, but only a handful of other officers remain. Eugene looks up and settles his eyes on Tirien, <br /> <br /> &quot;I thought we were done for the day, Dynast,&quot; He says, eyeing Tirien and her entourage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-10T06:49:03-07:00","id":110062,"title":"","content":"&quot;Would you believe that I thought so as well? Well, the Maidens seem to have thought otherwise. This is Yi, a man of renown, who has made quite an impression, it seems, with Origenes. I'm merely here as a facilitator of meeting between you two, &quot;Tirien says, bowing, and letting Yi say his piece.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T12:12:55-07:00","id":110978,"title":"","content":"&quot;Honored Strategos,&quot; Yi nodded his head, &quot;As the honored scion of House Ledaal said, I have this very day received the blessing and backing of Origenes to act with all energy and diligence for the preservation and its future prosperity. I have also made arrangements for the Academy to begin full scale production of enchantments to supplement your armed forces which will be covered by the funds of the temple. They have requested that your office dispatch notice of your intention to receive these supplies.<br /> <br /> I wish to make something clear to you. I arrived in the city this morning a vagrant priest. This evening I have spoken with the city god in his sanctum, convinced the Chancellor to risk his political neutrality, and have entered the halls of power while still an unknown and a foreigner. I mean no boasting in this, for there is none of it worthy of celebration. Rather let it be demonstration that I accomplish what I say and set out to do. Tomorrow I will convince Gens Ptreas and Spyrus to place their household troops under your command.<br /> <br /> What I require of you is to raise new levies to supplement these troops and to equip these forces with the Academy's thaumaturgical war material. However, discussions this day with gods and men have enlightened me to the tremendous inability of those in power to do what they wish or believe best. If there is someone else I must speak to to persuade you to authorize these measures I will see to that as well. Moreover, if there is any glaring flaw in this course of action I would be delighted to hear of it so that I may see to rectifying it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T21:39:28-07:00","id":111252,"title":"","content":"&quot;Your dynastic friend has already brought me the support of Gens Ptreas,&quot; Eugene says, &quot;Though the support of the Temple and the Academy help greatly.&quot; Turning to one of his adjuncts, he says, &quot;Inform the Academy that we will will take whatever order the Lookshan priest made.&quot; <br /> <br /> As the adjunct departs, the Strategos continues, &quot;In regards to your plan. One, the system is not as broken as you've likely been led to believe. Undoubtedly the Chancellor and Origenes have regaled you with how terribly the current system locks them out of politics. In theory, they have little direct power over the Boule or the Gentes, yes. But centuries of precedent give them unfettered access to the highest rungs of government. It's just that there's not much of a government to have access to at the moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;But, more importantly, ask yourself this question: why have neither faction in the current succession crisis resorted to violence? Because of me and my troops. The two factions' forces are matched evenly enough to make the result of any battle unpredictable. And they know that any force multipliers they have would pale in comparison to Capital forces and the Unaligned Gentes' mobilizing in support of the attacked. <br /> <br /> &quot;So, as much as I'd love to lead a legion against the Fae, your plan would cause the pot to boil over, so to speak. Both sides would see a golden opportunity to take the other out and quickly install their chosen regime.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T08:19:05-07:00","id":111499,"title":"","content":"&quot;I assumed it was no where near as broken as they communicated. Rather, I was led to believe that there is an institutional culture of passing responsibility to others among the upper echelons of power. Honestly, I was not surprised as that particular feature is almost ubiquitous among any organization of sufficient size. Nevertheless, I am grateful that you respond to their positions directly. I half expected to have to bribe your secretary to understand what direction you were facing from all the linguistic turning around to protect your behind.<br /> <br /> As for the belligerents,&quot; he sighed, &quot;I suppose I cannot leave them in financial ruin like I did those idiot would-be-hierarchics without the risk of destabilizing the nation. How would you suggest harnessing them to a productive end or leashing them so as to restrain any misbehavior while they are gone? I have a broad set of options, but I would prefer to keep my touch as light as possible.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T12:12:44-07:00","id":111671,"title":"","content":"Eugene considers for a moment, &quot;Now that I have support from Ptreas, getting Spyrus to back won't be difficult. They are my family after all. Maybe you could get your friends in the Academy and the Temple to quietly stir the rumor mill, getting people to question the motives and patriotism of the other Gentes. If I get their support then it solves two problems, since then I can direct the troublemakers at the Fae. Even if only one other Gens throws behind me, it will drastically tip the balance in my favor. That is an option&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T13:35:43-07:00","id":111734,"title":"","content":"Yi meditated on the difficulty inherent in a system with so many distinct sources of power working at direct cross purposes.<br /> <br /> &quot;You will have them both. Will there be any difficulty in moving the remainder of the armed forces against the Raksha? I ask because your neighbors may take this opportunity to invade while your armed forces are depleted or otherwise occupied.<br /> <br /> More generally, what areas require rectification which you are unable to act upon directly? At the moment, I am nominally independent in the sense that I am backed by multiple factions. I serve neither Origenes, the Academy, nor you and that is useful in the current political climate.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T15:47:30-07:00","id":112982,"title":"","content":"&quot;Our neighbors to the South and South-East have been engaged in low-level warfare with each other for decades. Our neighbors to the West are a Realm tributary, though, so I'm most concerned about the Realm garrison there. I doubt any of them would want to stab us in the back before the Fae are defeated. And, to be honest, I would welcome an invasion from them. Many in our nation fail to grasp the severity of the oncoming threat, but these are our traditional enemies. It might stir many in power from their plots.&quot; Eugene says. <br /> <br /> &quot;I think it would be best if you used your own initiative. Your outsider's perspective would most useful, I think. At this point, I can coordinate most of the military buildup I require. If you want resources or information from me, ask.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T11:57:12-07:00","id":113461,"title":"","content":"&quot;I do not know you well Strategos, but I will respect you enough to be honest. I am very worried about this nation. The master said 'One who excels in employing the military does not conscript the people twice or transport provisions a third time.' Besides the damage to moral, we have lost the initiative. While the additional troops, thaumaturgical aids, and improved moral now available greatly strengthen your position, what assurances can you give me that your skills are adequate to make proper use what what you now have?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T12:33:22-07:00","id":114254,"title":"","content":"Eugene places his fingertips together, forming a steeple with his arms. &quot;You may want to reconsider your words, Lookshan,&quot; He says coldly, rage evident in his eyes, &quot;Because it sounded to me like your approval somehow matters. That <i>I</i> need to justify myself to a <i>wayward houseless vagabond</i>.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T18:22:05-07:00","id":114448,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aaaah, excuse me, Ser Eugene. I must tell you something. Did you know I have an uncle in the Southern Legions? Cathak Haru, a man who is said to have no equal with the blade. I once asked him what made a good duelist, and he replied with,&quot; A good duelist can cut a man in half with one swing. A Great duelist can kill a man's spirit with his words and make him learn his dishonor.&quot; So, please, forgive my friend before Creation loses such a peerless orator, even if he has more words than sense,&quot; She says, bowing deeply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T20:30:43-07:00","id":114511,"title":"","content":"Yi raised one eyebrow questioningly and the barest hint of a smirk touched his lips. &quot;Far me it from me, honored strategos, to require justification from you. However, I am not the one you owe an answer to.&quot;<br /> <br /> He fingered the jadeite staff he held and mused on if he would keep it when he stopped playing at being a nobody.<br /> <br /> &quot;Know this, I do not want your job, wish to sully your honor, care if you are a good person, or give an iota of concern for your social position. The nation is in the grip of despair strategos, and to question me will do nothing for that problem. I do not fault you for growing angry with me for questioning you, that is a very human reaction. What will and should be a mark against you is if you are unable to view the current <i>military</i> situation as distinct from yourself. I am aware that by raising this question I strike at the very core of the narrative about yourself you have spent a lifetime building.<br /> <br /> Still the question must be asked and answered. It does not need to be answered to me, but it must be answered. Novelesk deserves an answer strategos, as do you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T20:29:59-07:00","id":115090,"title":"","content":"&quot;You speak as if you are not human, Lookshan. As if you are somehow better than me,&quot; Eugene says sharply. &quot;But I will explain.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I was not born in to the lofty heights of wealth and privilege that I now hold. I enlisted over forty years ago as a spearman, and worked my way up the ranks. A decade ago, I was made Strategos after my victory at Lian's Fell.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi is somewhat shocked by this claim. Lian's fell is a well-known disaster for Lookshy, when Hiyama Gidan and his force of nearly 50 gunzota were ambushed and slain, nearly to a man, by &quot;barbarian forces&quot; at some point &quot;north of Gunzota Redoubt&quot;. Those slain were never recovered.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, Lookshan, I've bested your finest warriors. I am not some armchair general who's never seen combat. I have served man and boy, linesman and officer. I may not be the most talented strategist in Novalesk. But I am the best trained, most experienced and most capable general this nation will have in the days ahead unless Sunipa herself comes to relieve me of command.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, and for the record,&quot; Eugene smirks as he leans forward, &quot;I cannot claim the distinction of being a great duelist. But I happen to be a <i>very good </i>duelist.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 04-17-2014, 11:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T21:01:31-07:00","id":115097,"title":"","content":"Yi nodded, conceding the Strategos' points. &quot;Perhaps it is a sign of the fallenness of this age that Heaven has not seen fit to lift you still higher. Or perhaps it is a sign have at last gained the sense to mind its own affairs.<br /> <br /> In light of what you have said, and on the assumption I am able to deliver on the promises I have made to you, how do you propose to deal with the Fair Folk. I am most certainly not beyond recourse to prayer, but I prefer something more prosaic to work with first.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>\u200bHe has confidence enough for an Exalted, perhaps more than many. Yet confidence alone does not change the world or fewer fools would lie unburied.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T18:21:01-07:00","id":115630,"title":"","content":"&quot;I propose to meet the Raksha on the field of battle, far from my home-city. Not what you wanted to hear, I know, but I cannot make any plans until I have hard numbers of troops, up to date intelligence... by the time I have troops ready to reinforce the field, the situation will likely have changed dramatically,&quot; Eugene says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T19:32:07-07:00","id":115653,"title":"","content":"&quot;A true answer, but let me be more clear in what I am asking. What do you intend to do differently this time? Meeting the Raksha on the field of battle was the general description of the last engagement and that ended less then favorably for us.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T21:24:18-07:00","id":115699,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fight better, be smarter. We have better intelligence now, and we've blunted their momentum. We haven't lost the initiative; it was never ours to begin with. We've reached a period of parity with both sides scrambling to push the other off balance. All we have to do is not get knocked over, and the day will be ours.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T00:06:52-07:00","id":115740,"title":"","content":"&quot;I supposed its the best we can do under the circumstances. I hope you will not fault me for praying as well though, it is one of those things I do.<br /> <br /> While we are adding things to the record; I am perfectly human, it is simply that I have tried to cultivate an awareness of what that means. When I said your anger was quite human I did not mean that I would not feel it in the same circumstances, only that anger at being questioned is neither voluntary nor useful for those who must bear the burden of leadership.<br /> <br /> I believe I have taken up enough of your time today. If you would lend me the services of an assistant or secretary I would be most grateful. The temple has suffered enough from my imposition.&quot;<br /> <br /> ____<br /> <br /> On the way out Yi asked the priestess to show him to the penitent's quarters or something similar. Origenes charity likely included something of the sort. As they were walking Yi turned to her and said,<br /> <br /> &quot;I imagine the senior priests will wish to speak to me in the morning, and I cannot blame them.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sighed before continuing.<br /> <br /> &quot;What do you think, of what I have done this day? In my position honest answers are worth more then jade.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T12:51:56-07:00","id":116050,"title":"","content":"(Road to Temple)<br /> The young priestess answers Yi's with a pregnant silence. Yi begins to consider that she is purposefully ignoring his question before she says hesitantly, &quot;... You've given us a rallying point, leveled some common ground for us to stand on together, which is good for the Nation. But you've written to those in power that you want to change the balance, which is terrible for you. And anyone associated with you.&quot;<br /> <br /> (What will everyone be doing at this time? It is getting rather late.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T14:11:00-07:00","id":116091,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then we will deal with the terrible when it comes. There is no need to fret about it now. We are making good happen. That is all that matters for now.&quot; Hyuga will stretch a bit and yawn. &quot;I suppose we should get some sort of rest though. Why don't we go back and get some sleep. We can take care of the rest tomorrow.&quot; <br /> <br /> For ST only:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> If they go back to sleep, Hyuga will go to his room right away, open a window, and pretend to go to sleep. When he deems that everyone is settled down ready to sleep he will climb out the window into the cold, moon-filled night, his powerful vein-filled, bulging hands grabbing the outer edges as firmly as possible and fling himself up through the air like a pouncing tiger, deftly grabbing at each ledge until he swiftly lands on the roof of the building with a quick front flip (I will make 3 sets of rolls (just in case it is a large building), str+ath to fling himself; then dex+ath to catch the next section to jump from.) Once upon the roof he will keep watch for anyone suspicious, for people entering the building, or for one of his allies to enter or leave. (+1 stunt to each roll for climbing?)<br /> <br /> Rolls: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4474576/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4474576/</a> 3 sux to listen; <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4474594/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4474594/</a> (1st launch- 3 sux; 1st grab- 2 sux; 2nd launch- 5 sux; 2nd grab- 3 sux;<br /> 3rd launch- 5 sux; flip onto roof- BOTCH :/) </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T15:03:59-07:00","id":116136,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you wish no part of it, I give you leave to depart and neither I nor your god will hold it against you. It is true what you say, that my actions bring great danger. Yet I cannot in good conscience do other than I do. With power comes obligation, the duty to use that power responsibly for the sake of those whom you have power over. Those who become corrupt, who abandon virtue and allow the people to suffer do not deserve their power. Such people have lost the right to rule and their power should be taken from them.<br /> <br /> This was the logic by which those who became the Anathema made war on the enemies of the gods and the same logic by which the Ten Thousand Dragons justified the Great Uprising. Perhaps it will be used again when the Age of Dragons ends as well. I do not concern myself with such grand things, yet I know that there is a difference between order and good order and that authority is not equivalent to morality. I will bear whatever peril this brings upon because I have the strength to bear it. Someone must.&quot;<br /> <br /> As he spoke something like a light came over him. It was nothing so ostentatious as true illumination. Rather, it seemed to reveal his character, to show that he was the kind of person who not only believed what he said, but had the strength and will to back it up. It was the sort of thing that stayed with you, the fire that kindled the hearts of a people and set the world upside down.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Now then: I have obtained divine backing, commissioned the largest production of magical weaponry in the nation's history, and obtained the cooperation of the Strategos. I am going to go out on a limb and call that a three dot stunt when taken together.<br /> <br /> First, there is the roll to see if my Guan activates. <a href=\"http://&#91;COLOR=#A0A0A0]&#91;FONT=Helvetica Neue]&#91;SIZE=12px]http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4474627/&#91;/SIZE]&#91;/FONT]&#91;/COLOR]\" target=\"_blank\">It does</a>, raising my Charisma and Appearance by 3 each.<br /> Next, I am going to activate a combo of the maxed out Second Socialize Excellency, Wise-Eyed Courtier Method, Mastery of Small Manners, and Heartfelt Honorific Opportunity and channeling Compassion.<br /> <br /> Charisma 6 + Socialize 5 + Social Change Specialty 1 + Compassion 4 + Stunt 3 = 19 + 4 successes<br /> Mote Cost: Excellency 8 + MoSM 1 + WECM 3 + HHO 3 = 15<br /> WP Cost: WECM 1 + HHO 1 + Virtue 1 = 3<br /> <br /> This is a social attack against the Leader of Novalesk. The magnitude of the nation is considered one less then it actually is and halved then added to the leaders MDV and the attack is unexpected. Assuming they have a social surprise negator of some kind, my effective appearance is 7.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://&#91;COLOR=#A0A0A0]&#91;FONT=Helvetica Neue]&#91;SIZE=12px]http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4474653/&#91;/SIZE]&#91;/FONT]&#91;/COLOR]\" target=\"_blank\">18 Successes</a> + 4 = 22 success (The dice gods appear to favor me. Throw that at Folkuf and I would be the one sitting on the Scarlet Throne.)<br /> <br /> The goal of this is to grant me as much backing and influence as the nation of Navalesk can support. The belief it is imposing would be something along the lines of, &quot;The Stranger who cut through all the red tape, stagnation, and self-doubt has delivered us from ruin and should be the one in charge.&quot; Though of course better worded.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 04-21-2014, 11:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T21:00:16-07:00","id":116324,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think, tomorrow, I'll be going on a trip. If I can talk to Novalesk's neighbors, then we may be able to get an army sooner. They've been fighting for some time, so they should have a few bravos ready for adventure,&quot; Tirien muses, &quot;Dero, tell me about them, will you? Will any of them be amenable to assisting us?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T12:32:00-07:00","id":117095,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga)<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Hyuga sees nothing out of the ordinary. Some poeple enter the building late, but that's not unusual, given its purpose. No-one leaves that you can see, and the guard changes rather uneventfully</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T18:37:56-07:00","id":117295,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> &quot;Lord Origenes has confirmed the Heirophant's orders to me. And I pledged myself to stand where the god commands.&quot; The young priestess says softly. <br /> <br /> At long last you arrive at the Temple, and the priestess leads you to small, rather spartan, sleeping chamber. &quot;These are maintained for mendicants. I trust they will serve your purpose,&quot; she says with a slight bow, &quot;If there is nothing else you require, I shall retire for the evening.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T18:43:55-07:00","id":117299,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> Dero indicates that Novalesk has a mutual defense pact with the Geherin Forest-lords to the southeast, but that is only against the inhabitants of the Glorious Free City of Ordon to the south. They have helped each other out in other circumstances in the past, but those were few and far between.<br /> <br /> Theros, the nation to the west, is a Realm tributary and boasts a modest garrison of Legionaries. While not necessarily friendly towards Novalesk, Dero postulates that Tirien's Dynastic heritage may allow her to convince them to aid Novalesk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-24T12:50:44-07:00","id":118555,"title":"","content":"&quot;Nothing more is required, thank you.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Why do I insist on this? I move so openly now that any pretense of hiding from Lookshy is gone. At this juncture though, I have more to fear from knives in the dark.</i><br /> <br /> That last thought did not comfort him, but on consideration his options were fairly limited. With a roll of his eyes, he realized politeness toward his minders at the temple was just as great a restraint as physical difficulties. Even so, he still needed to sleep.<br /> <br /> He got up, taking the staff from Origenes statue with him and made his way to the main sanctuary. The statue of the god was still as he had left it earlier in the day. Bending close to it he whispered, &quot;Call me paranoid, but I suspect the gens are not above sending assassins. A spot of flat ground would be more then enough, if you would be willing to suffer my imposition at all.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T07:47:58-07:00","id":119105,"title":"","content":"(With her decision of going abroad, Tirien will retire for the night, bidding Dero do so as well. Before she does go to sleep, though, she'll return to her Marsupial Lion form, which she figures would be enough of a shock to any would-be assassins to let her make a getaway.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T16:11:03-07:00","id":119409,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> A portal, similar to the one to Origenes' sanctum before, appears before Yi. Heading through, Yi finds himself in what is effectively a Divine studio apartment. A young woman who bears a strong familial resemblance to Origenes stands in the room, her expression carefully neutral.<br /> <br /> &quot;My father departed for Yu Shan shortly after meeting with you,&quot; she says. Her voice is indicates a wealth of experience in contrast to her youthful form. A slight smile touches her eyes as she continues, &quot;In his absence, I have decided to humor your request.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I have laid out some modest accommodations,&quot; she gestures to a furnished cot in the center of the room. Stepping past Yi, she opens the studio's sole door, &quot;This door will open back to your guest quarters. I would prefer rumors of you sleeping here not get passed around. Good eve, priest.&quot; The goddess steps through the door, winking at Yi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T16:13:29-07:00","id":119412,"title":"","content":"[I presume that everyone is good for the IC day]<br /> <br /> (All)<br /> It is now the next day. Wonder of wonders, the Daystar has risen in the East and Creation is keeping on existing. And, bonus, no one you know died last night. At least that any of you can tell. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T17:19:42-07:00","id":119439,"title":"","content":"Yi had been up before dawn, greeting the sun as it returned to the sky. He left a note for Origenes daughter expressing this thanks to her and her father before departing. He also resolved not to return to the temple for a very long time. Speeding off to Heaven might be nothing more than business, but the timing was suspicious to him.<br /> <br /> <i>If I can trust so few with so little, then I am going to accomplish very little in this life. </i><br /> <br /> &quot;Even so, I must try. I may have to flee er this is done.&quot;<br /> <br /> He met his escort for the day and said, &quot;A pleasure to see you again my lady. If there is no business with your superiors, I believe I shall arrange for transportation to the representatives of the Gens. Spyrus first would seem the proper course. That said, will those in the city be able to speak without consultation with their elders, or will I have to start making trips to the house seats?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 04-25-2014, 10:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T18:05:34-07:00","id":119469,"title":"","content":"Hyuga stands up slowly once the daystar begins to shed its light over the horizon far beyond. He smacks his face a few times to keep the sleepiness away and continues to watch for movements within the city. Knowing that it is only a matter of time before Tirien and Yi attract some attention and head out, he keep his eyes peeled like a hawk waiting for a time to come down. He continues to watch, like a hawk, the crowds that have started to move out into the city like little ants in a field. Hyuga continually watches them seeking for any signs that they know Anathema are in the city. Realizing he may have been a little too careless within his situation in the city, he is determined to never lower his guard, lest they try to have him killed, let alone Tirien or Yi. They are vital to the plans; much more than he. He had started to realize more of his glaring weaknesses. His abilities could only help him so much. He knew he had a long way to go. <br /> <br /> As his eyes continue to scan for any signs of danger, he reflects back on his thoughts of Anathema before he became one himself. He had been ashamed becoming one at first recalling all the pain they had brought to many people. He vowed to never let anyone do that again with his new-found strength. If only he could communicate that to everyone; he knew not how to himself. He knew only action would help him. Knowing that his allies will gain the power needed to start the fight, he dashes across the rooftops, jumping between them like a streak of light bouncing off the surface of the water and heads to the edge of the town. Cautiously, he clambers down the building at the edge of town and dashes to the nearby forest; his new sanctuary for the time being. <br /> <br /> Hyuga always had an affinity for the forest; strange for one born in the south such as himself. It brought him a sense of peace, protection, and was a beautiful rest from the heat of the sun. This would be the perfect place to meditate on his blade among other things. Slowly, Hyuga takes his essence filled hand and creates the symbol of the Twilight around him in the dirt. He then sits in a meditative pose placing his sword on his lap, with the pommel still in his hand and meditates on the things that Yi talked to him about on the boat.<br /> <br /> <i>I am a part of the Sun. I go where I am needed as does my blade. I shine in glory as I wield my sword. Its path is simple and where it should be. It does not yield to any and will hold its ground in my hands. I am unmoved in my determination and blade. I shall not falter nor change to the circumstances like the Sun. It will all change to me.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4481916/:\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4481916/:</a> 3 sux; for keeping awake another day (stam+res); To jump across rooftops: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4481920/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4481920/</a> : 4 sux<br /> <br /> Hyuga will also spend this time finishing his training towards the charm &quot;Protection of the Celestial Bliss&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T19:06:03-07:00","id":119505,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> Your escort for the day is none other than Origenes' daughter. The young goddess is clad in the functional robes common among many of Novalesk's citizenry. Her robes are delicately armored, however, and she bears a straight broad blade at her waist. <br /> <br /> &quot;Master Yi, I am Origenon Larissa, god of Novalesk's Citizenry, and until several months ago, Archon of this nation,&quot; she says, &quot;I shall accompany you throughout the city this day.&quot;<br /> <br /> Leading you out of the Temple, Larissa says, &quot;The Boule meets shortly after noon, and the Representatives usually meet with the Elders in the City for lunch beforehand. Whether or not they will act without expressed approval depends on the individual. Some Gentes give their representatives more leyway, others keep them on a tight leash. All of them are influential members of their families, though, or else they wouldn't have the position.&quot;<br /> <br /> Once you are of sufficient distance from the Temple, Larissa leans in towards Yi and whispers, &quot;The Heirophant is not fond of you at all. With my father in Yu Shan he would have to complain to me, and he's not going to do that in front of you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T19:09:15-07:00","id":119506,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga)<br /> Hyuga notices nothing truly out of the ordinary, though rumors are flying of a vagabond priest who Gets Things Done by smashing cultural mores and shaking the totem pole.<br /> <br /> Sounds like Yi if you ask me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 04-25-2014, 10:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T01:49:19-07:00","id":119639,"title":"","content":"<i>I'm probably going to end up with her old job. Why does that make me feel uncomfortable?</i><br /> <br /> After her introduction, Yi bowed to Larissa. &quot;I am honored that you have chosen to accompany me. I apologize for my inability to express my full gratitude at this time.&quot;<br /> <br /> On the walk the Zenith considered his actions. Though he was too schooled for his cheeks to flush, it occurred to him that he should have shown just as much respect to the priestess who went with him yesterday. The goddess knew what he was and what he was capable of, but the young girl had gone with him into the mouth of tigers. He perked up at the information about the Boule. &quot;Perhaps it would be better to address the whole body at once then. Though laying a foundation with the individual representatives first would not go amiss. I would be glad of your recommendation.&quot;<br /> <br /> Her final comment very nearly caused him to lose his poise, but he replied quietly, &quot;Understandable that he would rather I was absent. If it is something in particular I will do what I can to mollify him.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T21:52:36-07:00","id":120157,"title":"","content":"Tirien wakes up invigorated and ready for the day. After a hearty breakfast, she approaches Dero with her proposal.<br /> <br /> &quot;Dero, today, we're going to go to the Geherin. We're going to try and enlist their aid,&quot; she says confidently.<br /> <br /> While Dero expresses confusion as to why she's not exploiting her connections in Theros, Tirien coughs, and says, &quot;While it would be nice to see family, I don't think that immediately running to the Realm and requesting troops would do well for me with ingratiating myself with Eugene and the military, apart from maybe being run out of town for trying something funny. No, I think Geherin is our better bet.Now, let us find a ferry to take us downriver,&quot; she says, and begins the search.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T18:26:22-07:00","id":122126,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> &quot;My recommendation?&quot; Larissa says, arching her brow slightly, &quot;Leave. Short of literally getting in bed with one of the major power-players, nothing is going to completely stop the knives in the dark.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;We will weather this storm, even without your help. In a month or two the situation will deteriorate to the point where the Pyrtanies or I will be able to justify declaring martial law and resuming supreme executive control,&quot; her eyes harden, and you can sense her resolve, a lifetime of hard choices and decisions evident in her countenance, &quot;We will survive. We may be battered but we will not be broken. But if you stay, you will be consumed by this.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If you're set on staying, though, you need to get cozy with one of the factions. My predecessor tells me you're trying to make yourself seem like a neutral party. That's not going to get you far here. That just means that everyone will distrust you, thinking you're secretly working for one of their enemies. You need a formal declaration of support from one of the major powers. Everyone will assume that you have tacit backing from the Temple for the moment, but the lac of a formal declaration will weaken that over time.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now, if you want to stay, I presume you wish to head to Gens Spyrus' Boule chambers?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T19:18:52-07:00","id":122146,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> Dero indicates that, using mundane means of transportation, the best way to get to the Geherin would be to travel East along the river until just south of Lake Vera. There's a small town at the southern bank that connects to an old dirt road. Dero indicates that most of Geherin's trade with Novalesk travels along this road. <br /> <br /> All in all, such a trip would take about a week. Other, less mundane, methods may result in a travel time of perhaps two-to-three days. They will be significantly more expensive, Dero indicates.<br /> <br /> Dero also expresses confusion on how Tirien intends to pay for this trip. It seems like he's doing all of the financial lifting, but Tirien's his employer...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T20:36:18-07:00","id":122172,"title":"","content":"Tirien reddens She hadn't noticed, but Dero was right. He had been doing all of the heavy lifting. Alright. Time to do this thing.<br /> <br /> While Tirien's mind initially went to the easiest method of obtaining funds legally, she didn't want to make Dero's perception of her change, at least too much. She shifts into her portee dog shape, and then, using Dog Tongue method, says, &quot;I apologize for not telling you this before, but I am a Chosen of Luna, an Anathema as the Immaculate Theology would call me. It's partly why I'm so far from my home, but believe me when I say that everything I have told you and your grandfather is honest; I wish to help Novalesk become a great nation. If we both become wealthy because of this, well, who is to blame us? But, first I need your help. You are to be my trainer, and we are to become a band of performers. Name things for me to do, and I'll do them in this form. However, I'll need you to take me to a location...&quot;<br /> <br /> Once there, she'll activate Terrifying Lust Affliction to command the masses to [Pay attention to their wonderful show]. With Dero &quot;Directing&quot; her actions, Tirien will perform a number of tricks, from walking about on her hind legs, to even playing Gateway with Dero, nosing the pieces into position.<br /> <br /> Her initial social attack succeeds with <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4486235/\" target=\"_blank\"> 5 suxx.</a> However, do you want me to roll for the other tricks?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T21:34:27-07:00","id":122184,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> The show is remarkably well received. So well that one Therian noble offers to buy Tirien (it's so hard to find a genuine purebred portee dog outside of the Isle!), but Dero emphasizes that she is not for sale. <br /> <br /> The money paid for the show amounts to a handful of chump change, barely enough to pay for transit on a barge. That is, until you take into account the purse that Dero lifted off the noble, which contains nearly ten obols; a respectable sum, equal to the yearly taxes of a dozen successful homesteads.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T14:14:22-07:00","id":124757,"title":"","content":"&quot;Goddess, I cannot speak to my own righteousness or virtue. I cannot speak to the eventual fate of this nation should I withdraw myself from the situation. More then all that, I cannot speak on if I am even capable of helping anyone.<br /> <br /> What I do know is this, Humanity deserves better then survival. Gods and men survived when the Titans walked the Creation in the light of two suns. It was not for survival's sake that humans did the great things of that age, but for the right and chance to flourish and thrive. The situation in this age, and Novalesk is as much a part of it as the Realm, is that humanity does not flourish. It clings to life with all the tenacity of a cornered rat and has proved excellently successful.<br /> <br /> To my mind, that is not good enough. Humanity will never have better if someone doesn't try to make it better. I am willing to try, and have no more right to anything I do then that.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-04-2014, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T20:26:55-07:00","id":124944,"title":"","content":"(With money in Hand, Tirien will find a quiet corner to transform back, and then, along with Dero, look for the supernatural ferry going in that direction. Do I need to roll anything?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 05-04-2014, 10:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-04T21:28:14-07:00","id":125542,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> Larissa beams at Yi, and he has to shield his eyes for a moment from her radiant smile.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good. It makes my life easier to work with someone with a spine,&quot; she says. Looking Yi up and down, as if truly noticing him for the first time, she says softly, almost to herself, &quot;Yes, you might do nicely.&quot;<br /> <br /> Your conversation is interrupted by your arrival at the Hall of the Boule, at an entrance noted by the Mon of Gens Spyrus. Recognizing the Ex-Archon, the troops allow you in immediately. You pass a long series of aristocrats, who bow to your Divine escort on sight. Larissa acknowledges far more of them by name than not.<br /> <br /> Eventually, Larissa leads you to a heavy door with a large desk and several guards in front of it. The guards are split between the heraldry of Spyrus and that of Novalesk itself. A middle aged man who was seated at the desk rises and bows to Larissa, mumbling, something along the lines of &quot;M'lady Archon&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Good morning, Vasil,&quot; Larissa says with a faint smile, &quot;Does he have few moments?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;He's speaking to the Lord Strategos at the moment,&quot; Vasil says, clearly confused by this turn of events.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah. I believe that's about us. Can you let him know I'm here, and ask for a moment?&quot; Larissa asks. Vasil nods and ducks into the door, emerging a few moments later. <br /> <br /> &quot;He can speak with you now,&quot; Vasil says as he ushers you through the door into a spartan writing room. Eugene is there, and is speaking with an elderly man. Upon seeing you enter, the old man looks to Eugene who nods, a wry look on his face. <br /> <br /> Larissa strides in and plants herself in an open chair before introducing Yi to Spyrus Nereus, High Elder of Gens Spyrus and vice-versa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-04T21:44:19-07:00","id":125548,"title":"","content":"(Tirien) <br /> Your queries lead you to a dirty-looking building, in one of the less reputable (but not necessarily dangerous) parts of town. A large man, with the build and look of a recently retired wrestler who is starting to go soft, and a white-painted face, meets you. He listen to your inquiries while chewing from a large wad of dried leaves. <br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah, I can getcha there,&quot; he says, swallowing a mass of the leaves, &quot;Thirty Dinars for the round trip. Each leg'll take two days, with stops for eatin' and sleepin'. Deal?&quot;<br /> <br /> If you need a conversion, 30 dinars are approx. equal to 3.5 obols.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T09:54:28-07:00","id":126763,"title":"","content":"&quot;Pay the man, Dero,&quot; Tirien says, &quot;We're going on a trip.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T20:49:54-07:00","id":127225,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> Dero pulls a coin pouches out of his shirt, and hands the man two obols. He indicates that the man will receive the rest upon the return trip. <br /> <br /> The man shrugs, and says, &quot;Fair 'nuff.&quot;. He eats the obols, and then takes a large pack and an odd double-saddle from a nearby rack. He straps the pack to his chest, and the saddle to his back. After following him outside, the man squats down and flexes his muscles. He explodes in a thunder-crack and blast of ozone, revealing a monstrous hawk with rainbow wings and a circlet of lightning 'pon its brow. Tirien and Dero strap themselves into the saddle, its odd straps and handholds now making perfect sense. Once they confirm that they are secured, the thunderbird flaps its wings with a loud thunder-crack and rockets up into the sky. <br /> <br /> At your periodic stops, you learn that your current ride is named Rain-Upon-His-Wings, and is a relatively young Thunderbird. He flies this route relatively often, and is acquainted with several Geherin, including one of their Skalds. No, he hasn't ever entered Geherin proper, as the local spirits don't take kindly to outsiders poking around in their airspace. <br /> <br /> After the advertised two days, you fly into a modest market-town, a mile or so from a large, dense forest. The town looks to be constructed in Novaleski styles, and a significant number of the populace are dressed as such as well. The rest, however, are in varying states of advanced undress, with loincloths (and chest wraps for the women) to be the norm. They are prime specimens, fit and strong, and many of them carry multiple bearded axes. What appears to be a ball game is being played on the outskirts of the town in the direction of the forest. The locals, presumably. <br /> <br /> Rain-Upon-His-Wings touches you down and transforms back into a human. He informs you that he will be taking in the local color, and will wait for you for two weeks before he'll head back without you. He then heads off, chasing (metaphorical) skirts.<br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T21:01:19-07:00","id":127233,"title":"","content":"(Yi) [In Response to the Mastery of Small Manners]<br /> Eugene appears content with your arrival; he was likely expecting you. He appears to have a begrudging respect for you (though you sense a deep-seated disgust for Lookshans in general). He likely believes that your presence and actions will reinforce what he has said to the High Elder.<br /> <br /> High Elder Nereus appears to be somewhat skeptical (likely in response to whatever Eugene has been saying). He too seems to have an instinctual dislike of Lookshans, but you sense another, almost faint emotion beneath it. Hope. As to what he hopes .... *shrug*.<br /> <br /> Larissa is positively awash in tiny indicators of her satisfaction. She appears to like the fact that both the Strategos and the Elder of the most martial house are present. She appears confident, perhaps in Yi's skill. You also sense the faint flickers of attraction, directed towards Yi. Hope that doesn't compromise your working relationship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-07T06:54:51-07:00","id":127436,"title":"","content":"Tirien (And Dero) will go to observe this ball game. If we're to ingratiate ourselves with the locals, we're going to have to know a bit of their culture, aren't we?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-07T13:56:22-07:00","id":127702,"title":"","content":"Yi bowed in greeting to Elder Nereus and recognition to Strategos Eugene, acknowledging each in turn.<br /> <br /> &quot;Honorable Elder, I do not know what you have been told about me. Nor do I think I would succeed if I tried to live up to all the expectations built up around me. I will save us both the annoyance of trying. Though doing so may have weakened my position, I will weaken it further now by saying that I am going to speak with the bluntest of honesty. I have seen far more damage done by secrets kept to long then egos bruised to quickly, and the regard of the goddess and strategos suggests to me your character can stand insults better than flattery.<br /> <br /> The current difficulties Novalesk faces ultimately emerge from a systemic flaw in the organization of its military resources. While those resources may yet be sufficient to deal with this difficulty, that will not correct the problem that allowed the situation to reach the level of a crisis. Simply put, a significant portion of the military is too enmeshed in political fetters to be easily mobilized for any threat save civil war, though I do not suggest that such is happening or will.<br /> <br /> It is my goal, modified and expanded from a suggestion of Origenes, to convince all the gens to place their private forces under the Strategos\u2019 command and to capitalize on the public goodwill of victory to never surrender that command. This will entail require drastic military measures, including integration of units so as to dilute individual gens loyalty, an expansion of the officer corps, and a reevaluation of the role of the Strategos. The master says that once an army is assembled it is the province of the general and not the king, and that wisdom is useful here. While it is dangerous to allow the army to set it own objectives, it is equally dangerous to prevent the army from carrying out its objectives once they are assigned.<br /> <br /> I would like your support for this initiative by releasing your own forces to the Strategos and supporting the later military reorganization. Novalesk is strong, but as it now stands is unable to use its strength when it needs to. Extreme measures may overcome temporary disasters, but it is better to repair the flaw then expect the conditions to always be right for someone to cut through the beuracracy when it is required.<br /> <br /> I am of course open to whatever insight you have to offer. Heaven would not have caused our paths to cross if Creation could not benefit thereby.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-07T21:39:20-07:00","id":127976,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> Tirien and Dero head towards the game, where they find a dozen people running wildly over a field, between two raised nets. They each have a curved, axe-shaped stick. The objective of the game seems to be to hit a hard fist-sized ball into the net while brutalizing the opposing team. A older man in a green-blue-red plaid kilt is standing be the edge of the field and appears to be refereeing the match (such as it is). He nods with smiling eyes towards Tirien and Dero.<br /> <br /> A minute or so after you being watching the &quot;plaids&quot; score a goal on the &quot;skins&quot;, and several minutes later, the ref calls time. Both teams begin congratulating each other over a well played game. Dero expresses his confusion over how the &quot;skins&quot; can be so glad losing, which causes the ref to chuckle heartily.<br /> <br /> &quot;You don't really understand then, Novalesk,&quot; he says. His words are not loud, but they carry well through noise. &quot;They all played well, and it was a beautiful game. To us it is more important than winning.&quot;<br /> <br /> The man cocks his head to Tirien and Dero, &quot;Now, I take it you have business in the Forests of the Silver-Horned Mother?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-07T22:07:01-07:00","id":127982,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> Nereus raises an eyebrow, &quot;You realize that our family relies on its military strength to fill our coffers? Your plan places my family's well-being at risk.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Also, from my perspective you're operating on a flawed premise. As any member of Gens Spyrus or Gens Midea will tell you, the house force structure has served our country well. It has allowed our commanders to respond to threats from Ordon or Theros at our disgression without having to consult the capital. I cannot tell you how many full scale wars that freedom has stopped.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T08:16:18-07:00","id":128258,"title":"","content":"Tirien bows, and says, &quot;I am Ledaal Monos Tirien, scion of the Realm, and resident of Novalesk. I have taken it upon myself, both as a Noble, but also as a Steward of Creation, to defend Novalesk from an invasion of Fae. I have heard that your society has defended itself admirably from Ordon for generations, and was thinking to appeal to your warriors, should they be willing to assist, they would be richly rewarded.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T10:47:51-07:00","id":128367,"title":"","content":"After meditating on his sword and life, Hyuga explores for the forest for a short while. Remembering the weaknesses Loheim told him, (&quot;You can't do detail for for s$!&amp; ! Those hands of yours can be clumsy! Learn to use them in the finer details!&quot;) Hyuga pulls himself up into the trees using only his hands, practicing his gripping skills and fine usage of his fingers, carefully calculating where they will go and how they shift. Carefully, he carves his way through the treetops in search of forage-able food, watching the beautiful sunset's dark hue penetrate through the forest bed.<br /> <br /> After sunset, Hyuga settles down to start making some designs for decorations of sword hilts. Using a make-shift dagger like rock, Hyuga practices carving intricate designs that might be used for hilts (<a href=\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v417/Fuin_Elda/haradrim-dagger.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v4...rim-dagger.jpg</a>) into the trees nearby. As the light continues to fade, he continues practicing using only the touch of his fingers to caress and feel the designs whilst continuing to craft. Occasionally, Hyuga will mumble to himself about not being THAT bad at detail work, yet continues to daintily cut the trees.<br /> <br /> After a couple of hours, Hyuga feels his finished designs and hopes that it looks as good as he thought it felt. He knew he would have to come back in the morning and check. After not having slept last night, he knew that it was now time to sleep. Carefully, he cuts and rips bark off of the other nearby trees to help make a nicer makeshift sleeping area. Finding a decent spot to lay down, he began to make his preparations. Having traveled through the woods by himself for quite a while, he knew what animals would likely be out during the night and set up small barriers and traps against them. He moved a rock or two here, put a sharpened stick here and there, and even made some tripwires from plants, rocks, and pieces of bark that would alert him if dangers came near. Satisfied, he laid down in a bed of leaves covered by the large sections of bark and went to sleep.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>For climbing I used a -1 penalty</b> dex +athl = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495032/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495032/</a> (<b>3,1,2 sux</b>)</li> <li><b>For finding food</b> (wits+surv+specialty)= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495074/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495074/</a> (<b>3 sux</b>)</li> <li>For sharpened <b>dagger-like rock</b> (dex+craft-earth)= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495057/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495057/</a><b>(6 sux) </b></li> <li>He will start <b>training his dexterity</b> at this time using up the rest of his experience.</li> <li><b>For designs </b>(craft-air + dex at -2 penalty)= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495069/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495069/</a> (<b>1 sux</b>)</li> <li><b>For feeling designs </b>(per+ aware at -2 penalty)= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495070/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495070/</a> (<b>1 sux)</b></li> <li><b>For finding shelter </b>(wits+survival+specialty+2-die stunt?)= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495077/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4495077/</a> (<b>3+1 sux)</b></li> </ol>\u200b\u200b</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T14:48:00-07:00","id":128529,"title":"","content":"Yi smiled slightly, pleased by the bluntness of the reply.<br /> <br /> \u201cYour second point is the easier to answer, so I will begin with it if you do not mind. There are multiple answers to the problem of local flexibility which would each remove the difficulty.<br /> <br /> In the first place, a unified military command structure is in no necessary way linked to a loss of local authority. While in practice there may be limitations imposed, such as forbidding responses back across the border, they will present in a broader context of unified command.<br /> <br /> Secondly, there are multiple methods for dealing with communication. Though sorcery is an option, it is an expensive and rare one. More usefully, there are several works of artifice designed for this exact problem, and either myself or the academy is capable of producing them. The specifics would depend on the exact use they were put to, with unique civilian and military concerns.<br /> <br /> Lastly, your own reply is based on a potentially dangerous conflation of roles. The positions of Gens Elder and leader of Gens forces while often linked are not identical. Each possesses a distinct and potentially conflicting responsibility to both the Gens and the nation as a whole. In perfect candor, having what are essentially autonomous warlords within Novalesk produces far more risk than benefit. The Strategos himself has expressed concern for a potential coup made possible by these private forces to say nothing of the fact that a change in elected leadership should not bring about the specter of civil war..<br /> <br /> This is a useful place to point out that part of the reason for integrated units and unified training standards is to ensure that the armed forces will not be in a position to act against Novalesk.<br /> <br /> As for the wealth of your house, I am given to understand that you are the major provider of military weapons and metalwork in the nation. This being the case, my proposed reorganization will result in your family becoming exceptionally wealthy if you handle the situation correctly. While I am leery of offering anything like a fully developed play, the basic should be helpful enough.<br /> <br /> Standardization of training and equipment, as well as a larger available military budget when all current sources are united, means that your contracts will become even more lucrative. In addition, the ability to make larger individual purchases even if the amount is the same means that more specialized material such as siege panoply can be commissioned at an increased rate. Honestly speaking, your metal working infrastructure will prove even more lucrative in the long run especially with the infrastructural expansion proposals I plan make with some of the other Gens.<br /> <br /> I would also suggest making or preserving a sharp distinction between the autonomous mercenary organizations you support and the personal forces of your house. Well it will fool no one intelligent, it is a useful distinction in the realm of politics by creating a zone of separation from the government of Novalesk and the activities of our agents. These revenue streams at the very least would not be affected by the proposal.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T10:38:14-07:00","id":129085,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> &quot;A Steward of Creation, from the Realm? That is an odd sight in truth,&quot; the man says shaking his head slightly. He bows slightly to Tirien, &quot;I am Erwan, Skald of clan Donnkad. If you are in truth a Steward, then I know my lord chieftain would be glad to speak with you.&quot;<br /> <br /> He pauses seeming to by trying to confirm if your word-choice was hinting at something, or just a quirk of language.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-09-2014, 01:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T11:19:49-07:00","id":129107,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga)<br /> Hyuga awakens in the mid morning as a stray bit of sunlight pierces through the tree-tops. It appears to sear his eyes, as if the Sun itself is rousing him awake. Looking around he sees that his traps are undisturbed, yet a small platter of wild vegetables sits on the ground in front of one of the trees he used for practice. <br /> <br /> And upon that tree, the delicate work that Hyuga had carved either changed overnight, of something odd happened when he carved in the dark. The delicate lines shift at one point into intricate scrolled Flametongue text, before switching back into meaningless decoration.<br /> <br /> The Text: &quot;Return to the city; the Dawn Comes&quot;<br /> <br /> I wonder what the could possibility mean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T12:45:19-07:00","id":129190,"title":"","content":"(Yi) <br /> Eugene cracks a half smile; from your previous interaction, this makes him appear positively euphoric. <br /> <br /> &quot;That is exactly what Eugene said you would say,&quot; Nereus says, &quot;And I must admit that my house's martial inclinations would place us in the position to dominate the officer corps for the time being. I have already released my troops to Eugene; all we were waiting for is for someone else to do it first. You support this course of action, M'lady Archon?&quot;<br /> <br /> Larissa pauses a moment before nodding, &quot;You know my father and I both want to hedge the power of Nikoloi and Zophyrus. They have grown too powerful for the nation's good. Nationalizing the military would be a good step in that direction. My father suggested you of Ptreas putting forward a compromise candidate. Perhaps by engineering some hero in the battles ahead.&quot;<br /> <br /> Eugene says, &quot;We have someone who might fit that bill. A young mercenary commander with a gift for tactics and logistics. All of our mercenary companies have been recalled and should be here before we march.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T13:42:41-07:00","id":129234,"title":"","content":"Jensven strides into the market of the main city of Novalesk, Shadow slightly behind and to his left. He scans the stalls in an attempt to find someone selling armor and actually knowing what they are doing. His time with a Guild caravan smith gave him some idea of what to look for.<br /> <br /> Before he can get far, the dog looks at him expectantly. &quot;I suppose we have traveled a long way. We should find some charred meat for both of us. Maybe some mead.&quot; Jensven notices the dog drop his head and cover his nose. &quot;Well, no mead for you. I remember you don't like it. Definitely the coolest, cleanest water I can get my hands on.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that the Lightbringer begins to look for a stand or establishment selling cooked meat, &quot;I heard something about amazing Elk on a stick on the way in. I doubt they have that here.&quot; He still keeps his eyes out for the armor sellers, because that is what he has on the brain; Armor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:36:45-07:00","id":129265,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> Jensven finds a dearth of armor salesmen; presumably most, if not all, of military hardware under production is being stockpiled for the military. There is a rather large foundry complex near the docks; you may be able to find work there.<br /> <br /> You find a shaggy looking hobo man, who is selling elk-on-a-stick from a Rickshaw. He seems like a nice guy and throws in a free kabob for the pooch, but he seems a bit obsessed with some sort of Perfect Mountain. Pretty weird guy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T15:00:00-07:00","id":129282,"title":"","content":"Jensven thanks the peddler of elk heartily, ordering and paying for two servings for himself and one more for his canine companion. He decides against telling him about the prevailing religion from back home. The locals worshiped the tribal chieftan as a god. He bought into it as well. That was until that fateful raid when the Shining Golden King gave power to the humble apprentice blacksmith. He still had conflicting feelings to work through about that.<br /> <br /> He didn't have to call Shadow as he moves over to the nearest fountain and proceeds to gather water for the animal with his hands. He cups the water and holds it for the dog to drink. Then he repeats the process until the animal has it's fill, &quot;There you are, Shadow. Nice, clean water. Now you can stop complaining. You aren't dying of thirst.&quot;<br /> <br /> After getting some water for himself he proceeds to the foundry complex to find a foreman of some sort.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 05-09-2014, 06:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:25:01-07:00","id":129375,"title":"","content":"Hyuga eyeing the vegetables fills up on them whilst pondering the message. He wonders if it was from Mia. He had hinted to her what he was after all. But did this mean that it was actually time for dawn, or did the message come for one of the Sun's chosen. If so, was I mistaken for one of those of &quot;Dawn&quot; or did it speak of another. And who here would be speaking flametongue? It was not all that common around here. Or was this a simple magic that appeared in his native tongue? Could it be Mia, an unknown person, or maybe their new companion Yi? There were so many possibilities. Getting frustrated, Hyuga combs his hands through his hair trying to tame it and get all of the moss and twigs out of it. <br /> <br /> &quot;I suppose I won't figure anything out like this. Time to head back into the city. Perhaps Mia will have an answer for me. That's the best place to start. I would like to see her again as well. After a quick visit, I should probably do some crafting to make money and gain at least some sort of prestige. Why do these things have to be so complicated?&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga quickly wraps himself in his cape to bring cover from the bright, glaring daystar above. Saying his goodbyes to the forest, he walks into the city along the bustling main road looking left and right at the different games, activities, stalls, and other events happening through the town. He knew he should keep in mind the location of at least one or two of the blacksmith stalls and shops. Recalling the road to the academy where Mia would most likely be, he treks onward, a clear foreigner to all he passes by. He ignores all the calls to see products, jeers, and all the other noises of the crowds. Eventually, he finds himself at his destination waiting for the messenger to appear.<br /> <br /> As soon as the messenger appears, Hyuga says, &quot;I believe Madame Mia may be looking for me. Could you please let her know that I am here?&quot; Hyuga will then give a short bow and stare off into the distance looking and listening for more news of his friends.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> per+awareness= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4496590/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4496590/</a> <b>(1 sux)</b> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:14:35-07:00","id":129463,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> Mere moments after Shadow has had his fill, a mouse scurries out from underneath the lip of the fountain betwixt the dog's legs. Falling prey to his instinct, Shadow chases after the mouse, which darts towards a nearby stall. The dog barrels towards a swordsman, a southerner from the looks of him. This southerner sees the oncoming dog at the last moment, narrowly dodging out of the way. Shadow (somehow) looses track of the mouse, and begins sniffing around on the ground around the southerner. <br /> <br /> (Hyuga) <br /> While walking towards the Academy's grounds, Hyuga passes a number smithy stands, and something unusual happens. A stray sunbeam crosses a displayed plow at the exact right moment for it to shine directly into Hyuga's eyes. He turns his head reflexively, seeing a large dog barrel towards him. Narrowly dodging, Hyuga's gaze falls upon a northern swordsman, presumably the dog;s owner. <br /> <br /> (Both)<br /> The two swordsmen take stock of each other. Each one seems so familiar yet alien to the other, as if they were brothers in a past life. The northerner recalls the southerner giving him a gleaming blade of gleaming silver and blazing white-gold, a masterpiece blade that he died swinging. And the southerner recalls the northerner using this blade to save his life, thrusting himself upon traitorous blades to give his brother a chance to flee and live. <br /> <br /> So very familiar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:27:47-07:00","id":129471,"title":"","content":"&quot;I remain uncertain about the plan to manufacture a hero, a great many things could go wrong and the selection criteria do not seem ideal for selecting a head of state. A throne is a poor place for a corpse, and a puppet would be a sign that we do not believe in the system we are supporting. Nevertheless, I trust that each of you have given the matter amble thought and trust your judgement.<br /> <br /> There is another matter which I had hopped to discuss while I was here. As you have suggested goddess,&quot; he inclined his head toward her, &quot;the appearance of neutrality is unlikely to be beneficial for either my mission or my life expectancy. Aligning myself with you could prove damaging to you given my status and origin, but I would appreciate your thoughts on the matter.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:48:58-07:00","id":129486,"title":"","content":"After he manages to shake himself out of the momentary reverie, the Ascending Sun berates the northern dog in Skytongue, &quot;Shadow! I trained you better than that. I want you to apologize to this swordsman this instant. Don't act like you don't understand what I am saying. I know you are smarter than the average dog.&quot; He seems to be having a heated discussion with the animal, almost as if he were scolding a child.<br /> <br /> The dog folds his ears down and cautiously approaches Hyuga. He sits on his haunches and raises a paw to him. The Northerner switches to Riverspeak to address the Southerner, &quot;I'm really sorry about that. You really know how to move though. Shadow is sorry, too. He agrees to watch where he is going. He's even willing to shake on it.&quot; Jensven will stare oddly at Hyuga for a moment and wait awkwardly for a response.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:59:26-07:00","id":129497,"title":"","content":"In the same instant he saw the foreigner and remembered the details, Hyuga swiftly bear hugged him without thinking. A split second later, Hyuga jolts backwards and apologizes scratching his head. &quot;Ah... sorry about that. I do not know what came over me. Please forgive my rudeness. I just felt an overwhelming feeling of trust and debt to you.&quot; Hyuga will survey him once again and look around at the dog chasing a mouse into a corner. &quot;I feel as if this is not the first time we have met. I believe the unconquered sun may have led me to you. I received a most interesting message this morning. The Dawn has come.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga puts his fingers to his temple and tries to concentrate for a second. &quot;Surely there must be some sort of connection between us for the sun to lead me to you. I have heard tales that groups of the sun's chosen often fought together in tight knit groups in the past. Perhaps this is all a message that we worked together in the past. I am certain that it must have been you that saved my life. I would be honored if you would fight with me once again. I also saw a sword in that vision. It was like a ray of light from the daystar that stopped evil in its path. Maybe I have found yet another grand design to craft once again.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without skipping yet another beat, he says &quot;I am working with some others to help protect part of this great nation from a Raksha invasion. I believe you might be of great help. Will you come with me old friend?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:19:52-07:00","id":129514,"title":"","content":"&quot;Whoa! Hold it there stranger!&quot; Jensven takes a step back and calls the dog over again. &quot;I have little to no clue what you are talking about. The only lives I saved were the villagers back home just before I left. I also understood Raksha invasion. I heard a bit about that on the way in. I have no love for the Fair Ones. I actually came to see if I could help produce armor for the soldiers that will be fighting.&quot;<br /> <br /> After a short pause he continues while idly scratching Shadow behind the ears, &quot;You know, that stuff you just said sounded really weird. Part of me wants to say you are completely insane. Another part wants to believe every bit of it.&quot; He extends a hand to the other Chosen of the Sun, &quot;The name is Jensven Vargsmed. He's Shadow. If you are up for helping with the effort to defeat some Raksha, I'm all in. You will have to explain some of that other stuff to me later, though.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:28:28-07:00","id":129524,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will scratch his head and shake the dog's paw. &quot;Sorry. I have a few bad habits and have a hard time not speaking my mind in everything. Please forgive me for not introducing myself. I am Hyuga and I am standing against the Raksha invasion. I myself am here to craft weapons so that people may rise up and protect themselves from their foes.&quot; &quot;I do have to say that you have quite the smart dog there. He must be a wonderful companion.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:40:08-07:00","id":129533,"title":"","content":"Shadow looks at Hyuga almost as if thanking him for the compliment and the Bronze Tiger speaks again, &quot;Yeah, he wasn't always this smart. It's like I can actually understand him most of the time. He seems to have gotten smarter since we left home. He listens pretty well most of the time.<br /> <br /> &quot;Since you do weaponsmithing and I do armorsmithing, I think we would make one heck of a team trying to outfit soldiers. Were you planning on joining on in the foundry here to lend a hand, or were you going elsewhere?&quot;<br /> <br /> He pauses for a moment and thinks, &quot;You mentioned that you were with others. Others like you believe we are or average folks? Where are they, and were we going to see them?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 05-10-2014, 09:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T22:09:26-07:00","id":129623,"title":"","content":"Tirien nods, and then shifts to her warform, a sinewy tower of fur, massive limbs, claws and teeth. She rubs her still-somewhat human face a bit, and blinks, before looking back at Erwan.<br /> <br /> &quot;When I said I was a Steward, I meant it, Ser, although I understand your confusion. The Realm is my homeland, but I am no longer welcome there, as you can see. If you would do me the honor, I would have you introduce me to your King, so I can address him rightly and properly,&quot; Tirien says.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T14:53:59-07:00","id":130242,"title":"","content":"Hyuga pauses to think a moment and says, &quot;They are like us, but oh so very different. They prefer to use words to get things done. I do not know where they are at the moment, but they have already begun to turn the wheels to make sure we are able to get rid of the Raksha threat. I suppose we could go to the academy and help outfit soldiers, but I was thinking about using my skills in the town to help gain reputation within the populace. It would come in handy later on. What would you like to do?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T16:10:47-07:00","id":130844,"title":"","content":"(Jensven and Hyuga)<br /> As Hyuga is finishing his question, you both hear a large crushing sound in the direction of the foundry complex, followed by the sounds of battle. Sounds like someone's trying to destroy it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T16:16:18-07:00","id":130854,"title":"","content":"(Yi) <br /> Eugene shakes his head, &quot;I wouldn't try to manufacture a hero, but to give a likely hero a chance to shine may work. Moreover-&quot;<br /> <br /> Eugene is cut off by Nereus' secretary bursting through the door. &quot;My lords, Fae are attacking the foundry!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T21:25:07-07:00","id":131531,"title":"","content":"Yi's apparel was still in the billowing white form they had taken to resemble Origenes. Even so, his sword remained at his side. He turned to Larissa, already getting up, and said, &quot;I apologize for any trouble this may bring you, but lost credibility can be restored and lost lives cannot.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that he turned and started to run toward the foundry. He didn't turn to look back, but he hopped he was not doing so alone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T21:28:53-07:00","id":131536,"title":"","content":"&quot;It appears we will have to wait to use our creativity later,&quot; the Lightbringer states as he attempts to get a good look at what all the commotion is about. &quot;I have a hunch we may need to be more violent shortly.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Perception + Awareness to attempt to see what is going on. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4497946/\" target=\"_blank\">One success! Really?</a>Am I going to be regretting not getting the Third Excellency?</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He barks a command in Skytongue to the dog and affects a stance that is poised to react to what is going on. Whether he should just run, run toward the sounds in the foundry, or draw his blade he is ready to make the decision in a second and see it through. Shadow stands ready at his side in a similar, yet definitively canine pose.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Perception + Awareness for the dog for the same reason. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4497979/\" target=\"_blank\">Three successes!</a> Go puppy!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T22:33:14-07:00","id":131645,"title":"","content":"(Tirien) <br /> The Geherin, save for Erwan, gape. Erwan merely nods his head politely, &quot;Lady Steward. It has been decades since last I have seen one of your kind. Now if you would return to you normal form?&quot; <br /> <br /> Once Tirien has transformed back into her regular form, the Skald beckons her towards the forest, and sets off in a run. Tirien and Dero set off after him. They sprint nearly three miles into and through the forest. There, you find a settlement, a large town built both on the ground and into the towering evergreens of the forest. Erwan is hardly winded, but Dero is absolutely wasted. <br /> <br /> Erwan leads you through the prosperous town, mentioning casually that if she wants a better manservant than Dero, he can get her one. Eventually he finds a blurry, bald, bearded man with a iron torc. Erwan introduces Chieftain Darmud to Tirien and vice-versa. <br /> <br /> \u200bThe Chieftain seems rather happy to be hosting one of the Stewards of Creation; he declares a feast this evening in Tirien's honor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T23:57:14-07:00","id":131744,"title":"","content":"Before the dawn even finishes his sentence, Hyuga whirls his blade over his shoulder in a single flowing arc and runs off towards the foundry leaving a streak of dust in his path. Repeating his vow to protect others using his crafting and swordsman skills, Hyuga focus on what he learned about his blade and rushes to the scene quickly dodging around and past gathering crowds and listening for any signs of where the most help is needed. Arriving at the foundry, he quickly passes those with injuries calling for a doctor to help, whilst running to the nearest fight to repel the invaders. He jumps over obstacles, dodges arrows, and ducks and dives around to get as close as possible. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga will activate Protection of the Celestial Bliss while running to the scene. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4498084/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4498084/</a> 0 sux for dosing any obstacles :/. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4498086/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4498086/</a> BOTCH on awareness roll :/. If a join battle roll is needed... What penalty will I have? Stupid dice acting like this at the worst time :/ </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T15:34:51-07:00","id":132824,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> Yi feels an unexpected tug on the back of his robe. Looking for it's source, he finds Larissa's expectantly strong grip. She is looking at the Spyroi, and she simply asks, &quot;Eugene?&quot;<br /> <br /> Eugene is himself already in motion. He suddenly appears uncomfortable unarmed and unarmored. He nods, saying, &quot;I'll organize this end. You'll get there faster without me.&quot;<br /> <br /> Larissa grins wolfishly, and Yi finds himself thrown over her shoulder without feeling the intervening motion. Larissa sprints out of the building, and into the streets, narrowly avoiding many. The crowd on the streets, however, are apparently too much for her, and she leaps onto a nearby building, avoiding the crowds by leaping from rooftop to rooftop. <br /> <br /> (Hyuga and Jensven)<br /> Terror and panic abound on the riverfront. Shadow indicates that something is going on in that direction, similar to what happened on the day of Jensven's exaltation. Should Jensven follow Hyuga, they find the foundry in the midst of a fierce battle. Small pockets of goblins make battle with some Novaleski soldiers. A particularly large group of goblins guards the large brass doors of the facility. <br /> <br /> (Novalesk [all])<br /> Hyuga and Jensven hear a voice pierce through the din of battle. A young-looking woman clad in armored robes hefts a broad straight sword, its surface covered in faintly glowing runes. Yi is behind her, having been just dumped unceremoniously upon the ground. &quot;You have been Judged, Fae,&quot; Larissa says, her voice cold and piercing, &quot;And you have been found wanting.&quot; She swings her blade, and despite standing over ten yards from the nearest goblin, the mass of goblins simply unravels, dissolving into ambient essence. <br /> <br /> Around you, the soldiers appear to have the goblins in hand. Larissa slumps down somewhat, likely tired from sprinting across town and then destroying a goblin strike-team. &quot;Thier leader is likely inside,&quot; she says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T16:25:58-07:00","id":132860,"title":"","content":"&quot;Larissa,&quot; Yi said as he drew his sword with practiced flourish, &quot;please warn me the next time you mean to prove your greater athleticism. Such a victory is far richer when earned in the face of active competition.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Did I actually just proposition a goddess? What has happened to me? I believed, really believed in the Dragons and their teachings, even when I knew they were a lie.</i><br /> <br /> Time for reflection would come later. For now, he cocked his sword so that it reflected the sky, and it remained shining blue-gold. &quot;Hyuga, you wouldn't happen to know where Tiren is would you? One can never have too much backup.&quot;<br /> <br /> Even as he spoke he started walking toward the foundry, concerned for the people who might remain trapped inside.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T21:34:01-07:00","id":133166,"title":"","content":"He snaps his gaze around at the confusion and tries to make sense of it...and fails, but Jensven notices that the dog's attention is pointed in the direction that Hyuga rushes off to. Hearing familiar, haunting sounds the decision is made in an instant. No words need be said to the canine. It knows how to read it's masters actions and other aural cues. Three feet of steel appear in his hand, he starts running, and Shadow follows behind and slightly to the left. All the actions occur so closely together they are almost simultaneous.<br /> <br /> Rounding a corner to get a view of the facility, he pauses to take in the scene. The pause is just long enough for the Goddess and Zenith to arrive. He takes them in quickly and is grateful for their arrival. The Ascending Sun walks briskly behind Yi, &quot;I don't know who this Tirien is, but Hyuga seems to believe I am a great warrior. Add to that the fact that I have no love for the Fair Ones and I am going to provide this 'backup' you speak of.&quot; After a few steps he adds, &quot;This is only my second real battle. I hope I won't disappoint.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 05-12-2014, 12:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T22:29:36-07:00","id":133199,"title":"","content":"After stumbling around, Hyuga somersaults up to his feet flicking his cape through the air flicking all of the dust away. Hyuga will yell to Yi, &quot;Tirien left town earlier with her hired help. They went somewhere, but I know not where. We will need to deal with this ourselves. I did bring some help with me though.&quot; Hyuga will point with thumb over his shoulder at Jensven. &quot;I think I knew him before. Pretty sure he saved my life. He should be of some help. It looks like you've brought some help of your own.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the sun reflects of his blade in a fine golden sheer, his attention will turn towards the brass doors. Swiftly, Hyuga will dash towards the goblins like a streak of light bouncing from side to side through the maze of the courtyard with his sword held at shoulder level directly in front of him. As he approaches the goblins, he pierces the ground with his sword like lightning striking the ground. A split second later, Hyuga uses the force to propel himself in the air above the goblins, like a pole vaulter, in a giant arc. As his feet touch the door, he swings around slicing at the nearest goblin's head, the light streaming from his blade like the sun's rays, and the gem in the hilt glowing whilst yelling, &quot;Feel the burn of the sun&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4499110/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4499110/</a> (1+0 sux) on the door stunt; I added 2-die to my join battle roll for the &quot;surprise stunt&quot; <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4499112/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4499112/</a> (3+0 sux) for join battle. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":".  My iPad doesn't to like keeping my formatting... 05-12-2014, 02:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T07:23:29-07:00","id":133691,"title":"","content":"<br /> <br /> To Erwan's comment, Tirien will shake her head, and pat Dero's head.<br /> <br /> &quot;He may not be entirely up to snuff, but he's my cute little Dero, so I'll keep him,&quot; She says.<br /> <br /> When she meets the chieftain, Tirien will bow, and says, &quot;I am honored and flattered by this display of hospitality. However, I must ask if it would be possible to gather all the tribes? I have a request I wish to make of your people as a whole.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T18:32:51-07:00","id":134744,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Larissa strides into the foundry, her blade bare. Those of you who follow her see the interior of the foundry; long lines of clay moldings sit in neat lines along the interior, running parallel to the waterfront (of which you are on the far side). A series of pulley systems run along the rails dangling from the ceiling, holding the buckets which deliver the molten metals to the forge. Two openings lead out to the waterfront at each side of the open complex; judging from the layout of the complex, the one to your right delivers raw materials to the large furnace nearby, while the one on the left presumably is used to ship the processed metals from the complex.<br /> <br /> You see a half dozen large insectoid creatures, looking something like a cross between <a href=\"http://www.vuurvliegie.net/wp-content/uploads/2012/03/P1450567b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">a leaf insect nymph</a>, <a href=\"http://floridakeysreeladventures.com/files/2012/03/spiny-Lobster.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">a spiny lobster</a> and <a href=\"http://beetlesinthebush.files.wordpress.com/2010/12/img_4360_cln_crp_lvl_clr_1200x800_usm.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">a stag beetle</a>. Four of these monstrosities are busy smashing up the molds and production lines. The other two are busily spraying gouts of freezing mist into the furnace. Each one has a beastial humanoid riding them.<br /> <br /> On a catwalk above the furnace, a strange figure with crazily spiked hair and strange erratically belted clothing, stands with a huge daiklaive over his shoulder.<br /> <br /> When you enter, he turns and points his sword at you, saying, &quot;YOooUuu are laaate! Don'tYou know YOU've gotto stay ON the script?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-12-2014, 09:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T18:48:47-07:00","id":134755,"title":"","content":"(Tirien) <br /> Darmud strokes his beard, clearly pondering something. &quot;Lady Steward, I cannot call a clan-moot save in time of greatest peril to the clans of Vicruith,&quot; he says, with a frown. He suddenly bursts into a toothy grin, and with a laugh in his voice, he clarifies, &quot;but a Steward can. I will interpret your words as a request to relay your command to the rest of the clans. Erwan! Send word to the clans. A Steward call the clans to moot! We travel to the Court of the High King in the morning. Tonight we feast in the steward's honor!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T18:58:15-07:00","id":134769,"title":"","content":"There was a part of Yi that he had learned better then to try to shut up that was distracted by the improvement he could make to this facility. Fortunately it was a very small part.<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't you know that the hero always arrives just in the nick of time? Now have at you, I'm late for my happily ever after and your standing in the way of it.&quot;<br /> <br /> The taunt was calculated, drawn from his knowledge of the fey. There were ways to cut more deeply, strike at their honor or beauty, but those required a greater understanding. Challenge their roll in their story and any of them will lose their composure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T20:40:20-07:00","id":134945,"title":"","content":"Tirien smiles, &quot;Then we have an accord, Your Eminence. I am looking forward to seeing the hospitality of your people.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T21:28:12-07:00","id":134991,"title":"","content":"Jensven follows Larissa into the foundry and stares at all the equipment in the place. He had only used a small standing forge before, nothing as complex as this and he found himself fascinated.<br /> <br /> Shadow growls at the fey creatures, which causes his bipedal companion to pull his gaze away from the metalworks. After sizing up the creatures he feels that he would be outclassed against the one with the huge sword, but he might be able to do something against the insectoid fey. He positions himself in as close to a line as possible to the right of the goddess and readies himself for battle. The dog howls, a sound almost indistinguishable from that of a wolf, &quot;Sounds like Shadow's ready. I wonder if these bugs are?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will pay two motes from my peripheral pool to gain two extra dice to my Join Battle roll from my First Awareness Excellency. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500073/\" target=\"_blank\">Five successes!</a> This should leave me with twenty seven in my peripheral pool. Shadow rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500075/\" target=\"_blank\">three successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T21:34:47-07:00","id":134998,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> &quot;HA! YOU thiiink that you are, the Hero?&quot; The Fae shouts, his hair spiking out at exactly the same angle despite your shifting perspective. <br /> <br /> Suddenly, the room fades to dark, and all figures save the Circle and Larissa appear frozen in time. Any attempts to move are met with resistance, as if you are floating in a viscous fluid. A glowing screen appears before you, and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gEmEnXI19uQ\" target=\"_blank\">piano music begins to play</a>. Grainy sepia images begin to appear.<br /> <br /> A grotesque paper-cutout woman appears and begins stomping a tiny claymation village. <i>[subtitle]Gaia: rawr.[/subtitle]</i> The scene cuts to the Fae, who is wearing overalls and a ridiculous onion-shaped hat <i>[subtitle]Shu-Yin:Oh noes! My village![/subtitle]. </i>Cut back to paper-cutout Gaia, who wags a finger <i>[subtitle]Gaia: To face me you must first defeat my Five Elemental Dragons, who are leeching off the Elemental Poles[/subtitle]</i>. <br /> <br /> The screen disappears, the scene returns to both normal lighting and speed, and the resistance to your motion disappears. Shu-Yin pumps a fist, &quot;YOU seeeee? This is whyy II'M the, Main character?.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi finds a large codex (that makes most college math textbooks seem like light reading) hurled at him. On the cover: Penultimate Phantasmagoria XIIII (C)<br /> <br /> &quot;NOW, Stay ontooo, the script?.,&quot; Shu-Yin says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T06:09:45-07:00","id":135288,"title":"","content":"Directly after landing, Hyuga pushes back to enter the room and immediately grabs the codex off the ground.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hold on a minute. We need to check through this...&quot; Hyuga will read quickly and then say, &quot;No, no, no... this is just not right. It doesn't highlight the hero and make them elegant. It seems just way too boring for a hero. You need to think of all the great stories like Bogard and the Seven Monstrous Giants or even The Adventures of the Spike-haired man and the inferno wastes. Those truly showed off the hero. True heroism is tragic and full of awesome battles where they take the lead.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will pause in thought for a second and then say, &quot;Yes... I think I have it. Why don't you command all of your beasts not to attack the building, but us. You could command them from afar showing how elegant and charismatic you are. It would build up the hero's resolve and charismatic traits. Soon after, we kill a few of them and you charge in ready to save the day, showing your elegance and bravery. But we must not forget the tragedy and legacy that must be in the story. You can jump in front of one of the soldiers and take an attack for them. Your bravery would shine best and then you put up a short fight. In the end though, the hero must fall. But one of the soldiers has to escape to spread the story of our brave, noble, and wonderful hero. His legacy will live on forever and inspire so many countless others. That is how a true hero would lead his nation to the greatest heights and finish the great objective of the hero. Yes, this would be the most beautiful ending for such an amazing hero.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will close his eyes for a second seemingly in deep retrospect. &quot;This is the best story, don't you agree everyone? Why don't we finish this beautiful story?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T09:09:48-07:00","id":135411,"title":"","content":"Jensven wonders what in Creation Hyuga is thinking playing with a Fey Lord like that. From what he has heard these creatures devour souls and remove all passion and emotion from someone, and those are just the weaker ones. This Fey appears to be one of the more ravenous (big stuff) ones. It doesn't seem very likely the enemy would just follow the plan like that, but Jensven nods his assent anyway. He maintains his state of readiness, idly shifting his weight from one foot to the other in order to maintain both balance and the ability to react at a moment's notice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T10:28:33-07:00","id":135497,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Shu-yin adopts a Stance, and laughs, &quot;I aaaam the Hero, because of myterriblesecretpast. AAAAND I am leading my ragtag bannnnd of loveable misfits against the mad tyrant Gaia. The story cannot goooo like that? If the Main character dies, it is only after nobly, sacrificing themselves. To defeat the primary, villain. I can't die because I AM, the Main Character!&quot;<br /> <br /> The other Fae pull out codices similar to the one tossed at you, leaf through for a moment, and then nod, saying in rough unison, &quot;Yes, yes, he's the main character.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You seee? But enough talk, let's fight!&quot;<br /> <br /> Roll join battle, Exthalion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-13-2014, 01:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T11:33:12-07:00","id":135573,"title":"","content":"It was dangerous to play the raksha's games too much, it gave them a sort of power. Even so, Yi couldn't resist tossing out,<br /> <br /> &quot;You presume this isn't a tragedy. Let me show you why it is.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500303/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500303/</a><br /> <br /> 3 successes.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T12:35:58-07:00","id":135663,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> The feast is truly lavish, ripe with the bounty of the forests. II mean look at that, it's a whole roast moose!<br /> <br /> The Skalds regale you with the tales of clan Donnkad and the Geherin in general. For the most part, they revolve around their ferocity in battle, besting bands of Fae, barbarians of the foothills, and the Ordon's phalanxes and &quot;metal men&quot;. Two particular tales stand out; the Epic of High King Eckelbraun the Foolish, and the tale of the Silver-Horned Mother's birth (both are summarized below).<br /> <br /> The Epic of High King Eckelbraun the Foolish<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">High King Eckelbraun the foolish was High King a long time ago, sometime before last Solday. He demanded that he be able to ride a horse in three dimensions, since it was the only creature noble enough for him to ride. To do this, they used a pulley system to get a horse into a tree. The horse then fell out, crushing King Eckelbraun to death. Everyone then realized it was a stupid plan, and agreed to never do it again.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Silver Mother's Birth<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The Moon was travelling around, doing moon things. Eating Fae, stomping demons, that sort of thing. Then the moon got a stomach ache 'cause she ate too many Fae, and puked. But instead of gastric juices with Fae bits in them, she puked out a silver-horned woman, fully clothed and on a silver-maned horse. The moon then went off to gloat to the sun about it (legend says the sun, not one to be outdone, then barfed up a gilded dragon). The woman decided to stay where she was born and became the goddess of the Geherin. Her twin brother (the Horse) went off to have awesome adventures</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Yep. Ready to begin your travels to the court of the High King?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T19:20:08-07:00","id":136078,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Shu-Yin throws his daikliave at Hyuga, hops onto it, and then steps off at the last moment, grabbing it by the hilt to throw a downward swing. Hyuga narrowly dodges the attack as the daiklaive loops around his arm, morphing into a firewand, which fires at Hyuga as it comes to bear. Hyuga is hit squarely by the blast.<br /> <br /> Unless he does something, he will be hit by the 12L base damage attack.<br /> <br /> It is now Jensven's turn. Larissa and the commoners act simultaneously. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T19:44:15-07:00","id":136117,"title":"","content":"As he dodges the initial diklaive attack in a whirlwind of motion, he cuts the story codex in half with a quick motion and places both halves between himself and the now formed firewand which has wrapped itself around his arm waiting for it to be blasted.<br /> <br /> &quot;Best for this piece of crap story to be burned. Welcome to reality. Let me show you how YOU end.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I don't expect this to do much, it was mostly for theatrics. If it is stuntable, all the better. I will take the attack as is (burning the book as well). </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T19:58:21-07:00","id":136136,"title":"","content":"Tirien will thank Clan Diarmud for their hospitality, and asks if it would be possible to speak with the Silver-horned Mother. If she truly is descended from the Moon, then as the Moon's chosen warrior, she ought to pay her respects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T21:17:44-07:00","id":136172,"title":"","content":"Jensven charges one of the insectoid fey and leaps into the air. He brings his sword down with a two handed reversed grip in an attempt to stab through the creature's carapace. A fierce shout escapes his lips, signifying his fury.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Simple attack with the straight sword and no charm activations gives me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500993/\" target=\"_blank\">five successes</a>. I also think that qualifies for a one die stunt. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500995/\" target=\"_blank\">Two successes if it does!</a> The sword would do 6L base damage. This is assuming I can even reach the sucker to attack this action. If not I will dash toward the nearest insectoid fey until I am able to attack and this is the attack I would like to use. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T14:34:25-07:00","id":137165,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Hyuga's antics disipate the blast somewhat, but he is still hit with a significant blast; Hyuga takes 2L damage.<br /> <br /> Jensven's attack connects with the Behemoth, causing it to scream and lash out at him in pain. The strike from its mandible spine thing narrowly misses.<br /> <br /> The two behemoths that are messing with the furnace continue to do so. One of the remaining Fae jumps over the materiel littering the ground to lash at Yi, missing wildly. The next commoner orders his beast to attack Larissa, and it does, spitting a blast of frozen energy at her, which misses.<br /> <br /> The last Fae (a wolf-lizard-man) launches himself off his beast to attack Larissa. She attempts to parry his attack, but ends up with his hand through her gut. She attempts to fight him off, resulting in him backing off momentarily.<br /> <br /> As the Wolf-Lizard-Man backs up from the Larissa's attacks, he glances towards Shu-Yin and says, &quot;I am now on your Team.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Were YOU not on my Team, already?&quot; Shu-Yin replies, to which the Wolf-Lizard-Man rebuts, &quot;Yes, but I'm strong now.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;THAT is okay.&quot;<br /> <br /> Net results:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Hyuga takes 2L.<br /> <br /> Jensven dealt minor damage to one commoner. <br /> <br /> Larissa took a significant amount of damage.<br /> <br /> One of the commoners is now a Noble.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Yi, Hyuga, and Shadow's turns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-14-2014, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T15:44:08-07:00","id":137284,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> &quot;I imagine the she knows you're here,&quot; Darmud responds to Tirien's query, &quot;And she'll reveal herself when she's good and ready. We'll probably see her in the court of the High King. That is were she makes her home. She would anger many if she made a home in the territory of any of the clans, you see. But at the same time, she has to live with the Vicruith. So she lives in the one place owned by all Vicruith clans.&quot; <br /> <br /> You set off the next day with Darmud, Erwan, and a handful of warriors in your company. Despite Erwan having told you that the King's Court is to the South, you head East, and it is not long before you end up in a strange area with crimson grass growing on the trees, a Yellow Sky, and a blue sun. A Wyld zone. You are met by a towering Fae, seemingly made of vines and with two deer horns sticking from its brow. <br /> <br /> &quot;Come on,&quot; It says in an exasperated tenor, &quot;You took all my Crescent Tea last week. I haven't finished growing a new crop yet.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Baron Corb, we require you to open a Way to the Court,&quot; Erwan says in reply.<br /> <br /> The Fae Baron sighs, and says, &quot;My oaths of Fealty require that I offer resistance to this action. Let this be quick.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, the Fae suddenly doubles in height and its arm's unweave into a individual whip-like cords. Red-barked stump-goblins appear from the trees and begin engaging Darmud and his warriors. <br /> <br /> &quot;I'll leave the Baron to you and your manservant, Steward!&quot; Darmud shouts, joy evident in his voice.<br /> <br /> Roll join battle if you please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T18:05:33-07:00","id":137432,"title":"","content":"Yi quickly glanced around, noticing the numerous implements of iron. He smiled as he began to move, &quot;Only a fool calls down the lightning and does not expect the Solar Thunder!&quot;<br /> <br /> He made a broad, sweeping thrust, dragging the tip of his sword along a table where it caught a length of chain. Bringing it out and swinging it around so that the chain was wrapped around the blade he thrust for the fey's heart.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Targeting the original noble, and making it a thrusting attack which makes it piercing, reducing his soak by 4. Protection of Celestial Bliss means my DV is not penalized by my attack.<br /> Dex 5 + Melee 5 + Specialty 1 + Accuracy 4 + Stunt 2 + Excellency 3 = 20 dice<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502010/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502010/</a> 14 successes<br /> <br /> Just to save on time: Here is my damage roll: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502019/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502019/</a><br /> <br /> The weapon is 4/2L (So at least 2 dice if it hits), my strength is 1 so at least five dice of raw damage. + whatever attack successes were over his DV. Read dice from left to right. (So I did at least one level of damage.)<br /> <br /> If you are feeling generous the iron chain might make this aggravated.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T18:31:29-07:00","id":137460,"title":"","content":"Tirien assumes her warform again, activating Bruise Relief Method, Claws of the Silver Moon, and Hide Toughening Essence to max. She rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502029/\" target=\"_blank\"> 3 suxx</a> andassumes a fighting stance.<br /> <br /> &quot;Let us do righteous battle, Fae,&quot; She says, solemnly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T21:36:55-07:00","id":137680,"title":"","content":"Shadow rushes to the aid of the stricken goddess and becomes a black and white blur. Leaping in front of Larissa, he growls at the newly crowned noble and begins to move in harrying motions. He nips at exposed limbs and bounces sideways to interpose himself between the fey and the lady.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Shadow will attempt a Defend Other action with Larissa as his ward. He will allow attacks to go through to attempt to overcome her defenses if his parry is overcome as he doesn't want to get hurt and is merely looking to aid her. If the description counts as a one die stunt for DV he increases his parry DV by one automatically. Again, this is assuming he can reach her right away. He will attempt to dash in her direction until he gets in range (Dex (3) yards) to defend her if he is not yet in range. Then he will Defend Other Larissa.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":".  Clarification of intent for Shadow's actions 05-15-2014, 12:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T06:32:44-07:00","id":138007,"title":"","content":"Part of Hyuga's skin burns off and he grits his teeth through the pain, watching as the book slowly burns. Hyuga gathers all his strength in his well-built biceps gained from blacksmithing. His arm bulges and his veins seem to pop out from his arm. Swiftly, he angrily tugs with his left arm on the weapon pulling the fae to him. His essence coalesces into words in Flametongue reflecting his thoughts and they wrap around his sword like flames in a brilliant display of robust blues and golds twisting along the blade and back around. <i>My sword flies through the air and pierces all, never faltering. </i><br /> <br /> As the fae is jerked through the air, Hyuga grabs his blade in his right hand in a back-hand style and jabs directly at the fae's mid-section, his blade aglow yelling, &quot;Your end comes in fire.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>The words thoughts are a reflection of his having Protection of Celestial Bliss active. I am hoping this may be a three-die stunt, but I went with two just in case.</li> <li><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502466/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502466/</a> (4+2 sux on the sword attack) which would deal 9/2L damage.</li> </ol></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":".  Not on my iPad and can fix this now. 05-15-2014, 08:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T07:34:17-07:00","id":138036,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> Baron Corb lashes out at Tirien with a flurry of lashes from his whip-like limbs. She is struck several times, opening several long gashes (Mechanically, two hits struck). <br /> <br /> It is Tiren's turn; Dero moves concurrently. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T14:08:46-07:00","id":138384,"title":"","content":"Shu-Yin's firewand leaps from his hands, transforming into a petite, feminine robotic form which attempts to divert Yi's blade with it's blade-like forearms. This knocks the strike off-target, causing it strike his arm, rather than his core. He seems unfazed, despite the iron in contact with his 'flesh', shouting, &quot;Was That, supposed, to Hurt?&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga's attack misses, batted aside casually by the robo-sword.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Solar Thunder, YOU say?&quot; Shu-yin says, grabing hold of his daikliave once more, &quot;Then I will, have to use my own Exalted, moves?&quot; He makes a slashing attack at Hyuga and Yi. Mid-stroke, he and his blade burst into elemental glory, surrounded by an electrified web of fire-vines. He hits Yi, but Yi manages to deflect the blade enough that it fails to hit Hyuga.<br /> <br /> <br /> Net Results<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yi's attack connects, and does some damage<br /> <br /> Hyuga misses but gets a 3-die stunt. Congrats!<br /> <br /> Shu-Yin hits Yi, 12L base damage, Unrolled as of yet to give you a chance to respond.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T17:28:33-07:00","id":138664,"title":"","content":"Sorry forgot to put up the new turn order. <br /> <br /> Jensven, Larissa and the non-Shu-Yin Fae act this tick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T18:46:47-07:00","id":138704,"title":"","content":"Jensven is emboldened by the previous exchange of attacks between himself and the large insect. He attempts to slash at joints in the carapace in order to increase his chances of landing a telling blow. As he does this he attempts to position himself closer to Shadow and the goddess should he need to rush to their aid, &quot;You help her out Shadow, but I don't want you getting hurt. I think she can take a hit better than you!&quot;<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">No aiming, moving, or dashing. I'm just trying to get the one die stunt for a normal attack with my sword. It gives me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4503385/\" target=\"_blank\">seven (plus one for the stunt) successes.</a> It will do 6L Base Damage if it hits.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T21:16:07-07:00","id":138877,"title":"","content":"Tirien grins at the outburst of violence, and wipes up the blood from her gazed wounds.<br /> <br /> &quot;Alright, time to do this thing,&quot; and nods to Dero. She runs towards the Fae as if charging, but ducks at the last minute, running up the massive grave of a nearby sequoia, parkour-running up the length of the stump, until kicking off and slamming her foot down in a slicing drop kick on Corb's back. Not only will this deal massive damage, It will more than likely make Corb turn around, opening him up to a coordinated attack!<br /> <br /> (Tirien will use her 1st Dex Excellency to improve her attack's accuracy to its fullest, rolling 15d10. She rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4503548/\" target=\"_blank\"> 7 suxx.</a>.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T21:22:15-07:00","id":138900,"title":"","content":"For a moment, Yi was afraid. He saw the blade approaching him and <i>knew</i> he could not stop it. He began to contemplate running, surviving for another day just like he had when he fled from Lookshy. There were countries besides Novalesk, he could try again somewhere else...<br /> <br /> <i>Frak that noise.</i><br /> <br /> With a stomp to brace his stance he knocked an iron hammer into the air from where it had fallen when he swept the table. Catching it in his left hand he swung it and his blade to strike the fairy sword, catching it like piece of metal between a hammer and an anvil.<br /> <br /> &quot;Going to have to do better then that.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spending one point of WP to channel Conviction raising my DV by two points. The stunt will add its rating to my DV as well, but I don't know what the rating will be.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-16-2014, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T16:09:16-07:00","id":139933,"title":"","content":"Yi's maneuver knocks the blade ever so slightly off course, it coming mere fractions of an inch from connecting with his chest.<br /> <br /> Jensven's strike peels the insect's carapace apart, slashing completely through the monster's frigid fuchsia entrails. The bisected beast shrieks an unnatural sound, and falls. Near-identical wounds appear on the handler, bisecting him as well. Both corpses begin rapidly disintegrate and decompose. <br /> <br /> With Yi and Hyuga engaged with his 'Exalted' Superior, the commoner who had engaged Yi flies over to engage Jensven. The behemoth lashes out with it's spines, landing a solid hit on Jensven.<br /> <br /> The remaining engaged commoner's behemoth lobs another blast of frigid acid at Larissa, which misses wildly. <br /> <br /> The Wolf-Lizard-Man noble lunges again at Larissa; Shadow interposes himself, causing the Fae to stumble and deliver a clumsy strike. Larissa almost casually bats the strike aside, and, her blade surrounded by a vortex of terrestrial essence, lashes out, delivering a wicked horizontal cut to the Fae's gut.<br /> <br /> Next turn is Yi. Hyuga and Shadow go in the following tick.<br /> <br /> Net Results<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jensven kills one of the commoners. <br /> <br /> Jensven is hit solidly by another commoner, Base damage of 9L; you can stunt defense or activate defense charms at this time.<br /> <br /> Larissa connects with a fairly solid strike of her own to the Wolf-Lizard-Man.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T18:14:36-07:00","id":140100,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> Tirien's maneuver scores her a solid hit on the Fae, and distracts him for enough time for Dero to bury a pair of knives in his side. <br /> <br /> The Fae shrieks in pain and grabs Dero with one of his vine-arms, and begins slowly crushing the young man.<br /> <br /> Tirien's go one more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T18:59:44-07:00","id":140142,"title":"","content":"&quot;You may believe you have my measure from seeing my attacks, but you haven't seen anything yet!&quot; Jensven bellows as he attempts to knock aside the spines. Golden essence sparks from his blade as it blurs through the air almost faster than the mortal eye can follow. A look of grim determination and maybe even a hint of elation comes across his face. A golden aura surrounds him and the mark of the Ascending Sun blazes like a golden brand upon his brow, casting light upon the chunks of iron and debris scattered about the impromptu battleground.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will remain standing far longer than you!&quot; He uses footwork to mitigate the force of the blow, but gives only enough ground to allow the behemoth to land just close enough for him to begin dissecting it with his next attack.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Alright, I'm going to activate my Second Melee Excellency to give myself two points to my DV at a cost of four motes, I will then pour three more motes into the First Melee Excellency to roll three dice for my DV. This nets me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504464/\" target=\"_blank\">three successes</a> on the Excellency roll for three more points to the DV. I will assume a stunt worth two dice. This gives me Second Excellency of two, plus First Excellency of three, plus stunt of two for a seven point increase in the DV. I have not spent any willpower this session, so I will opt to take the four motes. This leaves me three from max on my peripheral pool. I also have light bright enough to read by coming from my forehead, having spent nine motes from the peripheral pool this scene. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T21:05:51-07:00","id":140209,"title":"","content":"This had gone on long enough. People were getting hurt, damage was being done, and he was allowing his caution to restrain him not from foolishness, but from action. So he gave his last quip, the last boast he would allow himself for this battle.<br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe you are the Hero. But show me any hero...&quot;<br /> <br /> The world disappeared in a flash of light as the Solar anima blazed so incandescent that those outside saw every piece of the structure outlined in light. Within, all it touched was changed. The sand of the floor glowed like alabaster, the wood of the walls shone like amber and ammolite, the molds and cauldrons glittered like nacre, even the ice the fey had breathed burned like a crystal lightning.<br /> <br /> In the center of it all was Yi Zhinan, the Righteous Guide come back to comfort the ailing world. Then he began to move.<br /> <br /> Half a dozen hanging chains parted like silk before Yi\u2019s first strike, pouring out a waterfall of molten iron that the Sword of Wu Wei parted as it fell.<br /> <br /> As the sword pulled back it drew a stream of the fairy\u2019s gossamer viscera forth. The raw dream became a shower of autumn foliage through which Yi\u2019s strike soared like a leaf on the wind.<br /> <br /> Stepping back he began to assume a victorious pose only to drive his blade backward directly toward the chest of the newly ennobled fay.<br /> <br /> &quot;... and I will write you a tragedy.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Attacks: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504522/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504522/</a><br /> 1. 12+2<br /> 2. 18+0<br /> 3. 12+0<br /> Costs: 30 motes, 3 wp, 3 Compassion channels<br /> <br /> Edit: All the attacks are piercing. Also, please let me know what the highest stunt level was so I can add back the reward. (That blew a lot of motes.)</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-17-2014, 03:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T14:58:57-07:00","id":140949,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Jensven, awash in a corona of solar essence, deftly parries the insectiod strike.<br /> <br /> Shu-Yin parries Yi's first attack with seemingly contemptuous ease, twirling his oversized blade to deflect the sword and iron shower. Yi's second attack fares better, scoring a hit on Shu-Yin's abdomen. Shu-Yin's 'anima banner' vines push the blade out sideways, greatly expanding the stab wound.<br /> <br /> Yi's third attack pierces the newly ennobled fae's back. The wolf-lizard-man howls in pain, and vomits up a large hair-covered orb. The ball flies over to Shu-Yin, who catches it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, no,&quot; Shu-Yin sobs, holding the orb, &quot;Gherkin! You, were my best friend? from childhood.&quot;<br /> <br /> His eyes red from tears, Shu-Yin glances about, and shouts, &quot;These guys, don't mess around!&quot; With that Shu-Yin hops onto his diaklaive and flies off, with the surviving commoners' insects sprouting wings and following a split-second later.<br /> <br /> All except &quot;Gherkin's&quot; behemoth, which is poking around the rubble, seemingly confused.<br /> <br /> Net Result<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yi obtained 3-die stunt, wounded Shu-Yin, and slew 'Gherkin'<br /> <br /> Shu-Yin and the remaining Fae fled, with the exception of the one rider-less behemoth, which appears non-hostile, for the moment.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-17-2014, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T20:46:53-07:00","id":141198,"title":"","content":"&quot;Close your eyes, Dero,&quot; Tirien says, and her eyes flash. As the Fae is mesmerized, she'll deliver a sweeping knife hand strike to his face, while using the momentum to grab Dero, and toss him away with her other hand. <br /> <br /> (Tirien will activate Hypnotic Cobra Method to mersmerize Baron Corb, and then flurry with the knife hand attack. She rolls 10d10 for the social attack, getting <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505626/\" target=\"_blank\">7 suxx.</a>, and rolls 11d10 for her punch attack, rolling <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505632/\" target=\"_blank\">6 suxx.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T23:00:31-07:00","id":141273,"title":"","content":"Hyuga winces in pain as he rips off the sleeves from his shirt and then starts to pick up some metal from the destroyed equipment. Carefully, he analyzes the great behemoth left there analyzing its movements and great stature. &quot;I have never ridden anything like this before. Hopefully it is not too crazy.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga closes his eyes and concentrates for a second, bringing up images of his finished product in mind. Suddenly, his caste marks starts to glow and a small ball of light appears above the materials. The light reflects along the walls and seem to fill Hyuga's eyes. Slowly, the ball starts to stretch and coil around his hands and begins to twist into shapes of different tools in lightning speeds. Screwdrivers, hammers, picks, and other tools seem to appear and disappear at a dizzying rate as if they were never there to being with. Suddenly, a phantasmal image of a bit a bit and reins seems to overlap on top of the materials. Hyuga then mumbles to himself, &quot;I have been waiting too long. It is time for you to see the light.&quot; Immediately after, the image of the bit and reins seems to just fall into existence and the materials seem to disappear as if they were an illusion the entire time. <br /> <br /> <i>This behemoth is nothing like a horse, but I think I can tame him. I've already analyzed its movements and I can predict how it may buck and try to get me off of his back. I can do this.</i><br /> <br /> Swiftly, Hyuga swipes the bit and reins designed for this great beast off of the ground and walks over towards the beast. &quot;Your master has died and I can be your master now. We will find a place for you.&quot; Hyuga jumps upon the behemoth's back and gently caresses its back and neck area with a gentle hand. &quot;You'll be alright. Just be calm.&quot; In the same moment, Hyuga snaps the bit flinging it around through the air like a lasso outward fitting the beast with it and holds the reins tightly in his hands whilst bracing himself by holding onto the behemoths thick carapace. Hyuga continues talking to it in a light pleasant voice, hoping that it may have some sort of understanding with him. &quot;Why don't we be friends. I think you could be a great help.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 1. Hyuga will observe the beast monitoring how it moves and any noticeable habits (per+aware) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505721/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505721/</a> = 4 sux<br /> <br /> 2. Hyuga will use CnnT to create the bit and reins quickly and without tools. I am also using 7m for the first craft excellency +2 stunt dice. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505516/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505516/</a> = 11+ 1 sux (a flawless bit and reins fitted to the beast)<br /> <br /> 3. For trying to tame/ride the beast I am using (int+ride) (if I need to roll something else, let me know.) I am hoping this is a 3-die stunt (For having near perfect fitted bit and reins, having analyzed its movements, and the thematic description) Let me know if it is not. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505723/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4505723/</a> = 3+1 sux <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T07:52:01-07:00","id":142298,"title":"","content":"He keeps Hyuga's attempt to pacify a fae creature in the corner of his eye, but Jensven's first concern is a damage assessment. He respectfully approaches the goddess with an eye to gauge her wounds.<br /> <br /> &quot;It looks like that Fae managed to wound you. I know a little of taking care of wounds. Do you require assistance?&quot; he will ask her.<br /> <br /> Shadow bounces around happily, seeming to realize that the battle is won and he is on the winning side. He stops to sniff at the rapidly dissolving remains of the fae and then continues his frolicking.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will roll Wits+Medicine to get a cursory examination of Larrisa's wounds. This gives me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4507184/\" target=\"_blank\">two successes.</a> Is the lady in danger of falling over, or will she be fine?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 05-19-2014, 11:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T09:33:50-07:00","id":142413,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Hyuga crafts a bit for the beast, carefully watching it. It seems to be poking around the debris for organic materiel, which it devours. Approaching it while it devours a large chunk of lumber, deftly throwing the harness upon the behemoth, he swiftly mounts it, holding on for a few moments before the behemoth bites through the harness and tossed Hyuga across the room. <br /> <br /> He does discover that the point of contact for the handlers was a hilt-looking protrusion, near the nape of it's neck.<br /> <br /> Larissa allows Jenseven to examine her wound, assuring him that she'll be fine. Her wound seems to have puckered up, and, despite being sever, looks like it has been healing for some time now. One of the perks of Divine physiology, I guess. She should survive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T11:27:08-07:00","id":142550,"title":"","content":"<i>I will weave his heart into shoes, that I might tread upon his dreams with every step!</i><br /> <br /> The thought was there and gone in a flash, shaming Yi slightly with its vehemence. Even before the Fey were gone the still shining Zenith was over at Larissa's side. While Jenseven looked over her wound he said gently, &quot;Are you alright?&quot;<br /> <br /> She smiled faintly, &quot;I'll be fine. I just need to lay off the heavy lifting for a day or two.&quot;<br /> <br /> Relieved he tried to lighten the mood, smirking a bit. &quot;I suppose this isn't going to do much to dispel those rumors of an anathema lover.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You paid attention to those old things?&quot; Larissa chuckles, &quot;They started up right after I got elected, and have been popping up every so often since. Never were true.&quot;<br /> <br /> Looking around at the damages Yi's grin became rueful. &quot;I... ah... I'll fix the damages.&quot; Under his breath he muttered, &quot;Even if the place should be torn down and rebuilt from scratch.&quot;<br /> <br /> Larissa shakes her head slightly, &quot;I don't blame you for the damage, and I don't think the Spyroi will either.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Still, I feel bad. For all of this. I know I am spending your father's money and have promised to pay him back double, but I want to make this up to you and Spyroi.&quot;<br /> <br /> He pinched the bridge of his nose, &quot;Which would be much easier to contemplate if I were not living off your father's money, twice that in debt to him, and overspent on time even more then funds.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T12:16:01-07:00","id":142598,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods politely at the goddess and quietly begs forgiveness for any intrusion on her modesty. Upon seeing Hyuga go flying Shadow will bound after him as his master calls over, &quot;You got that things measure or do we need to get rid of it?&quot;<br /> <br /> Finally, he will turn to Yi and the goddess and make introductions, &quot;The name is Jensven Vargsmed, humble armorsmith in training. The furry one is Shadow. I call him that because that is what he is, my shadow.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T20:37:12-07:00","id":142989,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> Baron Corb is mesmerized by Tirien's gaze and takes her attack squarely on the jaw. He falls onto his rear, dropping Dero in the process. Clutching his jaw, he says, &quot;I awknoldge your strength. Now leave. J-J-Just go!&quot;<br /> <br /> With his words, the goblins retreat, and a Way opens. The Geherin appear largely untouched, having merely suffered a handful of superficial wounds in the battle. <br /> <br /> Dero, on the other hand, indicates that he believes his left arm is broken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T20:46:35-07:00","id":142996,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, you might want to help him,&quot; Larissa shoots to Jensven, &quot;It's valuable, though; try to subdue it first. They're should be a handle, or hilt or something on it somewhere. Grabing that should render it inert.&quot; <br /> <br /> She returns her attention to Yi, &quot;You might not want to borrow trouble. Especially when you would be paying for it with borrowed capital.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T21:34:34-07:00","id":143037,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am a son of the Age of Sorrows. None of my troubles are borrowed, they are my inheritance.<br /> <br /> Besides, it would take all of an afternoon to repay what I owe your father, I simply do not have any afternoons free for the foreseeable future.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T21:46:27-07:00","id":143047,"title":"","content":"As Hyuga flies backward through the air after being flung off the beast, he swiped the broken-off reins outward like a whip latches onto the nearest catch-able surface keeping himself from hitting the wall. He then let's himself slide slowly downward and prepares for the easy drop down on his feet.<br /> <br /> &quot;The hilt she speaks of is the near the nape of his neck. Grab that quickly before anything else happens.&quot;<br /> <br /> After wiping the dust off himself and his cape, Hyuga looks around at the damage to the building. &quot;This damage isn't too bad. I should be able to fix this in a short amount of time. If you have a few workers and some tools for me, all the better. Perhaps someone should find out how the fey slipped into the city so easily with very little warning.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Rolling dex+athl at -1 (wound penalty) with a 1-die stunt: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4507776/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4507776/</a> = 3+1 sux (w00t! good rolls saving me from more damage ftw!) </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 05-20-2014, 01:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T10:04:28-07:00","id":143632,"title":"","content":"Tirien fusses over her charge, &quot;Ser Skald, do you know of any medical arts?&quot; She'll ask. She'd be a poor Steward if her servants died in her service, and protecting her, no less!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T13:32:12-07:00","id":143821,"title":"","content":"Jensven catches the drift from Larissa and Hyuga and rushes over to the behemoth with Shadow at his heels.<br /> <br /> &quot;I could use a boost, Shadow!&quot; He calls out, and shadow bounds ahead of him and stops perpendicular to the path his master is running in. He stands perfectly still as the Lawgiver places a foot on his shoulders and vaults toward the beast with an eye toward grabbing the 'hilt' sticking out of it's back.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Alright, Dexterity + Athletics and a one die stunt give me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4508533/\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes(!)</a> and <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4508535/\" target=\"_blank\"> one success!</a> Thank goodness for stunts, eh?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T20:02:34-07:00","id":144033,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> With a boost from Shadow, Jensven clears the behemoth, grabbing the indicated protrusion. As he does so, the behemoth curls up and it's body folds in onto itself, and it's jaw-spines come together and being to interconnect, and the protrusion extends. In the end, the behemoth resembles a sword-spear, with a two-and-a-half foot blade consisting of two jagged edges connected by a matrix of spines, and a handle as long as the blade. He can sense the behemoth's animalistic mind nacient in the weapon. It would likely be a good idea to try to befriend or attune to the behemoth before trying to wield it. <br /> <br /> A large unit of men with, oddly enough, the Ptreas House Mon, suddenly enters. They are led by a flaxen-haired young woman, who is wearing the robes common in the nobility bound around her waist like a skirt in conjunction with a light jade breastplate. A Dire Lance sits in one of her hands. Looking about, she orders her troops to sweep the room for Fae, and orders one of her officers out to begin re-organizing the workers and to pass on to the Lord Strategos that the situation appears to be under control. <br /> <br /> She then turns to a silver-haired, blue-robed man and says, &quot;You've been of great assistance, sorcerer. The thanks of myself and my house to you and yours.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Vykos has entered the scene!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T20:11:37-07:00","id":144041,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> Erwan confirms that he does have some medical knowledge, and examines Dero's arm as the Geherin bandage their myriad small wounds. <br /> <br /> &quot;There doesn't appear to be a break,&quot; Erwan observes, &quot;Though the bones might be cracked. I will splint it. Unless the injury is far worse that I suspect, he will regain full use of his arm in two weeks on the outside.&quot;<br /> <br /> He then proceeds to make a splint from a pair of spare axe-handles and some bandages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T20:42:45-07:00","id":144056,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fey, anathema, gods, and now Exalted and sorcerers; it seems this foundry was built at the crossing of many fates. Larissa, I am sure no on would lay a hand on you, but should I be looking to create a distraction and begin investing in a different face?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T04:12:01-07:00","id":144341,"title":"","content":"Jensven is obviously very wary of the fae creature/weapon. He holds it at arms length almost as if he expects it to turn on him at any second.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't trust this thing,&quot; he states as he offers it to Hyuga. &quot;You were quite interested in it. I believe I will leave you to it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T07:36:03-07:00","id":144457,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will take the weapon from his hands and say, &quot;Thanks. I will make sure to put this to good use. He didn't seem to lime me the first time, perhaps I should just attune to him instead.&quot; Hyuga will then close his eyes and start pouring motes into the sword carefully feeling the sword's inner workings. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga will attempt to attune to the weapon. Wits+ Lore/occult <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4509280/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4509280/</a> = 7 sux! Out of 7 dice 7 sux... Why can't super important rolls be like this?!? </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T08:12:35-07:00","id":144485,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, don't scare me like that. I need your help, Dero,&quot; Tirien frowns, and turns to the Geherin,&quot; Thank you for your assistance, Ser Erwan. May we continue on?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T14:09:04-07:00","id":144840,"title":"","content":"Vykos respond to the young woman with a shy smile &quot; Don't mention it, it was my pleasure beside he needed the exercise &quot; As he gesture at the erymanthoi standing behind him &quot;Now if you'll excuse me&quot; Vykos will spot Larissa before walking toward her with his demon still following behind him &quot;Lady Larissa always a pleasure to see you, the academy sent me to assist an agent of your father or something like that I believe, the message they sent me wasn't all that clear on who or what though&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-21-2014, 05:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T14:46:20-07:00","id":144878,"title":"","content":"(Novelsk)<br /> <br /> &quot;After the face you've gained with Eugene and Gens Spyrus today?&quot; Larissa responds to Yi, &quot;I wouldn't.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga resonates with the beastie, pouring essence into it until it appears satiated. The behemoth's mind slumbers deep within the chitinous blade, content with the current arrangement. For now. (I will post specific details in the OOC thread shortly).<br /> <br /> Larissa nods greeting to Vykos and the young woman, &quot;If only it were under better circumstances. Comrades, this is Vykos, a member of the Faculty at the Academy. And, unless I miss my guess, this young lady is Ptreas Artemia, a warrior of no small skill.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Correct as always, lady Archon,&quot; Artemia says, &quot;Excuse me, I must see to my men.&quot; <br /> <br /> Artemia walks off, barking orders left and right, deriding her men's work ethic and mocking their ancestry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T15:34:18-07:00","id":144965,"title":"","content":"Vykos shake is head with a sad look before speaking <br /> <br /> &quot; Indeed these circumstances are not good, the Fairfolks grow bolder by the day it seems we will need to reinforced our protections which is why I came to see you I have a project that could help us... potentially it is still in the theoretical stage but I believe some of my research could help us&quot;<br /> <br /> He pause before looking around &quot;But such talk will need to wait till we are someplace more private it is sensitive information&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T17:25:43-07:00","id":145006,"title":"","content":"Yi turned to Vykos.<br /> <br /> &quot;To be worthy of the title of sorcerer is a sign of great achievement. Namaste&quot; he nodded respectfully.<br /> <br /> His face was flushed as though by exertion and his breathing was only beginning to settle from the massive exertion of power.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am the one who commissioned the Academy to begin production of thaumaturgical wards and weapons, and I am sure that what you say will be of great value. At the moment however, I have urgent business with the Gens' elders regarding the prosecution of the war.&quot;<br /> <br /> After a moment's consideration he continued, &quot;Then again, it might make for more difficult discussions if I go as I am. I will have to be satisfied with the victories I have already won today.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sighed, &quot;Larissa, is there anything I can do to assist you? An escort back to the temple perhaps?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T18:03:12-07:00","id":145080,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> You travel though the Way, leading to a small Wyld Zone, wherein a number of proud Geherin warriors, each armed one armed with an iron axe in addition to the usual bronze weaponry, and each one wearing an iron torc. Darmud tells Tirien that only those warriors who have slain a Fae noble can wear an iron torc. Each of these warriors are the champions of the clans, hand-picked by the Silver-horned Mother to serve as her honor guard. <br /> <br /> Mere minutes after leavign the Wyld zone, you reach a sprawling metropolis; Ceridyth, seat of the High King, and nexus of the Vicruith civilization. You notice a number of other parties similar to your own, eahc wearing a different color combination that the familiar Donnkad combination. Darmud and Erwan leave to mingle with them, telling Tirien that the clan-moot will begin at sundown. <br /> <br /> A number of Darmud's warriors' offer to host Dero a round of drinks. They say that they never expected such a scrawny kid to be able to knife a Fae noble, so he's alright in their books. They might even help him with the age-old tradition of lying through his teeth to the local women about his exploits. Dero indicates that he will head out with them and excuses himself, leaving Tirien alone. <br /> <br /> Tirien's solitude does not last long; she is soon approached by a middle-aged woman who is wearing a pelt of some large, white-furred beasty. She introduces herself as Ceryd, and she asks how a woman such as Tirien ended up alone in what is clearly unfamiliar territory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T18:05:49-07:00","id":145083,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> &quot;I will be fine,&quot; Larissa says, &quot;And I will continue to serve as your guide, if you desire it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T18:51:57-07:00","id":145108,"title":"","content":"Vykos looks at Yi with a grateful look in is eyes<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you not all understand what it takes to become a sorcerer. If you are the one who commissioned the academy to make to those wards then you are the man I am looking for. I was sent to help you by the master of the academy since he had to step lightly so that I could help on your endeavors and I don't know about the other Gens but as a member of Gens Nikoloi I can get you introduced and probably manage to set up a meeting with some high ranking members if you wish&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T20:16:22-07:00","id":145200,"title":"","content":"After looking around at the wreckage, Jensven will mention to Hyuga, &quot;It would appear that our skills might be useful here. I have never worked with anything of this scale before, but I have an inkling I could provide some useful assistance to any endeavors that you would like to take with getting this place repaired. I can use a hammer and anvil, or just a hammer by itself passably. What do you think?&quot;<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Jensven will look at the Foundry and try to determine what it was used for and how best to repair the sucker to do what it did before. Intelligence + Craft (Fire) will give me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510057/\" target=\"_blank\"> six successes. </a> Let's keep in mind that he has never worked with anything larger than a small village forge.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T21:30:23-07:00","id":145268,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will also take a quick glance at the wreckage to see what work needs to be done. &quot;Let's get ready. We should get all non-workers out of here so we can be undisturbed while working. Might you be able to get us some smith-workers Yi or Larissa to aid us?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I am sure that you will be of great help Jensven and I look forward to working with you. Let us cut the chatter and get started though. I will lead the way.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga's appraisal (int+craft(fire)); <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510130/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510130/</a> =6 sux as well.<br /> <br /> I will wait to use my charms until everyone leaves and won't roll until I know how many helpers I will have besides Jensven if any. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T07:54:28-07:00","id":145660,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am here on important business, you see. As a Steward of Creation, I must forego my comfort for the sake those less powerful than I. Until Creation is set right, and the people can live in peace,&quot; Tirien says, cocking her head at the unfamiliar words coming from her own mouth.<br /> <br /> She then has a glimpse of a tall, red-haired woman wearing silver armor that writhed with her own motions. On her back was a banner with a hyena, and behind her was a host of obviously Dragonblooded troops.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyways, I must apologize for not introducing myself. As you say, I am not in my own home, and as a guest, I must make myself known to my most gracious hosts. I am Ledaal Monos Tirien, scion of the Scarlet Dynasty, and Chosen of Luna.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 05-22-2014, 11:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T13:00:45-07:00","id":145940,"title":"","content":"<i>The head of the academy assigns me a sorcerer, I am appealed to in the same breath as the goddess of the people, and I am afraid to go outside because I'm glowing. One of these things is not like the other.</i><br /> <br /> He turned to Larissa first, &quot;I do indeed desire it, though perhaps you let me be the heroic one next time and jump in front of the enemies? At this rate, my poor ego is going to have to sign an armistice with my reason if I continue to be surrounded by competent friends.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Sorcerer Vykos, I would be most grateful if you could arrange such a meeting. There is little time in which to ensure peace between gens once the Strategos departs and I would rather he did have to worry about domestic stability on the planes of faerie.&quot;<br /> <br /> Standing, he walked to the nearest door and walked forth with his head high and his eyes bright. All shadows fled before him, so that it seemed a second sun emerged from the mouth of a cave.<br /> <br /> He looked a the assembled crowd and said, &quot;See o people the mark of your worth! See the disquiet you have kindled in the unseelie host who issue forth half ready and half wrought to strike your works of iron. They fear you o people, they fear your iron souls and the iron arms they wield. Who here has iron hearts to match, who stand unshaken before the fairy mischief and now will set it aright?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Charisma + Performance to get some assistants for Hyuga (and possibly get everybody back to work)<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510679/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510679/</a> 7 successes<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510682/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510682/</a> for the possible stunt dice, but no successes. For mote recovery reasons could you let me know if that counted as a stunt?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T19:09:29-07:00","id":146255,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Yi's display serves to help motivate the workers, between the recently arrived Ptreas troops and the foundry foremen, two score workers with construction experience are recruited. (two-die FYI) Though, he catches a glare from Artemia; if looks could kill she would have instantly reduced to smoldering ash.<br /> <br /> The purpose of the foundry is the same as for any other foundry; producing metal casings of the desired size and shape for easier production of finished goods. The shapes produced appear to be primarily long, narrow casings, indicating the production of either personal weaponry or tools. This foundry seem to be processing exclusively bronze.<br /> <br /> @Hyuga: Each roll with be one hour of work iff CNNT is used. A total of 20 successes are needed to fully repair the foundry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-22-2014, 10:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T19:50:22-07:00","id":146271,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> &quot;A Steward?&quot; the woman says. She reaches over and casually places a finger on Tirien's skin. &quot;But you have no tattoos... Are you Unbloodied? Or do you hide them?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T19:50:40-07:00","id":146272,"title":"","content":"Immediately after the 40 men enter the foundry, his caste mark burns brightly and his aura begins to twist around himself in a brilliant display of twisting reds and golds. As his aura shifts, a giant orichalcum looking hammer and anvil appear behind him and the hall fills with echoing clanking sounds as the hammer hits the anvil. Suddenly, Hyuga begins barking out commands for the workers. &quot;Take this hammer, and work on fixing that molds shape,&quot; &quot;You two take this hammer and go fix the shaft for the molten metal,&quot; &quot;You five take these shovels and picks and clean up the broken stone over there!&quot; He continuously barks out the orders and as he is speaking, blue and gold streams of essence comes flying out of his mouth as words in Firetongue for the tools he speaks and immediately moves to his hands and coalesce into every tool he mentions.<br /> <br /> He hands out all the necessary tools to the workers and then brings out a hammer and anvil for Jensven. &quot;I need you to help me over there,&quot; he says as he points to the main furnace. &quot;We need to un-dent the furnace walls, fix the pipelines, and rebuild the blower and filter. I will remake the pathway for the fire elements essence lines to come through.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga rushes off to fix the elements in a blinding speed as his hands glow brightly with swiftly-shifting shapes of essence unraveling and entangle at amazing speeds. In a swift moment, he finishes the lines and gives them to Jensven to put back in. &quot;I am sure you will know how to do this. I am sure you had some sort of furnace in that small village of yours,&quot; he says to Jensven as he walks off to aid the other workers. &quot;No, no, no. Not like that! You've got to hit it from every angle! You over there, don't forget to shape the mold properly! If you are done over there, you three need to help these morons fix the major pipeline!&quot;<br /> <br /> As he walks around, he continues to bring out more tools for the workers and continues to bark out orders. With each new tool he brought out, the room glowed brighter and brighter as if the sun itself was beginning to enter the factory. His presence alone seemed to speed the workers up and he continued to work on all the projects as a blindingly fast speed showing each worker how to do their job. Sweat pours from his face, but Hyuga never seems to tire. He was in his zone of concentration for sure.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga is using WaWM and CNNT, so the work is done at 12x speed and as if he had a master's workshop eliminating any penalties. With 40 assistants and Jensven, his bonus is 12 dice. He is not using dexterity as it is a job on a very large object/area and uses the next lower stat: perception. I am assuming this is a 3-die stunt. Hyuga is also using 9 dice for his first craft excellency (9m) for the first roll (which sends his anima to a brilliant bonfire).<br /> <br /> This gives a total of 12(bonus)+9(1st ex)+4(perception)+7(craft fire w/hearthstone bonus)+3 stunt dice= 32+3 dice. Thanks to peerless paragon of fire, he will also have 2 additional sux for free.<br /> <br /> So... drum roll.... <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510987/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4510987/</a> = 17+1 +2 sux = 20 sux! Lol! 1 hour it is! I had to re-count that roll like 7 times to make sure I got the right count &gt;&gt; </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 05-22-2014, 11:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T05:23:45-07:00","id":146601,"title":"","content":"Jensven is still in awe of the apparatus he has been assigned to, but jumps in anyway. After a quick examination it appears to just be a larger version of the portable forge he worked with when traveling with a Guild caravan. He hammers away with gusto, making sure that parts that appear to need rounding are as perfectly round as possible and those that should be flat are as perfectly flat as possible.<br /> <br /> Shadow finds a relatively safe place to lie down and doze as a golden similacrum of the canine appears around Jensven pouring essence into his work. The Lawgiver hammers away with inhuman precision and satisfies his natural urge to set things right. It is not armor that he is making, but it may just be what is needed to help these people protect themselves.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will roll Perception + Craft (Fire) in an attempt to help with Hyuga's efforts. I will assume a one die stunt. This roll gives me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4511302/\" target=\"_blank\">one success.</a> I will also spend six motes to power my Craft Essence Triumphant (Second Excellency) for three automatic successes. This gives me a total of four successes to my attempts to be a useful assistant.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T08:26:00-07:00","id":146776,"title":"","content":"Tirien shrugs, and her swirling spiral tattoos return to sight.<br /> <br /> &quot;I generally hide them with magic. Having tattoos of such manufacture tends to warrant unwanted attention, especially from someone of my heritage,&quot; she replies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T15:57:59-07:00","id":147243,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Hyuga and Jensven's experience and preternatural intuition cause the workers to fall into an easy pattern behind them. Though the foremen expected it to take days in the very least to get the foundry workable again, you finish the work in a mere hour. It is not long before work is started up again (though it takes Artemia to relight the furnace so quickly).<br /> <br /> Artemia organizes a much superior guard for the foundry, using both her Ptreas troops and the uninjured and lightly injured Spyrus guardsmen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T16:29:29-07:00","id":147268,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> &quot;You're not like to gt such treatment here. If anything, it will prove the truth of your claims,&quot; Ceryd says, looking over your visible tattoos. A particularly intricate swirl catches her eye and she laughs, sounding infinitely younger than her appearance would suggest. <br /> <br /> &quot;You're one of Mejan's students!&quot; she laughs. At that moment, you notice that she has a trio of gazelle-like silver horns curling through her grey-lined brown hair above each ear. How did you not notice that before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T18:55:58-07:00","id":147414,"title":"","content":"Privately to Larissa Yi asked, &quot;I seem to have offended officer Artemia in some way, though I cannot imagine it is for the usual reasons. I haven't even tried to give her pointers on her style of leadership yet for Dragon's sake. Is there anything about her I should know?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">1 personal mote to activate Mastery of Small Manners</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T21:52:58-07:00","id":147573,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> &quot;She's supposed to be a lot like her mother,&quot; Larissa responds, &quot;And her mother's a half-Geherin Spyrus. Not exactly fond of Lookshans, that one. And the mother's a rather vocal nationalist. She probably interpreted what you were saying as an insinuation that we can't defend ourselves.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T21:57:35-07:00","id":147576,"title":"","content":"&quot;I may have to tailor my word choice in the future. The speech was meant to be appeal to their pride by blaming the fey attack on fear of what Novalesk has and can accomplish.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T07:03:36-07:00","id":147820,"title":"","content":"Having assisted in the absolutely astonishing effort Hyuga made at repairing the facility, Jensven will idly stroll around watching the workings of the facility in an attempt to increase his knowledge of such processes. All the while his mind will wander to the capacity of such machines to be put to use in the construction of armor. He will make a passing comment to a foreman that he was looking for local armorsmiths before the fight broke out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T08:22:04-07:00","id":147847,"title":"","content":"After the display of skills shown to repair the foundry Vykos whistle in admiration as he walk to Hyuga &quot;That was impressive to say the least, I wish I could do the same with my research work, allow me to introduce myself I am Vykos Antalek sorcerer of the Academy of sorcerous wisdom nice to meet you &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T19:43:12-07:00","id":148341,"title":"","content":"Hyuga reaches out for a handshake and grips really tightly. &quot;Nice to meet you, Do you work under Madame Maia? She seems quite the nice gal. I had always looked into the occult myself, but never practiced magic. I have heard you must go through some difficult trials to become one. You must have done many impressive things yourself. Fixing things doesn't seem as hard. This is what I have always done.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will step back and take a good look at Vykos. &quot;So what is your role in all of this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T08:35:11-07:00","id":148718,"title":"","content":"Vykos raise an eyebrow from the too tight handshake but doesn't say anything about it though. <br /> <br /> &quot;My role ? Well I investigate and research fae activities to find better ways of fighting them though I have hit some setbacks recently, other than that I have a few skills that are more useful in laboratories than on the field&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T08:52:24-07:00","id":148721,"title":"","content":"&quot;I see. Are you going to join us in the fight against the upcoming fae invasion? I am sure your expertise would be helpful. I have gained a fae weapon behemoth that you might want to take a closer look at in that laboratory of yours. I am a smith, but this is much different than any type of materials I am used to. Perhaps you will have a better chance of analyzing it. It might also give us some insight towards the impending battle. It is yours to borrow for a while if you need.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will stop to think for a second. &quot;Perhaps I can join your for a bit in the academy. I could be of some help with production there as you can see, and perhaps I can learn some more in the time that we have left.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will turn to look at Jensven. &quot;Jensven over there was looking to work for an armory during this time. He has been a great help in this reconstruction and I know his skills are of good quality. Perhaps he can help out in the production of armor for the soldiers.&quot; <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T09:12:22-07:00","id":148734,"title":"","content":"Vykos face light up with a smile and you can almost see stars in his at the mention of the fae behemoth.<br /> <br /> &quot;Really that would be very generous of you and I'm sure you and your friend help would be very much appreciated at the academy the orders we have received is putting a bit of a strain on the academy and I would be happy to join in pushing those fae out of my home. Though I don't know how much help I will be in studying this weapon the wyld is a complex and unpredictable thing a best. But as a smith I might require your skills you see one of the setback I talked about is the fact that I do not have the appropriate tools for my work which as stopped me from making much progress and do not have the skills to make them myself. What do you know of essence manipulation ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-25-2014, 12:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T12:18:31-07:00","id":148852,"title":"","content":"Hyuga will turn to Jensven and yell, &quot;Get on over here! We may have a place to do some work!&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will then pull out his sword and say, &quot;This is the sword. If he becomes a behemoth again, you have to hold the hilt that comes out from near his neck. That will turn him back into a sword. Then it is just a matter of calming him and taking command. I do expect this back though.&quot; Hyuga will slide his hands over the blade almost caressing it. &quot;I will give it to you when we get to the academy. If tools are your only problem, I can help with that. Just name what you need and I can get it. I do need to rest a little while before we head out to the academy though. I wouldn't want to attract to much attention walking through the town&quot;. <br /> <br /> <i>My aura is glowing and he seems to have no problems. I shouldn't need to worry about him. Did he not watch me create the tools and do all this work? I wonder why he asks about me manipulating essence....</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T13:56:33-07:00","id":148924,"title":"","content":"Tirien looks with surprise at this revelation, and says, &quot;Yes, I am a student of Mejan Holof. However, I don't share my Master's love of biology and botany. I find humans to be far more intriguing. That's why I come here. Your nation may be quite a boon in aiding Novalesk against this oncoming horde of Fae. Will you lend us your aid, Madame?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T19:36:24-07:00","id":149072,"title":"","content":"Jensven jogs over to Hyuga and Shadow follows without being called, &quot;What was this about work? I prefer hammering on metal to slicing foes with it.&quot;<br /> <br /> He will extend a hand to the Sorceror and shake with just the right amount of pressure to make sure it is firm, &quot;Sorry I didn't introduce myself earlier. I had work that I wanted to do. Jensven Vargsmed and he,&quot; Jensven continues after gesturing to the dog, &quot;is Shadow. He is literally my shadow. I am an armorsmith of little skill, but it is what I do best. I hope to armor some of the soldiers fighting the fae invasion. The chain I wear is the least of what I can do.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T07:59:50-07:00","id":149401,"title":"","content":"While the introductions were going on Yi said quietly to Larissa, &quot;I assume investigators have been looking into my background at least since my stunt at the temple. While I would prefer to keep it private, at least for a while, would you like to discuss it now so that we can get ahead of any repercussions? This display will be like a bonfire for those who once knew me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-26-2014, 05:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T16:53:13-07:00","id":149811,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> From Yi's Mastery of Small Manners: <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Larissa seems a bit distracted with the damage, and seems to be paying her wound no mind; it would appear that she is far more concerned with the fate of her people than her own.<br /> <br /> Artemia's prevailing emotions are Pride and Duty. Combined with what Larissa told you, she's probably PO'd that the attack was even able to succeed a little in the first place.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> In response to Yi's query, Larissa says, &quot;Unless they're likely to try to murder me in the next couple of hours, it can wait.&quot;<br /> <br /> (I'm just going to leave the rest of y'all to your conversation. seems to not require any input from me at this time)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T17:03:51-07:00","id":149816,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah. It would seem that you have discerned my identity. I was rude enough to fail to introduce myself before, but I am Ceryd, known the the Vicruith as the Silver-Horned Mother, Goddess of the Vicruith and of Predatory Consumption by Forest Mammals,&quot; Ceryd says with a small bow. <br /> <br /> &quot;It would seem to me that you're doing well enough,&quot; Ceryd says with a toothy grin, &quot;You've called moot, and the chieftains will all be here to hear your words by the evening. Even if they reject your words, they will be honor-bound to relay them to the clans. Even if you fail to persuade the chiefs, some will rally to your banner.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T15:18:47-07:00","id":150847,"title":"","content":"&quot; It is nice to meet you I am Vykos a sorcerer at the academy. I believe that I can find you some place to work and someone at the academy could probably use your skills in his research many are studying the thaumaturgical art of enchantment. Shall we get going then ?&quot; As he gesture toward the door.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T04:16:24-07:00","id":151192,"title":"","content":"Jensven pauses before heading out the door, &quot;Are you sure I should go out there looking like this? I think it would be best to wait 'till this dies down. Yi had a darn good reason for doing as he did, but I don't want to muddy the waters any.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T09:15:16-07:00","id":151346,"title":"","content":"&quot;I appreciate your support, and I hope so; It would be a great boon to our cause to have Viciriuth support,&quot; Tirien replies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T21:49:21-07:00","id":152105,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yeah, it might have to wait a while. I don't want to go out with my aura showing like this. Madame Maia warned me it is not a great idea to look like I am with the anathema, or am an anathema for that matter, around here. Once it dies down though, I would be happy to head back to the academy. Perhaps I can even larn to make some charms.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T04:30:36-07:00","id":152352,"title":"","content":"Vykos doesn't even look surprise at hearing Hyuga mention anathema &quot; Yes it would be better to wait a bit until you aura dissipate so that you don't get into trouble&quot; He seems to be lost in is thoughts for a second &quot; Why is there so many of you here ? I mean it is rare to see one but three at the same time is not a coincidence, am I right ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T08:20:12-07:00","id":152510,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am confused by the words you are using, but I do have a desire to hide my nature. Something tells me that we would gain attention from other places that we don't need right now.&quot; Jensven nods and idly scratches Shadow's head for a moment. &quot;Otherwise, I am sure I could learn what needs to be done fast.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T09:29:19-07:00","id":152600,"title":"","content":"<i>Once a bumpkin, always a bumpkin; anathema or no anathema.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;You all realize that there is an entire room full of witnesses who saw you doing very visible magic, do you not? Even if there wasn't, you were seen with me and I was out in public like this already. I believe the caravan has already departed on keeping a low profile.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-29-2014, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T11:53:26-07:00","id":152747,"title":"","content":"Hyuga scratches his head. &quot;Well that is true, but shouldn't we keep this between the fifty of us... rather than the whole town. One contained incident is better than going out in public right? Though I am sure the rumors will spread quick enough. I would not like to walk around town like this if I can help it though.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>I remember the times when I hated seeing the exalted such as myself. I do not want to become that to everyone if I can help it. Once I have done my good deeds, then perhaps I can show the world that the &quot;anathema&quot; aren't so bad after all...</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":".  Stupid iPads not being able to do anything fancy... 05-29-2014, 09:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T12:04:20-07:00","id":152755,"title":"","content":"&quot;I would wager a significant fraction of money I don't actually own that if every important person in the city already knows or will by the end of the day. Every important person in the country will know by the end of the week. Containment right now essentially means presenting a favorable impression first so that all discussion grows from the starting point we set. It is going to get out.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T13:47:07-07:00","id":152930,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> &quot;Those in power knew of you before you even arrived,&quot; someone says from the cat-walk above you, a split second before Artemia drops down next to you.<br /> <br /> &quot;My grandfather notified all of his kin in power before you even left my hometown. The other Gentes most likely found out when he did.&quot; Artemia says, casually flipping her hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;However,&quot; she continues, her eyes fiery, &quot;no matter how much Grandfather Nikon trusts you, if I so much as think you're endangering my nation, I will kill you myself. The same goes for you too, Southerner, Northerner.&quot;<br /> <br /> Artemia turns to Larissa, &quot;If you attempt to stop me Lady Archon, I will assume you have been compromised and will act accordingly. Now you should get them out of this place before they draw an assassin's blade to themselves.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T13:58:07-07:00","id":152946,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> &quot;You already have my support. As champion of my mother, and student of my friend Mejan.&quot; Ceryd says with a wink. &quot;I accept few better character references. Now it will be some hours before the moot. How do you intend to spend those hours?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T14:35:43-07:00","id":152984,"title":"","content":"&quot;Lady Artemia, do you know a better place to draw an assassin's blade then the presence of a warrior both skillful enough to deflect it and dutiful enough to do so? We could hardly be safer then where your honor would be stained by our blood. Even so, I have several meetings I have become most distressingly late to.&quot;<br /> <br /> He smirked and continued, &quot;Larissa, I defer to your judgement on who it would be best to continue negotiations with. Perhaps we should depart quickly though, as it would hardly be for the good of the nation should so noble a soul as Lady Artemia become guilty of very public high treason.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T14:54:04-07:00","id":153059,"title":"","content":"<i>The mouth on this guy and he believes that we will just take this.</i><br /> <br /> Vykos facial expression changes and you can see anger on his face, he snaps his fingers and a huge red ape materialize in front of Yi his red fur is caked in blood and horns comes out of his head and back these trait identifies him easily as a demon his stature easily dominating Yi.<br /> <br /> &quot; I don't think you truly understand the position you are in. You are an outsider and we don't appreciate when an outsiders tries to act like he owns the place this is our home and we will keep it ours. Even though Norigen gave you his support it will not protect you forever so I suggest you watch your mouth. &quot; <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T16:14:41-07:00","id":153217,"title":"","content":"&quot;Are you offended by what I said or that I am the one who said it? If the former, I respect but do not agree with your sense of propriety; if the latter, I regret your bigotry but am accustom to it from others; and either way, I find your method of communicating your offense barbarous and intemperate. In your favor, it is a sign that you would get along with the folk of Lookshy better then most of your countryman. They said much the same to me and I have the scars to show that <i>they</i> were willing to carry out their threats.<br /> <br /> I apologize for the offense I have caused you, but I do not apologize for the sentiment of my words or my disdain for these continuing threats to my person and maligning of my intentions as thanks for risking my life and safety for <i>your</i> people.&quot;<br /> <br /> As he took a breath he shot a pleading look at Larissa. Sol knew his ego got him in enough trouble, but this could prove lethal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-29-2014, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T16:36:38-07:00","id":153228,"title":"","content":"This behavior is somewhat out of line with Yi's low Valor and Conviction. He's going to have to make a Valor roll to keep standing up to Artemia and Vykos like this.<br /> <br /> *EDIT: Oh, you edited in an addendum. Ne'ermind, that makes it more believable virtue-wise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-29-2014, 07:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T16:57:02-07:00","id":153244,"title":"","content":"Jensven will turn to Lady Artemia and address her with as earnest a tone as he can muster, &quot;I can say for myself that I intend no harm to your nation, I only desire to place hammer on metal and construct armor to defend your soldiers from the Fae. Also, should I need to repeat my actions here, but in battle and out, I will do that as well. Should my words mean little to you I trust my works will speak much more efficiently than I can.&quot; He nods to Shadow, &quot;The dog is faithful to a fault. You needn't worry about him.&quot;<br /> <br /> He places a hand on the shoulder of the &quot;Southerner&quot;, &quot;I will also stake my life on the intent of this one. I can't explain it, but I have a sense that I owe my life to him even though I only met him today.&quot;<br /> <br /> After he speaks he makes a few mental notes:<br /> One; Find some books so he can research Anathema, Dawn, etc. Being ignorant isn't looking good on him.<br /> Two; Find some way to construct a harness for Shadow like the ones back home. There is no snow so a wheeled cart of some sort will have to suffice for the sled. Also, the harness would need a quick release feature so he can get Shadow into (or out of) a battle quickly.<br /> Three: Find a way to at least tolerate political discourse, no matter how heated and threat-laden.<br /> Four: Get a freakin' clue!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T17:13:02-07:00","id":153264,"title":"","content":"Vykos nods to Jensven<br /> <br /> &quot; I will see to it that you find an adequate workplace&quot;<br /> <br /> He snaps is finger again an the Blood Ape disappears but the smell somewhat remains behind<br /> <br /> &quot; You misunderstand Yi it is not your actions that I reprimand or your words but the way you say them and the way you acts, you need to understand that we are weary of outsiders and of Lookshians in general I will admit to some bigotry on my part but such rash actions will not be tolerated by us. I appreaciate your help and you will still have my support in your endeavors but you need to moderate your actions you are a guest in our nation for now never forget that.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T17:42:20-07:00","id":153302,"title":"","content":"&quot;Your last request I can assure you will be honored, I will never forget I am a stranger. It is all I have ever been. That said, I appreciate guest far more then some other terms for it.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>At the rate I keep dropping hints, I must want Lookshy to find me. Will they spare the effort to hunt me down though? Will Zhan suffer because of it?</i><br /> <br /> That last thought made him pause in mid step.<br /> <br /> <i>Oh frak!</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T18:06:31-07:00","id":153337,"title":"","content":"Vykos smile but this smile is not one of joy but of sadness it seems to pain him to speak the way he speaks to Yi.<br /> <br /> &quot; It seems that my words are not conveying what I want to say, my expertise lay elsewhere I'm afraid. This is not a request it is how we do things here, that you want to make changes is fine but it needs to be done in respect of our ways or it won't go this is not from me but also from the higher up we welcome changes when it is done right but forcing your way in will not be tolerated. Right now we are in a war with the fae and we must stand united I'm am sure you will able to unite us. You have done more in the few days you have been here than some did in decades. But if your actions brings down the hammer that is the Immaculate faith on us you will be given to them like a piece of meat without a second thought if you are more trouble than good I am sorry to be discourteous it is not usually how I like to say things but such words must be blunt and to the point. This is my home and I will protect it with my life if needs be.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-30-2014, 09:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T09:28:15-07:00","id":153937,"title":"","content":"&quot;If possible, I'd like to see more of your culture. What interesting things do you do, for instance?&quot; Tirien asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T17:54:23-07:00","id":154396,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk) <br /> &quot;Lady Ptreas. Master Antalek. Your zeal is respectable, but you are out of line,&quot; Larissa states, her tone flat and eyes frowning. <br /> <br /> &quot;No, we are not,&quot; Artemia shoots back, &quot;My oaths demand I protect this nation. My honor demands the Anathema know this.&quot; One of Artemia's men calls for her, and she heads over towards him, saying as she goes, &quot;Now, you should leave this place, before the knives come. I might even be tempted to send one after you, where my pet assassin not mysteriously absent.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;By the Incarnae,&quot; Larissa mumbles, seemingly to herself, &quot;Exaltation has made that woman worse than her mother, as impossible as that seems.&quot;<br /> <br /> Larissa turns to the assembled group, &quot;Now, if I'm to address the Boule in two hours, I'm going to need to get cleaned up and eat something. Those of you who wish to join me are welcome.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, she opens a spiritual door, similar in kind to the type that Yi has seen any multiple times in the past few days. <br /> <br /> Who's going to go in, and those who aren't, what will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T18:20:58-07:00","id":154409,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh? Walk with me,&quot; the goddess waves to you, and begins wandering through the township. <br /> <br /> As you walk, the goddess tells you of the Vicruith's deep seated love of life, performing epic deeds, and boasting about them to everyone that will listen, and tons of people who won't. &quot;They were like this before I found them. Neither I nor Mejan have altered their ways in any drastic action. To be honest, he rarely interferes with the course of the clans. I believe that he only supports them to quiet his fellow Stewards. But, I suppose neither of us needed to change them. They' seem to be doing well enough as it is.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I will warn you, though, the crisis that faces Novalesk is not unknown to these people. Wyld zones dot these lands, and many Fae have attempted to invade Creation through these forests. They understand the danger of the Fair Folk. But many might view the Novalesk as worth falling if they topple so easily. That is the challenge you face.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the divinity speaks, you find yourself in large clearing, wherein a number of small children, aged perhaps ten to twelve, are playing the game you saw outside the town. <br /> <br /> Ceryd suggests you play he game; the best way to learn a culture is to experience it. If you decide to play, make a Stamina+Atheltics and a Dexterity+Athletics roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T18:56:17-07:00","id":154430,"title":"","content":"<br /> Vykos sight in relief as Artemia leaves &quot;I am sorry Lady Larissa after the first stage of initiation into sorcery some trait of my personality have changed I am still struggling with those changes but If you don't mind I will join you, I could use some peace after this &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T19:10:04-07:00","id":154435,"title":"","content":"Yi was not familiar was this ability of divinity, having only encountered spirit doors that opened from a particular place to another particular place. The concept was actually quite fascinating.<br /> <br /> &quot;I would be grateful for your hospitality My Lady.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T19:23:57-07:00","id":154446,"title":"","content":"Shadow's ears perk up at the mention of food and Jensven may come from a barbarian culture, but he wasn't about to turn down hospitality. &quot;The work can wait an hour or so, Hyuga. Vykos, wouldn't you agree?&quot; He starts for the doorway, but waits for the two he addressed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T16:27:41-07:00","id":155294,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Those of you who enter the portal, find yourselves in a spacious Divine studio, which Yi recognizes as Larissa's sanctum. A large table, set with fine flatware and cutlery and an assortment of local cuisine sits in the center of the room. Larissa drops herself into one of the surrounding stools, and swiftly lathers a thick slice of nutty bread with a white, creamy cheese, then topping it of with a hunk of rare lamb and several large slices of tomato. <br /> <br /> Vykos recognizes this as a pretty standard local working-man's meal. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh,&quot; Larissa says, &quot;please, help yourselves. &quot;<br /> <br /> (This is an opportunity for you to communicate IC, determine what you'll be doing next, and prepare for it)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T16:53:47-07:00","id":155305,"title":"","content":"&quot;Lady Larissa, may I have your permission to request the blessing of the Goddess of the Novalesk's Citizens over this meal?&quot; He smirked as he said it, and a little Ambrosia never goes amiss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-01-2014, 03:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T18:25:52-07:00","id":155338,"title":"","content":"<i>Well I guess if everyone else is going and I want to get anything done, I guess I have to go...</i><br /> <br /> Hyuga steps into the portal amongst all the others and eyes the meal. <i>I suppose this isn't that bad. I didn't even realize how hungry I was.</i><br /> <br /> Hyuga eyes Yi and attempts to copy his mannerisms. <i>I don't want to screw things up with this Goddess around. This is way too formal for me. What am I even doing thinking of coming in here?</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T19:17:31-07:00","id":155369,"title":"","content":"Jensven will gaze about in awe for a long moment before having a seat in a conveniently open place. Shadow sits next to him and does not jump on the table and start wolfing down lamb. &quot;I thank you for your hospitality. I must admit that I am unfamiliar with the food and customs here. What sort of animal does this meat come from?&quot;<br /> <br /> The Ascending Sun gathers a portion to feed his canine companion and then himself before he receives an answer. He gives the impression of one that is awkwardly attempting to fit in and trusting of the safety of the assembled fare.<br /> <br /> After taking a bite he will look at the lamb in astonishment, &quot;I can taste meat, but what is this hint of the earth and...plants I get from it?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 05-31-2014, 10:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T20:40:55-07:00","id":155412,"title":"","content":"Swallowing, she replies to Jensven, &quot;It's mutton. Comes from sheep. Most of the meat in the country does. Good animal, sheep. You can spin their wool, and then you can eat them and use their skin for paper. Pretty much every part of them's useful for something.&quot;<br /> <br /> Larissa chuckles at Jensven's last comment. &quot;That's the herbs and spices. One of the perks of being Divine. You have access to the some of the most extravagant luxuries at what amounts to the wave of a hand.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 06-02-2014, 06:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T22:17:36-07:00","id":155454,"title":"","content":"Tirien stretches, and then shifts her Moonsilver gown into spats and a sports bra. She can't play in robes, can she?<br /> <br /> She manages <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4520711/\" target=\"_blank\"> 4 suxx</a> for Sta+Athletics, and <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4520712/\" target=\"_blank\">3 suxx</a> on her dex+Atheltics rolls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T05:07:31-07:00","id":155599,"title":"","content":"Jensven looks at the lamb again before eating it down with relish, &quot;You will have to forgive my ignorance. Back home salt, mushrooms, and maybe some onions were all we used to add flavor to our bear or venison. The Guild caravan I traveled here with were fond of spices that created the feeling of fire in the mouth.&quot;<br /> <br /> Shadow doesn't seem to notice or care about the herbs and chows down happily before looking at his master expectantly. The sound of silence from the canine seems to be cue enough for the young Lawgiver to procure more food for his furry friend. &quot;I extend my gratitude again,&quot; He says as he curiously samples some of the bread and cheese. This is followed by some of the tomatoes. Each bite of new food is met with a contemplative expression from him, and a satisfied expression from Shadow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T12:04:37-07:00","id":155797,"title":"","content":"Vykos will help himself to a good sized plate and sit at the table right in front of Yi<br /> <br /> &quot; Thank you for this meal lady Larissa. Now that we are out of reach from unwanted attention could someone tell me what is going on I've been cooped up in my lab for the last 5 days and came out when I received instructions to help you Yi, you say you are going to address the boule Lady Larissa but for what reason if I may ask ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T15:18:28-07:00","id":156934,"title":"","content":"In response to Yi, Larissa says, &quot;Of course, you have permission to request a blessing.&quot; She seems somewhat baffled by your asking a for permission to ask a question.<br /> <br /> In response to Vykos, she says, in a pause between eating, &quot;Yi wants to address them. Encourage them to rally behind the Strategos. I'm just going to facilitate that.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T15:49:32-07:00","id":156959,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> Tirien plays the violent sport, which is somewhat bluntly named &quot;Tossing&quot;, for just more than an hour. Ceryd serves as referee, and Tirien manages to remember the primary rules of the game well enough to lead her team to a narrow victory. With the youngsters of both sexes (and apparently all levels of birth) playing such a violent, yet strangely sophisticated game together, it is no wonder that they turn into the bellicose, boisterous people that she had seen before.<br /> <br /> The youngsters want Tirien to play with them some more but Ceryd gives them a motherly stare, and says that they should probably be about their chores. The head off, already embellishing Tirien's purported exploits (like biting a Tossing Stick in half, and splitting herself in half and playing both offense and defense at the same time)<br /> <br /> You have some more time, before the moot, if you want to do something else, otherwise I can skip ahead to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T17:05:25-07:00","id":157088,"title":"","content":"Tirien will try to mingle with the adults, especially the warriors, to ry and get a feel for them and their temperments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T17:55:45-07:00","id":157145,"title":"","content":"Yi bowed graciously and began.<br /> <br /> &quot;To you, Larissa, I begin to sing:<br /> O glorious goddess, flashing-eyed, keen of mind, great of heart, pure in nobility, savior of the people, valorous, beloved.<br /> From their honored midst the Boule beheld you, divine soul in mortal frame, and gazed in awe on your benevolent works.<br /> But Larissa rose mightily from amid the people and stood before Origenes the founder, clad in authority:<br /> great Novalesk began to reel tremendously at the might of the strong-armed goddess, and Creation round about cried fearfully, and Heaven was moved and set to furious activity and wonder:<br /> the bright charioteer of Day stopped her great vessel a long while, until the great Archon drew her blade and all the people shouted for joy.<br /> And great Novalesk was glad. And so hail to you, daughter of Origenes the founder! Now I will remember you and with many songs as well.&quot;<br /> <br /> His song rippled across the sanctum, their essence laden reverberations causing its structure to dance like the surface of a pond. He caught up his on echo and incorporated it into his melody until at the height he was singing in three part harmony with himself. With the final word, the golden winds of his hymn came together before the goddess, coalescing into ambrosia.<br /> <br /> It was something he had pieced together from snippets of conversation and prayer as he had walked with Larissa. It was probably missing sections, and he had been forced to improvise, but he hopped the Ambrosia would be well received.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Prayer roll for no other reason then to benefit the cult of Larissa, provide her with some Ambrosia, (and perhaps get her to think well of me)<br /> Charisma 6 + Performance 5 + Stunt 2 = 13 dice: 8 successes against difficulty 6<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4522546/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4522546/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4522546/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4522546/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The wording is adapted from the Homeric Hymn to Athena</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-02-2014, 09:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T18:33:28-07:00","id":157187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=157145#post157145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The wording is adapted from the Homeric Hymn to Athena</div> </div> </div> </div>You found something not only thematically appropriate the aesthetics of the nation, but also to the situation at hand, and adapted it pretty well to the game. Dude, this is worthy of a three die. Anyways....<br /> <br /> (Novalesk) <br /> <br /> The essence of the prayer rings out through the sanctum, coalescing into a tiny sparkling item in front of Larissa. &quot;Huh,&quot; she says delicately picking it up. Larissa and examines it, revealing it to be a miniature golden statuette of Yi. &quot;It's kind of cute,&quot; she says, smiling lightly at Yi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T19:01:04-07:00","id":157251,"title":"","content":"Yi blushed slightly and bowed. &quot;I am sorry that it is so small a thing. Perhaps with time and practice I might be able to provide you with a meal instead of the other way around.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sat down and began to eat. He took only a thin tea, vegetables, rice, and bread; the fare of an immaculate monk. Before he began he said, &quot;Please do not mind me too much, I must meditate to settle my spirit after the battle. I may need the strength later.&quot; With that he began to chant softly over the food, eating and drinking in an almost ritual manner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-02-2014, 10:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T11:17:41-07:00","id":158054,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> Ceryd points Tirien towards an establishment, which she claims is a likely spot to get a nice picture of the Vicruith adults. She excuses herself, saying that something has come up. She transforms into a Crimson Flying Fox (with miniature versions of her horns) and departs, her vulpine form alternating between running and jumping the the trees.<br /> <br /> Tirien follows her advice, finding herself in a Public House. Inside, she finds many a Geherin, including a handful of Darmud's warriors and Dero. Dero appears to be basking in the admiration of young woman of approximate age to him. Ah, to be young.<br /> <br /> The nearly the entire of the public house is listening to a particular warrior (of a clan with Tirien cannot identify), who is telling some tale.<br /> <br /> &quot;That makes no sense, Osin&quot; one of Darmud's warriors calls out, &quot;How'd anyone know what was going on in Heaven while Finn was battling the Six-Speared Knight?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Does I look like a skald, Fer?&quot; The narating warrior, Osin, responds, &quot;Maybe Lady Ceryd was there, eh? Spending some family time with her mum.&quot; He takes a large swig from a pitcher-sized mug. &quot;Dammit man, I lost my place.&quot; He takes another swig while apparently attempting to recall his place in the story.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, while Finn was battling the Six-Speared Faery Lord, the Sun and the Moon and the Red Star of Battle were all in Heaven looking down at him, right? Each one held a spark of their powers in their hand, and argued over which one would make Finn their champion. The Red Star said that he was a might warrior, especially skilled in fighting the Fae. The Fae are the Stars' special enemies, you see, so the Red Star demanded to make Finn hers. The Sun said that he hadn't seen such a might warrior since the sun-kings of old, so naturally, he wanted him too. And the Moon claimed that he was already hers, with the Vicruith being her daughters' people and all.<br /> <br /> &quot;They argued three days and three nights, while Finn and the Faery knight fought across forest, hill and moor. In the end, they decided to settle the enlargement by casting lots. That's the only game they could play to settle it, since the perfection of the sun and moon make it so they always win any game of skill, and the Stars naturally tilt the field in their favor. But lots is entirely chance, so none of that went into it. But as they was casting their dice, Finn slipped in the moor, and the Faery ran him through.<br /> <br /> &quot;Finn's body sank into the moor as the Fae knight took his prize, Finn's magic spear. And then he rode of, to terrorize parts unknown. The End.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Nah, that's not what happened,&quot; another warrior shoots out, &quot;The Fae tied Finn's body to his saddle and rode off into Faery, proclaiming him to be the best warrior he'd ever faced in battle.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Either way,&quot; Osin responds, &quot;The Faery lord killed Finn and his body was not recovered. Satisfied?&quot; A general rumble of agreement rings out.<br /> <br /> &quot;Its a damned shame, too,&quot; yet another speaks out, &quot;Finn'd have made a damfine chief in ten of twenty years.&quot; Another rumble of agreement.<br /> <br /> With that, the collected warriors toast to fallen Heroes, and then return to their individual conversations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T11:24:57-07:00","id":158063,"title":"","content":"&quot;Pardon my ignorance, but who is this Finn Far-Striker? He sounds like a soldier of note from your comments,&quot; Tirien says, trying to break the ice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T11:30:18-07:00","id":158065,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> So, now that y'all have had the opportunity to eat and freshen up, it approaches the time that Larissa will head off towards the Boule. I know Yi will want to go with, but what about the rest of you? I imagine that Hyuga and Jensven will want to head towards the Academy with Vykos, but wouldn't wish to presume.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T11:58:14-07:00","id":158091,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> This comment causes a hush in the public house noise once more. Fer speaks up, &quot;Finn was one of the greatest heroes of our generation. He fought off a squirrel-man warband all on his own.&quot;<br /> <br /> Osin nods. &quot;His dad was one of them Novaleskis. The Mideans or somehat. He inherited their magic blood. When the rage took 'em, he turned into a half-man, half monster.&quot;<br /> <br /> And such does the tales continue. He turned down Ceryd's affections thrice. He traveled the lands of the Vicruith and beyond, <i>riding a horse </i>(this was apparently a Big Deal), having awesome magical adventures. He never missed his mark when throwing anything. He once lifted a yeddim. He traveled into the Underworld to do battle the shade of Great-cleaver Glainne, one of the Vicruith's greatest heroes, and his great-great-grandfather. He had a magic spear that could pierce anything, but was only one of a set of twelve. He was killed by a Fae noble who was trying to complete the set, after battling tirelessly for three days and three nights. <br /> <br /> And, apparently, several people present knew him personally. He only died two years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T20:31:08-07:00","id":158622,"title":"","content":"Hyuga stuffs the rest of his lamb quickly into his mouth and stands up as soon as Larissa looks like she is ready to leave. &quot;Sthank you..&quot; Hyuga then swallows the rest of his lamb realizing his big mistake and then says &quot;Erm. Sorry about that. Thank you for the food and your hospitality. I will leave all the talking to you and Yi. I had better go share my expertise at the Academy. Good day to you&quot;. Hyuga will then bow a standard prayer bow with his hands together. &quot;I hope the boule listens carefully. May the Sun be with you&quot;.<br /> <br /> As he finishes his sentence, he turns on his heel in an instant and looks at Vykos and Jensven. &quot;Shall we get going then? I am sure they can use our help&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T06:52:36-07:00","id":158980,"title":"","content":"Vykos takes a last bite of his lamb before leaving with Hyuga &quot; Yes there is work to be done. Thank you for this meal Lady Larissa and good luck to the two of you with the boule, if there is anything you need from me you know where to find me &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 06-04-2014, 10:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T15:17:51-07:00","id":159391,"title":"","content":"(Academy) <br /> You leave through the Sanctum door, finding yourself in Origenes' temple. Vykos, being a native of the city, successfully navigates the city streets to the Academy. <br /> <br /> Once you arrive at the academy, Hyuga notes that the mantis demon DOESN'T materialize (Because Vykos is attuned to the manse, if anyone asks). <br /> <br /> Now, Vykos can merely take Hyuga, and whomever else comes with, to his laboratory. Alternatively, he can direct y'all to any of the various departments. Hyuga could even go to the Artificery on his own, having been there before. What will y'all do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T15:42:07-07:00","id":159415,"title":"","content":"Provided Yi is ready to go:<br /> (Boule)<br /> <br /> Heading through the door to Larissa's sanctum, one finds themselves in the Temple once more. It is a simple enough task to reach the Hall of the Boule once more. Heading through a solitary door on the southern corner of the Hall, you quickly find yourself at the entrance to a large auditorium, guarded by ten soldiers with the Novalesk national mon emblazoned on their shields. Though Larissa passes through their guard just fine, the bar your passage. <br /> <br /> One of them, an officer, given his bearing an non-standard equipment, says, &quot;You'll have to relinquish your weapons. Unless, they are badges of office from a recognized legal authority, of course.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T16:21:59-07:00","id":159437,"title":"","content":"&quot;It is not my will,&quot; he said, &quot;to put aside my sword or to deliver the blade of Wu Wei to the hand of any other.&quot;<br /> <br /> Even so he unbukled his belt and himself set his sword upright against the wall. &quot;Here I set it,&quot; he said, &quot;but I charge you not to touch it, nor to permit any other to lay hand on it. In this rude sheath rests the blade forged from the Unconquered Sun's victory over the Prince of the Morning Star. For any save his chosen to wield it is to become bound to that struggle so long as time is time.&quot;<br /> <br /> Straightening he began to follow Larissa, &quot;To be his Chosen is to be bound to that struggle already.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T18:28:14-07:00","id":159583,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah, my apologies. I did not know. However, Finn sounds like a honorable and upstanding warrior. To Finn!&quot; Tirien says, quaffing her drink and slamming her stein on the table.<br /> <br /> (Her toast will be a prayer to the spirit of the fallen warrior to be at rest. She rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4524999/\" target=\"_blank\"> 5 suxx.</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T21:42:25-07:00","id":159732,"title":"","content":"Jensven follows the sorcerer out with Shadow at his heels. The Artificery sounds very interesting and he believes he should find a library of occult lore and start studying. He needs to learn more about some of the terms the others are using so his ignorance doesn't prove to be his undoing. All of this can wait until later, however.<br /> <br /> &quot;You mentioned that there were people here building wards. Is there some way my skills with a hammer and anvil can assist with this? Perhaps I can assist in the Artificery by hammering out armor to be enchanted. Or maybe there are other things that need to be hammered out to assist around here.&quot; He is silent for a long while before continuing, &quot;Point is I want to hammer things. Then maybe I can learn some things.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T19:09:56-07:00","id":160469,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> Tirien's call is echoed around the public house, and it settles back into the usual din.<br /> <br /> [Meanwhile, Elsewhere]<br /> Cut to a man, sitting in an odd cafe in a moonless, starry avenue. Across from him sits a horned horse. &quot;No, Iolo,&quot; he says, engaged in a thick debate with the horse, &quot;I'm a free sp-&quot;<br /> <br /> He cuts off mid sentence. He feels odd, almost as if someone distant called his name-<br /> <br /> &quot;Lancer!&quot; a short, humanoid cat calls from the cafe's kitchenette, &quot;Two chilled ramen ready for table six! Iolo, go bus table nine!&quot;<br /> <br /> The man and the horse each stand, to perform the tasks set before him. As he lifts the tray, the Lancer shakes such thoughts from his mind. He has work to do, after all.[/Meanwhile. Elsewhere]<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T20:26:10-07:00","id":160502,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> The warriors look to each other, as if silently asking if this guy is serious. After receiving a quick nod from Larissa, they appear to go with Yi's request. <br /> <br /> Yi follows Larissa, entering at the rough center of the stands. The room is shaped like a flattened &quot;U&quot;, with several tiers below and above where you're standing.<br /> <br /> Those below you are clearly delineated into sections, with six standing banners. Each one depicts the Mon of one of the Gentes and its subsidiary families; likely the seating for the Gens representatives. These make up the larger middle section. On the flanks there are two additional sections; the one to the left of the stage is sparsely filled with people in foreign looking fashions (a quick examination seems to indicate no Lookshans. Whew.) The right flank is also sparsely filled, but by locals; Strategos Eugene, Chancellor Feiro, and young Lady Artemia are all present in this section, along with a number of unfamiliar faces; perhaps this is the section for national officers and bureaucrats?<br /> <br /> Larissa leads you there; people are continue to file in, with a vast majority of them heading to the singular upper section. She says that it will likely be around a half-hour before the Pyrtannes calls the session to order. <br /> <br /> If you want to converse with anyone, you can do so now. If you don't (which I completely understand) I'll just move it along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T08:59:05-07:00","id":160882,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> Jensven makes his way to the Artificery (either being led by Vykos, Hyuga or a helpful demon). Once there, a fiery haired woman with heavy scars on the left side of her body; she is missing her left eye, and her left arm is composed of seemingly half-molten obsidian, She introduces herself as Maia, one of the senior instructors in the artificery department (if Hyuga and/or Vykos are present, she greets them with a friendly smile).<br /> <br /> She says that the talismans are mostly constructed by the Enchanting department; they purchase the hexagonal chips they use to make them in bulk from other suppliers. The same usually goes for armor and weapons too. <br /> <br /> &quot;We primarily repair and construct Artifacts,&quot; Maia says. She waves at the mostly empty facility, &quot;most of the staff and students have been seconded to the Enchantment office to fill the Strategos' order.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If you want to start a project of your own, you're welcome to use the facilities. Or, if you're dead set on helping, the Chancellor wants me to make him some Steelfire golems. Some help making the shells would make my life a hundred times easier.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T14:09:28-07:00","id":161085,"title":"","content":"&quot;I may be willing to learn how to help with the talismans at a later time. I would really be interested in seeing these golems. If their shells are constructed anything like armor, then I would be the man for the job.&quot; Jensven is very obviously excited at the prospect of actually being able to do what he enjoys after so long of not being able to do it. Shadow seems to be dreading the idea of having to be near a hot forge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T14:29:03-07:00","id":161100,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> Tirien whiles away some time in the Pub, drinking with the Geherin.<br /> <br /> After an hour or two of this, Ceryd enters the pub. The owner offers her a pint, but she politely declines, requesting Tirien's presence.<br /> <br /> Should Tirien follow her outside, the goddess leads her to a somewhat secluded locale, where a young woman is waiting.<br /> <br /> &quot;This young lady was that pressing business I mentioned. I wondered what a Sidereal was doing in my forests until she gave me this,&quot; Ceryd says waving a vellum letter. She carefully unfolds the letter.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tirien,&quot; she says imitating Mejan Holof's voice and intonation almost exactly. Tirien can almost picture Mejan standing there, wearing his habitual Absolutely Nothing, &quot;I was visited by one of my associates this morning. The grouchy old hag told me that you were alive. Also, she said that one of her students had a mission nearby where you were. I'm giving this letter to her for her to pass onto that student. She's a Sidereal, and is not likely to kill you. I think. Anyway, you should probably listen to what she has to say. Try not to get yourself killed; Mejan.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ceryd hands the letter to Tirien; it appears to be written in Mejan's tight, hurried hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T15:13:08-07:00","id":161168,"title":"","content":"Adverse Blossom, the young woman in question, raises an eyebrow when the letter refers to her sifu as a &quot;grouchy old hag,&quot; but chooses not to comment. She gives Tirien an appraising look, and stands in front of the Lunar with one hand on her hip, her left shoulder left bare by her dress, her expression curious, and a little snarky. &quot;I think that, if I was going to kill you, I wouldn't have started by getting a letter of introduction from your Sifu,&quot; she says wryly. &quot;So, you're the famous Tirien that Mejan spoke of. Hmm. I thought you'd be taller,&quot; the Sidereal comments, a hint of playfulness in her voice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T16:48:21-07:00","id":161257,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> <br /> &quot;It's similar, yes,&quot; Maia says with a smile, &quot;let me show you.&quot; <br /> <br /> She pulls out a scroll, and lays it on a table. It's full of arcane sigils, an unfamiliar diagrams. Each set of diagrams, however seems to correspond to a piece of metal akin to an individual piece of superheavy plate armor. <br /> <br /> &quot;Usually I have an assistant perform the fabrication. Its essentially a double-thick set of raw iron superheavy plate. Once the plates are fabricated, I'll etch them with the necessary runes, fuse them together, and bind the animating spirit. Think you can handle that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T19:22:23-07:00","id":161340,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> Some time after Yi and Larissa enters the auditorium, the doors are closed, and the buzz of conversation dims unto oblivion.<br /> <br /> Yi feels a chill pass by him, and a moment later, a cloak which had been thrown over a podium in the center of the room lifts itself up and settles over invisible shoulders. An overblown Sijanese death mask is lifted above it, and the mask's eyes open to reveal flat glass orbs.<br /> <br /> The mask's mouth opens, and a chill voice echoes from its black void, &quot;<b><span style=\"color:#000000\">I, Zophyrus Linon, Pyrtaneis of Novalesk, do hereby call this session of the Noble Boule Council of Novalesk to order, in the Name of Myrinne, the Three Founders, Origenes, and the Prince of the Divine City. May they watch upon these proceedings.</span></b>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Glory and Honor to Novalesk,&quot; The crowd rumbles. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>The Eyes of Heaven are upon us, gentlemen.</b></span>&quot; Pyrtaneis Linon states, and looks down to the podium, &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Now, the first order of business ... </b></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> And so it continues for several hours. It seems odd that the assault has yet to be mentioned, nor has Eugene spoken at all. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>For the next order of business</b></span>,&quot; the Pyrtaneis grates, &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Lady Larissa, Strategos Eugene, and guest have requested the floor.</b></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Larissa descends onto the stage with Eugene, and motions for Yi to follow. She indicates that she will address the Boule first, then hand the floor to Yi. Eugene will then follow Yi. Once you are all on the stage, Larissa states, &quot;Citizens of Novalesk. Honored Ambassadors. When last I addressed this Assembly, I was your Archon. I stepped down in accordance with the laws of this nation. I believed that the members of the council would elect a new Archon with all due haste.<br /> <br /> &quot;I was wrong. This body has failed to do its duty in promptly electing a new Archon, instead choosing to engage in childish rivalries. And this has made us look weak to our enemies. The Fae have invaded our nation with their demihuman hordes. Though our forces have blunted their advance, they have not been stopped. And today, they attacked us here, in this very city.&quot;<br /> <br /> Larissa steps down, motioning for Yi to take the floor. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T22:52:27-07:00","id":161430,"title":"","content":"Jensven studies the scroll intently. &quot;I can't make out the writing here, but I get the idea.&quot; He is so absorbed in the diagrams that he seems to almost be talking to himself. He moves around the table and peers at the instructions from different angles, trying to make out what he can do to help with this endeavor. Fascination and excitement are the foremost emotions displayed on his face.<br /> <br /> &quot;I usually made chain. The warriors from our village were raiders. They used boats and would often jump out of the boats before they hit shore to help pull the boat up or just to disperse when the arrows started flying.&quot; The young man rests a hand on his chin, &quot;The chain was good for catching arrowheads or protecting from a blade. I would occasionally be asked to make plates to soften the impact of bludgeons at the more exposed points.&quot;<br /> <br /> Shadow yawns and stretches. &quot;Our go...ahem...chieftan had a ceremonial suit that was nowhere near this sturdy. In fact, it would be a very rare warrior indeed that could wear this let alone fight in it.&quot; Then it clicks and his face lights up, &quot;Animating spirit? You mean to tell me we can send this armor into battle without risking one of your warriors?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T10:48:15-07:00","id":161859,"title":"","content":"Yi nodded to Larissa as he replaced her on the stand and began to address the assembly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Very different, men of Novalesk, are the thoughts suggested to me by the contemplation of public affairs and by the speeches to which I listen. I observe that the speeches are all about the concerns of governing of the nation, while our affairs have reached a stage at which it must be our first concern to ensure there is a nation to govern. Hence these speakers seem to me to make precisely the mistake of submitting to you the wrong subject for deliberation.<br /> <br /> Never was there a crisis that demanded more careful handling than the present. But the difficulty lies, I think, not in proposing a plan to meet the case: what puzzles me, men of Novalesk, is how to put it before you. For what I have seen and heard convinces me that most of your chances have escaped you rather from a disinclination to do your duty than from a failure to understand it. I must ask you to bear with me if I speak frankly, considering only whether I am speaking the truth, and speaking with the object that things may go better in the future; for you see how the politicking of some has led us into this desperate predicament.<br /> What is done cannot be undone; but now comes the opportunity stand together where before there was only division. What use, men of Novalesk, are we to make of our opportunity? For if you do not support the Strategos \u2018in full muster, whereto your power shall extend,\u2019 observe how all your private generalship will make for your enemies success.<br /> <br /> What remains then, men of Novalesk, but to help him with all your power and energy? I see no alternative. For quite apart from the disgrace that you should incur if you shirk your responsibilities, I see not a little danger, men of Novalesk, for the future, if the Theros maintain their hostility toward you, and the Geherin are not stirred, that we shall be caught between the stone and the storm and crushed between them.<br /> <br /> But surely if anyone of you would postpone the necessary action till then, he must prefer to see danger at his very doors, rather than hear of it far away, and to beg help for himself, when he might be lending help to others now; for I suppose we all realize that this is what it will come to, if we throw away our present chance.<br /> <br /> Perhaps you will say, \u2018Of course we all know that we must send out another army, and we are willing to do so; but how it shall go differently.\u2019 Then do not be surprised, Novaleski, if my answer comes as a shock to most of you. Release your house troops to the strategos in their entirety. To hold them back now is not prudence, but cannot be any other than a sign that you wish to do violence against your nation while it is beset by enemies.<br /> <br /> At the same time Novaleski, you must not forget this, that a mere declaration is worthless without a willingness on your part to put your resolutions into practice. If declarations could automatically compel you to do your duty, or could accomplish the objects for which they were proposed, you would not have so great a girdle of foes about you. Long ago, if declarations had power, the fey would have been thrown back.<br /> <br /> But that is not so. For in order of time action is subsequent to speaking and voting, but in importance it comes first and ranks higher. It is action, then, that must be added: of all else we have enough. You have among you, Novaleski, men competent to say the right thing, no nation is quicker-witted to grasp the meaning of speech, and you will at once be able to translate it into action, if only you do your duty.<br /> <br /> If, therefore, even at the eleventh hour, you can shake off these habits of disunity, and consent to fight and act as becomes Novaleski and to devote the abundant resources that you have at home to the attainment of success abroad, perhaps, men of Novalesk, perhaps you may gain some important and unqualified advantage and may look beyond self-destructive factionalism. Like the diet prescribed by doctors, which neither restores the strength of the patient nor allows him to succumb, so these competitions that you are now engaged in neither suffice to ensure your safety nor allow you to renounce them and try something else; they only confirm each citizen in his apathy.<br /> <br /> I am not indeed blaming the man who does your duty for you, but I call on you to do that for yourselves which you reward others for doing, and not to desert that post of honor, men of Novalesk, which your ancestors through many glorious hazards won and bequeathed to you.<br /> <br /> I have now said almost all that I consider suitable. It is for you to choose what is likely to benefit the city and all of you.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stepped down and nodded to Eugene as Larissa had done to him.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Text is adapted and shortened from Demosthenes' Third Olynthiac.<br /> <br /> Charisma 6 + Performance 5 + 1st Performance Excellency 8 + Compassion Channel 4 = 23<br /> Artifact Activates: <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6139/view\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6139/view</a><br /> 18 successes: <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6140/view\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6140/view</a><br /> No stunt successes: <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6141/view\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6141/view</a><br /> <br /> Note: Trying rpdom's dice roller since it counts successes.<br /> <br /> Activating Heartfelt Honorific Opportunity and Mastery of Small Manners. My effective appearance is 7, I don't step on anyone's toes with the insults, and the attack is unexpected.<br /> Total cost: 12 motes, 2 wp</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-07-2014, 02:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T18:31:44-07:00","id":162061,"title":"","content":"Upon arrival at the artificery, Hyuga immediately notices Maia and gets a great big smile. &quot;Hi there Madame Maia. It's great to see you again! And so soon! This here is my friend... er... well...I guess friend.. Jensven that is here to help. He just helped me rebuild the foundry a few hours ago. He did rather well.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will pat Jensven friendly on the shoulders. &quot;I am sure he would be of great help with making the golems. Did you have any other major projects you needed help with? Or would you mind me tinkering around a little bit? I had some theories for some artifacts I was thinking of trying to make. I was thinking of making a sword for my friend here as well. I am sure he will be more useful in battle than I.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T05:53:18-07:00","id":163481,"title":"","content":"it doesn't take long for Vykos to find his way to the artificery though he is a little out of breath when he arrives but he seems pleased ta have them.<br /> <br /> &quot; I'm so sorry, I didn't noticed you were gone until I arrived at my lab, once I start thinking I lose a bit of touch with what'S around me but it seems that you have found you way to the right place with out any help. Nice to see you Maia I see that almost everybody is gone where are they ? &quot;<br /> <br /> (I like to think that Vykos as a friendly relationship with the people at the academy)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T07:43:54-07:00","id":163578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=161168#post161168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Adverse Blossom, the young woman in question, raises an eyebrow when the letter refers to her sifu as a &quot;grouchy old hag,&quot; but chooses not to comment. She gives Tirien an appraising look, and stands in front of the Lunar with one hand on her hip, her left shoulder left bare by her dress, her expression curious, and a little snarky. &quot;I think that, if I was going to kill you, I wouldn't have started by getting a letter of introduction from your Sifu,&quot; she says wryly. &quot;So, you're the famous Tirien that Mejan spoke of. Hmm. I thought you'd be taller,&quot; the Sidereal comments, a hint of playfulness in her voice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tirien frowned at the note. Now she had to apologize for her Sifu's exhibitionism and his blunt sense of diction,&quot;Do you wish me to show you my warform, then? I'm taller like that. In any case, I am Ledaal Monos Tirien, daughter of Ragara Guron Arteff and Ledaal Monos Dalyss, and student of Mejan Holof. I am at your service,&quot; she says with a bow, &quot;Please excuse my Sifu, though. He is a man for whom social niceties are a thing to ignore while plumbing for Gaia's secrets. He is a bioengineer first, and a human being second. Something I realized when I studied under him.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T10:43:53-07:00","id":163801,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello, Hyuga. Vykos. I see you've met,&quot; Maia. <br /> <br /> &quot;That's right,&quot; Maia responds to Jensven, &quot;A bound elemental will power and animate the golem. In this case, a fire elemental. When bound to the golem, it will be in a trance-like sleep, obeying orders literally, but feeling no pain and taking no harm from any damage to the shell.&quot; She glances around the room, with a furled brow, &quot;There should be a golem or two around, if you want to examine a complete one.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Most of the staff is off at the Enchantment wing, helping with the Strategos' order,&quot; Maia replies to Vykos and Hyuga, &quot;The only reason that I'm here is because the Chancellor wants some golems. So, this is the only major project that's being worked on right now. If you want to use the facilities, be my guest. Though,&quot; Maia says gesturing to Jensven, &quot;if all you need is a sword for him, I have a couple of 'klaives lying around. I'd gladly trade one for help with these things.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T13:02:26-07:00","id":163930,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> <br /> Eugene takes the floor, carrying the ceremonial half-spear of his office. &quot;Know this, men of Novalesk. Two amongst your numbers have already offered their support to this action. The Elders of Gens Ptreas and Gens Spyrus, blessed be their wisdom, have granted to the service of this fine nation their military forces. Only they and their allied families have glanced beyond the intermittent debates of succession to protect this nation as a whole.<br /> <br /> &quot;Will you stand for this, men of Nikoloi and Midea, Zophyrus and Althea? For seven centuries our nation has survive the trials and tribulations of war, famine, and plague. Will you allow your Elders to cast this nation into ruin now, over their squabbles for power? <br /> <br /> &quot;I hereby place before the representatives of Nikoloi, Midea, Zophyyrus and Althea a petition for use of their house forces for the defense of this nation. If you care for this nation, Citizens, lend your voices to mine and let your representatives and Elders know our displeasure at their actions. If you be true patriots, take up your arms in our service. Before the Boule of Novalesk, its assembled Citizenry, and the Eyes of Heaven, I invoke the powers of my office. The nation of Novalesk is now recruiting for the formation of the First Capital Stratos.<br /> <br /> &quot;Let the word ring out, to the six corners of our nation. Let all who are virtuous and upright aid us in this quest and the defense of our nation.&quot;<br /> <br /> Eugene steps down, saying, &quot;I thank the Pyrtaneis, and cede the floor to him once more.&quot; <br /> <br /> As you, Eugene and Larissa retreat to your section, the crowd buzzes with conversation, which Linon silences a few moments later. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>As is customary, I allow the Representatives of the Boule time to deliberate the Strategos' petition. The decisions of the houses will be made to the Strategos at session tomorrow. Next, the honored Ambassador of Theros has requested the floor.</b></span>&quot; <br /> <br /> The Therian ambassador takes the floor, and confirms the rumors that an additional Dragon of Imperial medium infantry has been moved into Theros, as well as working up of several Dragons of local Therian light infantry. However, despite allegations by parties such as &quot;guest&quot;, Theros wishes nothing but goodwill and peace towards Novalesk. These troops are readying for a pacification and cleansing of the Forests of Bone. He explains that this campaign is meant as a 'proof of concept' of certain strategies and doctrines for the eventual liberation of the Realm's conquered ally, Thorns. <br /> <br /> The Ambassador of Ordon, who wears a face concealing helm and form-disguising robe, demands that the Boule recognize Ordon's sovereign claim to the quarries South of Nera's Copse. The Boule declines. <br /> <br /> Such does the day's business end. <br /> <br /> What do, Yi?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T13:24:52-07:00","id":163952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=163578#post163578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien frowned at the note. Now she had to apologize for her Sifu's exhibitionism and his blunt sense of diction,&quot;Do you wish me to show you my warform, then? I'm taller like that. In any case, I am Ledaal Monos Tirien, daughter of Ragara Guron Arteff and Ledaal Monos Dalyss, and student of Mejan Holof. I am at your service,&quot; she says with a bow, &quot;Please excuse my Sifu, though. He is a man for whom social niceties are a thing to ignore while plumbing for Gaia's secrets. He is a bioengineer first, and a human being second. Something I realized when I studied under him.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Yes, he gave me that impression as well,&quot; Blossom replies with a small smile, just a little quirk of her lips, really, though her bright green eyes convey amusement and warmth. &quot;I can relate- it's easy to get caught up in a task, especially when it is near and dear to your heart. I'm not here to discuss the foibles of your mentor, though, or his bioengineering,&quot; she continues, her mirth that quickly replaced by seriousness.<br /> <br /> She glances around the trio, then lowers her voice, so that only Tirien and Ceryd could possibly hear, despite their secluded locale. &quot;I'm here because we share a common goal- protecting the local populace from the Puissant Amethyst Court. I came to you because I have some information that, if you use it right, can assist you in enlisting the Geherin to our cause.&quot; Just that quickly, it was &quot;our&quot; cause. &quot;Tell me- have you ever heard of the local hero Finn Far-Striker?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T14:38:49-07:00","id":164017,"title":"","content":"&quot;Only what I gleaned from the warriors here. He seems to have been a powerful folk hero. Possibly a Dragonblood?&quot; Tirien says,&quot; What of him? Isn't he dead?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T15:19:24-07:00","id":164087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=164017#post164017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;Only what I gleaned from the warriors here. He seems to have been a powerful folk hero. Possibly a Dragonblood?&amp;quot; Tirien says,&amp;quot; What of him? Isn't he dead?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;As a matter of fact, he is,&quot; Blossom confirms with a nod and a sly smile. &quot;But his killer managed to get away. A Fae, as it happens, and quite a distinctive fellow. A knight in red robes and rust-colored armor, wielding six spears, who killed Finn to take his magic spear as part of the set.&quot; Blossom's smile widens as she continues.<br /> <br /> &quot;And I happen to know that a group of Fae Knights calling themselves the Warriors of the Poles have joined with the Puissant Amethyst Court. They're led by a Fae named Shu-Yin, but he's not the one we're interested in. The one we're interested in is Spear-Sage Retilvek, a mighty warrior who dresses in ochre armor and red robes. When last seen, he was trying to collect all twelve of the spears of Ares Ultor, of which he had six according to the last reliable reports.&quot; She leans back, looking very self-satisfied while she let Tirien draw the obvious conclusions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":".  Fixing continuity errors. I blame Arcane Fate, and grumpy pattern spiders. 06-09-2014, 08:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T15:24:00-07:00","id":164089,"title":"","content":"Actually, Nutiket, Tirien wasn't in Novalesk when Shu-Yin attacked there. I don't think that Blossom would know about the attack either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T16:24:27-07:00","id":164185,"title":"","content":"OOC: Wasn't what's her name, the other Sidereal, present? I was going on the assumption that Blossom got the information from her report. I forgot Tirien wasn't there, though. Shall I amend as needed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T16:27:10-07:00","id":164187,"title":"","content":"Sea's disappeared, off to another mission. <br /> <br /> That would be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T16:56:42-07:00","id":164205,"title":"","content":"Yi was too well practiced to shake his head, any sign of weakness would undermine the joint position. Nevertheless, he was disappointed. The speech was something he had found in dusty old scrolls, shortened and updated for the situation. It was... uninspired to say the least.<br /> <br /> <i>Never have I delivered so poor an oration so well. I </i>must<i> do better.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;An excellent display lord Strategos. May heaven favor it with much support tomorrow.&quot; He said.<br /> <br /> Once they had walked a ways, farther from prying ears, &quot;Do you recommend I meet with anyone else before the vote? Nikoloi's road proposal is almost ideal leverage. Also, I am worried about Theros. This is a perfect opportunity for them to stage an incursion.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T17:06:03-07:00","id":164213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=164187#post164187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sea's disappeared, off to another mission.<br /> <br /> That would be great.</div> </div> </div> </div>OOC:<br /> <br /> Fixed. :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T17:19:33-07:00","id":164228,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do you have the other six, then? Or do you know where they are?' Tirien asked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T17:47:42-07:00","id":164249,"title":"","content":"&quot;What?&quot; Blossom asks, her smile slipping into a confused frown. &quot;No, I don't have... that's not what I meant at all. Don't you get it? Spear-Sage Retilvek is the Fae who killed Finn Far-Striker!&quot; She looks at Tirien expectantly, waiting for her to make the connection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T17:54:31-07:00","id":164252,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> <br /> &quot;I doubt it wise,&quot; Eugene says as Yi recovers his blade, &quot;They will be swamped with members of their Citizenry voicing their opinions. Hopefully, those voices demand action, and they see the writing on the wall. But we placed them in a classic prisoner's dilemma. I think we can count on them acting in their own best interests to negate any loses to public support. It won't make them happy with us though. <br /> <br /> &quot;Argyus has been making that proposal with updated numbers every season for years. It's a good idea, but there's simply no way that we can afford the manpower that's necessary, even in times of peace.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Theros's additional troops are troubling, but I doubt they'll be attacking us. Our naval forces are nothing by Lookshan standards, but they're the strongest fleet in hundreds of miles. The only center of ours they can hit without crossing the rivers is Spyron, and its a hard nut to crack without considering that we can reinforce and resupply it indefinitely from here. No, I imagine they're either doing what they're saying, or they're going to hit Ahal,&quot; Eugene says, referencing the western-most Ordoni city, &quot;We and Theros have been trying to get our hands on intact samples of Ordoni technology and infrastructure for centuries. If they pull it off, Theros will become the primary power in the area. Plus, their war with Ordon over the founding of that city is what drove them into the Realm's arms to begin with. They probably have a couple of centuries of pent-up aggression over that particular slice of land.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T17:57:46-07:00","id":164255,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, and here I was thinking we were going to go on a wondrous journey of love and discovery as we track down the items necessary to halt a dangerous Fae noble. Of course I know what you implied. However, I don't think it'll be necessary. I am a Chosen of their god's mother. They seem to defer to my judgement. I suppose I could drop this bit of juicy news, and whip them up into a fervor, but if this causes a gigantic power-shift, will your superiors be able to handle such a shift in the Status Quo? What I hear, Elder Sidereals dislike such things,&quot; Tirien smirks, chuckling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T18:18:35-07:00","id":164262,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods appreciably, &quot;The quick explanation will have to do for now, Maia. I will have plenty of time to think about maybe magicking up some of these later.&quot;<br /> <br /> He nods to the others in turn, &quot;Hyuga. Sorceror.&quot; Then turning back to Maia, &quot;It would help to see complete ones. Also, ones that are partly done, if you have any.&quot; After scratching Shadow behind the ears for a moment, the Northman adds sincerely, &quot;I will not accept any payment I have not earned. If, after I have finished, you believe I have not earned the weapon you speak of, I won't begrudge you keeping it. In any case I would be honored to use one of your treasured weapons to defend your nation and return it after the threat is ended.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T18:22:08-07:00","id":164274,"title":"","content":"Blossom continues frowning, raising a brow. &quot;I wouldn't worry about it,&quot; she replies, shaking her head slightly. &quot;Well, since you seem to have everything so well in hand, what's the next move?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T22:49:30-07:00","id":164534,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> Maia finds one a bronze golem and calls it over. As the golem walks over, Maia says, &quot;From a structural perspective, this golem is identical to these schema.&quot;<br /> <br /> She orders the golem through a full range of movements. Jensven sees that the golem is indeed constructed almost identically to a set of superheavy plate armor. The key differences lie in the large ball-bearings in the joints, and the fact that the entire suit is welded together. As the golem moves about, the points of motion heat and flex with internal fire.<br /> <br /> &quot;The joints do complicate things, and the assembly post fabrication is difficult,&quot; Maia says, as you watch the golem go through its 'exercises'. &quot;To be honest, I'd cast the thing whole if it weren't for the fact that it requires internal sygadry.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So, thinl you're up for it?&quot; Maia asks. If you decide to take up the request, roll Int+Craft, plz.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T23:33:05-07:00","id":164559,"title":"","content":"&quot;I bow to your wisdom in all these matter save one. I know a way by which Lord Nicoloi's roads might be built in a tenth the time and for a tenth the cost and at greater quality. That is a matter for times of peace though. When we have a chance to catch our breath, I think I might like to go to Ordon. I admit the rumors I have heard, if true, represent learning Lookshy does not posses.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T19:50:40-07:00","id":165538,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will give it my all,&quot; Jensven grabs the nearest apron and ties it about himself. Shadow seems to recognize this as a sign of what is to come and curls up in a corner. &quot;This workshop is very well stocked. It's not like the one I used back home. That was just an open air stone forge with a cover to keep the rain off the fire.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Dawn sets about gathering hammers, tongs, pokers, bellows, and other forging implements. He ensures that the anvil and table he will use are clean and gathers a fair amount of steel for the construction. A long time is spent studying the diagrams and the other golem. Jensven visualizes the process he would like to follow to craft the armored shell of the construct. He can see it form from steel ingots to actual plates and then to something that could be constructed into a machine for battle.<br /> <br /> He then imagines the warriors that wouldn't have to be in harm's way because the golems will be able to fight and the people that will be spared the predations of the Fae. The fire is stoked and the bellows bring it to a nice cherry glow. Smiling and laughing children enter his mind's eye and young lovers whisper, kiss, and nuzzle. The steel is heated and when it glows orange it is moved to the anvil. Old men smoke pipes as children sit at their feet to hear their wisdom. The hammer sings it's song, alternately hitting the glowing metal that will be a plate in a sturdy shell then the anvil and back again. Mothers and grandmothers prepare a feast for their family at a wedding of one of their offspring. All this not destroyed, all this possible because the golems were able to fight.<br /> <br /> The thoughts of these possibilities and more spur Jensven on as he works, tirelessly constructing plate after plate after plate. Hours pass and soon so does the night. Fatigue is forgotten as his hope that the hopes and dreams of the people of Novalesk be allowed to bear fruit buoys his spirits and lightens his burden. The mark of the Ascending Suns glistens on his brow as he pours essence into his work.<br /> <br /> Should Maia leave for the evening and return in the morning, she will be greeted by a cheerful Jensven, a snoozing dog, and as many golem parts as Jensven is able to make in that time.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will be spending a point of Willpower in order to put a compassion channel into the crafting. I will also spend six motes to power Craft Essence Triumphant. This gives me three successes before the roll. Intelligence (5) + Craft (Fire) (4) + Compassion (3) + A specialty in Crafting Armor (3) + What I hope is a three die stunt (3) gives me a total of eighteen dice to roll. I come up with <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4531378/\" target=\"_blank\">ten successes (none for the stunt dice)</a>. Adding in the three successes from the Excellency gives me a total of thirteen successes.<br /> <br /> I will also be rolling Stamina (2) + Resistance (1) and expend another Willpower to channel Compassion (3) again. This roll of six dice gives me <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4531381/\" target=\"_blank\">four successes</a> to work through the night without falling down dead tired.<br /> <br /> Regardless of whether the stunt counts as a two or three dot stunt, I will opt for gaining Willpower from it. This leaves me six motes down on my peripheral pool, at a temporary Willpower of four, and with only one Compassion channel left for this story.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T21:51:44-07:00","id":165621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=164274#post164274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Blossom continues frowning, raising a brow. &quot;I wouldn't worry about it,&quot; she replies, shaking her head slightly. &quot;Well, since you seem to have everything so well in hand, what's the next move?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I'll let the meeting begin. No reason to upset things, and I'll address them as I intended. Then, if need be, I'll drop this information. If Luck holds, I'll have at least a wing of powerful soldiers used to fighting the Fae. If not, well, I tried, and it'll probably make it so that one or more of the Chiefs start independent campaigns to appease their nobles. If these people are anything like the Tepets, they'll be out for blood as soon as ANYONE implies they're running, and there'd be a lot of that if I fail, believe you me,&quot; Tirien says, smiling widely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T22:13:56-07:00","id":165639,"title":"","content":"(Boule)<br /> <br /> &quot;Go to Ordon?&quot; Eugene sputters, &quot;Yes, and I'd like to shake hands with the Sol Incarnate and have a chat with Sunipa.&quot; He shakes his head, &quot;I've got to get ready for the mess of activity our stunt will cause. Try not to get yourself killed, Lookshan. With what you did this morning, I might actually be sad if you bought a farm.&quot;<br /> <br /> Eugene walks off, raising his hand in a simple wave.<br /> <br /> &quot;You're not likely to end up in Ordon. Only a handful of living Novaleskis have seen the city, and none have ever been inside of it. As far as we know, no outsiders have ever been inside of Ordon, &quot;Larissa says, &quot;I will point out that we are running out of business hours in this day. You may want to consider calling it a day.&quot;<br /> <br /> [Before you ask, it's around 5 in the afternoon for you]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T05:56:01-07:00","id":165843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=165621#post165621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I'll let the meeting begin. No reason to upset things, and I'll address them as I intended. Then, if need be, I'll drop this information. If Luck holds, I'll have at least a wing of powerful soldiers used to fighting the Fae. If not, well, I tried, and it'll probably make it so that one or more of the Chiefs start independent campaigns to appease their nobles. If these people are anything like the Tepets, they'll be out for blood as soon as ANYONE implies they're running, and there'd be a lot of that if I fail, believe you me,&quot; Tirien says, smiling widely.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Fair enough,&quot; Blossom replies with a nod. &quot;How can I help?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T06:38:09-07:00","id":165862,"title":"","content":"Hyuga watches as Jensven starts to work on creating the shell for the golem. Immediately, he can see him pouring his all into making these golems an realizes that this must have some sort of importance to him. <br /> <br /> <i>I suppose I should help. I don't know why this is so important to him, but it is nonetheless. </i><br /> <br /> Not wanting to interrupt him, Hyuga quietly grabs some of the tools and heads into a nearby room to start his work. Hyuga closes his eyes for a second, remembering the exact layout of the golem and his hands immediately start to move. <i>You will come to fruition golem body as I command now. </i>Hyuga begins to channel his essence, letting it coalesce in his hands; a most comfortable feeling to him. His hands continue to move like a blur, picking up the tools at amazing speeds and set them down with no more than a small &quot;tink!&quot; sound. Noise echoes around the hall as Hyuga bends the malleable metal into shape and etches signs into the smooth side of the metal.<br /> <br /> This makes me feel like I am at home making armor. I miss those days sometimes. Back when I had a more simple life. But here and now I have a chance to do some good. That oughta count for somethin'. <br /> <br /> Light and sound continues to come from the room as Hyuga deftly pounds and bends the metal into the needed shapes. His eye for the details and being meticulous allows him to finish them up with ease. Metal is smoothed with his hands and various tools so that it shines brightly like the sun. Hyuga grunts and makes strange clicking noises to himself as he makes sure the bearings and joints work smoothly.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga is using his craft excellency for 5 extra dice on each roll and is using CNNT for each item. (On the link I forgot to add stunt dice, but it didn't matter XD I also accidentally made a roll of 3 dice, so ignore that (or you can make it my stunt dice for 2 extra successes <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> 1st golem: <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6200/view\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6200/view</a> =11 sux +2 auto<br /> 2nd golem: <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6202/view\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6202/view</a> =12 sux +2 auto<br /> 3rd golem: <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6203/view\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6203/view</a> =8 sux +2 auto<br /> <br /> I am going to assume I will only have time to make 3 even with CNNT speeding things up. If I can't make that many, just let me know.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T08:40:37-07:00","id":165959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=165843#post165843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Fair enough,&quot; Blossom replies with a nod. &quot;How can I help?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Tirien ponders for a moment before saying, &quot;My master told my that the Star-Chosen can not only read the Heavens with unerring clarity, but also can manipulate their meanings. Can you grant me luck in this? No need to do this half-assedly. Not that I need it, mind, but it wouldn't hurt.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T10:07:54-07:00","id":166071,"title":"","content":"&quot;Much has changed recently, perhaps that will change as well. Let us head back though, I am sure you have lost more then enough Ambrosia for the day while escorting me around. Even so, I am grateful, this day has been the most enjoyable in some time.&quot;<br /> <br /> Along the way he muttered, &quot;One of these days I will remember to ask Eugene for a guard so I can sleep at night.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T13:17:31-07:00","id":166195,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=165959#post165959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Tirien ponders for a moment before saying, &amp;quot;My master told my that the Star-Chosen can not only read the Heavens with unerring clarity, but also can manipulate their meanings. Can you grant me luck in this? No need to do this half-assedly. Not that I need it, mind, but it wouldn't hurt.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> Blossom blinks in surprise. She had grown so used to being around other Sidereals, and the gods of the Bureau of Destiny, that it felt odd to hear someone speak of the manipulation of fate so casually, and with no appreiation of the effort involved. The ignorance of the request was staggering, but Blossom didn't let that show on her face. &quot;I... suppose I can try. How much time do we have?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T23:20:33-07:00","id":166668,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> You head back to the Temple, and anticipating your needs, Larissa opens her sanctum and allows Yi to enter. He finds the place similar to his first viewing, with a large palate set out for him. Once again Larissa excuses herself, and leaves you alone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T23:39:01-07:00","id":166677,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> Hyuga and Jensven enter into a familiar rhythm, assisting each other with nary a word said. It is as if they each learned their craft at the others' side, knowing the other's strengths and shortcomings, and therefore how best to account for them. Hyuga's supernatural crafting is far superior to Jensven's skills, even with the master's tools he has at his disposal, but Jensven's superior Dexterity and strong technique help him apply the skills far better than he could on his own.<br /> <br /> Long story short, you make a good team! <br /> <br /> Working in the pale glow of a slumbering fire elemental, the two Solars work through the night, pounding out the components of four golem shells. You could make more, but you seem to have burned through all of the materiel Maia left for you. Noticing a pair of sleeping pallets in the side of the room (one of which Shadow has already claimed), and some light food on a nearby table, you grab a quick meal before catching a few hours of sleep. Shadow is rather perturbed at having to give up his extravagant sleeping arrangements, however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T23:47:32-07:00","id":166684,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> Once again, the sun has risen, a new day has dawned, and Creation keeps on existing. <br /> <br /> [You're two days behind Tirien and Blossom, for the record]<br /> <br /> (Academy)<br /> <br /> Hyuga and Jensven are awoken, having managed to catch a few hours of sleep, by metallic noises and sweet smells. A pair of bowls of thick honeyed porridge sit upon the table, steaming next to a plate with a few thick slices of ham. <br /> <br /> Looking for the source fo the noise, you see Maia examining your handiwork. Shadow is not far from her, and is gnawing on a meaty ham-bone. Jensven can tell from his body language that he thinks OH MY INCARNAE MAIA IS MY NEW FAVORITEST PERSON EVAR.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T23:50:53-07:00","id":166686,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=166195#post166195\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Blossom blinks in surprise. She had grown so used to being around other Sidereals, and the gods of the Bureau of Destiny, that it felt odd to hear someone speak of the manipulation of fate so casually, and with no appreiation of the effort involved. The ignorance of the request was staggering, but Blossom didn't let that show on her face. &quot;I... suppose I can try. How much time do we have?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Ceryd glances at the sky, and says, &quot;You have an hour before the moot. Taking into account travel and polite punctuality, you should be leaving her in no more than a half-hour.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T07:16:32-07:00","id":166917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=166686#post166686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin) Ceryd glances at the sky, and says, &amp;quot;You have an hour before the moot. Taking into account travel and polite punctuality, you should be leaving her in no more than a half-hour.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> Blossom blinks, then shakes her head. &quot;Then there's nothing I can do from an astrologial standpoint. What you ask, Tirien, would take days of preparation at least. The alteration of destiny is not something to be undertaken lightly.&quot; She looks up at the sky for a moment, then bak to Tirien and Ceryd. &quot;An hour isn't much, but there may be enough time to meet with some of the participants of the moot beforehand. The right information whispered in the right ear could help put some of the more relutant participants in the right state of mind for your arguments.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T09:11:29-07:00","id":166979,"title":"","content":"Jensven sits up and ruffles his hair. He walks over to the dog after grabbing some of the ham and idly nibbles it as he moves. The meat is torn roughly in half and Shadow is given the greater portion, which he wolfs down then returns to the bone. Jensven scratches the dog behind the ears before saying, &quot;Yeah, I think she's neat too.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Dawn eats his portion leisurely and speak between bites, &quot;What do you think, Maia? I would like to give Hyuga much of the credit. He did an amazing job. We could have had more ready, but we ran out of steel. Do you think you will require more?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T09:13:28-07:00","id":166980,"title":"","content":"Tirien sighs. It seems that her Sifu has given her faulty information again. <br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize for the inconvenience. My only information about the Star-chosen is the tales my master told of the Chosen of Saturn, Peerless Ocelot, a Sidereal beholden to his Sifu, Kardalla the Librarian. According to him, Peerless Ocelot was a man of superb skill, able to bring down gods and demons alike with a mere piece of paper, a man whose skill in Martial Arts led to the development of the Five Directional Animal styles, and the architect of a large palace complex somewhere near here...In any case, I would greatly appreciate your support in gaining the Viciriuth as allies,&quot; she says, curtsying. <br /> <br /> Tirien will then survey the scene, and begin small talk, trying to get a feel for how the Nobles feel about potentially fighting on foreign soil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T16:26:46-07:00","id":167334,"title":"","content":"Seeing that Jensven and Hyuga getting to work on the golems he decide to head back to his lab. The behemoth sword that he borrowed from Hyuga it was a mystery and a wyld artifact was rare and the opportunity to study it was welcomed. First the library was the first stop on his way, he needed books on the subject his second was the kitchen it was gonna be a long night and he was gonna need his strength summoning demons was both taxing and dangerous but their powers was quite useful.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 06-12-2014, 08:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T17:47:09-07:00","id":167378,"title":"","content":"Still in the sanctum, Yi went through his morning rituals quietly. When he felt he was presentable he looked about for his hostess. Finding her he wished her a good morning before saying, &quot;If you have the time, we could talk about who I was before I came here. Perhaps it will even be a good thing, but I know neither of us enjoys surprises.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T21:57:50-07:00","id":167563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=166980#post166980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien sighs. It seems that her Sifu has given her faulty information again. &amp;quot;I apologize for the inconvenience. My only information about the Star-chosen is the tales my master told of the Chosen of Saturn, Peerless Ocelot, a Sidereal beholden to his Sifu, Kardalla the Librarian. According to him, Peerless Ocelot was a man of superb skill, able to bring down gods and demons alike with a mere piece of paper, a man whose skill in Martial Arts led to the development of the Five Directional Animal styles, and the architect of a large palace complex somewhere near here...In any case, I would greatly appreciate your support in gaining the Viciriuth as allies,&amp;quot; she says, curtsying. Tirien will then survey the scene, and begin small talk, trying to get a feel for how the Nobles feel about potentially fighting on foreign soil.</div> </div> </div> </div> OOC: Wait, what scene? I thought we had been removed to a secluded location. Where exactly are we?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T22:00:43-07:00","id":167566,"title":"","content":"(Ooc: Ah, geez, you're right. Well, erm....)<br /> <br /> Tirien turns to Ceryd,&quot; Where will the Moot be held, by any chance?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T22:53:40-07:00","id":167593,"title":"","content":"<i>During the night, Hyuga tosses and turns. Nightmares once again come back to haunt his sleep. He was out with Yi, Tirien, and Jensven on the battle field with their weapons aglow and poised for battle. Everything seemed to be going fine. They had made a lot of ground and were felling enemies left and right. It was at that time that Hyuga split off from the group to go investigate and enemy manse. After killing all inhabitants, he ran back to where the others were heading. At first he thought his eyes were deceiving him. Past the hill he ran up, burnt trees stood crippled, bushes burned, and all the ground became desolate. That is when he saw it. Yi lay broken on the ground, Tirien was ripped apart and Jensven was being held in the air like a helpless rag doll. They had come. The jackals had come again, but this time they were great metal beasts of fire. He knew they had evolved and came back to haunt him. A cloaked man slyly moves among the shadow, cackling as he flitted about. He ran as fast as he could toward the tall beasts, but Jensven's neck was broken before he could even get there. Hyuga fell to the ground devastated. He had failed to protect them.... it was all going to happen again. Rage filled him and he ran towards the front line. He started running faster and faster, turning into a great beast himself as he ran, full of rage and unable to think of anything else. He managed to rip off one of the beast's arms as he got there, but his struggling ended up for naught as he was held. Behind him, he could feel the man come float to him and whisper, &quot;Look at what you've become. I guess it is your turn now. Feel the pain that you let them suffer&quot;. Despair filled Hyuga as he saw his monsterous form that was almost jackal like... and a sudden clanking noise could be heard from the man's mace. Hyuga knew he was about to be killed and yet was still full of rage...</i><br /> <br /> Hyuga immediately bolts upright grabbing his sword in an instant and looks around. As he calmed himself down silently, he noticed Jensven and Shadow eating some ham and Maia tinkering with the golems and checking their work. Hyuga puts down his sword quietly and listens to Jensven whom has started talking.<br /> <br /> From sitting up so quickly and the dream, Hyuga's head begins to pound. Rest certainly isn't what he got last night. His eyes were puffy and he was still feeling drained.<br /> <br /> <i>It was all a dream. Calm yourself. </i><br /> <br /> As Jensven finishes talking to Maia, Hyuga says, &quot;I used essence to bring the shells into existence. Your used just your own two hands. You did quite commendable work there&quot;. He will turn to Madame Maia and say, &quot;He was quite bent on helping you. You could tell he was extremely determined. Just that alone made me decide to stay and help. You have him to thank for all this work even being done. I would have gone off by myself to do some research and planning if not for him. Please give him any reward you think they deserve&quot;. Hyuga will grab some food and then say, &quot;Thank you for the meal. It is quite appreciated. Now if you don't mind, I am going to go get cleaned up for the day. Please feel free to check anything you need with the shells. I hope they are to your liking&quot;.<br /> <br /> With that, Hyuga will bow to Maia and Jensven and go to get cleaned up. The Sun certainly knew he needed it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Obviously, my nightmares flaw has come up. I accidentally forgot to copy the link, but I rolled a 2 on the dice (4 or less gives me nightmares). </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 06-13-2014, 01:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T23:44:13-07:00","id":167652,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> &quot;Good morning,&quot; Maia says. Continuing to examine your handiwork, she says, &quot;It's excellent work. There are maybe ten in the nation who could match this craftsmanship. And even they couldn't work this fast.&quot;<br /> <br /> She heads over to the table, sitting down, &quot;Even with Hyuga's anathema sorcery, I expected you to finish one. One. Four will take me three weeks worth of work to finish. I'm not sure what I'd do if you helped me any more. I'd end up with far too much work to do!&quot;<br /> <br /> She laughs to herself as she retrieves a nearby bundle. Using her prosthetic arm, she lifts it up onto the table, grunting slightly. Unwrapping it, it opens to reveal several weapons. A straight sword of fine, clean steel, with hypnotic patterns of black jade on the blade. A lightly curved sword of bronze, that gives off an acrid odor of ionization and crackles with internal lightning. And a broad, leaf-shaped blade, seemingly made of the same semi-molten volcanic stone as Maia's arm. <br /> <br /> &quot;Take one. You've helped me immensely, and they're no use to me. Chancellor said we couldn't sell them, for myriad reasons, and I have no reason to hold onto them.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Vykos)<br /> Okay. Roll (Intelligence + Investigation) to find relevant information on the Wyld weapon. Then make appropriate decisions (species, type of binding, specific task if task-binding) and binding rolls for your demon summoning.<br /> <br /> (Yi)<br /> &quot;I suppose now would be a good time,&quot; Larissa says, dropping a few pieces of paperwork into a golden-white fire on her desk, &quot;If it's as important as you seem to think, it might be best for me to know before the fires of Malfeas burn my nation to the ground. Or whatever other doom you portend.&quot; Her tone is light and mildly mocking, as if she is bantering with you. <br /> <br /> (Geherin)<br /> &quot;A half-mile due east of here, in a large Fell,&quot; Ceryd says, &quot;You will recognize it by there being a score of the loudest more boisterous members of a loud and boisterous people, all in differing patterned clothing.&quot; <br /> <br /> Transforming into a flying fox one more, Ceryd's vulpine form grins, &quot;I trust a Steward and Vizier can find their way there without my assistance?&quot; before loping off, in what you presume to be the East. <br /> <br /> Now, how will you find your way there?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T07:18:46-07:00","id":167893,"title":"","content":"&quot;Why is it,&quot; Blossom grumbles to Tirien, looking at the night sky, &quot;people assume that astrology and celestial navigation are the same thing? Just because I know what it means when Mercury traverses the Mask retrograde doesn't mean I can navigate without a compass.&quot; She studies the stars for a few more minutes, then hesitantly points. &quot;East is... this way?&quot; She's pointing southwest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":". 06-13-2014, 12:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T08:58:45-07:00","id":167959,"title":"","content":"Tirien smirks, &quot;We don't need to know where it is, just follow those who have gone before.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tirien will then make a (Wits+Survival) roll to track Ceryd's route towards the Moot, with <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4534140/\" target=\"_blank\">2 suxx.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T11:02:20-07:00","id":168101,"title":"","content":"Bracing himself, Yi began, &quot;I would be more concerned with Terrestrial fire.<br /> <br /> As a mortal I was Wai Tan-Junai of the Second Dragon of Fire, associate member of the faculties of both Artifice and Archaeology, and the most prominent metic in Lookshy. The last lent a certain character to the other two that you can guess well enough.<br /> <br /> The Sun's choice was made in battle, after I disobeyed direct orders and exposed our forces to the death-machines of Thorns in order to save my commander. I escaped custody afterwords while awaiting my court martial.<br /> <br /> In short, I am a very public deserter who knows technological and military secrets of Lookshy. The Wyld Hunt is overdue at this point I think. Even if it weren't, this could result in a very serious diplomatic incident. Or it could make me wildly popular with the people due to their anti-Seventh Legion attitudes. Fate is fickle like that.&quot;<br /> <br /> He let out a sharp exhalation that might have been a laugh.<br /> <br /> &quot;Or perhaps I am simply tired of hiding all this and needed to tell someone, to trust someone.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T15:26:13-07:00","id":168306,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> Tirien follows the marks which Ceryd's vulpine form left on her travels. Perhaps twenty minutes passes before you end up in a large clearing. Ceryd is there, conversing with a skald. A horse stands next to her; It s conversing with one of the chieftains, gesticulating with it's front hooves.<br /> <br /> Many other individuals are there, many of them with the look of a chief, and many others with the look of skalds. Tirien picks out Erwan and Darmud in the crowd.<br /> <br /> You've got some time to mingle, if that is your wish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T17:59:06-07:00","id":168411,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> Larissa seems shocked by this turn of events. She says nothing for a good long while, gears in her head whirling. &quot;We need to restrict your contact with the Ordon, then,&quot; she finally says, &quot;They've been known to have dealings with Lookshans. Founders, I'm going to have to do damage control, keep rumors of your presence to a minimum. At the very least, we're going to need to get you a language councilor to kill that Lookshan accent of yours.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Damn,&quot; she grips her forehead, &quot;I'm tempted to cast you across the face of Creation, and let you be someone else's problem. Damn...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T08:50:57-07:00","id":168960,"title":"","content":"At the library (Vykos activate his first investigation excellency to add 6 dice to his roll for a total of 15 dice and scores<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4535063/\" target=\"_blank\"> 9 sux </a>).<br /> <br /> At the lab Vyko will attempt to summon a Metody, the binding will be standard I bind him to obey him. As the sun set Vykos will begin to cast the spell to call forth the demon chanting as the Metody emerge from the circle it roars it's defiance as the clash of their will begins. (Vykos spends 20m for the spell + 15m to remove three dice from the dice pool of the demon for a total of 35 motes of peripheral essence)<br /> <br /> <br /> (Vykos rolls 11 dice for the contested willpower roll and the Metody rolls 7 normally its 10)<br /> <br /> First contested willpower roll Vykos scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4535098/\" target=\"_blank\">9 sux</a> and the Metody scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4535099/\" target=\"_blank\">5 sux</a>, Vykos scored 4 more success than the demon the binding is successful !!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T23:05:58-07:00","id":169521,"title":"","content":"The resplendent sun smiled, though no one saw it.<br /> <br /> Yi had a lot of smiles. He had the polite smile when paying attention to fools not worth the air they fouled with their next breath. He had the smile for when other people accomplished something and he couldn't bring himself to be genuinely happy for them. He even had a few for when the feelings inside him couldn't stay in the tiny vessel beating in his chest and had to spill over into the muscles of his face. This one was of that last kind, a smile for when what happened was unwanted but expected and he could not bring himself to be upset by it.<br /> <br /> &quot;You are right, much work shall be required. We will find a way through this, even if it means I must depart. I revealed myself to help this nation and if it is better for this nation I shall remove myself. I do not think it will come to that, there is too much good yet undone for me to be so selfish as to run. Yet whatever troubles or triumphs are or might come about, this too shall pass.&quot;<br /> <br /> After sitting down at the table he said, &quot;Would you like any help in preparing your response? I am hardly in a position to brag, but I was the 'Young Tiger of the River' who beggared the 'Five Silver Kings' and negotiated the Accord of Earth and Water.&quot;<br /> <br /> It was bragging of the most shameless sort, bringing up two of the biggest diplomatic victories Lookshy had won in the Scavenger Lands in living memory. The so called &quot;Five Kings&quot;, really four factors and one reigning plutocrat, had attempted to popularize the silver standard in the Confederation of Rivers. When the dust settled all five were paupers and Lookshy sat on a stockpile of exotic materials and silver. The Accord of Earth and Water that followed was Lookshy's response to the collapse of several of the largest fortunes in the Confederation, greatly expanding its own supply networks and prestige.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T11:58:59-07:00","id":169964,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods at Maia, &quot;Well, we shall find other ways to make ourselves useful.&quot; He turns to Hyuga, &quot;Do you know what animal this meat comes from? Also, we could go study up on things. I realize I have much to learn. Ignorance becomes no man.&quot;<br /> <br /> He withdraws from the praise of both, though. &quot;I thought if we constructed the golems we could use them to save warriors and other people. So my hammer flew. Thanks for the help Hyuga.&quot;<br /> <br /> After examining the blades before him he touches the straight blade, &quot;This one reminds me of Shadow. Does it do anything particularly interesting. I can already tell it is of finer quality than the one I already have. I couldn't make it's like if I wanted to.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T12:19:04-07:00","id":169987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=168306#post168306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin)<br /> Tirien follows the marks which Ceryd's vulpine form left on her travels. Perhaps twenty minutes passes before you end up in a large clearing. Ceryd is there, conversing with a skald. A horse stands next to her; It s conversing with one of the chieftains, gesticulating with it's front hooves.<br /> <br /> Many other individuals are there, many of them with the look of a chief, and many others with the look of skalds. Tirien picks out Erwan and Darmud in the crowd.<br /> <br /> You've got some time to mingle, if that is your wish.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tirien will introduce herself to some of the clan chieftains and make small talk with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T18:22:26-07:00","id":171257,"title":"","content":"(Vykos)<br /> <br /> Vykos finds an ancient codex, entitled <i>The Weaponnes of the F\u00e4ry and Assorted Wylde Creatures. </i>Within, he finds the following information:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Among the most fearsome of the Wylde weaponnes, are the beastes known as the 'Behemothes'. These Beastes are weaponnes most versatile, enhancing the strengthe and mighte of their handlers with their owne mightie powers. Though they ussualy must be directed in their actionnes by a handler, when without a controlling F\u00e4ry, the beastes will follow their own instincts. The mightiest of these behemothes, the Horrors of the Deep Wylde, may act indipendently, even with a handler. <br /> <br /> When fighting such a beaste, I have been informed that, despitte the strengthe of the behemothe relative to the handler, it is more intelligent to strike at the monster. Each strike that harmes the behemothe damages the handler, though the reverse is notte true. In Creation, the behemothes, narative as a living weaponne forces it to take the forme of a physicall weaponne as of humann artifise under most circumstances. Under these circumstances, onne can wield the beaste as a weaponne or a beaste.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> The codex goes on to explain a list of behemoths that the author has heard of, and their assorted powers. <br /> <br /> Upon the successful binding of the demon, it grumbles and pulls a tome of basalt plates from its chest and opens it. It lays one hand on the open plates, and you can smell an acrid odor as it says, &quot;Day 943 of existence. Got summoned into creation by some jerkass Solar. Hope it doesn't melt me down into chalcanth.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T18:43:00-07:00","id":171272,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;You did THAT?&quot; Larissa stutters, &quot;Never tell anyone else. Never. The elders will all cease their infighting to try and kill you. Even your new friends in Ptreas and Spyrus.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Any public response will only ensure that people talk about you as a Lookshan. No, I need to start spreading rumors that you're some sort of wandering prophet. An agent of the Divine, sent to aid us in our hour of need. My father giving you that,&quot; she gestures towards the stave Yi took from the temple, &quot;will support that. What I need of you is to walk around the city, acting like a holy man, prophesying and such. That way, wen I start spreading the rumors, it has a foundation to build on.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T18:51:19-07:00","id":171281,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=168306#post168306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin)<br /> Tirien follows the marks which Ceryd's vulpine form left on her travels. Perhaps twenty minutes passes before you end up in a large clearing. Ceryd is there, conversing with a skald. A horse stands next to her; It s conversing with one of the chieftains, gesticulating with it's front hooves.<br /> <br /> Many other individuals are there, many of them with the look of a chief, and many others with the look of skalds. Tirien picks out Erwan and Darmud in the crowd.<br /> <br /> You've got some time to mingle, if that is your wish.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given the lack of time with which to work, Blossom will simply try to keep a low profile, moving about the clearing, trying to get a feel for the mood of the gathering, perhaps pick up on a few tidbits that might aid Tirien in her work or lend insight. She works to stay at the periphery of the conversations, speaking as little as possible, drifting from social group to social group, blending in, not drawing attention, simply... listening.<br /> <br /> OOC: To aid herself in staying beneath everyone's radar, Blossom will be using Lion Mouse Stratagem, activated with personal essence. Noodle, do you want me to make any rolls for any of this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T19:03:29-07:00","id":171299,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> &quot;It's a 'klaive. Not a full on daikliave, mind. Just a 'klaive. Indestructible, like any other artifact, and it's far better balanced than even the best swords. It was one of my experiments in imbuing elemental essence in a non-golem item. It didn't work as intended, but it will draw in water essence from external sources. Including bodies. Once it has enough, the wielder can cause it to explode out, unleashing a vortex of water essence. The essence bleeds out fast though.&quot; Maia explains. &quot;I never bothered to name it, since it was a commission. I'll leave that honor to you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Stat-line:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Speed 5, Accuracy +3, Damage +4L, Defense +3, Rate 2, Attune 3.<br /> After having dealt at least 3L damage during the scene, the wielder can expend a point of willpower. On the next successful attack, the target's next action is delayed (wielder's Essence) ticks. Using this power or ending the scene resets the 'counter' of damage to 0. Immersing the sword in water can also increase this track. The amount raised by doing so is determined on a case-by-case basis.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 06-16-2014, 10:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T12:21:25-07:00","id":171847,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Tirien meets several chieftans and their skalds. None of them seem willing to make any substantive talk, but they are polite and deferential to her. <br /> <br /> Blossom, however, gets a different picture. Several chieftains are grumbling to each other about Tirien and Darmud, and don't they know that the Squirrel-men will be invading any day now? <br /> <br /> Also, Blossom overhears a trio of young-ish looking women talking shit about her, saying that there's no way she could attract a honorable warrior when she's that weak. I mean, can that girl even lift up a pig? Also, that dress? Faux-novaleski dresses went out of fashion like, two years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T15:16:53-07:00","id":172067,"title":"","content":"OOC: Talking shit about Blossom, or about Tirien?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T15:19:55-07:00","id":172070,"title":"","content":"[[OOC: Blossom]]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T15:29:15-07:00","id":172072,"title":"","content":"OOC: LOL. Well, I guess there are downsides to a charm by which she &quot;cloaks herself in the humble and unassuming air of the... hanger-on in the company of legends.&quot; I didn't know Novaleski liked dresses that leave one shoulder bare, though; that info might come in handy. Before I proceed, I need to know, was it obvious that Blossom arrived with Tirien and is part of the Lunar's &quot;party&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T16:07:12-07:00","id":172118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=172072#post172072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OOC: LOL. Well, I guess there are downsides to a charm by which she &quot;cloaks herself in the humble and unassuming air of the... hanger-on in the company of legends.&quot; I didn't know Novaleski liked dresses that leave one shoulder bare, though; that info might come in handy. Before I proceed, I need to know, was it obvious that Blossom arrived with Tirien and is part of the Lunar's &quot;party&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't say that it's obvious, per se, but a reasonably intelligent individual (of which many people here are) could definitely put two and two together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T17:52:05-07:00","id":172216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=171847#post171847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Tirien meets several chieftans and their skalds. None of them seem willing to make any substantive talk, but they are polite and deferential to her.<br /> <br /> Blossom, however, gets a different picture. Several chieftains are grumbling to each other about Tirien and Darmud, and don't they know that the Squirrel-men will be invading any day now?<br /> <br /> Also, Blossom overhears a trio of young-ish looking women talking shit about her, saying that there's no way she could attract a honorable warrior when she's that weak. I mean, can that girl even lift up a pig? Also, that dress? Faux-novaleski dresses went out of fashion like, two years ago.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even in semi-barbarous culture, there are mean girls, it seems.<br /> <br /> Tirien frowns. This is getting her nowhere. However, she'll wait for the High King to call the Moot. While she probably could get away with starting now, she doesn't need any other points that could be used against her.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T05:36:01-07:00","id":172666,"title":"","content":"After an appropriate period of time making the rounds of the clearing, and listening to the budding conversations, Blossom lets the natural flow of the gathering bring her back into contact with Tirien. She continues to act in an unobtrusive way, her mannerisms anything but threatening. Every downward flick of her eyes whenever they make contact with the gaze of another, every subtle movement as she glides out of the way of her betters, the slight hunch of her shoulders, the almost imperceptible flinch whenever someone's gaze lingers on her for too long, the self-conscious way she smooths the folds of her dress over her hips... it all screams <i>this person is beneath your notice</i>.<br /> <br /> Well, it's a very subtle scream.<br /> <br /> This uninteresting person pauses for the briefest of moments in front of Tirien, moving carefully so as not to be in the Lunar's way, nodding apologetically and seeming to whisper an apology for obstructing her. Instead, she whispers information, in a low, breathy voice. &quot;You may have your work cut out for you, Tirien. These people are far more concerned about an impending invasion of Squirrel-people than about the Puissant Amethyst Court, which they think is shaping up to happen any day now. There's some budding resentment against you, and Darmud, seemingly for distracting from it. Good luck. Now, if you don't mind, snub me. I'm more effective if I'm less associated with you, and given the way these women see me, a mild snubbing of me will increase your standing in some eyes here.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T06:58:11-07:00","id":172752,"title":"","content":"As Hyuga starts to walk out into the hall he says, &quot;It's probably from a wild boar Jensven&quot;. It was clear that he was still a bit shaken up from the dream, but he tried to pass it off as being tired. &quot;We can study in a while Jensven. Let me get cleaned up&quot;. As Jensven thanked him for the help, Hyuga put up his hand and gave a tiny wave as simple recognition as he walked out the door.<br /> <br /> His mind was still racing and his heartbeat was still going crazy. Why won't you be calm heart? It was just a dream. Dreams cannot hurt you. I must have been exhausted from all the work on the golems. That must be what set it off. It is nothing more.<br /> <br /> Hyuga immediately walks to the closest bathroom and starts to wash off his face in the sink. He was always fond of doing that. At home it helped with the heat at times, but it just seemed natural. He had taken many baths in the rivers and it comforted him for some reason. He just seemed to have an affinity for water for some reason. <i>I wonder if my essence is of the water aspect... but that would make no sense at all. There are still many things I need to learn about essence and all of the elemental poles. I am sure they have a great deal to do with the realm defense grid. I should do more studying about that. I haven't really looked at that in a long time... at this rate I will never get around to fixing it. It would solve the problem with the Fey really quickly too... I wonder...</i><br /> <br /> Hyuga lost himself in thought over his dream of fixing the realm defense grid. Soon enough he had forgotten all about the nightmare that had come to him during the night. Thinking about crafting always took Hyuga's mind off of everything else; it never failed him. <br /> <br /> After a while, he forgot all about even taking a shower and headed back to the artificery to find Jensven. &quot;Why don't we do some research. Maybe we could find that sorcerer and get his help. I am sure he found something useful about that weapon. Maybe he could help us with some research too. Those scholarly types always seem to have their nose in books and want to be superior to everyone else and know everything. We could probably get plenty of information from him&quot;. <br /> <br /> <i>Well... I do look through plenty of crafting tomes, scrolls, and books when I am around them too... I guess I shouldn't be too judgemental... </i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:18:47-07:00","id":173367,"title":"","content":"Urgh... Demons always say some thing to get at your nerves.<br /> <br /> &quot; We shall see, we have a year to spend together after all. But first some sleep it may not look like it but it takes a toll to get your ass in our world if only you would behave like proper guest when we summon your kind.&quot;<br /> <br /> Vykos will try to get some sleep before heading to the artificery with bags under his eyes this always took a toll on him when he summoned demon he stops by the kitchen to get something to eat while he walk, he reaches the workshop as he's gulping the last bite. He whistles in admiration at the unfinished golem since tey obviously weren't there yesterday.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good morning everyone I see you've both been busy, you will be pleased to know that I found some information about your weapon Hyuga but not enough to please me. If it does not trouble you I would like to keep studying it&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:48:51-07:00","id":173526,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> &quot;The dumbass solar is apparently tired from its six hour task of summoning and binding my massive ego,&quot; the metody continues his diction, &quot;I suppose it doesn't understand that I just trekked across a desert for five days and nights to get here. A desert that hates liquids. And people. And liquid people. Oh, before I forget, I managed to surpass diet goals! I lost 59% of my body mass this past week! Must report good news to Personal Trainer. Still hope it doesn't render me down into chalcanth.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Artificery)<br /> [[leaving this to you three's conversation for the moment]]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T20:21:45-07:00","id":173570,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> The last light of the sun fades out as an elderly one-armed man hits a tree with a heavy club. Conversation dies out almost immediately, and the individuals move into a circle, with the old man, who is now flanked by Ceryd and the horse, at one point along the circle. They are clustered in groups of like-colored scarves and kilts, and Darmud waves Tirien over towards him. <br /> <br /> Once everyone is in thier rightful position, the old man, who wears an iron torc and knarled black-iron circlet looks to Darmud, saying, &quot;Darmud, chieftain of clan Donnkad. For what reason have you called this moot?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I called this moot at the order of a Steward, who wishes to address the chiefs of the Vicruith,&quot; Darmud replies.<br /> <br /> &quot;And this is the Steward?&quot; the old man says, gesturing to Tirien.<br /> <br /> &quot;She is.&quot;<br /> <br /> The old man turns to Ceryd, &quot;Have you examined her claim, Lady Ceryd? Is she moon-kin?&quot;<br /> <br /> Ceryd nods. &quot;She is, as she claims, a Steward of Creation. She is also student of Mejan Flesh-weaver.&quot;<br /> <br /> The old man seems a bit suprised by this last point. He turns to Tirien. &quot;Very well. Steward, you may address the High King and Chiefs of the Vicruith clans.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T20:38:00-07:00","id":173586,"title":"","content":"[[redacted]]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 06-18-2014, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T20:42:42-07:00","id":173596,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thank you, Ser King. I stand before you, amazed by what I see. A society that lives, nay thrives, in unity with nature. Truly you all deserve the titles of Stewards of Gaia as well, for your great service. However, a great shadow befalls our lands. I speak now of the Padishah of Puissant Amethyst's invasion of Novalesk. You might scoff, &quot;Oh, these foes are known to us. Why should we care?&quot; Tell me, then? Who do you fall to when the Ordoni and their fearsome metal men hack at your trees? Who comes to your aid when the Therians come with their alien religions and powerful martial arts to quell the forest spirits you live side by side with? I say no. Let us fight! Let us defeat them, and show not only Novalesk, but also Theros, Ordon and even the Realm the might of the Vicruith!<br /> <br /> Now, I know that this is a troublesome time for you; Fearsome invaders harry your borders, and age-old foes would see this as an ample opportunity to strike. I ask not the Nation itself to war, but those who see few options for glory. Those second sons, those maidens consigned to hearth and home? Those are whom I seek. I was as you once, and I know that you have the mettle needed for this crusade. Will you not join me?&quot; At this, Tirien will pump her fist in the air, and flare her anima for full dramatic effect, while <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iM4oiPnsrnk\" target=\"_blank\"> the faint sound of an electric guitar wails in the background</a><br /> <br /> Tirien will then roll (Cha+Performance) and activate 1st Charisma Ex to max, alongside Terrifying Lust Infliction to incite desire for the glory Tirien described. She rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4540250/\" target=\"_blank\"> 6 suxx.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T20:44:06-07:00","id":173598,"title":"","content":"&quot;I generally prefer to create the future instead of predicting it, but I will see what I can manage.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that he took his leave into the temple and then out into the square in front of it. He found the high platform that was used for pronouncements and began to preach.<br /> <br /> &quot;I see you O people, and am shamed on your behalf! Is man a beast that he should endure in such squalor?<br /> <br /> You are confused by this. You look at this high temple and these proud buildings and these mighty men and think, 'Such things this madman says! Are we not a great people? Our riches are many, our strength is vast, our enlightenment is surpassing. We are not scattered across the face of the Creation.\u201d Hear then; our ancestors, those ancients who were strangers to every age you have know, threw down the world that was and raised it anew to escape such barbarism as you now endure.<br /> <br /> You build your lives of mediocrity; and you say, \u2018Is this not good enough?\u2019 In so doing you claim, \u2018We do not deserve better.\u2019 Hear O Novelesk the word of the Sun, spoken in compassion that you should have the inheritance that was promised you.<br /> <br /> \u2018Be excellent, as I am excellent, that your every breath might strive toward perfection. Test me in this, and see if you do not achieve such wonders that you cannot even comprehend them.\u2019<br /> <br /> This is the age to come O Novalesk, if you will but reach forth and grasp it! This is why your forbearers laid down their blood and sacred honor! Put aside the pettiness of factions and politicking. Stand with your brothers and sisters in unity and trust. Fight with all your soul and strength. Not merely against the foes that encircle you, but against every challenge that is before you. In this way you shall become the equal of all troubles that stand before you and in this way you shall overcome them.<br /> <br /> I tell you the truth O Novalesk, You Can Be More!\u201d<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Guan Activates: <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6276/view\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6276/view</a><br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\">The Destiny of Man,<br /> <br /> Being a sermon delivered before the Temple of Origenes for the moral education of the populace of Novalesk and the promotion of the ritual veneration and cult practices of the Unconquered Sun<br /> <br /> With an unspoken message concerning the Solar Yi Zhinan, namely that he is worthy of veneration as the Sun\u2019s chosen EXALTED</div><br /> Charisma 6 + Performance 5 + Excellency 8 + Stunt 2 : 11 successes<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6277/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6277/view\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6277/view\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6277/view </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6278/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6278/view\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6278/view\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.roleplay.zone/dice/6278/view </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Activating Heartfelt Honorific Opportunity and Wise-Eyed Courtier Method. The Title indicates what I want out of it.<br /> <br /> Going to meet with Nikoloi representative after, and then perhaps get some more preaching in before the Boule meeting. Taking my stunt reward as WP.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T20:46:24-07:00","id":173601,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wild bore? Doesn't sound very exciting. It is tasty, though.&quot; Jensven will share the other slab of the meat with Shadow, but keep the oatmeal for himself. He waves absently at Hyuga. He barely registers that something is troubling the Descending Sun.<br /> <br /> The Ascending Sun will pick up the straight blade and admire it some more, &quot;I will have to think on a name for it. For the time being I thank you. This despite not being a true...daiklaive as you called it will serve me well.&quot; Jensven chuckles a little, &quot;An indestructible sword? I wonder if I could construct armor of such materials?&quot;<br /> <br /> At Vykos' remark he will speak up, &quot;Hyuga did much of the delicate work. I just hammered like a man possessed. Maia told me the golems would be able to keep warriors and villagers out of harms way, I had to get it done.&quot; He grows thoughtful for a moment and absently tries some of the oatmeal, &quot;Wow! This is good!&quot; Jensven will turn to Vykos. &quot;Hyuga mentioned we could do some studying around here. I'm all about that for now. Just let me finish this food, whatever it is.&quot; With that he will proceed to wolf down the not quite as warm as it was cereal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T20:55:41-07:00","id":173630,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> Yi's preaching seems to be landing on open ears. A large crowd gathers around him as he preaches, and they seem to be effected by the sermon. <br /> <br /> However, a familiar-looking old hobo man with a rickshaw pushes his way through the crowd from the opposing side of the market area. <br /> <br /> &quot;Yeh. I claimed this spot. My spot!&quot; He says, as Yi notices a crudely painted board on the rickshaw, extolling the worship of 'The Mount of Perfection'. The old man spits, &quot;Yeh can't take my spot Simeon! Yeh can't take me taxes!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T06:32:16-07:00","id":174042,"title":"","content":"Adverse Blossom moves to the fringes of the clearing, observing Tirien's speech but trying to stay unobtrusive and out of the way. Someone as lowly as her has no place in a circle of chieftains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T15:41:28-07:00","id":174651,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> A buff, heavily scarred man in an ivory-green-red pattern retorts, &quot;But what of the Squirell-men? They'll attack us any day now. The warriors you want usually bolster the strength of us, the Eastern clans. We would have to weather that storm alone.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T15:51:16-07:00","id":174662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=173601#post173601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Wild bore? Doesn't sound very exciting. It is tasty, though.&quot; Jensven will share the other slab of the meat with Shadow, but keep the oatmeal for himself. He waves absently at Hyuga. He barely registers that something is troubling the Descending Sun.<br /> <br /> The Ascending Sun will pick up the straight blade and admire it some more, &quot;I will have to think on a name for it. For the time being I thank you. This despite not being a true...daiklaive as you called it will serve me well.&quot; Jensven chuckles a little, &quot;An indestructible sword? I wonder if I could construct armor of such materials?&quot;<br /> <br /> At Vykos' remark he will speak up, &quot;Hyuga did much of the delicate work. I just hammered like a man possessed. Maia told me the golems would be able to keep warriors and villagers out of harms way, I had to get it done.&quot; He grows thoughtful for a moment and absently tries some of the oatmeal, &quot;Wow! This is good!&quot; Jensven will turn to Vykos. &quot;Hyuga mentioned we could do some studying around here. I'm all about that for now. Just let me finish this food, whatever it is.&quot; With that he will proceed to wolf down the not quite as warm as it was cereal.</div> </div> </div> </div>(Academy)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, yes.&quot; Maia says, &quot;Any form of artifact armor is nigh indestructible. Though I would avoid using a similar method to that sword in particular.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We do have a rather extensive library,&quot; Maia confirms, &quot;but most of the ancient and rare tomes are in the Chancellor's personal study.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T21:38:08-07:00","id":174945,"title":"","content":"&quot;You are as much a beggar as I am a vagrant. Even if there will be difficulty between us, can I not at least have the respect of speaking with you and not the mask you wear?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T07:58:20-07:00","id":175249,"title":"","content":"&quot;Tell me, then. Why should not the other clans come to your aid with their hardened warriors? If you are at war with one another, then I would say that it's best to put that aside for now, or, if you please, to duel it out now and be done with it. This isn't the time for that. <br /> <br /> If you're not at war, why are your warriors staying at home, quaffing mead? Are you not all men and women of action? Should you not all heed the call of glory when it sounds? If your cousins to the East have to deal with this threat, then why sit idly? Especially when your younger brothers, sisters, sons and daughters would ride to avenge Finn Far-Striker? Yes, the Fae Knight who slew him is among the number of the Padishah's vassals. <br /> <br /> Once more, I humbly entreat you, and understand that these are difficult times, where difficult decisions must be made, but know this. I would not ask this of you without recompense. Those who come with me will be given fair compensation for their efforts, and next year, If it pleases the Moot, I would ride with you and assist in the defense of the Vicruith from the Squirrel-Men. If not, then once the Padishah is slain, then I pledge to this Moot I will perform one task that you would have me do. My honor, though foreign, is as strong as your own, and would accept no less for putting your sons and daughters in grave peril as I am asking. What say you, then?&quot; Tirien says to the Eastern Chieftain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T14:43:41-07:00","id":175550,"title":"","content":"(Yi) <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b><span style=\"color:#D3D3D3\">He is not a mask, but a lens. A lens through which I view the world. And forget the tortures </span><span style=\"color:#FFA500\">HE</span><span style=\"color:#D3D3D3\"> visited upon ME. </span></b></span></span><br /> <br /> A voice, like the rumbling of an ancient cavern, echoes through Yi's mind, its source undiscernible. The hobo preacher casually picks his nose with his little finger. Extracting his finger from his nostril, he examines a blob of excavated mucus. Flipping it to the ground, he says, positively sedate considering his seemingly-impotent rage moments ago, &quot;Yeh gotta stick, Simeon. I's gotta stick,&quot; He extracts a long gnarled rod of an off-white wood from his rickshaw, &quot;Yeh can stick-fight me fer the spot, Simeon. But yeh can't take me taxes!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T19:21:06-07:00","id":175682,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm not looking for anything too rare or involved, Maia,&quot; Jensven says. &quot;I seem to be missing some basic common knowledge that Yi, Vykos, Hyuga, and others can repeat from memory. I think I should start with some of the material the new students here are given and see if I can't work my way up.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T06:53:59-07:00","id":176954,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> A low rumble rises from the throats of the Geherin chieftains, like the sound of an enraged beast. A particularly tall, willowy man speaks up.<br /> <br /> &quot;The slayer of my kinsman is with them?,&quot; he says, turning to face the Eastern chief, &quot;Drest of Ludgheigh, you have the support of me and mine. Though I would rather march against him myself, I will do what I can to free the warriors the Steward desires.&quot;<br /> <br /> This seems to settle the manpower dispute.<br /> <br /> &quot;Before discussion continues,&quot; the horse says, &quot;I point out to the moot that to demand the Steward aid against the Squirrel-men this year would be to deny her request.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you, Lord Agrippa,&quot; the High King says, nodding to the horse, &quot;That leaves the matter of where the Steward would like this force to assemble?&quot;<br /> <br /> For your consideration:<br /> The primary concern, if you intend to transport these men to Novalesk proper, is skirting Ordon. This leads to two potential routes; by land and by river. The main trade routes between Novalesk and Geherin originate in the lands of Clan Donnkad, making that a natural muster point. Alternatively, you could head west, then head up-river. This raised the issue of finding boats to move up-river, but if you can do so, your warband will move faster. <br /> <br /> Blossom can interject in this discussion. If you don't want her to speak up in the scene, such discussion can have happened before, retroactively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 06-22-2014, 09:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T08:37:08-07:00","id":177072,"title":"","content":"OOC: It would be good to know how many warriors we're talking about here. That's a big factor, if we're thinking about boats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T16:35:53-07:00","id":177414,"title":"","content":"&quot;Is that why you were chosen from the midst of all mankind, selected and valued most highly, and uplifted? Is this what you were meant to do, to hide from yourself and the world? Is this your destiny, the destiny you chose when you among so few have that choice?<br /> <br /> Is this truly the quality of heroes? Has mankind fallen so far?<br /> <br /> I do not think so. I do not think you so weak as all that. Will you prove me wrong?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T17:18:59-07:00","id":177469,"title":"","content":"Vykos seems to think for a few seconds and takes a look at Hyuga for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot; Yes some basic knowledge and a few specific advanced course would be useful for someone in your situation, I will show you what I know but there a somethings that I can't teach you or reveal however some knowledge are best left to discover on your own&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 06-23-2014, 09:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T17:38:11-07:00","id":178452,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;Yep. I's important causa me stick,&quot; hobo preacher says, his eyes wide. &quot;I's yeh important causa yeh stick?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T17:54:18-07:00","id":178463,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> If I understand correctly, you're going to be researching things. What will you be researching, and will you be requesting assistance of the librarians? If you will not be requesting their assistance roll (Per + Lore) or (Per + Investigation) to look for relevant material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T21:42:33-07:00","id":178635,"title":"","content":"Hyuga sits up a bit and says, &quot;Yes. You are right. Some information must be sought yourself. It provides a certain clarity and understanding that will let you recreate something, improve on something, or even bring forth new visions. Now, if you will excuse me, I will be heading to the library.&quot;<br /> On his way to the library, thousands of thoughts seem to fill his head. <i>The realm defense grid. It could be used to fix everything. It had been used for fighting, but it had the capability of showing visions and more. It seemed like an enhancement station that would let everything reach around Creation. I really need to look into it while I have the chance. It could save plenty of people, though I know it comes at a price. Perhaps there will be a way to change that.</i><br /> <br /> Hyuga's mind was so occupied that he seemed to arrive almost instantly. As he walked in, light flooded the room and shone upon the brilliantly made shelves. He could see his reflection in them and immediately felt happy.<br /> <br /> As he walked around, he gingerly fingered the spines of the books, whilst reading their titles. A few titleless books caught his attention here and there, but they seemed to not be as important. He knew what he must look for: information on the elemental poles, demenses, manses, the Imperial Manse, ancient magitech artifacts, and the creation of Creation itself. They must hold some sort of key.<br /> <br /> Hyuga quickly read a few books about the realm and the Scarlet Empress, a mouse who followed many important individuals and collected exotic items, and about basic manse building. He caressed each page reading intently and memorizing everything thanks to the help of his hearthstone. Not too much later, his forehead began to itch and burn a little, like sun-seared flesh.<br /> <br /> Unknowingly, he had walked into the geomantic center of the library and was bathed in impossibly comfortable light that kept him warm. He began to have a gut feeling that an important piece to the puzzle of the Realm Defense Grid was somewhere nearby, but he just couldn't seem to pinpoint it.<br /> <br /> Light began to cascade around the room filtering out of sight the books he didn't need and showing in a golden glow, which books he needed. He knew this must be a miracle from the Unconquered Sun. <i>I need to remember to pray to him more often. He helps me quite a lot.</i><br /> <br /> Hygua's brain focused at his max, his eyes taking in all the sights and each individual book. He still could not find the book he knew he needed, yet he could still feel it nearby. He then closed his eyes focusing on his gut feeling for the book that he so desperately needed.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga will be using 9-die for his lore excellency and I am assuming this is a 3-die stunt. Per+Lore+1st exc+3-die bonus= <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4546511/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4546511/</a> = 12 +1 sux! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":". 06-24-2014, 01:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T21:47:07-07:00","id":178640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CitanHyuga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=178635#post178635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really big post</div> </div> </div> </div>Just for clarification: You're looking for books on Geomancy and Magitech, specifically how it pertains to the Realm Defense Grid, yes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T21:51:46-07:00","id":178643,"title":"","content":"Tirien turns to Blossom,&quot; Lady Blossom, the counsel of a Vizier would be most appreciated,&quot; she says, nodding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T22:06:37-07:00","id":178666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=178640#post178640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Just for clarification: You're looking for books on Geomancy and Magitech, specifically how it pertains to the Realm Defense Grid, yes?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> OOC: Yes. It is a part of my motivation, so it is all going towards that. (Like maybe what exotic ingredients, how it was made, what it all pertains to, how it was structured, etc.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T22:10:50-07:00","id":178668,"title":"","content":"Blossom just stares at Tirien for a moment. After all the trouble that she had gone through to keep a low profile, after working so hard to seem inconsequential and dismissible, after she had done so much to be taken for anything but an important player... Tirien just threw it away with a single sentence.<br /> <br /> Blossom keeps her face impassive, and reminds herself that she couldn't blame the Lunar. After all, Chosen though she may be, Tirien was still just an amateur. Still, the Sidereal resolves to give the Lunar a very firm talking to once they were in private on the subject of discretion.<br /> <br /> It was too late now, though. Taking a step forward, Blossom clears her throat, speaking for the first time since the gathering had actually convened. &quot;I would suggest travel by river. It would be swifter and safer, and I should be able to arrange suitable transportation for the Geherin host.&quot; She steps back again after speaking, hoping that she could quickly fade back into the background.<br /> <br /> OOC: For obvious reasons, Blossom drops her commitment to Lion Mouse Stratagem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T11:12:23-07:00","id":179077,"title":"","content":"<i>Why do I feel as though I am accomplishing nothing? Am I too used to being obeyed or having my wishes executed?</i><br /> <br /> Yi stepped down to avoid shouting and public attention.<br /> <br /> &quot;For what little it is worth, I am sorry for your situation. If I can help you, the one behind the Broken Mask, I will do so. No one should have to endure that.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sighed,<br /> <br /> &quot;Why don't we go somewhere a little quieter and you can tell me about the Mountain of Perfection?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T13:14:12-07:00","id":179189,"title":"","content":"Jensven states a polite parting comment to Maia and follows in Hyuga's wake to the library, Shadow following in his. He makes no attempt to engage Hyuga in conversation as he seems very deep in thought.<br /> <br /> <i>If I am going to be useful to this group I have to know more. I will read books of history, find out what exactly an &quot;Anathema&quot; and a &quot;Dawn&quot; are, and probably get some information </i><i>on &quot;artifact&quot; armors</i>.<br /> <br /> Upon arriving at the Library, the Lawgiver will stop and stare at all the books and the shelves they are stacked upon, &quot;This room alone is bigger than the meadhall back home...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jensven will opt to ask for assistance with finding the books as he has only seen a few books in his life let alone so many in one place.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T16:07:27-07:00","id":179284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=178668#post178668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Blossom just stares at Tirien for a moment. After all the trouble that she had gone through to keep a low profile, after working so hard to seem inconsequential and dismissible, after she had done so much to be taken for anything but an important player... Tirien just threw it away with a single sentence.<br /> <br /> Blossom keeps her face impassive, and reminds herself that she couldn't blame the Lunar. After all, Chosen though she may be, Tirien was still just an amateur. Still, the Sidereal resolves to give the Lunar a very firm talking to once they were in private on the subject of discretion.<br /> <br /> It was too late now, though. Taking a step forward, Blossom clears her throat, speaking for the first time since the gathering had actually convened. &quot;I would suggest travel by river. It would be swifter and safer, and I should be able to arrange suitable transportation for the Geherin host.&quot; She steps back again after speaking, hoping that she could quickly fade back into the background.<br /> <br /> OOC: For obvious reasons, Blossom drops her commitment to Lion Mouse Stratagem.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> (Sorry, Tirien is not big on stealth or subtlety)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T17:49:06-07:00","id":179384,"title":"","content":"((OOC: I noticed, LOL. Just go on with the scene. Blossom will yell at her later.))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":". 06-24-2014, 11:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T19:19:42-07:00","id":179416,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga)<br /> <br /> Hyuga finds precious little about the Realm Defense Grid, save the normal histories and some rather unsubstantiated rumors. According to one, Defense Grid is powered by a lobotomized titan of raw warfare!<br /> <br /> In his search for information, however, he finds a tome entitled &quot;Advanced Manse Design for Complete Idiots&quot; by a Kordellia the Librarian. Despite it's ancient appearance, the book looks to be at least three or four steps removed from the original tome.<br /> <br /> The book claims that networking manses together using sorcerous and geomantic techniques greatly increases the potency of the individual manses powers; even more so if they are focused around a central core. Each subsequent manse, however, destabilizes the network as a whole unless extraordinary steps are taken. Unless those steps are taken, adding any more than ten manses to a network will result in immediate catastrophic failure, and any more than five begins to become susceptible to tampering influences. <br /> <br /> Additionally, the use of magitechnology &quot;Animating Intelligences&quot; is strengthened by this networking. Unfortunately, much like the geomantic properties, networking manses past a certain point causes the Intelligence to become more and more unstable psychologically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T20:17:54-07:00","id":179428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=179384#post179384\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">((OOC: I noticed, LOL. Just go on with the scene. Blossom will yell at him later.))</div> </div> </div> </div>[[Tirien is a female. Well, as much as a Lunar can have a clearly defined gender.]]<br /> <br /> (Geherin)<br /> <br /> The collected group appears to be a bit put out by this turn of events. <br /> <br /> &quot;What is a Vizier?&quot; One of the chieftains asks Ceryd.<br /> <br /> &quot;An aide and adviser to the Stewards and Kings,&quot; she replies, &quot;A keeper of lore, and a negotiator with spirits.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh. A skald, then?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;They fill a similar role, yes,&quot; Ceryd replies. <br /> <br /> And they relax, understanding a little what Blossom would do. <br /> <br /> &quot;Lord Ahearn,&quot; the High King says, addressing one of the chieftains, &quot;Your lands are closest to the river. Will you agree to host this warband while it assembles.&quot;<br /> <br /> The queried chief pauses for several moments before nodding, &quot;Aye.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Then let this matter be closed. Send word to the clans that one of the Stewards requests warriors brave and strong to march to aid the Novalesk. Let it be know that this force leaves two weeks hence from the lands of Clan Scathahd.&quot;<br /> <br /> If you have anything else to say to the moot, now would be the time to say so. Otherwise, what will you do now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T20:38:10-07:00","id":179431,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;Neh. Yeh trying to take me taxes!&quot; the hobo preacher says, &quot;I's not gonna go wicha! I's gonna give yeh a pamphlet.&quot;<br /> <br /> He tosses a folded piece of papyrus at Yi before dashing off with his rickshaw, screaming about how Simeon is trying to take his taxes. <br /> <br /> If Yi examines the pamphet, he discovers a crudely drawn comic in which a llama with a man's head, explains that the Mountain of Perfection is all of the trials and trivals a man experiences through their lifetime. By choosing to climb this mountain they reach ever closer to ultimate enlightenment and apotheosis. The Mountain is a metaphor for the human condition! <br /> <br /> It's also a literal Mountain. Make of that what you will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T21:02:15-07:00","id":179440,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Jensven's request is so odd that the librarian he queried directs him to the basement. Therein, in a cage behind five demonic custodians, lies a jagged shard of opaque crystal set in orichalcum and starmetal. <br /> <br /> The librarian says that you should direct your questions to it, though any attempt to touch the crystal will be met with deadly force.<br /> <br /> Provided you ask about the &quot;Anathema&quot; and &quot;Dawns&quot;, the crystal answers in a ringing voice:<br /> <br /> &quot;Anathema is the term used by the Immaculate Faith to discredit the Solar and Lunar Exalted and legitimize the Terrestrial's coup in the eyes of the masses. They claimed that the Solars and Lunars were demon-priests who had stolen shards of the Sun and Moon's power, rather than their chosen champions.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;In the context of your previous question: the Dawn caste, called the Forsaken by the Immaculates, were those Solars who were chosen by the Sun for their martial prowess. In the early days of their histories, they were the generals and champions of the exalted host.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T07:30:54-07:00","id":179695,"title":"","content":"Jensven takes in the information and mulls it over and speaks quietly to himself, &quot;I doubt I would make a very good general, but a champion, no a guardian...that i could do. If I am to survive what I have become, I will need to change my way of thinking as well as my attitude. I am much more than a humble apprentice blacksmith. I have surpassed mastery there. According to this information I could be a great warrior. It would be up to me to decide what I do with that.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jensven will naturally move on to asking about Solars, Lunars, Exalted, Terrestrials, and the Immaculate Faith. He will continue down this rabbit hole of question and answer with the crystal until he has obtained knowledge of most of the setting information concerning Exalted and the Immaculate Faith found in the setting chapter of Ex2 Core. Also, I will spend enough experience to start raising my Lore (Not Favored) to two dots. I believe that would be two experience. Correct me if I am wrong. Also, let me know how long I will have to spend per day and how many days I would need to do this (study at the Library) to satisfy the non-favored training time. Again, correct me if I am wrong, but I believe that would be a week of training.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T04:25:40-07:00","id":180669,"title":"","content":"OOC: Blossom will need to talk to Tirien in private after the meeting breaks up, but I'll hold off for now in case you wanted Tirien to do something else at the meeting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T09:59:49-07:00","id":180952,"title":"","content":"<i>Now that these two are busy I can focus more on my projects tonight summoning will be dangerous for the mind and the soul... I still wonder if it is necessary... No I...The nation needs all the help it can get.</i><br /> <br /> After saluting Maia and making sure that both Jensven and Hyuga have all they need for their research Vykos heads back to his laboratory to put it back in order. The place is a mess of notes, books, half dissected animals (from a squirrel to a deer no less) insects and vivarium that contains all sort of animals and plants both rare and mundane. The smell of rot and decay had begun to set and he could not have that. It was time to get serious and only drastic measures would work now. Using the Blood Ape to move the heavy stuff and the Metody to dissolve the carcass of the dead animals, Vykos cleans the labs and set everything in order for tonight for he would attempted to summon tonight a Teodozjia one of the lion sent into the world one of the most dangerous demon if not the most dangerous demon of the first circle.Even he shudders at the idea of summoning that but desperate times...<br /> <br /> After getting his lab in order Vykos heads back to the library to look for books with information on Third Circle demons and the Yozi such book are rare but maybe he could find some about the subjects even threading into the restricted zone of the Library to find what he needs. (Vykos activates his first lore excellency to add 9 dice to his roll for a cost of 9 mote of personal essence for a total of 18 dice scoring <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4549667/\" target=\"_blank\">10 sux</a>)<br /> <br /> (\u200bOops I think it was supposed to be an occult roll)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 06-26-2014, 01:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T18:13:11-07:00","id":181484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=179695#post179695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I will spend enough experience to start raising my Lore (Not Favored) to two dots. I believe that would be two experience. Correct me if I am wrong. Also, let me know how long I will have to spend per day and how many days I would need to do this (study at the Library) to satisfy the non-favored training time. Again, correct me if I am wrong, but I believe that would be a week of training.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are correct on both assumptions; 2 exp and 1 week. You'll have to spend about four hours a day in the library to do so. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T18:17:54-07:00","id":181486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=180669#post180669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OOC: Blossom will need to talk to Tirien in private after the meeting breaks up, but I'll hold off for now in case you wanted Tirien to do something else at the meeting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Duly Noted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T19:20:17-07:00","id":181536,"title":"","content":"(Vykos)<br /> <br /> The Blood Ape begins his habitual singing whenever doing anything as he tidies up. This time, he's singing a rather over-dramatic song about an alluring Angyalka courtesan in his deep, resonant Baritone. This shocks the metody, who once again retrieves his journal(?)<br /> <br /> &quot;The dumbass Solar is apparently also a sadist,&quot; The metody dictates, &quot;It's ordering me to eat a whole deer carcass. Clearly it can't stand letting me get any comfort in this trip, and letting me keep off those liters? Well, the joke's on it. I bet that it doesn't even know that it summoned one of the Demon City's greatest performers is right here, cleaning up it lab.Yeah, I met Erdus the Bloody-Tongued! I'm too nervous to ask him for his autograph, though.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Blood-ape ceases his sweeping for a moment, and takes the book for the metody, flipping it to the front page. Retrieving a diamond stylus from a lab table, the signs the book before returning to his task. <br /> <br /> &quot;Erdus signed my book!&quot; the metody dictates, &quot;Anyways, the dumbass solar doesn't seem to have any equipment for making chalcanth. This is a good sign, but I'm not letting my guard down. Hope it doesn't melt me down into Theion To.&quot;<br /> <br /> The metody then gets to work consuming and dissolving the remains of his experiments. <br /> <br /> Vykos heads to the library, and looks through the restricted section of the Library. There he finds one of the most respected and ancient tomes of Infernal Lore, the <i>Book of Ten-Thousand Limbs.</i> Or so it seems. While the section on first circle demons is mostly intact (save some water-damage), the sections on second and third circle demons are curiously blank. Flipping through it, Vykos finds a note, in a rough, choppy hand:<br /> <br /> <i>That you are looking for this shows some potentially troublesome designs. The complete tome is in my possession. If your designs are just, then speak to me, and I may grant you access to the the Tome.<br /> <br /> -Chancellor Nikoloi Feiro.</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T20:14:44-07:00","id":181583,"title":"","content":"After the incident with the beggar Yi hailed a rickshaw and asked to be taken to the residence of that Nikoloi councilor he had seen earlier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T11:04:34-07:00","id":182108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=181583#post181583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After the incident with the beggar Yi hailed a rickshaw and asked to be taken to the residence of that Nikoloi councilor he had seen earlier.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't recall Yi having met a Nikoloi councilor. He met the Head of Gens Spyrus, the Strategos... I actually don't recall him having met ANY of the councilors. The only one who's done anything specific is Ptreas Isaakos, and only Tirien met him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T11:27:15-07:00","id":182121,"title":"","content":"OOC:<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Next on the agenda was clearly a persistent issue, in which the elderly Nikoloi Argyrus presented fro half an hour on why the nation should increase the roads budget by 250%, and consecrate all of the roads to Mercury and Origenes, turning the entire nation into a mandala therefore increasing the effects of prayer in the nation by 13% and increasing travel along the roads by 16%. This segues into another half-hour in which the Pyrtaneis and Argyrus argue over the issue. You can tell that this is something that has been going for a while, partially due to the strange voice that Argyrus uses when addressing the Pyrtaneis.</div> </div> </div> </div>That Nikoloi</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T22:45:03-07:00","id":182641,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thank you very much for your kindness and generosity. I look forward to seeing the prowess of the Vicruith on the battlefield,&quot; Tirien says, and bows. She then turns to Blossom. <br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize if I put you on the spot there. I do not have a head for spirit negotiation, nor sorcery, and Master Mejan told me all Stargazers have excellent training in both,&quot; Tirien mumbles, looking a bit relieved now that her bluff paid off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T22:46:58-07:00","id":182642,"title":"","content":"Oh. Okay. For some reason your wording was making me think that Yi had interacted with a Nikoloi councilor. My Bad. Anyways, Argyrus isn't a councilor, he's a high ranking bureaucrat. The best comparison I can think of is that, if a Boule councilor is analogous to a US Senator, then Argyrus is the Director of the US Department of the Interior's Bureau of Land Management.<br /> <br /> (Yi)<br /> <br /> Yi makes his trip across town, and many a pedestrian stops to gawk and whisper to each other as he passes. Eventually, Yi ends up at a modestly sized townhouse. It is clean and well maintained, though nothing in particular sets it out. A brief conversation with the middle-aged woman that answers the door earns you entry. Once inside, she knocks on a nearby door saying, &quot;Grandfather? Some priest is here to see you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi hears a muffled voice in the room; it is clearly male, but it unintelligible. The woman opens the door, revealing a large study. It is cluttered with a papers, covered in maps and complex mathematical formulae, haphazardly placed around the room and tacked into the walls. <br /> <br /> Nikoloi Argyrus stands about them, stepping over piles of reference books, jotting down notes and calculations on seemingly random sections of a dozen papers. <br /> <br /> &quot;The priest, Grandfather,&quot; the woman says. She glances to a cluttered table, where a tea set sits. &quot;You haven't touched your tea. The apothecary was quite strict, Grandfather.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Bah. It tastes like Haltan swamp water,&quot; the elderly looking Earth aspect says, &quot;and the apothecaries are full of shit. I've got another sixty years before I have to worry about my age catching up to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> The woman gives Argyrus a deathly glare before retrieving the tea set. Declaring that she will make him more, she departs. <br /> <br /> The terrestrial drops himself into a thickly cushioned chair, and gestures for Yi to take another.<br /> <br /> &quot;You're that priest that took the stage with Little Larissa the other day,&quot; Argyrus says, &quot;what do you want with me?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T06:10:12-07:00","id":182831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=182641#post182641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Thank you very much for your kindness and generosity. I look forward to seeing the prowess of the Vicruith on the battlefield,&quot; Tirien says, and bows. She then turns to Blossom.<br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize if I put you on the spot there. I do not have a head for spirit negotiation, nor sorcery, and Master Mejan told me all Stargazers have excellent training in both,&quot; Tirien mumbles, looking a bit relieved now that her bluff paid off.</div> </div> </div> </div>Blossom looks around at the gathered chiefs that Tirien just turned away from, then at the Lunar. &quot;Can we speak privately?&quot; she asks in a soft, flat voice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T18:48:00-07:00","id":183417,"title":"","content":"Yi walked around before answering, taking a closer look at the maps and equations.<br /> <br /> \u201cI am tempted to make some small critique of your notions to establish my competence, but\u2026 there is a more fundamental flaw. At least in my opinion, that is. It exists only on paper.\u201d<br /> <br /> He turned to his elder and bowed humbly.<br /> <br /> \u201cI am Yi Zhinan, of no house worth mentioning. You honor me with your acquaintance Lord Nicoloi.\u201d<br /> <br /> He straightened and resumed his inspection. \u201cI will be brief honored one, this plan is a good one and I believe I can assist you in seeing it done. I believe I can reduce construction time by a factor of approximately ten, with a similar but distinct reduction in labor costs. If that does not make it palatable to the Boule, I have other options though none of them available at this time.<br /> <br /> I would leave it at that, but I am afraid my position is not strong enough for me to engage in charity. As my price for this assistance, I would like you to rework the fundamental arrangement into an eightfold mandala, thereby expressing veneration to the Most High.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T20:32:38-07:00","id":183453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=182831#post182831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Blossom looks around at the gathered chiefs that Tirien just turned away from, then at the Lunar. &quot;Can we speak privately?&quot; she asks in a soft, flat voice.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Of course,&quot; Tirien says, walking alongside Blossom, &quot;What is it you wish to discuss?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T06:51:15-07:00","id":183759,"title":"","content":"Blossom leads Tirien a little bit away from the assembled chiefs, speaking softly to her and glancing around occasionally to be sure they are not overheard. The observation of their surroundings, the care not to speak while anyone else is too close... it seems like a reflex action for her, rather than something she has to think about doing. Stealth and subtlety is clearly her way of life.<br /> <br /> &quot;Look,&quot; she says softly, a note of exasperation in her voice, &quot;I think you need to understand a little about how the Sidereal Exalted work. You Lunars and Solars like to be out in front, bright and shiny and noticeable, inspiring people and leading and all that stuff. But my people don't do that. Well, not usually,&quot; she amended with a small shrug. &quot;There are always exceptions. But 9 times out of 10, we work best if we stay in the background, or the shadows, unnoticed, especially if there's a bright Solar or Lunar around to take most of the attention.&quot; She stops glancing around for a moment to look Tirien in the eye. &quot;There's a very old saying among my people. 'The Solars lead and reign, the Lunars protect and inspire, the Terrestrials serve and soldier, while the Sidereals do everything else.' It's a simplistic way of looking at it,&quot; Blossom continues with a shrug, &quot;but it goes to show our mentality, yes? We let you other Exalted stand in the forefront, because that's what you do best, while we stand in the background, quietly making sure the little details get taken care of, because that's what we do best. Now, this is doubly true for me, since my job is gathering information. I work best when I go unnoticed, or if I am noticed, when no one pays any special attention to me. So, in the future, please, don't call me out like that in front of others unless we've discussed it beforehand, or it's absolutely necessary. And especially don't reveal my true nature.&quot;<br /> <br /> Blossom continues slowly walking with Tirien, clearly having more to talk about, but pausing to give the Lunar a moment to speak.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":". 06-29-2014, 09:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T15:38:15-07:00","id":185166,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Leaving things to your conversation for the moment. <br /> <br /> (Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;An eightfold mandala? Those are only theoretical. Besides it would require massive alteration of the surrounding geomancy in both Novalesk and the surrounding nations,&quot; Argyrus says before launching into a twenty-minute long lecture, completely ignoring any attempts to interrupt him.<br /> <br /> &quot;... potentially rendering up to eighty percent of the manses and demesnes in the nation and their surrounding area geomantically sterile...&quot; Argyrus continues as his granddaughter returns with a new tea tray. <br /> <br /> &quot;Make sure you take it this time,&quot; she says as she leaves in a huff. <br /> <br /> Argyrus picks ups a cup of the tea, and adds a liberal amount of some form of alcohol to it. Sipping the now-spiked beverage, he says, &quot;In short, not a good idea.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T22:26:56-07:00","id":185368,"title":"","content":"It had been a long time since Yi had been able to &quot;talk shop&quot; with anyone. Back in Lookshy the younger engineers had been afraid of his connections and the older ones had looked down on his origin or mortality. Since then he had lack for someone his intellectual equal, knowledgeable in something that interested him, or both. His time with Hyuga had been mostly taken up with training, each trading secrets of solar magic, and left little time for technical details.<br /> <br /> <i>Do not screw this up!</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Might I use a sheet of your paper and something to write with?&quot; At a nod he began to draw as he spoke.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am afraid you are putting the cart of effect before the horse of cause lord Nikoloi. The geomantic disturbances are a desirable benefit the project should bring about, though I confess that the road network is only a portion of the greater plan. The eight fold pattern...&quot;<br /> <br /> The rudiments of an eight pointed star about a circle and within one now covered the paper with the trigram shorthand of the sixty-four changes of essence written near intersections of lines.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is the fundamental plan of first age cities, archaeological evidence from the southeast suggests it may predate the first age. Instead of specific structures I mean to anchor the crossings with cities and towns. To be sure, roads will not be appropriate for all the interconnections. Canals will serve for most of the rest, with sky paths and tunnels completing the arrangement. At first the roll will likely be served by underground aqueducts to link groundwater wells to the main river systems for water and semaphore and messenger bird routes for air. True tunnels and skyship lines will serve better once the infrastructure is more developed.&quot;<br /> <br /> Now he began to add the map of Novalesk and surrounding nations, showing how many of the cities were already located at favorable locations for such a network. Notable were the rivers, forming a great lake around Novalesk City and branching out into give enormous canals.<br /> <br /> &quot;Once completed, along with civic alterations, the whole of the nation will serve to magnify all prayers uttered to such an extent that the Sanctum of Origenes will not have room for him to stand and the floor of the Jade Pleasure Dome will flood so that golden ambrosia runs like rivers from its doors. That is but the beginning though. The resonance between the nationwide occult matrix and the infinite energies of the Sun will flood essence into the geomancy, causing the nation to act as a quasi-elemental pole. Demesne will grow about the region like trees in an eastern forest. Secondary magical effects such as speeding all travel along the roads and reducing the fatigue and burden of travelers, normally the province of the surviving artifact roads, will become ubiquitous from the derived magical energies.<br /> <br /> It goes without saying that by capping even a fraction of the demesnes a network of war manses bettered only by the Defense Grid could be produced.&quot;<br /> <br /> Along the sides, notations grew into blocks of text explaining essence gyre formation, static and dynamic resonance of the nth order, necessary resplendent mythitecture construction, and the like.<br /> <br /> &quot;When complete, it will be a triumph of sympathetic megafetish worthy to stand with the greatest accomplishments of the any age. A wheel within the wheel and an instrument on which the strings of Creation may be played. Call me mad Lord Nikoloi, say it is foolishness, but look at this and tell me it is not glorious.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stood to give the elderly man a better look at what he had rendered. He needed no magic to look aglow, fervor burned just as bright within him.<br /> <br /> &quot;Know this also, I have power enough to see it done in your lifetime. Before the Sun who chose me and the Dragons I have revered and to the Creation I have sworn to exalted higher then I have been, I swear it.&quot;<br /> <br /> [spoiler]Umm... Should that be some sort of roll? I think its a 3 die stunt.[/stunt]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T17:26:37-07:00","id":186644,"title":"","content":"&quot;I understand, and will strive to not make this mistake again. Subtlety is one of my poorer traits, always having to jockey for position when in the Realm, or between my Teacher's pupils and myself, I always feel a bit inadequate. However, I suppose that that's something you can assist me in learning, if you would have me,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T17:35:06-07:00","id":186656,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of course,&quot; Blossom replies with a small smile. That had gone better than she had hoped; humility was not a trait often associated with Ealtation. &quot;In any case, what is done, is done. However, I did not come here just to help you,&quot; she continues with a graver expression. &quot;I have a mission of my own, and your master thought that you might be able to help me. I plan to travel to the Puissant Amethyst Court,&quot; Blossom says, as matter-of-factly as if she was announcing that she was taking a walk to the market. &quot;Quite frankly, we're operating in the dark, and I intend to change that. I plan to infiltrate their freehold by stealth, learn all that I can about their plans and capabilities, then return without being detected. I understand if you want to remain here, but if you have any skills that would help me gather information about our foe, your help would be... appreciated.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T21:56:24-07:00","id":186820,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Still leaving it to y'all.<br /> <br /> (Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;Assuming the evidence that you give is accurate,&quot; Argyrus says with a swig of his spiked tea, &quot;That merely shifts the issue from trying to enhance my family's roads to trying to conquer a nation of a quarter million, with dozens of viable terrestrial bloodlines and ties to the most powerful nation extant, conquer a technologically advanced nation that has never lost a defensive war in its entire history with ties to the most powerful military extant, and pacify scores of nomadic barbarian tribes.&quot; He gestures on your map to Theros, Ordon and the large steppes to the East in turn.<br /> <br /> &quot;All the while keeping from antagonizing the Fae Freeholds to the north, the Vicruith Geherin to the South, the dead to the far west, and the Guild, who dislike their lack of ability to cut into our carrying trade.&quot; Argyrus shakes his head, &quot;I'm no tactician, but I've been seen dozens of conflicts and a trio of major wars wrack these lands since my childhood. Unless Sunipa herself comes down from Heaven to lead our armies, I don't see us winning the types of decisive victories you need.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T22:05:24-07:00","id":189928,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Realm is eighteen months away assuming they can magic a road from the Imperial City for their troops to march along, Lookshy will never permit them to travel the river in strength. With the benefit of the river, the Seventh Legion can have forces here within three seasons, they will not dispatch the sky fleet while the Mask of Winters grows stronger every day. For better or worse Novalesk's problems are local.<br /> <br /> As for the annexation or subjugation of its neighbors, Novalesk will not survive if it does not. Whatever the rumors say Theros is expanding. Novalesk is not self sufficient and the river does not supply the quantity of materials at the low prices necessary to allow for the continued growth of the nation. Even so...<br /> <br /> It will not be easy. I would welcome any thoughts you have on the technical or political aspects. The roads are but a portion of the greater plan though, even if you do not support this plan, the cost reduction I propose is not contingent on the whole.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 07-07-2014, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T20:46:43-07:00","id":191077,"title":"","content":"&quot;You forget of Nasaru, Gunzota and Greyfalls... Though they do a fair job of bottling each other up. Or so they would have you think.&quot; Argyrus says. <br /> <br /> Argyrus shakes his head, &quot;Ever since my youth, there's been a deadlock militarily here. Theros contained by Novalesk, Ordon and the Dead. Ordon contained by Novalesk and the Vicruith Geherin. And us contained by Theros, Ordon and the Barbarians to our East and North. Call me a conservative old man, but I don't see that stalemate breaking in our favor after recent events.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyway,&quot; he continues, sipping his tea, &quot;I can only assist on the roads. I'm just an engineer. An engineer who happens to also be a master Geomancer, but an engineer all the same. It would seem to me, with your seemingly cordial relationship with...&quot; Argyrus pauses for a few moments, clearly pondering his word choice, &quot; the more competent of our Strategoi, and the ex-Archon, you would be of more use to me than I could be to you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T23:02:25-07:00","id":191139,"title":"","content":"&quot;I would be more worried about Nasaru redoubt, it is closer and the garrison wasn't conveniently wiped out in an accident that killed the most corrupt officers in the Seventh Legion. As for Greyfalls, it is a power yes, but too far to be involved directly in local politics.<br /> <br /> As for our what we are to each other, why must we measure who is of greater use? Friends help each other, and good friends do not count the cost. I have need of the services of a skilled geomancer, so your acquaintance is an unlocked for boon to me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 07-08-2014, 02:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T21:04:32-07:00","id":191953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=186656#post186656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Of course,&quot; Blossom replies with a small smile. That had gone better than she had hoped; humility was not a trait often associated with Ealtation. &quot;In any case, what is done, is done. However, I did not come here just to help you,&quot; she continues with a graver expression. &quot;I have a mission of my own, and your master thought that you might be able to help me. I plan to travel to the Puissant Amethyst Court,&quot; Blossom says, as matter-of-factly as if she was announcing that she was taking a walk to the market. &quot;Quite frankly, we're operating in the dark, and I intend to change that. I plan to infiltrate their freehold by stealth, learn all that I can about their plans and capabilities, then return without being detected. I understand if you want to remain here, but if you have any skills that would help me gather information about our foe, your help would be... appreciated.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You have assisted me, even if that is not your intention. I would do the same. I do not doubt the Vicruith's ability to get to Novalesk, and they have given me their word. If we make a detour while returnin,g and in so doing, aid our efforts, all the better for it,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T21:37:37-07:00","id":193118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=191139#post191139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I would be more worried about Nasaru redoubt, it is closer and the garrison wasn't conveniently wiped out in an accident that killed the most corrupt officers in the Seventh Legion. As for Greyfalls, it is a power yes, but too far to be involved directly in local politics.<br /> <br /> As for our what we are to each other, why must we measure who is of greater use? Friends help each other, and good friends do not count the cost. I have need of the services of a skilled geomancer, so your acquaintance is an unlocked for boon to me.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Well&quot; Argyrus laughs, &quot;You gave old Linon a start, and that has endeared you to me somewhat. If you ever actually manage to get the land for your hairbrained scheme, you have your master geomancer.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Though, I must say this to one who can speak into the right ears. Althea Sanna must not be allowed to hold the Archon's blade.&quot; Argyrus says, suddenly stern. While you see genuine national interest in his eyes, you get a hnt that he has some sort of personal beef as well. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T10:44:24-07:00","id":193786,"title":"","content":"<i>Oh that smart bastard, it was to be expected however</i> <br /> <br /> After finding the note Vykos bgan to think that the fact that the chancellor has the book could be a good opportunity to have additional help in his research. Unlocking the secret of bio-essence manipulation from the vegetative technologies of the dragon king was the first step now he needs to bring additional help to the project. The second step is to gather demonic knowledge to help advance his goals and secure Novalesk from further attacks by the fair folks and the other enemies in the region but first getting the book could be tricky.<br /> <br /> Vykos will head to the chancellor's office with the note but he will leave his bound demons in his laboratory for the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T18:53:52-07:00","id":194203,"title":"","content":"&quot;Is there any particular reason for that? The nation has use for many even if not always in the place they desire.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T11:45:14-07:00","id":194831,"title":"","content":"<i>That's it! Poweful manses are all about linking the lines of essence in an overlaying pattern through a core point! This concept could easily work with magitech artifacts as well! The essence lines would link together with the wielder's aura through a central point and power an artifact. If this information is correct, I could even create artifacts with up to 10 seperate lines for different functions at an increased power level! </i><br /> <br /> After feverishly reading the book and memorizing its concepts, Hyuga will continue to seek more books about ancient technologies and crafting techniques (especially magitech). Pages turn rapidly and Hyuga's eyes seem to reflect the Sun's rays as his mind seems to expand faster than it seemed possible. So many links had been connected, lights were coming on, and everything was beginning to make sense and fall in its natural place.<br /> <br /> <i>These are all extremely simple concepts requiring just a bit of extra work, but they seem to have just dissapeared from today's world. I don't understand how this was not passed down. I must find more ancient texts. Perhaps I should go to see the Chancellor. Maia did mention that he would have some rare tomes. But first things first, time to start writing plans and see if I can help Maia finish up her work.</i><br /> <br /> With his newfound knowledge, Hyuga cheerfully and energetically walks back to the artificery to look for Maia. &quot;Maia! Are you here? I wanted to know if you needed any help infusing the golem spirits into the shells. I am very familiar with the occult after all!&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga will be using his last 6 exp to increase his craft-magitech up to 3 dots immediately. </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T17:27:10-07:00","id":195126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=193786#post193786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vykos will head to the chancellor's office with the note but he will leave his bound demons in his laboratory for the moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vykos heads through the Academy, arriving in the Chancellor's office. After knocking on the door, he hears the Chancellor's muffled voice, saying &quot;Enter.&quot;<br /> <br /> Upon opening the door, Vykos sees the Chancellor at his desk, probing at some sort of three dimensional arrangement of arcane script hovering in front of him. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah. Vykos. What do you need?&quot; The chancellor asks as he dismisses the sphere with a wave.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T17:30:06-07:00","id":195127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=194203#post194203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Is there any particular reason for that? The nation has use for many even if not always in the place they desire.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;She's young, idealistic, and has absolutely no experience. And she's too damn Immaculate. Thinks that she should be in charge just because she's Exalted.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 07-11-2014, 08:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T17:52:39-07:00","id":195140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CitanHyuga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=194831#post194831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With his newfound knowledge, Hyuga cheerfully and energetically walks back to the artificery to look for Maia. &quot;Maia! Are you here? I wanted to know if you needed any help infusing the golem spirits into the shells. I am very familiar with the occult after all!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Someone looks chipper,&quot; Maia says, looking up from where she is etching old-Realm script into one of the shells, &quot;If you feel you can help, by all means.&quot; she slides over the diagrams, some diamond styli, and gets back to work burning script into a 'vanbrace' with her finger, humming cheerfully as she works.<br /> <br /> Make a (Dex + Craft) roll, please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T17:53:00-07:00","id":195141,"title":"","content":"Vykos drops the notes on his desk.<br /> <br /> &quot; Well chancellor I am here for one of your overdue book actually &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T18:17:06-07:00","id":195159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=195141#post195141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vykos drops the notes on his desk.<br /> <br /> &quot; Well chancellor I am here for one of your overdue book actually &quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The Chancellor takes the note and looks over it for a moment. He looks at Vykos with a raised brow and narrow eyes, &quot;Why, pray tell, are you looking for information on the Nobles of Hell?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T18:24:07-07:00","id":195164,"title":"","content":"Jensven will finish his studies for the day and then rush to the artificery when Hyuga isn't to be found in the library. He stands just far enough back from Hyuga and Maia to not interrupt their work physically, but he is obviously very excited about something.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hyuga, I'm sure you know about this already, but I just read about something called the 'Realm Defense Grid'. Apparently the current ruler of the Realm was able to use this to drive off a huge Fae invasion!&quot; Jensven is gesticulating wildly, talking quickly, and all around giving the impression that he is about to bounce off the walls. &quot;Do you have any idea what we could do with only a bit of that power?&quot; He gets very subdued when he realizes something, &quot;Well, whatever it is..I really didn't figure out what it was in my rush to get here...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T18:43:16-07:00","id":195177,"title":"","content":"Vykos takes a deep breath before answering and actually looks a bit worried.<br /> <br /> &quot; As you know I took some of the dragon kings ancient vegetative technologies out of storage to study them and I managed to pry their secret opened. They manipulated their essence to change them or to create knew kind of plants to suit their needs. Over the course of my studies in demonology I found that many of the nobles of hell create knew demons of the first circle using similar technique I need to find out which one of the nobles of hell is willing to bargain it's secret with me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T07:41:55-07:00","id":195500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=191953#post191953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;You have assisted me, even if that is not your intention. I would do the same. I do not doubt the Vicruith's ability to get to Novalesk, and they have given me their word. If we make a detour while returnin,g and in so doing, aid our efforts, all the better for it,&quot; Tirien says.</div> </div> </div> </div>Blossom raises an eyebrow and gives her a small smile. &quot;It was my intention to assist you. I said that assisting you wasn't my <i>only</i> reason for coming here, but it was still <i>a</i> reason.&quot; She makes a small dismissing gesture with her hand. &quot;And don't worry about the Vicruith's ability to travel on their own. According to the reports we had before I left Yu-Shan, our target is only about six hundred miles from here. The way I travel, it should only take us about a day, maybe two, to get there, and the same for the trip back. If all goes well, we should be back in plenty of time to assist the Vicruith on their journey.&quot;<br /> <br /> Her expression grows more serious. &quot;I am a little more concerned about keeping you covert, however. You mentioned that subtlety is... not your strongest area. It is my hope to get in and out without the Fae ever realizing we were there. If you can't conceal yourself...&quot; She hesitates for a moment, then shrugs it off with a chuckle. &quot;Wait, what am I saying? You're a Lunar. You can just shapeshift into a mouse or a grasshopper or something, and I'll hide you on my person. That way, I can keep both of us safe and hidden.&quot; She smiles at the obvious solution to the problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":".  Pronouns 07-12-2014, 10:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T08:16:48-07:00","id":195534,"title":"","content":"Hyuga immediately grabs the styli and holds it delicately as if it were a fragile piece of glass. &quot;I have just found some secrets and ancient techniques that will provide most useful to me. I cannot help but be quite happy. If you want, I could always be a tutor in the ways of magitech: the artifact making of the old age. For now though, we will focus on finishing these golems&quot;. <br /> <br /> Hyuga takes in a deep breath his lungs filling to the max and slowly closes his eyes. He pictures the complicated designs in his head, but now they seem so simple to do. Without looking, he grabs another styli and begins his work two-handedly. He does not seem to be etching in the design in metal, rather it seems as if he is painting a picture, with his &quot;brushes&quot; flying across the surface of the lackluster metal bringing it life as an artist does to a canvas. His hands seem to never cease moving like a blur, yet perfect arcs and lines seem to magically materialize where they had once been.<br /> <br /> A soft glow fills the room as his caste mark burns, and reflects the golden light ever so lightly off the metal making it seem as if it were made of a gold and steel mixture of the finest quality. The design continues to bring even further beauty to the shell. This seemed to be a masterpiece statue rather than a war golem.<br /> <br /> As Hyuga works, he still manages to focus on his thoughts about his new techniques and the information about the realm defense grid. &quot;Yes Jensven. It is my dream to be able to fix the realm defense grid. I would even want to alter it a bit, making it a beacon of protection and not of fear. It would help us keep safe from any fae invasion or invasion from hell were it possible. I have found the basic parts of the technique for powering it. Later, we may be able to make a smaller more localized version, but it would take the help of many people over quite a bit of time. We would also need permission from the local authorities to do so. I have worked a bit with manses before, but it is not my specialty. I do know the techniques to link them now though amongst other things&quot;. <br /> <br /> As he continues to work, his anima begins to flare. The golden light becomes stronger, making the entirety of the metal look like a high carat gold. Wisps of blue come and go and a ghostly orichalcum anvil seems to sneak into existence behind him, making soft tinkering sounds. Hyuga grabs the other shells and begins to work on both simultaneously, one hand for each one. Still, he manages not to miss a beat in etching in the designs. He continues working throughout the evening whilst talking more about the realm defense grid, manses, ancient techniques he discovered, possible ideas he had for powerful artifacts, and seem never to lose energy talking about such things. <br /> <br /> <i>I wonder how long it has been since I have been this happy. It has been a long time since I have found any type of secret about the way to create and fix the realm defense grid too. I need to find more. It should be done soon enough. I need to start working on a design for the best sword too. I have seen so many wonderful artifact swords. My ideas should start coming together soon. I should get more tomes to read; I should ask Maia about it now.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Maia. I recall you telling me about some rare tomes. I know you let me see one already, but do you think that the Chancellor would let me see some of his? Also, do you think you could spare some paper for me to start wokring on my designs? It would be greatly appreciated&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Hyuga will be using CNNT for all 3 shells (21m+3WP) moving 12x faster than normal. He will also be adding in 6 dice for the first two craft-air rolls and 5 for the last using his final 17 motes. I am considering this a 3-die stunt as well. so dex 2 +craft 5 +craft-air 2 (from hearthstone) +3-die stunt.<br /> <br /> 1st golem: (15d10+3d10) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4567933/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4567933/</a> = 13 +3 sux <br /> 2nd golem: (15d10+3d10) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4567935/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4567935/</a> = 7 +2 sux<br /> 3rd golem: (14d10 +3d10) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4567936/=\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4567936/=</a> 4 +1 sux &gt;&lt; <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T10:59:45-07:00","id":195607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=195500#post195500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Blossom raises an eyebrow and gives her a small smile. &quot;It was my intention to assist you. I said that assisting you wasn't my <i>only</i> reason for coming here, but it was still <i>a</i> reason.&quot; She makes a small dismissing gesture with her hand. &quot;And don't worry about the Vicruith's ability to travel on their own. According to the reports we had before I left Yu-Shan, our target is only about six hundred miles from here. The way I travel, it should only take us about a day, maybe two, to get there, and the same for the trip back. If all goes well, we should be back in plenty of time to assist the Vicruith on their journey.&quot;<br /> <br /> Her expression grows more serious. &quot;I am a little more concerned about keeping you covert, however. You mentioned that subtlety is... not your strongest area. It is my hope to get in and out without the Fae ever realizing we were there. If you can't conceal yourself...&quot; She hesitates for a moment, then shrugs it off with a chuckle. &quot;Wait, what am I saying? You're a Lunar. You can just shapeshift into a mouse or a grasshopper or something, and I'll hide you on my person. That way, I can keep both of us safe and hidden.&quot; She smiles at the obvious solution to the problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I can do one better,&quot; Tirien says. she shifts to a beautiful raptor shape, and hops on Blossom's shoulder.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Peregrine Falcon is the Princess of Birds, beneath the Strix, according to my Sifu's Sifu, and I agree. Also, I'm not that large this way, am I? Plus, I give you a sort of gravitas,&quot; she says, looking this way and that, &quot;Before we leave, I must talk to my subordinate, if that is acceptable. I can;t very well leave on him.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 07-12-2014, 02:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T11:09:24-07:00","id":195613,"title":"","content":"OOC: Wait, what just happened? Did she just walk away from Blossom in the middle of the conversation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T11:20:03-07:00","id":195622,"title":"","content":"Mm, she kinda did. Sorry. I edited my post. I can't leave Dero out in the cold like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-13T00:02:20-07:00","id":196069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=195622#post195622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mm, she kinda did. Sorry. I edited my post. I can't leave Dero out in the cold like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>OOC: Ah, thank you, that makes a little more sense for me.<br /> <br /> IC:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;I can do one better,&quot; Tirien says. she shifts to a beautiful raptor shape, and hops on Blossom's shoulder.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Peregrine Falcon is the Princess of Birds, beneath the Strix, according to my Sifu's Sifu, and I agree. Also, I'm not that large this way, am I? Plus, I give you a sort of gravitas,&quot; she says, looking this way and that, &quot;Before we leave, I must talk to my subordinate, if that is acceptable. I can;t very well leave on him.&quot; </div> </div> </div>&quot;Hmm,&quot; Blossom mutters, considering as she glances at the bird on her shoulder. &quot;Well, I don't know about gravitas, since we're supposed to avoid detection entirely, but you are <i>definitely </i>more manageable at this size. Not as easily manageable as you'd be as a mouse, but we can make do.&quot; She nods her head back towards the others. &quot;Go do what you need to do. I'll wait here for you.&quot; Blossom shrugs her shoulder to launch Tirien off of it, then leans against a tree to wait.<br /> <br /> Blossom waits patiently until Tirien returns, then stands up again, one hand on her hip. &quot;All set then?&quot; she asks rhetorically, continuing on without giving Tirien a chance to reply to the question. &quot;Before we go, I thought you might want to send a message to your circlemates back in Novalesk, letting them know of your success here, or whatever else you'd like to pass on. I can do that for you easily, if you'd like.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T22:10:42-07:00","id":197523,"title":"","content":"(Vykos)<br /> <br /> &quot;Perhaps I can allay your curiosity, then,&quot; Feiro says, &quot;The tome in question mentions that the foundation of the Demon noble's creation of the serf classes is the imbuement of essence into a specific essence pattern. The construction of the demon serfs is simple, resulting from a confluence of certain stimuli, often involving a significant amount of raw essence. Most of the Nobles automatize this process, either producing some form of artifact to perform the requisite work, or granting the serfs some method of reproduction themselves. <br /> <br /> &quot;The more significant part, from a sorcerous standpoint, is recognition of what patterns will produce what effect in the demonic progeny. The Demons know this, seemingly intuitively, and are, as far as has been discovered, unable to communicate effectively any of this knowledge.<br /> <br /> &quot;Bear in mind that these are fractals of the Demon-Titans, motes of primordial entities of immense knowledge, power, and malevolence. They are beings of raw essence, building lesser creatures in their own image. Study of your bio-genesis tablets from an apocryphal pre-human lizard race are infinitely more likely to bear fruit.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T22:32:36-07:00","id":197556,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> <br /> Hyuga speeds through is work on the first golem, but by the second, the script begins to blur together, and he can feel his work becoming less precise. Seeing how fast Hyuga's going, Maia begins assembling the single finished shell using an assembly housing on a wall and a mote of white-hot fire conjured from her own elemental essence. <br /> <br /> Overhearing Jensven and Hyuga's conversation, Maia mentions that there is a government Department (a joint venture between the Capitial government and the Academy) with the expressed purpose of finding demesnes and potential demesnes. They identify those sites, activate the latent demesnes, and then give their recommendation on what should be done with the demesne. Generally its granted back to whatever Gens owned the land to be capped (either because the essence tokens have no real value [as they see it] or because the demesne's effects are dangerous), but sometimes the land is purchased by the Capital to be either developed into a manse for them (the fate of the strongest demsenes) or left as is to be harvested for the Academy. In a handful of other instances, the land was gifted to the Temple. <br /> <br /> Anyway, you should probably speak with them about you war-manse network. <br /> <br /> &quot;The Chancellor is probably busy,&quot; Maia says, &quot;But if you write out a request, I'll deliver it to him for you.&quot; <br /> <br /> Maia says she let you have full run of the artificery; she points out a writing room with some basic technical manuals and writing and diagramming equipment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T22:33:27-07:00","id":197557,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Okay, Dietaku: what did Tirien say to Dero, and will she send a message to her circlemates?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T22:58:58-07:00","id":197578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=196069#post196069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> OOC: Ah, thank you, that makes a little more sense for me.<br /> <br /> IC:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Hmm,&quot; Blossom mutters, considering as she glances at the bird on her shoulder. &quot;Well, I don't know about gravitas, since we're supposed to avoid detection entirely, but you are <i>definitely </i>more manageable at this size. Not as easily manageable as you'd be as a mouse, but we can make do.&quot; She nods her head back towards the others. &quot;Go do what you need to do. I'll wait here for you.&quot; Blossom shrugs her shoulder to launch Tirien off of it, then leans against a tree to wait.<br /> <br /> Blossom waits patiently until Tirien returns, then stands up again, one hand on her hip. &quot;All set then?&quot; she asks rhetorically, continuing on without giving Tirien a chance to reply to the question. &quot;Before we go, I thought you might want to send a message to your circlemates back in Novalesk, letting them know of your success here, or whatever else you'd like to pass on. I can do that for you easily, if you'd like.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Please do. Tell the Twilight Caste named Hyuga in Novalesk I succeeded in recruiting the Geherin, and will be returning after a detour to wrap up a few loose ends, if you please,&quot; she says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T00:03:13-07:00","id":197627,"title":"","content":"OOC: Don't forget to answer the ST's question from the previous post.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=197578#post197578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Please do. Tell the Twilight Caste named Hyuga in Novalesk I succeeded in recruiting the Geherin, and will be returning after a detour to wrap up a few loose ends, if you please,&quot; she says.</div> </div> </div> </div>Blossom nods, takes one last look around to make sure that they are alone, then closes her eyes to focus herself. After a moment, she speaks the words of power and makes the mudra of telecommunication with her left hand, shaping the essence before her to conjure a small cherub. Once the sorcerous construct appears, she whispers in its ear. &quot;You will seek out the Twilight caste solar Hyuga, who should be in Novalesk, and tell him this: 'This message is sent on behalf of the Lunar Tirien. She says that she has succeeded in recruiting the Geherin, and that she will return after a detour to wrap up a few loose ends. The Geherin will be ready to begin their journey in about two weeks.'&quot; The message complete, she waves the infallible messenger on its way before turning back to Tirien.<br /> <br /> &quot;Are you sure you're ready to go? Last chance if you have anything else you need to wrap up.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T16:20:55-07:00","id":198311,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Philosopher once said, 'He who seeks power is most unworthy of it.' It is a sad reality that Exaltation does not come with obligation to use the might it grants well. Yet such is our world, fey and witches may keep their dreamlands.&quot;<br /> <br /> So saying Yi bowed and took his leave. It would soon be time to receive the Boule's decision.<br /> <br /> <i>I am moving too slowly. The world is moving and I alone stay still. This is the temptation of divinity, and I will not sacrifice the reckless haste of human life for such detachment, it is a fool's bargain.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Enough time for another sermon...&quot;<br /> <br /> Somewhat distracted the Zenith began to walk toward the Hall of the Boule.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T18:13:49-07:00","id":198394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=197557#post197557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Okay, Dietaku: what did Tirien say to Dero, and will she send a message to her circlemates?</div> </div> </div> </div>She'll tell Dero to return to Novalesk with the Thunderbird, and to prepare the necessary logistics with Eugene and his grandfather in preparation for the Vicruith's arrival. She'll also tell him that she'll need to leave and perform some duties on her own, and that she doesn't wish for him to get injured, which may happen. She trusts his judgement and knows he can handle this until she returns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T20:48:55-07:00","id":198533,"title":"","content":"Most of the talk of manses and demesnes goes right over Jensven's head, but he makes an attempt to listen and absorb the information as well as he can. He relates the most pertinent of what he has learned from the Crystal in the vault. He isn't trying to display the knowledge in as much as he is trying to voice it and hear it in his own words in order to better understand it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hyuga, we are called Anathema. This isn't a good word. You are called one of 'The Unclean'. I am one of the 'Forsaken'. At least that is what these guys called the Immaculates say about us. I don't really think they are right. We haven't done much to them, but they spread hate and that is a dangerous thing.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We are Chosen of the Sun. You are a crafter, but you could also be a sorceror, a healer, a great teacher. I am a warrior, a champion, a general. I don't know about the general part, but I can definitely get behind the idea of being a guardian. I feel...called to it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T17:29:04-07:00","id":199460,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well I guess Loheim was right... I do need to learn to do the details better... I guess I should only try one hand at a time too.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Damn him always being right. I need to keep working on dexterity and inscriptions. These complicated symbols seem to be helpful in creating great weapons. I will need them in the future.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you Maia. I will make sure to connect with that department and I will write a letter to the chancellor in a bit. I appreciate all your help!&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will then turn to Jensven as he finishes speaking. &quot;Yeah. That immaculate stuff is mostly a bunch of crock to keep them in power. Just ignore it and do what you wanna do. Just don't get caught by the wyld hunt. They can be... annoying... to say the least. But there is no way I would be a sorcerer or a healer. I might eventually teach all my techniques to someone, but I am a smith first and foremost. However, I do recall you being a guardian. You did save my life... well I guess my previous life's life after all. And you were a brilliant fighter. That reminds me... that sword I saw... we should find it. I want to know what kinds of works that were done in the past. It is too bad that it was lost.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga seems to ponder for a while and then turns his attention back to Maia. &quot;That reminds me of something I've heard... Maia would you happen to have a skin of a 9-year cicada, a brass tack or the materials to make one, and 3 and a half yen? If so, it would be GREATLY appreciated.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will then grab a piece of parchment and a quill and start writing in the nicest, most neat, and alluring script he can muster.<br /> &quot;<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">To the wise chancellor of the Academy I ask for permission to peruse the contents of any tomes you may have hidden away that carry secrets to artificery, building manses, and capping and altering demenses. I ask for such things for the betterment of Novalesk and my own curiousity and knowledge. I would be happy to oblige any necessary tasks you deem necessary that I am capable of and am willing to talk to you in more detail if you wish. Thank you.<br /> ~Hyuga the Hands of Citan&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">Hyuga will look over the letter three times making sure that it looked nice enough and tries his best to make it sound official. He will then seal it up and give it to Maia to be delivered to the chancellor. <i>I hope this sounds good enough. I don't want him to think I am just an idiot after all.</i></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T20:42:30-07:00","id":199593,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> Dero seems to take the instructions well, but he seems somewhat uncomfortable that his meal ticket is walking off. Again. Oh well. His sister might have some work for him back in the capital anyway. <br /> <br /> The cherub nods and repeats the message to Blossom for accuracy before disappearing in a flash of multi-colored light. <br /> <br /> Okay. Will you leave now, and if so, to where exactly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T21:06:25-07:00","id":199608,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> <br /> &quot;To be fair to the Immaculates,&quot; Maia says, &quot;we in Novalesk have encountered our share of foul and nasty Anathema in the past. For every Myrinne or Midea in our history there was a Kandros the Reaper or Odal Thousand-Fangs. But then again, I'm the result of improper congress between spirits ad man, so what do I know?&quot;<br /> <br /> Puzzled by the list that Hyuga gives, she retrieves a brass tack, and says, &quot;Theros does some trade in Realm currency, so you should be able to get some from a money-lender, if you don't mind the fee. And my ... foster brother collected insects. He might have kept a cicada skin. I'll see if I can find his old collection.&quot; Her eye becomes watery towards the end there. She takes the letter form Hyuga, and heads off to deliver it. <br /> <br /> Okay. What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T21:12:43-07:00","id":199611,"title":"","content":"&quot;There will always be nasty people with power. That is a given. In fact, I fought one myself when I exalted. I have no quarrel with those facts. The problem is they are bigoted and make it seem like ALL anathema are bad. I just don't think that is very fair.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hyuga will take the brass tack and say, &quot;Thank you. I will make the trade for the coins and I appreciate you going to get the cicada skin. Would you like me to help you with anything else? I could go with you if you wish.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T22:44:24-07:00","id":199700,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> Argyrus grins wryly, revealing rows of slab-like marble teeth. <br /> <br /> As Yi heads towards the Hall of the Boule, he notes many odd glances and whispered words. Word is clearly spreading through the city about him. <br /> <br /> Provided he enters the Hall:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yi enters the hall, and is met with the same guards as before, and the same command to leave his weapon.<br /> <br /> Assuming he leaves his weapon like before:<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The hall fills up, much faster and fuller than yesterday. The Pyrtanneis appears with the same entry method and before and opens proceedings with the same benediction. Oddly enough though, he gets straight to business this time.<br /> <br /> &quot;The First order of business today is the petition fielded to the Gentes by Lady Larissa, Strategos Eugene and Guest yesterday. Gens Spyrus and Gens Ptreas have already answered in support of this petition. Gentes Nikoloi, Midea, Zophyrus, and Althea. please send up a representative to give your answers.<br /> <br /> The representative from Midea, a short, middle-aged woman, rises first, and answers that Gens Midea will offer all troops currently stationed in the city to the Strategos.<br /> <br /> Next is the representative for Althea, who claims that they have already moved all of their house troops to Vera (its city, and the city closest to the Fae army) and will send a message to place them at the command of Strategos Vasil<br /> <br /> After that is the representative for Nikoloi, who offers three maniples for the Capital. they are quickly followed by Zophyrus who seems to mirror Nikoloi's offer of three maniples.</div></div> </div> </div></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Will Yi stay, and if so, do you want a run down of all of the subsequent orders of business?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T11:35:18-07:00","id":200281,"title":"","content":"Yi exhaled softly, the closest he could get to a sigh in these circumstances. He decided to stay to better learn the state of the nation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T14:02:39-07:00","id":200392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=199593#post199593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin)<br /> Dero seems to take the instructions well, but he seems somewhat uncomfortable that his meal ticket is walking off. Again. Oh well. His sister might have some work for him back in the capital anyway.<br /> <br /> The cherub nods and repeats the message to Blossom for accuracy before disappearing in a flash of multi-colored light.<br /> <br /> Okay. Will you leave now, and if so, to where exactly?</div> </div> </div> </div>OOC: Is Tirien all finished then? I don;t want to jump ahead if she's not ready.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T20:16:18-07:00","id":200672,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yeah, we should talk to those guys, but that sounds like an awful heap of work.&quot; The Ascending Sun scratches at Shadow while lost in thought for a moment. He then jumps up in excitement. &quot;I think I have it! What about a suit of armor or a shield that creates a small area that the Fae have a hard time doing their weird magic in?&quot; He starts to pace around the room as he relates the idea almost as soon as it forms in his mind. &quot;It's mobile as long as the bearer is, it's not as hard to manufacture as these 'manses', and it's kinda, sorta something I can wrap my head around right now. What do you think?&quot;<br /> <br /> Jensven stops and snaps his fingers, &quot;I am not able to make artifacts, though. That stops this plan in it's tracks. It's a good idea, though.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T21:22:11-07:00","id":200702,"title":"","content":"With a disappointed look n his eyes Vykos finds a seat in the chancellor's office.<br /> <br /> &quot; Well that is the problem chancellor I have studied all I can from the dragon-king artifacts that the academy possess. Normally I would begin experimenting but the tools necessary to do so are extremely rare and thus far I have not been able to locate any, the remaining option would be to have them built but all the technicians are busy building an arsenal of talisman. I believe that my work will be of help in this conflict I already know that plant modifications will help protect crops from insect and diseases as well as accelerating growth and harvest or to create new kinds to suit our needs modifications to animal and even mortals are quite possible and countless other possibilities are also possibles in theory.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 07-18-2014, 12:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T22:54:16-07:00","id":200756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=200392#post200392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> OOC: Is Tirien all finished then? I don;t want to jump ahead if she's not ready.</div> </div> </div> </div>She's good. Lead the way, Blossom!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T08:57:48-07:00","id":201192,"title":"","content":"OOC: OK then.<br /> <br /> IC:<br /> <br /> Blossom waves for Tirien to follow her further into the forest, walking silently with the Lunar for about 20 minutes until she is sure they are alone. She takes one last careful look around, then adopts a look of concentration. She speaks softly in Old Realm, whispering the words of power as her hands move in front of her in arcane gestures. As her arms trace their way through the air, water vapor begins to gather around them, swirling before her. It slowly collects in a thick, white fog, which is in turn lit bright green by her glowing caste mark. She continues drawing in more little puffs and wisps of vapor until the clearing around the two exalts is filled with eerily green glowing fog. She pauses, surveying it for a moment, then clears her throat with annoyance and snaps her fingers. Obediently, the fog pulls in on itself, condensing until it forms a good sized, thick puffy cloud right in front of her, still tinted green by the anima of secrets. She looks at the cloud with dissatisfaction, and clears her throat loudly again. The cloud shifts slightly, forming a few steps at the back, and a pair of big, puffy chairs on top. Finally giving a small smile of satisfaction, she walks up the steps, settling into the right side chair and gesturing for Tirien to join her.<br /> <br /> [Assuming that Tirien joins her]<br /> <br /> The cloud stairs wisp away into vapor as soon as Tirien climbs each step, until from the bottom and sides it is indistinguishable from a normal puffy white cloud, especially in the dark. Once Tirien is seated in the soft, comfortable cloud chair, Blossom mentally commands the cloud to rise, shooting straight up into the air until they reach an appropriate cruising altitude. &quot;The Puissant Amethyst Court is operating out of a chancerel on the front lines,&quot; she tells Tirien. &quot;That's kind of like a mobile freehold, sort of,&quot; Blossom explains, looking around at the stars as she speaks. &quot;We'll need to find the exact location, but I can get us close, and it shouldn't be too hard to locate once we get near it. We'll go full speed at first,&quot; she continues, still studying the stars as puffy white seat belts encircle her and Tirien's waists, &quot;then slow down when we get closer so we can stay covert.&quot; She silently studies the stars for a moment, then nods in satisfaction. &quot;We need to start by heading North,&quot; she says, confidently pointing in a direction that Tirien knows to be Southeast.<br /> <br /> OOC:<br /> <br /> In case it wasn't obvious, she just cast Cirrus Skiff using peripheral essence. Noodle, does the above count as a stunt? Obviously no roll is necessary, I just ask for the purposes of essence and willpower recovery. Well, really just willpower- the trip will be long enough that her essence will be replenished anyway by the time they get there, I think.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm assuming that we're supposed to go north. Your message said they were on the court's southern battlefront, as I recall, and I assumed that the court's southern flank was north of us. If I misinterpreted, please let me know so I can correct the post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T21:52:03-07:00","id":203494,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm fine&quot;, Maia says while leaving, &quot;but thank you for you offer.&quot;<br /> <br /> After hearing Jensven's suggestion, a sphere of fire hovers out of the furnace. A face shapes itself in the flames, consisting of a trio of narrow shadows in the place of eyes, and what could very well be a grin of long fiery fangs. The face opens it's maw and says in a heavy voice, &quot;YES, SUCH A WORK IS POSSIBLE. FRET NOT FOR YOUR INABILITY, HUMAN. RELEASE ME FROM THIS PRISON, AND THAT SHALL BE BUT THE FIRST OF A THOUSAND-THOUSAND GIFTS I CAN BESTOW UPON THEE.&quot;<br /> <br /> After a pause of several beats, the face begins laughing, and says in a crackling, snapping voice, &quot;Ah, the looks on your faces. Priceless.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T22:50:03-07:00","id":203543,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> Eugene takes the floor with a party of other individuals and thanks the Gentes for their generosity. Nereus, Gens Spyrus' high elder, reports that the city's foundry complex has returned to full operation, and, with the assistance of Gens Ptreas, the facility has been secured against a secondary attack. A third member of his party, a tall, swarthy man with a garish fashion sense reports that the First Nautikon is prepared to defend the southern and Western borders, and that a single vessel has been dedicated to moving reinforcements and resupply to the front. <br /> <br /> Issues move on from there. A previously proposed economic stimulus package is tabled until the cessation of hostilities. Another previous issue, of an open trade agreement with Theros, is brought to vote, losing by a margin of six votes. The Academy reports that, while the shift in production to military goods has helped somewhat, the influx of raw materials for their alchemy labs have slowed to a trickle due to the fighting, drastically reducing their potential supply production. <br /> <br /> Gens Midea reports that one of their townships near the Ordoni border was sacked yesterday. The Ordoni ambassador denies responsibility, saying it was likely the actions of the Fae marauders. If only the Novelskis had rescinded their draconian policies towards Ordoni expansion, this might not have happened. This gets a rise from the Therian ambassador, who takes significant offense at the Ordoni's suggestion that it is Novalesk that keeps them in check. Eventually Linon is able to get them apart and to keep them from blow. He ends the session a bit early, likely in mind to prevent an international incident from occurring. <br /> <br /> The council is over. What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T23:03:33-07:00","id":203556,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> OOC: That's a nice two-die. <br /> <br /> IC: Blossom and Tirien fly through the night, heading north. After little less than an hour, the heavy forest breaks up into rolling hills. A large beast appears to swoop at you, later revealed to have been a hawk-faced dragon who was merely investigating goings on. After a sincerely offered apology, it offer to guide you to your destination. After a total of seven or so hours of travel, dawn is breaking, and the dragon informs you that the barbarian horde is twenty miles or so to your north. A large copse of trees seems to offer a ready place to rest after a night of travel; it may be easier to sneak past the barbarians under cover of night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T13:30:06-07:00","id":204168,"title":"","content":"OOC: Thanks for the compliment on my stunt. :-) Also, a dragon? As in, an elemental?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T13:31:45-07:00","id":204174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204168#post204168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OOC: Thanks for the compliment on my stunt. :-) Also, a dragon? As in, an elemental?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is true facts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T14:59:25-07:00","id":204279,"title":"","content":"Using her falcon sight, Tirien will scan the surrounding landscape for anything suspicious. Do I need to roll to do so?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T15:04:20-07:00","id":204287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204279#post204279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Using her falcon sight, Tirien will scan the surrounding landscape for anything suspicious. Do I need to roll to do so?</div> </div> </div> </div>Roll Perception + Awareness, with a +2 circumstantial modifier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T15:14:16-07:00","id":204297,"title":"","content":"Tirien looks as hard as she can in all directions, and gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4579613/\" target=\"_blank\"> 2 suxx</a> on her Perc+Awareness roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T17:27:02-07:00","id":204425,"title":"","content":"Hyuga turns to look at Jensven and pulls the charm he bought from Orchid. He fingers it a little &quot;That would be quite useful. I have heard of many Lunars doing something similar and have heard of Solars doing the same in the high-first age before the fall. Maybe I should work on something similar to this. It would take a bit of time though. Hmm... perhaps I should grab some writing paper and tools.&quot; <br /> <br /> Hyuga will turn to grab the tools that Maia had indicated before seeing the great flaming ball in the air talking to them. &quot;Well this is kind of annoying.&quot; Hyuga will look for some heat gloves and try to grab it from the center of the room and move it to the furnace and shut the grate.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now lets get working on this design... first we need to use cold iron. I have a feeling that we will need a book that will show me how to script some old realm as well. I suppose I should learn it soon enough anyway. I am trying to think of what components might be needed for it. I have a feeling that moonsilver and maybe some orichalcum would be involved. Perhaps I would need to need something to stop them from advancing. Perhaps dreams to distract them. First we should work on the design though Jensven. We have a lot of work ahead of us. I am going to need you to find some cold iron. I need to take a rest first though. I have been working for quite a while.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T18:00:12-07:00","id":204485,"title":"","content":"As the meeting adjourned Yi made his way to the ambassador of Ordon.<br /> <br /> &quot;In lak'ech noble one. You would do me honor to grant a moment of your time.&quot; He made the anjali mudra before his heart in greeting.<br /> <br /> <i>Eugene is going to be angry at me for this...</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Om mani Autochthon, the blessing of the Maker be on you and your people. I would discuss the needs of your nation so that prosperity and harmony might be increased.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T14:19:03-07:00","id":205334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=200702#post200702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With a disappointed look n his eyes Vykos finds a seat in the chancellor's office.<br /> <br /> &quot; Well that is the problem chancellor I have studied all I can from the dragon-king artifacts that the academy possess. Normally I would begin experimenting but the tools necessary to do so are extremely rare and thus far I have not been able to locate any, the remaining option would be to have them built but all the technicians are busy building an arsenal of talisman. I believe that my work will be of help in this conflict I already know that plant modifications will help protect crops from insect and diseases as well as accelerating growth and harvest or to create new kinds to suit our needs modifications to animal and even mortals are quite possible and countless other possibilities are also possibles in theory.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>[[Sorry, forgot about this one. ]]<br /> <br /> The Chancellor removes a stack of papers, from his desk, and casks the Incantation of Effective Restoration on it, restoring them to the complete tome from the Library. Opening the tome, he leafs through it for a few moments, before grabbing the last quarter or so pages and tearing them from the book with a sharp tug. <br /> <br /> &quot;This may offer you the information you desire. You will not, however, summon one of the Demon nobles in this city without my expressed consent. Agreed?&quot; he slides the tome towards Vykos, but leaves his hand atop the book for the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T14:25:24-07:00","id":205339,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> <br /> As Hyuga grapples the sphere and attempts to shove it back into the furnace, it shrieks, &quot;I am the god of this forge, and I will not tolerate this! A pox upon you! A pox upon your family! A POX UPON YOUR COOOWWWW.&quot;<br /> <br /> Will you continue your attempt, given this new information?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T14:39:07-07:00","id":205347,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;I accept your blessings, Outlander,&quot; the Ordoni ambassador, a short, pale individual with blackened gauze over his eyes, says with a nod, &quot;But I am unfamiliar with this 'Autochthon' of whom you speak. Are they your god? Or perhaps it is a place name. Or your own?&quot; He appears somewhat puzzled. <br /> <br /> &quot;The Glorious Free City of Ordon always looks to increase its prosperity. But first, whom do you represent, and by what authority do you come to me?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T14:47:43-07:00","id":205356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204297#post204297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien looks as hard as she can in all directions, and gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4579613/\" target=\"_blank\"> 2 suxx</a> on her Perc+Awareness roll.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tirien's falcon eyes note a small horse riding band, some ways to the east. Perhaps, seven or eight miles out? They appear to be heading south. Other than that, there is rolling hills, a few seemingly random copses like the one you are above now, and a large lake some miles to your west.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T15:38:47-07:00","id":205405,"title":"","content":"As he heard that sphere talk, Hyuga pauses a moment. &quot;You mean you are not one of those pesky demons from hell? Rather strange introduction then if not. What is it that you are looking for exactly?&quot; <br /> <br /> [OOC: I will hold off on gathering supplies and such from the previous post.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T16:54:14-07:00","id":205442,"title":"","content":"Tirien will communicate this information to Blossom, and ask for her input.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T19:14:08-07:00","id":205519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=205347#post205347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;I accept your blessings, Outlander,&quot; the Ordoni ambassador, a short, pale individual with blackened gauze over his eyes, says with a nod, &quot;But I am unfamiliar with this 'Autochthon' of whom you speak. Are they your god? Or perhaps it is a place name. Or your own?&quot; He appears somewhat puzzled.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Glorious Free City of Ordon always looks to increase its prosperity. But first, whom do you represent, and by what authority do you come to me?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;According the the Roll of Glorious Divinity, Autochthon is brother to Gaia, the living world; King of All Craftsmen and the Great Maker. It seemed auspicious to invoke so worthy a patron as one would invoke the Dragons before a Terrestrial Exalted.<br /> <br /> As for the authority behind me, it is only my own as Prince of the Earth and the affirmation of the King of Heaven who chose me. I speak for myself only, may Sol grant that so little is worthy of your attention.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T20:42:03-07:00","id":205603,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> <br /> &quot;What!?! You mistook I, kin of the Great Garda, for one of the Denizens of the Demon City?!?&quot; the spirit says, &quot;A pox upon your cow! Wait. I said that already. TWO POXES UPON YOUR COW!&quot;<br /> <br /> The spirit calms down and says, &quot;I'm lonely! No-one ever talks to me. They're all 'You're a Need Flame. The only purpose to your existence is to keep the furnaces lit. Blegh Blegh Blegh'. But I can help with your artifact shield. Thingy.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 07-22-2014, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T20:54:29-07:00","id":205623,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;So Autochthon is an avatar of the Engineer? That would be appropriate, I suppose,&quot; The Ambassador says, &quot;Though we in Ordon do not accept the authority of the Heavens or of gods. You may speak, but without power temporal or fiscal, there is little you can offer us.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T08:27:04-07:00","id":206130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=205334#post205334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> [[Sorry, forgot about this one. ]]<br /> <br /> The Chancellor removes a stack of papers, from his desk, and casks the Incantation of Effective Restoration on it, restoring them to the complete tome from the Library. Opening the tome, he leafs through it for a few moments, before grabbing the last quarter or so pages and tearing them from the book with a sharp tug.<br /> <br /> &quot;This may offer you the information you desire. You will not, however, summon one of the Demon nobles in this city without my expressed consent. Agreed?&quot; he slides the tome towards Vykos, but leaves his hand atop the book for the moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vykos is pleased to see the chancellor prepare the book for him and it reminds him to keep studying sorcery there are many spells could be useful, but it still a bit disappointing to see him rip the pages off, but he still had part of the book, let's just hope it hold information he needs.<br /> <br /> &quot; Of course it was never my intention to summon one the only thing I wanted was to communicate with one, there are alternate ways to communicate with demons beside summoning them. Still I give my word chancellor that I will not attempt to summon one. Still I'm still uncertain of the path my work will take me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 07-24-2014, 11:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T08:28:23-07:00","id":206131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=205442#post205442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien will communicate this information to Blossom, and ask for her input.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Well,&quot; Blossom replies, squinting off in the distance to try to catch sight of the aforementioned horsemen, &quot;we are near the front, so I suppose all of that is to be expected. I think it would be best if we took the opportunity to rest. It's been a long night of traveling, and it would be best if we were refreshed before we try to enter. Given the nature of the place, I'm not sure how long we're going to be inside. I don't want to...&quot; Blossom hesitates a moment, then obviously changes what she was about to say. &quot;It can be dangerous to sleep in such places. That copse beneath us should provide adequate shelter for the day.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Unless you wanted to investigate those riders first?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T08:59:17-07:00","id":206183,"title":"","content":"&quot;No, I'm fine. It would be better to investigate with rest rather than later. Besides, we've accomplished much today anyways,&quot; Tirien says,&quot; I agree, too. Those copses ought to provide us a degree of stealth, even here on the front,&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T09:08:52-07:00","id":206195,"title":"","content":"Jensven regards the need flame for a moment in silent contemplation. Shadow tenses, but remains silent, his vision laser focused on the ball of flame.<br /> <br /> &quot;Kin of Garda was it? I doubt Hyuga owns one of these 'cow' creatures. It doesn't do much good to put a pox on something he doesn't own. I, however...&quot; He indicates Shadow. &quot;...have a dog. He doesn't seem too happy with you. I think you may have been a bit loud for him. I doubt he would actually attack, but you can't be too careful.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now that we are done throwing around curses and whining like clingy, smitten maidens how do you believe you can be of assistance to us?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T09:26:41-07:00","id":206206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=206183#post206183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;No, I'm fine. It would be better to investigate with rest rather than later. Besides, we've accomplished much today anyways,&quot; Tirien says,&quot; I agree, too. Those copses ought to provide us a degree of stealth, even here on the front,&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Blossom nods, and without further ado brings the cirrus skiff down into the copse of trees as stealthily as she can, looking around for observers, lowering the cloud gradually and making sure to keep the copse itself between the skiff and the riders whenever possible, minimizing the chances of detection. Once the Sidereal and the Lunar are on the ground, she dismisses the spell, letting the cloudy skiff puff away. She hesitates a moment, then looks over to Tirien. &quot;You... undoubtedly have more experience at the whole... wilderness thing... than I do. What should we do to keep ourselves safe while we sleep?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":". 07-23-2014, 12:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T14:52:50-07:00","id":206578,"title":"","content":"&quot;We need to find a place downwind, somewhere with foliage or landmass enough to hide us, but also not depressed enough to be a drainage area. This can be somewhat hard,&quot; Tirien says, looking for a suitable area nearby.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T16:50:37-07:00","id":206682,"title":"","content":"&quot;No, I suppose I do not have such power, I am too young in years and strength. Yet I will not be young forever. There will come a day when I shall be in skill and surety like they who made the Singing Staves and the Soulbreaker Orbs.&quot; <br /> <br /> While he was speaking a stone block rose from the floor into the air before him. It hovered for a moment before silently bursting into a array of pins, braces, gears, even chains of interlocking links.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Jade Obelisks which hold back the tides of the Wyld, the War Manses which compose the Realm Defense Grid, the Dam of Days, the Glass Towers of Chiaroscuro; such as me raised such as those. The Craftsmen who need no tools are returned to the world.&quot;<br /> <br /> The pieces before him began to assemble and turn. Teeth found teeth, pegs found holes, chains wound about axles, and so forth. A great ring of interlocked segments and marked with the Glyph of the Sun stood from the flat top and a stone weight hung from its bottom.<br /> <br /> &quot;No doubt there are many who would see me and my like dead before we ripen to such puissance. We are both smart enough to know that is a fool's errand, futile and wasteful when no one can afford loss. The Solars are returned, the world is changing, and this Age is ending for good or ill. I want to help you and yours, to magnify your power and glory and prosperity so you may have a place of abundance and majesty in the future that is even now unfolding..&quot;<br /> <br /> Only the slow ticking of the mechanism in his hand filled the silence when he finished.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Craftsman Needs No Tools to construct a very simple clock. A pendulum clock only needs something like 4 gears and a simple gimbal will account for minor jolts. This is a stunt for a persuasion roll I plan to make.<br /> <br /> I would appreciate the knowing the stunt bonuses for mote recovery.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T04:37:14-07:00","id":206917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=206578#post206578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;We need to find a place downwind, somewhere with foliage or landmass enough to hide us, but also not depressed enough to be a drainage area. This can be somewhat hard,&amp;quot; Tirien says, looking for a suitable area nearby.</div> </div> </div> </div>Blossom shrugs and follows the lunar's lead, feeling slightly out of sorts conversing with and following a bird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T11:23:12-07:00","id":209431,"title":"","content":"(Vykos)<br /> <br /> The Chancellor nods, &quot;Good. See to it that you remember that. Now, if that is all, I have pressing matters to attend to.&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T11:50:21-07:00","id":209446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=206195#post206195\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jensven regards the need flame for a moment in silent contemplation. Shadow tenses, but remains silent, his vision laser focused on the ball of flame.<br /> <br /> &quot;Kin of Garda was it? I doubt Hyuga owns one of these 'cow' creatures. It doesn't do much good to put a pox on something he doesn't own. I, however...&quot; He indicates Shadow. &quot;...have a dog. He doesn't seem too happy with you. I think you may have been a bit loud for him. I doubt he would actually attack, but you can't be too careful.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now that we are done throwing around curses and whining like clingy, smitten maidens how do you believe you can be of assistance to us?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Didn't I already say that I was a forge god?&quot; the spirit says, impetuously. It pauses for a moment before amending, &quot;Okay, I'm not actually the forge god. But I do all of his work since he spends all of his time hitting on the female artificers, getting drunk, and then hitting on all of the artificers. I might as well be the forge god.<br /> <br /> &quot;Regardless, I can bless your enterprise, and if you tried to shove all the information I have about artificing into your heads, it would probably melt your brains.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 07-26-2014, 02:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T12:03:19-07:00","id":209451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=206682#post206682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;No, I suppose I do not have such power, I am too young in years and strength. Yet I will not be young forever. There will come a day when I shall be in skill and surety like they who made the Singing Staves and the Soulbreaker Orbs.&quot;<br /> <br /> While he was speaking a stone block rose from the floor into the air before him. It hovered for a moment before silently bursting into a array of pins, braces, gears, even chains of interlocking links.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Jade Obelisks which hold back the tides of the Wyld, the War Manses which compose the Realm Defense Grid, the Dam of Days, the Glass Towers of Chiaroscuro; such as me raised such as those. The Craftsmen who need no tools are returned to the world.&quot;<br /> <br /> The pieces before him began to assemble and turn. Teeth found teeth, pegs found holes, chains wound about axles, and so forth. A great ring of interlocked segments and marked with the Glyph of the Sun stood from the flat top and a stone weight hung from its bottom.<br /> <br /> &quot;No doubt there are many who would see me and my like dead before we ripen to such puissance. We are both smart enough to know that is a fool's errand, futile and wasteful when no one can afford loss. The Solars are returned, the world is changing, and this Age is ending for good or ill. I want to help you and yours, to magnify your power and glory and prosperity so you may have a place of abundance and majesty in the future that is even now unfolding..&quot;<br /> <br /> Only the slow ticking of the mechanism in his hand filled the silence when he finished.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Craftsman Needs No Tools to construct a very simple clock. A pendulum clock only needs something like 4 gears and a simple gimbal will account for minor jolts. This is a stunt for a persuasion roll I plan to make.<br /> <br /> I would appreciate the knowing the stunt bonuses for mote recovery.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You are a <i>Solar?</i>&quot; the Ambassador exclaims, &quot;Then I am putting my soul at risk even SPEAKING with you, vilest of monsters. Should you speak with any from Ordon ever again, you will be slain immediately. Unless, of course, you agree to be bound, mouth and hand, and taken to Ordon to repent for your sins in the Trials. Though, I am required by Law to inform you that no one, including at least two Solars, have survived the Trials.&quot;<br /> <br /> He pauses, clearly waiting for whether or not you will agree to take part in these trials.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T12:09:28-07:00","id":209454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=206578#post206578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;We need to find a place downwind, somewhere with foliage or landmass enough to hide us, but also not depressed enough to be a drainage area. This can be somewhat hard,&quot; Tirien says, looking for a suitable area nearby.</div> </div> </div> </div>As I said earlier, there is a copse that is a serviceable resting place; I took these conditions into account already. <br /> <br /> Provided you rest there:<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Your day is uneventful, with the trees providing you with plenty of shade and the ability to rest and sleep with ease. It is now Dusk, and you can roll to regain lost WP.<br /> <br /> Also, a quick examination of the surroundings by the Lunar, shows that the riders are long gone.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T14:08:49-07:00","id":209518,"title":"","content":"Internally Yi sighed. He as getting good at that.<br /> <br /> &quot;What in particular do they entail and why are they necessary? Specifically, are they sins committed by me personally, by solar exalted, by anathema, or by some yet larger group and are they sins we have commuted upon ourselves, on each other, or on others? Or being used exclusively of course.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T14:33:04-07:00","id":209529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=209518#post209518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Internally Yi sighed. He as getting good at that.<br /> <br /> &quot;What in particular do they entail and why are they necessary? Specifically, are they sins committed by me personally, by solar exalted, by anathema, or by some yet larger group and are they sins we have commuted upon ourselves, on each other, or on others? Or being used exclusively of course.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;They are sins inherent to your nature as a Solar. I cannot tell you more, nor can I tell you what the trials entail, lest you use that knowledge against us of Ordon.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T14:37:32-07:00","id":209535,"title":"","content":"Yi was silent for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;I was raised to believe such as me were demons, though I believe it no longer. Even so, I have seen things of the fallen age that lead me to believe that mighty crimes have been committed by those who should have known better.<br /> <br /> I will accompany you to face these trials, though I ask a little time to set some affairs in order.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>And to rig this game in my favor.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T19:59:09-07:00","id":209759,"title":"","content":"<i>As if other people don't have pressing matters to attend to I AM TRYING TO FIND A WAY TO HELP US WIN YOU OLD FART !!! (Inner voice)</i><br /> <br /> Vykos heads back to his lab with the book his mind burning under the amount of thinking going on in there, he does not even notice when he bumps into someone he just keep on walking.<br /> <br /> <i>They are too weak to see the danger or to put their squabbling aside to fight the enemy if the fairfolks break through here they will overrun other nations before Lookshy or the Realm can mobilize to stop them. Actions needs to be taken and mortals cannot keep order, peace or properly focus on the threat because of their selfishness and the cause is their individuality... wait if this individuality is taken away order and advancement will reign. No war, no petty conflicts over every little things. Getting rid of this individuality will be tricky they are all too fond of it. No it would take a new ...race... </i><br /> <br /> And at that moment Vykos mind cleared itself of any doubt and fear and all the information he took in clicked together to form a plan and a bold one a that. If humanity could not step up to the task they will be replaced by something that can and he will make the replacements but first things first. As he enters his lab he calls the two demons to appear.<br /> <br /> &quot; Erdus I need you to sing so that nobody outside the lab can hear what I am about to say please.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the blood-Ape begins to sing Vykos turn his attention towards the Methody<br /> <br /> &quot; You are a loudmouth but I kinda like that about you but now I need you to be quiet and listen carefully to what I am about to say and it must not be spoken of outside this lab in creation understood ? Now Methody I have a plan and I need your help to accomplish it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Vykos explains his plan to the methody in great details.<br /> <br /> &quot;So do you think someone in hell will help me ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 07-26-2014, 11:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T17:20:27-07:00","id":210658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=209535#post209535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yi was silent for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;I was raised to believe such as me were demons, though I believe it no longer. Even so, I have seen things of the fallen age that lead me to believe that mighty crimes have been committed by those who should have known better.<br /> <br /> I will accompany you to face these trials, though I ask a little time to set some affairs in order.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>And to rig this game in my favor.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I know better than to trust your kind. My threat stands. If you ever speak to an Ordon again, save to take the Trials, you die.&quot; the Ambassador states bluntly. With that, he leaves, his bodyguard glaring at you for a moment before following.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T18:00:42-07:00","id":210680,"title":"","content":"(Vykos)<br /> <br /> The metody retrieves its book and dictates &quot;The Solar truly is a dumbass. Rather than speak to, oh I don't don't know, its bound Citizen, it asks me about the Demon City. Yeah, like I know everything about all demons in existence. Anyways, the dumbass doesn't know that there are dozens of Peers and Unquestionables that will help him with his stupid quest, especially the Progeny of the Pyre. Hope it doesn't render me down into Chalcanth.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T13:13:01-07:00","id":211593,"title":"","content":"&quot;Unless you want to be referred to as 'Kin' for the rest of the time we work with you, I suggest you come up with a new name.&quot; Jensven pats Shadow, who instantly calms down. &quot;I'm quite literal with what I name things. Like Shadow here. He is called that because he is always like my shadow, following me around everywhere.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;As far as the work goes, I can hammer metal into just about any shape you want, and I do it well. Almost better than anyone I have seen.&quot; He will gesture to Hyuga. &quot;Here is the one that can do it better. He is also the one you would like to talk to for artifact work. I might be able to do it with the right directions, though.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 07-28-2014, 08:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T13:16:01-07:00","id":211595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=209454#post209454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As I said earlier, there is a copse that is a serviceable resting place; I took these conditions into account already.<br /> <br /> Provided you rest there:<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Your day is uneventful, with the trees providing you with plenty of shade and the ability to rest and sleep with ease. It is now Dusk, and you can roll to regain lost WP.<br /> <br /> Also, a quick examination of the surroundings by the Lunar, shows that the riders are long gone.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Tirien will rest there in Marsupial Lion form, and then, during the morning, resume her Falcon shape and look around once more. What do I see?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T18:25:55-07:00","id":213009,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Roll for the Nightmares flaw resulted in a 1. So, Blossom's sleep is wracked with nightmares, and she does not recover willpower. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4588913/\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a> Given their proximity to the Fae and the circumstances, Noodle, do you want to use the nightmare for something specific, or should it just be one of her usual variety? Just PM me with whatever you'd like.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> When Tirien awakes, the first thing she sees is Righteous Blossom. The Sidereal's clothes are soaked through with sweat, and her exposed skin is covered with scrapes and abrasions from violently tossing and turning on the ground during the night. She's still thrashing, muttering to herself fearfully as tears leak from beneath her eyelids. She's still asleep, and obviously having a horrific nightmare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":". 07-29-2014, 09:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T17:57:08-07:00","id":214125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=211593#post211593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Unless you want to be referred to as 'Kin' for the rest of the time we work with you, I suggest you come up with a new name.&quot; Jensven pats Shadow, who instantly calms down. &quot;I'm quite literal with what I name things. Like Shadow here. He is called that because he is always like my shadow, following me around everywhere.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;As far as the work goes, I can hammer metal into just about any shape you want, and I do it well. Almost better than anyone I have seen.&quot; He will gesture to Hyuga. &quot;Here is the one that can do it better. He is also the one you would like to talk to for artifact work. I might be able to do it with the right directions, though.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;<b>I am the Flame that Devours Cities; I am He Who Burns Eternal; I am the Thundering Magma!&quot; </b>the tiny fire-spirit says, &quot;Though most people just call me Cinder.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T18:05:54-07:00","id":214132,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> Surveying the surroundings, Tirien notes a small group, of perhaps six or seven individuals, has set up a camp some ways north of your position. Perhaps they are barbarian scouts, watching for attack on the horde's southern flank?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T18:21:46-07:00","id":214147,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well then Cinder. It looks like you do have some qualifications, but so do I. What is it that you could help with? Do you have secrets on what is needed to create such an artifact to hold wyld magics at bay? I can certainly craft them myself. What do you have to offer and what would you require in return?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":".  Can't forget the almighty quotation marks! 07-30-2014, 11:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T18:33:30-07:00","id":214176,"title":"","content":"Tirien will poke Blossom to ensure she's not possessed by some spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T16:26:37-07:00","id":217030,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CitanHyuga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=214147#post214147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Well then Cinder. It looks like you do have some qualifications, but so do I. What is it that you could help with? Do you have secrets on what is needed to create such an artifact to hold wyld magics at bay? I can certainly craft them myself. What do you have to offer and what would you require in return?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I am a magnanimous god, &quot; the flame-spirit says, its tone haughty, &quot;I require no payment to perform my duties. Though,&quot; it says in a conspiratorial whisper, &quot;a good word to Origenes to actually get me this job would be nice.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyways, your ward-shield? Depends on what type of effect you want. If you want an field that actively opposes and counters effects, start with eleven parts gossamer, add two parts moonsilver and one part Starmetal. Mix with a Grace artifact of some kind, the more potent the better. Heat at 4000 for twelve hours, flipping occasionally. Revolve from heat and allow to cool, soaking with Wyld or Lunar essence to taste. Repeat until Wyld and or Lunar essence has soaked through.<br /> <br /> &quot;If you want a simple impervious field that just shuts it down, start with ten parts reduced purified Iron, three parts Jade, white, and one part Orichalcum. Mix with solidified Earth Essence, one again, the more potent, the better. Heat at 5000, for eight hours, flipping ever hour. Once it has reached temperature, bombard with a mix of three parts Earth essence , one part Solar essence until it has reached room temperature. Repeat until saturated with Solar-reinforced Earth essence.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 08-02-2014, 07:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T19:43:53-07:00","id":217820,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, most of that just didn't make sense to me. About the only thing I understood was Solar and Lunar Essence. You have Solar essence standing right here, so we have a ready supply of that. I have yet to actually meet our Lunar friend, so we might have to wait on that if we were to go that route,&quot; Jensven muses.<br /> <br /> Shadow releases a puppy yawn mixed with a whine, as he stretches and curls up on the floor. Jensven looks over to the dog, &quot;Bored, huh? Well, I'm fascinated.&quot; He kneels down and scratches at the dog's ears. &quot;Listen, Cinder. I appreciate the help. I will call on you to help out later, but I think I've had a full day. I will have this guy run around for a bit and then get some sleep. After I have had some time to study in the library tomorrow, I will come here and chat with you again concerning this defensive artifact. What do you say?&quot;<br /> <br /> After a moment he adds, &quot;I think Hyuga mentioned the need for rest as well.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T21:42:46-07:00","id":217878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=214176#post214176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien will poke Blossom to ensure she's not possessed by some spirit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Blossom gasps loudly, her eyes flying open as Tirien touches her. She looks around wildly, seemingly panicked, then slowly starts to calm down, breathing heavily. &quot;I... I'm sorry,&quot; she says, between deep breaths. &quot;I get... night terrors, sometimes.&quot; She levers herself into a seated position, still shaking slightly and breathing heavily. &quot;Thank you for waking me.&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC: One day, you're going to have to tell me how poking someone is diagnostic of spiritual possession. :-P Also, I took the liberty of making the assumption that Tirien was in a human form when poking Blossom; she would have reacted very differently to being poked awake by a marsupial lion, which would have resulted in screaming, or a falcon, which would have resulted in swatting. ;-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T18:45:42-07:00","id":218648,"title":"","content":"(Artificery)<br /> <br /> &quot;Truly, I am as patient as I am magnanimous,&quot; Cinder says, &quot;I shall await your return.&quot;<br /> <br /> Want to move on to the next day?<br /> <br /> (Tirien &amp; Blossom)<br /> <br /> Okay, you are both awake, and are aware of some form of Camp north of you position. It is Dusk.<br /> <br /> What Do?<br /> <br /> (Yi)<br /> <br /> Yi's been spurned by the Ambassador, told to stay away from the Ordoni until such a time as he is prepared to take the Trials. What will he do next?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T19:08:35-07:00","id":218680,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wonderful. Then rest it is. I shall be back for more of your knowledge. Perhaps you will impress me greatly and earn a higher seat...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Now I am going to rest.. You can skip to the next day. Hyuga rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4595432/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4595432/</a> 1 sux to recover willpower (thank God I didn't botch..even with nightmares...) </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T07:04:00-07:00","id":219037,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods to Cinder then Hyuga. He then turns to Shadow and exclaims, &quot;A dog's gotta run, right?&quot;<br /> <br /> Shadow bounds to his feet and streaks out of the Artificery with Jensven close behind.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> The plan is to let Shadow run for a bit in an open area, even if heading outside Novalesk is needed. Then to sleep wherever both Shadow and Jensven are allowed. I'm sure the Academy won't mind. The Conviction (2) roll for Willpower gain generates <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4596023/\" target=\"_blank\">one success.</a> I believe that puts me back to full Willpower. The plan for the next day will be to run with Shadow in the morning, go to the library to study and then return to the Artificery to confer with Cinder and Hyuga. Jensven is more than willing to hammer metal, but not sure he can do any of the finer work needed due to lack of knowledge more than ability.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T09:55:27-07:00","id":220301,"title":"","content":"&quot;There's a gang of riders to near us. I'm going to scope things out,&quot; she says, and Tirien will reassume her bird shape and sidle up to the band of riders to see what they're up to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-07T15:23:54-07:00","id":221284,"title":"","content":"As soon as he was a way beyond the doors of the Boule Yi began to smile.<br /> <br /> <i>There are ways that could have gone better, and most of them require ancient prophecies or someone else putting in a lot of legwork. Ordon is closed to outsiders, a mystery to their neighbors and friends, and now a path is opened to me. I would give thanks to happy chance if I thought she actually had anything to do with it or Heaven were it not what we make of it..</i><br /> <br /> With a laugh he continued on his way. Before he returned to the temple he made for a park he had seen. To each person he passed he said, &quot;I go to teach the Way, and the will of Heaven. Will you follow me?&quot; It did not matter if they were beggars clad in rags or nobility in their palanquins.<br /> <br /> When they had reach the park and all were seated as they were he began to speak.<br /> <br /> &quot;Those who do wrong are not struck dead by lightning from the sky. Murders are not themselves murdered, thieves are not stolen from, hard work is not repayed with success, and in ten-thousand ways there is no justice. Some have said that those who go unpunished shall be punished in their next birth and those unrewarded shall be rewarded in their next birth. Yet their teachings are incomplete or confounded by worlds and times. If we do not know about life, on what ground do we stand concerning death?<br /> <br /> I tell you know the most hideous and terrible secret of the Creation, there is no good order save that which we make. There is no rightness in the world intrinsic too it by which it may be judged. There is no justice, there is just us.<br /> <br /> Now I tell you something more hideous because it is not secret. Everything is our fault. If the nation is good we deserve the credit. If times our wicked we have no one to blame. You cannot rely on gods or kings nor curse demons or fairies. If we are wiped out it is because we did not have the strength to defend ourselves or make use of that strength.<br /> <br /> By no doctrine under heaven can I make you greater than this. Not the Empress on her throne can claim to be the better of the urchin on the street in this.<br /> <br /> So answer me, in light of all this, what is the good?&quot;<br /> <br /> In such way did begin to teach.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Activating my artifact (Doesn't Work)<br /> Activating Gathering the Congregation + First Performance Excellency for 9 motes<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4598159/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4598159/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4598159/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4598159/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 10 successes (I took off the last 3 since the artifact didn't activate)<br /> <br /> 19 personal motes + 1wp</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-07T22:26:38-07:00","id":221618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=220301#post220301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;There's a gang of riders to near us. I'm going to scope things out,&quot; she says, and Tirien will reassume her bird shape and sidle up to the band of riders to see what they're up to.</div> </div> </div> </div>Blossom rubs the sleep out of her eyes. &quot;Well, I guess I'll just wait then,&quot; she replies, watching the Lunar fly off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T14:44:39-07:00","id":222465,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> Yi's proselytizing and preaching attracts a fair number of people who are clearly thoughtful about the issue. Many, however are resistant to his declaration that the Fae aren't to blame for the current status of the nation. Regardless there is some small handful who takes his message to heart. <br /> <br /> Okay; moving Novalesk on to the next day (Exthalion; If there is something simple you want Yi to do after preaching let me know, 'kay? Just don't want to keep the others waiting for longer). What will you three do now?<br /> <br /> (Grasslands)<br /> The camp is small; perhaps consisting of half dozen individuals, with no large animals. The camp seems sedate, the individuals are all moving about rather sluggishly; even more so than you would expect from a group setting down from the night. They seem similar to the wyld barbarians you saw on the way to Esstrayan, but you cannot be sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T16:54:38-07:00","id":222567,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">As already stated my plan is to run with Shadow, do some studying to try and complete the increase in my Lore ability, and talk shop with Hyuga and Cinder. In fact, this will be my plan for the next week, because that is how long we determined my Lore training would take. Unless something happens to break that routine, that is what I am going to go with. Note that I will not use this as a cop out for not posting dialogue and other things to interact with the other characters during this time. I'm reasonably sure I can have conversations during the training/crafting/etc. without messing anything up.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T22:50:12-07:00","id":223890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=222465#post222465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Grasslands)<br /> The camp is small; perhaps consisting of half dozen individuals, with no large animals. The camp seems sedate, the individuals are all moving about rather sluggishly; even more so than you would expect from a group setting down from the night. They seem similar to the wyld barbarians you saw on the way to Esstrayan, but you cannot be sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>OOC: When you say &quot;no large animals,&quot; do you mean nothing larger than a horse? Or nothing larger than a dog? Or nothing larger than a cat? Just for clarity's sake, please. Not that Blossom can see it, but still...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T23:53:58-07:00","id":223921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=223890#post223890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> OOC: When you say &amp;quot;no large animals,&amp;quot; do you mean nothing larger than a horse? Or nothing larger than a dog? Or nothing larger than a cat? Just for clarity's sake, please. Not that Blossom can see it, but still...</div> </div> </div> </div>I meant like horses and cattle, that sort of thing. But, for further clarification: without going into the camp, you see no animals, making it unlikely that there are any animals present larger than say, a typical shepherd dog (70-90 lbs, for those unfamiliar).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T11:20:34-07:00","id":228249,"title":"","content":"Tirien will flutter over in bird mode to see what they're speaking of, if anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T08:11:57-07:00","id":229057,"title":"","content":"(OOC: Nothing else for the day though I plan on having a vivid past-life dream.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-21T14:19:48-07:00","id":236925,"title":"","content":"Okay. Sorry for the delay, gents. Time has really been getting away from me lately. <br /> <br /> (Novalesk) <br /> A new day has begun! Lovely weather we're having. Cranky librarians are cranky, eccentric fire-spirits that want to be gods are kind of crazy, maybe?<br /> <br /> (Tirien and Blossom)<br /> The campers seem to be of the same stock as the barbarians that attacked you on the way to Esstryaan's freehold. They are much more sedate, however. There eyes seem glassed over, as if drugged, and they are not communicating save through non-verbal grunts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T09:33:52-07:00","id":244053,"title":"","content":"Unless Larissa had something pressing for him to do, Yi intended to offer another lesson to his cult and then look for some form of fast travel to Ordon. Perhaps a magical hawk man of some sort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T05:22:06-07:00","id":246086,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Here's a question: Is Cinder trying to elicit worship as 'payment' for the information he is giving out? What would I roll to figure that out?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T08:33:40-07:00","id":246162,"title":"","content":"Blossom, now more or less awake, waits in the clearing for Tirien to return.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T15:32:26-07:00","id":249215,"title":"","content":"Tirien will return, and report her findings to Blossom.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't think they're much threat, but their prescence suggests that another, larger force may yet be nearby,&quot; Tirien says to her comrade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T20:38:22-07:00","id":249433,"title":"","content":"Blossom adopts a thoughtful pose. &quot;The fact that their eyes are glassed over, and that the seem to be in an almost trance-like state, makes me think this warrants further investigation. They may be under some kind of Fae mind control. If we can find a way to break them free, they might be able to get us some useful intelligence. And, even if they can't, a few fewer soldiers for the Puissant Amethyst Court couldn't hurt...&quot;<br /> <br /> She looks over at Tirien again. &quot;Do you think that you could maybe lure one of them away from the others?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":". 09-05-2014, 09:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T10:20:12-07:00","id":249920,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well,&quot; Tirien says. She flutters off, and lands beside one of the mutants.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, hey, you! Wanna see something cool?&quot; Tirien asks the mutant, fluttering about on the ground.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T10:42:23-07:00","id":249938,"title":"","content":"After a long and quite strange day, Hyuga falls asleep and has a peaceful slumber. Hyuga can't recall the last time he had a nice,l yet strange dream about food, blacksmithing, and cats, but it was welcoming all the same. As Hyuga sits up, he tries to recall some of the portions of his dream. He vaguely recalls a very needy fire cat eating steel and then he immediately recalls Cinder.<br /> &quot;I suppose I SHOULD go greet him&quot; Hyuga whispers to himself as he grudgingly pulls himself out of bed. Hyuga takes a short walk around the academy and finds himself back in the artficery with the furnace inhabited by Cinder.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good morning Cinder,&quot; Hyuga shouts as he looks around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T20:37:32-07:00","id":250382,"title":"","content":"Jensven wakes in the morning and promptly finds a vendor selling sausages. He purchases two, a spicy one for himself and a not so spicy one for Shadow. There is a pause in his activity to allow Shadow to wolf the sausage handed to him and then the Dawn will make his way to the outskirts of the city.<br /> <br /> Jensven will try to keep his bearings with where he is going by comparing landmark locations in relation to the Academy grounds. When he loses sight of the academy, he will pick a landmark that he knows he can see the academy from and use that as his point of reference. The Ascending Sun will repeat this process until he is far enough into the woods that he feels safe letting Shadow have full range. The point here is to allow the dog to run and get exercise himself. He trains with his new blade as well as he knows how. The feel of it in his hands is awkward and he intends to change that.<br /> <br /> And so, imaginary enemies appear before him and he strikes, parries, dodges, and defeats. This continues until he is winded and the dog is bored, the sunlight through the trees slanted at a wider angle to the ground than when they started here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T15:40:24-07:00","id":251097,"title":"","content":"(Blossom and Tirien)<br /> <br /> The mutant does not answer Tirien's query. It does, however, grab a net, of the type one might use to snare rabbits, or say, small birds, and begins inching towards her.<br /> <br /> None of the others seem to have noticed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T15:43:30-07:00","id":251099,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga)<br /> <br /> The fire spirit emerges from his furnace, and gives you a toothy(?) grin. <br /> <br /> &quot;Greetings,&quot; he says, his tone aristocratic and slightly nasal, &quot;I am pleased to see you well. Is it something urgent?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T16:04:24-07:00","id":251116,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> You find a rather secluded spot and Shadow quickly heads off, chasing after birds or small woodland mammals. He returns every few minutes, a large grin on his face. <br /> <br /> As Jensven goes through his motions, his new blade begins to feel more comfortable in his hand. Just as he begins to feel winded, Jensven notices a handsome youth watching him practice. The young man is tall, with red-brown wavy hair and aquiline features. He wears a sleeveless shirt and billowing pants, over which a crimson cloth, halfway between a shawl and toga, is thrown. The shawl-toga is tied up at his left shoulder and right hip, and its hem is lined with what appears to be tiny bells of gold (or brass. Or some other yellowish metal.). How he snuck up on you with that, you cannot tell. <br /> <br /> &quot;You are skilled, Warrior,&quot; he says, drawing the straight blade he had sheathed on his left hip, &quot;I request a bout.&quot;<br /> <br /> He holds his sword in a one-handed low guard, the sun glinting off its blade. It seems to be of superior craftsmanship, but not a work of artifice.<br /> <br /> If you take him up on his request, roll Join Battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T17:07:52-07:00","id":251769,"title":"","content":"Tirien, not being born yesterday, sees the mutant's actions, and continues fluttering away, towards Blossom.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, c'mon! Wanna see? Wanna see?&quot; she asks, hopping about, figuring her blithe chatter was just seen as strange birdcalls to the wyldfolk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T18:57:18-07:00","id":251818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=251769#post251769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien, not being born yesterday, sees the mutant's actions, and continues fluttering away, towards Blossom.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, c'mon! Wanna see? Wanna see?&quot; she asks, hopping about, figuring her blithe chatter was just seen as strange birdcalls to the wyldfolk.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Oh my gods, I can't believe that's actually working...&quot; Blossom looks around the clearing, then reluctantly stands behind a tree, preparing to ambush the mutant as it passes her, hoping to catch him in a clinch and pin him to the ground so that she can use her essence senses to determine what has been done to the poor man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T20:51:08-07:00","id":251931,"title":"","content":"Seeing the naked blade, Jensven will motion for Shadow to stay where he is, and the dog will lie down almost as if bored. However, the canine keeps a watchful eye one the events that are unfolding. If the familiar is overly worried it would be hard to tell for one that didn't know him.<br /> <br /> The Dawn does not say a word as he drops into a guarding pose of his own. He is intent on the opponent before him. Any hint of surprise at this warrior's sudden appearance is absent. His breathing focused, he doesn't appear all that winded anymore. His posture coiled like a spring. His stance, like a wolf about to pounce. All attention is cast toward the task at hand.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will roll Join Battle. This means my Wits of 3 and my Awareness of 3 = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4636011/\" target=\"_blank\">five successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 09-09-2014, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T21:11:54-07:00","id":252958,"title":"","content":"(Tirien and Blossom)<br /> <br /> The mutant attempts to cast its net over Tirien several times, but misses narrowly each time. It is not long before it is in the clearing, in range for Blossom's pounce tactic. <br /> <br /> Jim, roll a clinch for Blossom's pin, please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T21:13:02-07:00","id":252961,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> The bell-warrior gets 2 successes, so Jensven acts first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T14:39:14-07:00","id":253600,"title":"","content":"&quot;I just came by to see how you were doing and ask a question. For the earth essence I need infused, do I require the help of a dragon-blood's pure earth essence, or can I use an earth-aspected manse or hearthstone, or could I even manipulate the earth essence around me by rebuilding an area?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T19:00:42-07:00","id":253755,"title":"","content":"Early, in the dark before the sun rises and only the barest wisp of grey paints the eastern horizon, Yi woke and made his way through the emptied streets to the academy of sorcery. He was alone, as he had been another night. The pale light cast its glow over the silent city as the moon had done in a cell of undressed stone. The tiny flashes were but dew now, not salt and silver and sulfur to hold a man-shaped demon fast. No crowd followed him, no peers shot him scornful glances, no students watched him with envy in their eyes, no young terrestrial prodigy's gaze briefly touched him. If there were eyes in this almost-night they were unfriendly, the fear and judgement behind them echoing around a single work; Anathema. He was not a sorcerer-engineer anymore, if he had ever deserved the title, nor was he a diplomat accustom to the halls of power, and if he was mistaken for a Lookshyan more frequently than ever before it was not to his benefit. His feet carried him on.<br /> <br /> <br /> There was something oddly comforting about returning to an institution of learning. He had spent most of his life in one. Even if this lacked the prestige, it indeed it did, the academic life was... structured in a way he was familiar with as an old and comfortable chair. It hadn't always been so. Once he imagined his purpose in life was to rise through the ranks of the intelligentsia like a wargod's spear, shattering their assumptions and preconceptions like glass until all marveled as his genius. Sifu Zhu had been less than impressed. Explaining a single koan does not earn the master's suffix, and the grandson of Paisap had earned his a dozen times in twice a mortal's span. There were times he had imagined it was punishment He had been forced to translate and re-translate the Book of the Red Names by hand more than twenty times. Every time he finished he would present it to the Master for approval only be be berated for wasting good paper with his useless words. Once, for that was all it had taken, he complained about the Master's own error at wasting his time with such a long surpassed tome. When the Master had taken down a dusty old copy of the Book, from his own days as a novice, and let the young Yi read what was within the boy had nearly wept. In words neither poetry nor prose, neither opaque nor trivial, neither critical nor convinced Zhu had put in mere ink and parchment such wonders as the boy had never imagined. That was the day he had truly begun to learn.<br /> <br /> <br /> The distance was not too great and the demon at the gate knew him. Perhaps some queer expression on his face convinced it not to question his errand, for it was silent. His bare feet, soles toughened by long travel, led him to the tower of sorcery. The grass was a softness he had learned to savor after the unpaved roads of the scavenger lands. His prison sandals had given out a month after his escape and he had neither the courage to steal any more or the time and materials with which to make his own. His food had run out not long before. As that day had grown hotter he had grown weaker until finally he collapsed before some temple or another. The irony was not lost on him, the vision on <i>that</i> day was far too fresh. So he had prayed. It was the first time he had really prayed, done more than offer ritual formality. He was breathless as he lay in the road, crying out to Sol for another chance and Sextes Jylis to strengthen him, and every god and goddess he could think of for just one more day. Nearly exhausted he spoke one final prayer, crying out to an unknown god. &quot;Raise me up, and I will raise your temples in every city I see in all the days I have been granted.&quot; The priests of Asclepius, whose temple it was, emerged to investigate a commotion they heard they saw the sacred snake of their god defending his unconscious body from those who had meant to rob or kill him. Taking it as a sign they cared for him until he had the strength to leave. So far he had done so in all cities he passed save two. Asclepius would have his temples though, in every city in Novalesk, Ordon, Theros, and all the nations he would bind. He did not forget his promises.<br /> <br /> As he reached the tower of sorcery he knelt in what he hoped was a pose of sufficient humility. He knew the stations as all in his position would and he had come to begin the training of a sorcerer. The learning would be easy, the journey to the war front should be sufficient for a journey. Yet what about fear? He had been afraid many times in his life, but nothing had shaken him like the day of the battle, the day he was Chosen. When the young terrestrial had fallen something in him had broken. Lookshy had never loved him, perhaps one or another of its people had though he had not noticed. Yet this one dragon blooded, of high birth and station who should have represented everything he hated about the city, made it bearable. For many agonizing moments he had been paralyzed with fear and indecision watching the dead throw back the honor guard. Then he felt the change. Orders be damned, the rest of the army be damned, <i>he</i> be damned; Karal Zhan would not die in something as meaningless as this skirmish. The glow of his anima may or may not have begun then, though who could say in the high noon, but the waking vision did. It was another place and time, and he was robed in splendor, yet in both he gave the same order. In both he took up a fallen blade. In both he heard the VOICE. It was like his father, who he did not remember, and like Sifu Zhu and Zhan and many more yet possessing a unity and identity greater than any he could compare it too. He had not been afraid then.<br /> <br /> As his contemplation finished he was left with a strange thought. He saw as clearly as he had that day the crown of many kingdoms on his head as he stood before Zhan and the High Command and offered them an alliance of power and glory. Filled with ambition for power, want of strength, and not a little fear they would say, &quot;Well done soldier. 'Come, and take your deserved place among us.' and Zhan would smile and finish, 'It is good to have you home again'.&quot; But then he stopped and looked, truly looked, around him; and he remembered. He remembered Origenes and Larissa and Eugene and the little circle of followers around him. They were not pieces on the gods board, or bribes to earn him back the favor of distant men. They were there own people with lives of their own and hopes and dreams just as worthy as his. He could not use them that way, not even if it meant gaining every thing he had thought he wanted. That was when the dawn came thundering and the ground shook and a loud crack ran from the step where his forehead had rested up to the very top of the tower, a sliver of light illuminating him through it. With sure steps he ascended the stops now, meeting those who had been within at the threshold.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am a sorcerer come to learn. Will any here teach me?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T19:03:30-07:00","id":253757,"title":"","content":"(Hyuga)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh. Good,&quot; the fire spirit says, &quot;if it was something important, I'd feel guilty for messing around. I'd still do it, mind, but I'd feel guilty for like, three whole minutes afterwards.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now as you recall, I said that earth essence was required at two parts of the process. An initial infusion of solidified Earth-essence and a secondary stream of Earth essence alloyed with Solar essence. You need something solid for the former. Essence tokens from an earth-aspected demesne, earth-aspected hearthstone, token blessed by a powerful Earth-elemental, that sort of thing. <br /> <br /> &quot;For the later, you need a font of essence. The ambient environment won't work, unless you're in a manse or demesne, or can tap a Dragon line. An Earth Terrestrial could work as that font, yeah, but so could a hearthstone or Elemental. Mind you, the solid source for the initial infusion's going to be consumed, so don't try to get funny ideas thinking you could just use one hearthstone for the whole thing. Sure, the broken hearthstone will reform in a month or so, but you need to get to work long before that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Oddly, the tiny fire elemental was almost professional for that statement. He seems to loose quire a bit of his joking nature when &quot;talking shop&quot;. Sadly, his thin traces of professionalism does not survive long afterwards, &quot;I did say that right? Or did I forget? Anyways, while you're here, have you gotten a good glimpse at Maia's posterior? You wouldn't expect it, but dayum, she's got back!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T19:52:43-07:00","id":253777,"title":"","content":"Jensven keeps his blade held down and to his side ready to come up at any moment to block an incoming strike. He moves slowly, neither circling his opponent or making an effort to approach. Finding the best spot to gain a defensive stance and then counter is foremost on his mind.<br /> <br /> In the blink of an eye he has somehow assessed the entire clearing and taken note of the positions of every fallen branch, every exposed root, every shrub and weed. Anything that could hinder his movement is noted and potential avenues of assault, retreat, and general ebb and flow sorted and prioritized.<br /> <br /> Despite the trust that he has in Shadow to move should the duel move in that direction, the Dawn also keeps a thought in the back of his mind concerning where the familiar is. Should the mysterious warrior move in that direction, multiple intercepting paths of movement are noted and prepared to be taken.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">All that to say Guard. Guard Like a foo.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T21:48:07-07:00","id":253824,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> As Yi enters the tower of sorcery, he is met by an odd sight. Chancellor Feiro, Artemia, a pale elderly woman, and a tall, strong middle aged man just beginning to Grey.<br /> <br /> &quot; I suppose you were right, Leto,&quot; the Chancellor says to the man, &quot;He can learn humility.&quot;<br /> <br /> The chancellor turns to Artemia, &quot;Will you reconsider your father's proxy?&quot;<br /> <br /> Artemia seems sour. &quot;He's still a Lookshan,&quot; she says, sulking.<br /> <br /> Chancellor Feiro smiles faintly, &quot; Very well. I will teach you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T22:00:29-07:00","id":253834,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> OOC: looking at your defenses, you calculated your stat line for the klaive wrong. It should be Accuracy 10, 7L damage, and a PDV of 5.<br /> <br /> The bell-warrior raises a brow slightly. He takes slight step forward a split-second before lashing out with a high stab with his blade. Yet, this move is just a feint, as mid-jab he drops the blade. In a single smooth motion, the warrior grabs the sword in his left hand and makes a horizontal slash at Jensven's stomach. <br /> <br /> The warrior rolls 6 successes, bypassing your PDV by one. What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T17:08:00-07:00","id":254827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=252958#post252958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Tirien and Blossom)<br /> <br /> The mutant attempts to cast its net over Tirien several times, but misses narrowly each time. It is not long before it is in the clearing, in range for Blossom's pounce tactic.<br /> <br /> Jim, roll a clinch for Blossom's pin, please.</div> </div> </div> </div>As the mutant moves past her, Righteous Blossom silently steps out behind him. She hooks one foot around his ankle, trying to pull one of the mutant's feet out from under him while wrapping her left hand around his jaw, holding his mouth closed to prevent him from crying out. Her right hand, palm stiff, slams into the small of his back, hopefully knocking him off balance. If all goes well, Blossom knocks the mutant to the ground, facedown, herself stradling his back. Her left hand is still holding onto his jaw, both keeping his mouth closed and preventing from striking his head and injuring himself on the way down; once he starts to fall, she moves her right hand, grabbing both of his hands by the wrists and pinning them in an awkward position underneath her in the small of his back. The whole maneuver takes only a few seconds and, if executed correctly, they land with a muted *THUMP*, the soft grass of the forest floor muffling their sounds.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">OOC: Not sure if that deserves a stunt or not; if so, can you roll the stunt dice for me, Noodle, to save time? In any case, used a full 1st MA Excellency, so rolled Dex 3 + MA 3 + Excellency 3 = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4640414/\" target=\"_blank\">9 dice for 3 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T17:51:58-07:00","id":254878,"title":"","content":"Carefully bringing his palms together Yi bowed respectfully, as a student to a master.<br /> <br /> &quot;As student, I submit to you in all things. As Chosen, I cannot cease my service to Novalesk. In the course of that service I may be forced to stand as patron or overseer to the resources or personnel of this academy. I pray that these two masks will not hide the face behind.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Bhuya eva ma bhagavan vijnapayatv-iti&quot; he said in Old Realm &quot;Please, Sir, inform me still more.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T20:24:25-07:00","id":254992,"title":"","content":"The Dawn says nothing and moves just enough to allow him to knock the blow off-course and narrowly miss connecting with chain mesh. He flips his own blade around in a blurred arc to adjust the path the opposing blade travels on. His movements are measured and sufficient, seeming minimalist or lazy to the untrained observer. His intent is to conserve his energy, bide his time, and strike when the opportunity presents itself.<br /> <br /> His expression is one of focused determination, betraying no hint of fear, doubt, or worry. It also betrays no pride, no joy, and no excitement. If anything he has decided to learn, observe, and thereby become a better warrior. A better guardian.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">This is an attempt to stunt the defense gaining at least one die, I hope two. Either way cranking PDV to 6 allows me to avoid being hit with this attack. If the stunt doesn't work, I will crank 2 motes into Melee Essence Triumphant to increase the PDV to 6 and successfully defend the attack that way.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T21:43:41-07:00","id":255040,"title":"","content":"(Tirien and Blossom)<br /> <br /> OOC: in the future, what you can do if you're unsure about the stunt rating is roll three d10 as a second roll,band I'll apply them as necessary. That was a two die, BTW, and you get... a 3 and a 10, increasing your successes to 5.<br /> <br /> IC: The mutant is quickly pinned to the ground, barely resisting. It clicks it's rows of elephantine molars, and it's hour-glass shaped pupils are unfocused. You've captured a mutant. Well done. Now, what are you going to do with it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T21:46:39-07:00","id":255043,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course,&quot; the chancellor says, dismissing the others with a casual gesture, &quot;Now, have you passed all five stations, or do you yet need initiations?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T21:53:11-07:00","id":255048,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Deflected by Jensven's parry, the bell-warrior's sword scrapes armor for a mere instant in the strike. <br /> <br /> OOC: the parry is successful by stunt. It's your turn now. Since both you're engaged in a 1-on-1 fight it may be more efficient to post you next action and you reaction at the same time. Just a suggestion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T14:05:28-07:00","id":256239,"title":"","content":"He had to admit that was a neat little trick, but Jensven wasn't about to try and beat this warrior at his own game. Where he came from the warrior that won was the one that beat his opponent into submission. He was never really good at that either. In fact, he was among the least of the warriors where he came from barely able to hold a weapon. This is why he was a smith and not included in the raiding parties.<br /> <br /> That all changed when the Sun God talked to him and showed him what he could be come, what was in the past. It was a past life that was now attached to him. In every combat he had participated in it was this experience from long ago that he allowed to guide him. Perhaps later he could try and merge that with what he had known and develop something uniquely his, but for now, this is how he survived. This is how he won.<br /> <br /> The Dawn allowed his blade to slide off that of his opponent and then swung it quickly at his adversary's midsection. There was no attempt at deception, no tricks involved. There was only speed and strength. Both were undeniably part of his attack and there was a simple grace to that. Jensven followed through just enough to ensure that it would strike if unhindered, but still allowed himself the ability to defend if necessary.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will just be doing a simple attack. I am going to assume a one die stunt on it. So my Dexterity (4) + my Melee (3) + Klaive Accuracy (3) + Stunt Die (1) = 11 dice rolled for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4642625/\" target=\"_blank\">two successes</a>... Sometimes rolls suck. Mental note: Melee Essence Resurgent might be a good idea for a charm purchase later...</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T18:09:49-07:00","id":256401,"title":"","content":"&quot;I have surmounted the station of choice, sacrificing the adulation of Lookshy on the altar of Novalesk. Beyond this, I cannot say.&quot;<br /> <br /> But no, that wasn't really true. Yi looked back at the milestones he had passed to reach where he now stood. Perhaps they were the markers on the road to Hell, yet he did not think so.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yet, I believe the task is accomplished.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T20:26:06-07:00","id":256962,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> The bell-warrior backhands his sword, bringing it up quickly to parry your strike. Flipping it back at the top of its arc, he brings his sword down in a brutal downward swing. <br /> <br /> Mechanics: The warrior easily parries the attack. His rebuttal scores 6 successes, beating your adjusted PDV of 4 by two. What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 09-14-2014, 11:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T20:36:11-07:00","id":256964,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;So certain,&quot; Feiro says with a half-smile, &quot;come. We will retreat to my study, and you can tell me your story. I will see if there are any trials you have yet to take.&quot;<br /> <br /> Feiro leads you to a cozy room, with several comfortable chairs and couches about. Bookcases line the walls, and there is nary a table in the room that lacks a pile of books atop it; most of them have two or more. He takes a seat, and gestures for Yi to do the same. <br /> <br /> OOC: this serves two purposes. One, for Feiro to get a feel for his new student, IC. And two, for you to present your points for him having passes the five stations OOC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-16T18:14:02-07:00","id":258598,"title":"","content":"The Dawn leads with his blade and spins into the attack, trusting his motion and his skill to intercept the opposing blade. He trusts his strength to meet the strength of his opponent and prevail. Jensven steps forward and puts his whole body into the force of the deflecting strike. The very idea of the opposing strike being able to get through is utterly alien to him. It may as well have not even been conceived.<br /> <br /> Moving directly through a technique he learned during a his 'golden vision' he jumps upward, sliding his 'klaive off the opposing sword. As Jensven approaches the apex of his jump he slams his knee upward, directly at the bell-warrior's chin. When his momentum slows he will raise his blade over his head in a double-handed grip. On the way down the Ascending Sun will use whatever impetus was gained from the impact of his knee to add power to a downward sword stroke of his own. His attack is aimed squarely at hacking into the point where neck and shoulder meet.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Okay, depending on how much of a stunt I can get out of the defensive action in the first paragraph there, I will activate Melee Essence Triumphant to get either one or two points added to my PDV. This will cost either two or four motes from peripheral.<br /> <br /> For the second paragraph, I am going to attempt a two attack flurry. The first attack (the knee) is going to be a kick (rate 2) and the second will be with the 'Klaive (rate 2). One attack each allows for me to stay within the limits for rate with both weapons. Since this is a two action flurry the first attack takes a -2 internal penalty and the second takes a -3 internal penalty.<br /> <br /> This means the kick would be at Dexterity (4) + Martial Arts (3) + Kick Accuracy (0) + Flurry (-2) = Five Dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4646272/\" target=\"_blank\">two successes</a>.<br /> <br /> I am going to assume one die of stunt for the 'Klaive strike. This gives me Dexterity (4) + Melee (3) + 'Klaive Accuracy (3) + Flurry (-3) + Stunt (1) = Seven + One Dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4646277/\" target=\"_blank\">two + one successes</a>.<br /> <br /> If the flurry doesn't work because of mixed attack types (Martial Art versus Melee) let me know and I will reroll the attack with just the 'Klaive.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-16T20:38:13-07:00","id":258632,"title":"","content":"Tirien will hop on its head, and look dashing, posing as she enjoys the thrill of her (Shared) victory.<br /> <br /> Truly, Tirien is in a Haslan mood at present.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-16T22:02:41-07:00","id":258713,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Jensven's essence infused parry barely deflects the strike yet again. As Jensven rallies, the warrior retreats a step, batting down Jensven's kick. This causes him to respond to Jensven's sword strike a moment too late. As the strike is mere inches from landing, the warrior's sword arm moves at an inhuman speed to parry it at the last instant. Brilliant golden sparks fly as the two blades meet, and Jensven's blade slashes wide. <br /> <br /> The warrior ripostes, making a lightning-fast lunge while Jensven is off-balance.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The bell-warrior blocks the attack by activating <i>Transcendent Ar\u00eate of the Midday Sun</i> (don't bother looking it up. You won't find it). He replies with a simple strike, scoring (you guessed it) Six successes, beating Jensven's adjusted PDV of 3 by 3.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T21:49:26-07:00","id":259507,"title":"","content":"Jensven uses sheer will to bat aside the attack, spinning off his back foot to knock the blade just far enough off the mark to miss. The brand of the Dawn Caste blazes on his forehead as he pauses for a brief instant secure in the thought that this attack will not find it's way to him.<br /> <br /> The northern apprentice blacksmith is surrounded by an explosion essence as he launches a ferocious attack. The light emanating from him encompasses the entire clearing the impromptu clash of blades occupies. He drives forward off his back foot, a howl ripping its way out of his throat. The tip of his sword is aimed squarely at his opponent's abdomen as golden essence trails behind him.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I am going to assume that I spent four essence for my last defense. It was all peripheral. I am going to combo Dipping Swallow Defense to bring my PDV back up to 5 and then crank two more motes into Melee Essence Triumphant for a total of four motes to raise my PDV to 6 and barely negate that attack. This means I have spent a total of 8 peripheral essence. Hello, blazing caste mark and bright aura.<br /> <br /> Jensven is through playing around. He is throwing everything he has into this attack. Melee Essence Overwhelming for seven motes to get seven more dice. This means an attack roll of Dexterity (4) + Melee (3) + 'Klaive Accuracy (3) + Stunt (1) + Melee Essence Overwhelming (7) = Seventeen plus One Dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4647859/\" target=\"_blank\">Thirteen plus Zero successes</a>.<br /> <br /> This means I have spent a total of 15 peripheral essence. I am just this side of an iconic anima. Due to stunts I have been able to regain four of the spent motes. I now have a peripheral pool of fifteen motes. </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T23:25:08-07:00","id":259578,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> OOC: Sorry, I thought I mentioned how much essence you used. It was 2m. <br /> <br /> Jensven's strike lands home, piercing the warrior's gut. Oddly, he does not bleed; instead, sunlight leaks from his wound. Just as Jensven's strike lands, the warrior lashes out with a nearly identical strike. The blade in his guts does not hinder him; he appears to gain strength from it. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jensven's strike hits, and deals 4L damage. Sucks that you don't have an Ogre's Loving Caress equivalent; three of those successes were from 10s. <br /> <br /> Anyways, the warrior activates <i>The Sun Burns Triumphant</i>to counterattack. His counter, enhanced by your own 7 dice of post-soak damage dice, gets 11 successes.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T15:47:41-07:00","id":260160,"title":"","content":"Jensven makes no attempt to avoid the attack. He is too intent on striking the opponent in front of him. It is almost as if he has forgotten that such a strike could harm him and refuses to acknowledge it as a threat of any sort. The Dawn begins to lean into the 'Klaive that has connected with his opponent as the return strike hits home.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Alright, I am waiting to see the results of this strike before I post my next attack. This is obviously because I recognize that such a strike could be a fight ending one.<br /> <br /> Thanks for clearing up that essence expenditure. This leaves my essence status at thirteen peripheral spent, meaning huge aura. My peripheral pool is sitting at seventeen motes.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T17:22:37-07:00","id":260195,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> OOC: Well, it would be his turn next anyway, since he used a charm to get an in-system counter to your attack. <br /> <br /> The bell-warrior's strike hits deep, burying into Jensven's gut (dealing 4L damage). The warrior pauses for a moment before stepping back nimbly, unencumbered by his gaping gut wound. A half-smile rests on his lips and he has laughing eyes. &quot;A fair bout, warrior,&quot; he says, flicking the blood off his blade with a flourish before sheathing it. Eyeing your wound he proffers a hand, &quot;I can close your wound if you desire, warrior. I warn, it will be painful. Less so than a festering gut wound, I would wager, but painful none the less.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T21:01:49-07:00","id":261751,"title":"","content":"The young Dawn has trouble controlling the wave of rage that is washing over him. He does not attack, but he struggles to find words. Every muscle in his body is tense and he clenches his teeth as blood flows from his wound. Closing his eyes, he focuses first on calming himself. Jensven pictures in his mind a cold day in the evergreen forests near his home, Shadow at his side, and a light snowfall. Off in the distance a young woman can be seen. She has dark hair, almost black as night. The snow lands in it and stays there, providing a stark yet appealing contrast.<br /> <br /> When he is calm enough he focuses on the wounds, on making his blood stop flowing so freely. He doesn't know how he realized this could be done the first time he tried it, but he just sat there after the defense of his home and focused on the wounds the raiders axes had caused and they closed. It took longer to heal, but he was able to expediate that as well. Both gifts of the sun. Gifts he felt utterly unworthy to have received. It was in this way that he now focused and attempted to stem the tide of blood from his gut.<br /> <br /> Jensven falls to his knees and rests on his empty hand to remain in a sitting position. His 'Klaive is still clutched tightly in his right hand but rests to his side. His attempts to alleviate his suffering have failed. Shadow pads over and paws at his shoulder.<br /> <br /> &quot;I yield. I accept your offer of help. I just need to know one thing. I need to know who you are.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I am attempting to stop the lethal wound from bleeding with a reflexive roll of Stamina (2) + Resistance (1) = Three dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4650863/\" target=\"_blank\">no successes</a>. This means I am not able to close that wound. I think I am two successes short. Keep in mind that I have Body Mending Meditation to fall back on. I don't necessarily need whoever or whatever this guy is to do it for me. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-21T07:53:46-07:00","id":262157,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am known by many names; your mind cannot comprehend the name and titles bestowed upon me by my maker,&quot; the bell-warrior says, &quot;But a people long dead named me Helios, the Midday Sun. They also named me Clemens, the Compassionate. Helios Clemens.That will function for a name.&quot;<br /> <br /> As Helios examines Jensven's wounds, he says &quot;you have no need to yield. The wounds were scored at identical times, and are equally severe. Besides,&quot; he continues with a chuckle, &quot;I sheathed first.&quot; His examination evidently finished, Helios lays a hand on Jensven's wound. His touch burns like a red iron. A few moments of agonizing pain later, Helios removes his hand, taking the edge off the pain, leaving only a dull aching throb and an angry red scar. Helios's entire arm is bathed in a soft golden glow, like steam rising from his skin. <br /> <br /> &quot;That should suffice until you have time to finish healing,&quot; Helios says, &quot;With most, I would say it would take a week or more, but one with your gifts, who knows? You may be fine by the end of the day. Even the scar will fade in time for you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-21T08:44:34-07:00","id":262195,"title":"","content":"Oh yes, I forgot to put this in; Jensven is healed 3L damage. Only his -0 is filled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T08:23:00-07:00","id":265483,"title":"","content":"&quot;Helios, the Midday Sun?&quot; Jensven muses on that a while and is shocked from his musings by the healing power's unfortunately painful side effect. After recovering from this shock, he stands and examines the scar. &quot;That's a neat trick. I wonder if I could learn how to do something similar,&quot; He muses to himself.<br /> <br /> Remembering himself and the situation at hand he addresses Helios directly. &quot;You will have to forgive me. Combat was rarely so...formal where I am from. You fought when you had to, but rarely would two warriors test each other this way. Even actual training was rare. I remember training techniques from someone else...Someone whose life I was shone by the Sun. I doubt you are he, but I believe you could be one of his servants. Am I correct?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T09:16:33-07:00","id":265510,"title":"","content":"&quot;So, what will you do? Lay some curse on his tribe til the seventh son of their seventh son dies?&quot; Tirien asks, hopping off the mutant's head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T18:37:42-07:00","id":265863,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;Doubt that I am the sun?&quot; Helios says, raising an eyebrow,, &quot;Is it because I am not-&quot;<br /> <br /> Helios pauses for a moment, his form being sheathed in gilded scales, his features shifting to that of a Saurian humanoid. A massive technicolor feathered headdress materializes over his head. Twin Orichalcum Grand Daiklaives appear, floating several feet behind back, and he is wreathed in a blazing aura of sunfire. He levitates up a foot or so into the air, as if his blazing aura supports him.<br /> <br /> &quot;-brilliant enough?&quot;<br /> <br /> Jensven blinks, and the moment is gone, Helios standing, apparently human again. &quot;You are correct, though. I am but a servant to the Sun. Ah... If only I could be so grossly incandescent,&quot; he says with a sigh, &quot;By edict of the Ignis Divine, I am Herald of the Ascendant Sun, Second Lictor of the Most High. It was by His command that I came here to do battle with you and deliver this message.<br /> <br /> &quot;<b><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">REMEMBER, WHAT YOU ARE. YOU ARE MY ARMS AND SHIELD, MY BLADE AGAINST THE FOUL AND WRETCHED, MY SHIELD AGAINST THE ARMIES OF HELL AND THE OUTER CHAOS. YOU ARE THE BLADE THAT SMITE MY FOES AND THE AEGIS THAT GUARDS MY PEOPLE. A SHARD OF MY INFINITE POWER BURNS IN YOUR SOUL.</span></b><br /> <br /> &quot;<b><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">ACT AS IT.</span></b>&quot;<br /> <br /> These words are clearly not Helios' own, but the words of the Sol Incarnate relayed through his Herald. <br /> <br /> &quot;If you wish me to relay a reply, I may. Also,&quot; He says, flipping an Orichalcum disc, roughly two inches in diameter to Jensven. On one side is the eight-pointed sigil of the Unconquered Sun. On the other is the simple disc sigil of the Ascendant Sun, &quot;It was not uncommon in better times for the Sunblessed to compete with the five Lictors to earn their favor. Those who made earned the favor of all five were granted a boon by our mutual patron. This token marks you as one who has earned mine, though had the choice been up to me, the contest would have been more in line with my own skills. If you desire to continue this challenge, I can relay that request to my siblings as well.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T16:40:51-07:00","id":267050,"title":"","content":"Taking the offered seat Yi considers a moment before he begins.<br /> <br /> &quot;Despite what is said of me, I am not a Lookshian. Even so, I lived there for most of my life and worked with the Seventh Legion. I will not shame myself by complaining about my situation there, but I trust you know enough about the City that you understand how I learned humility. It was also in the city that I received tutelage. The Dragon's Chosen have a never ending need for artifices and wonders and cannot attend to all of their own needs. Such as I were trained, if never trusted, to supplement them as keepers or lore and workers of magic.<br /> <br /> My fear came in a battle, the one which led to the termination of my service with the legion. The center was overrun, our archers were pinned down, and the enemy fielded Exalted of their own. I expected to die that day, and not only on the field of battle. The night that followed and many after were more than enough to prove to me that I could no longer continue living the life I had had. Then of course came the journey. Novalesk and Lookshy are not very close as the mendicant walks.<br /> <br /> As for the choice, that I think is to blame for the new windows and skylight running around the tower.&quot; He looked mildly embarrassed. &quot;I will have funds sent to repair that. Or... I could do it myself.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T20:57:57-07:00","id":267954,"title":"","content":"Jensven stands a while in quiet contemplation. Shadow sidles over to Helios and gives him a sniff before sitting and wagging his tail. The Dawn flips the disc over and over. When he catches sight of his own reflection in it he has to resist an urge to rub the blazing brand from his head. It still looks out of place to him.<br /> <br /> &quot;It's not that I think you aren't strong enough, Helios. You've just convinced me I am no match for you yet. The Sun sent you and told you to take it easy on me, I bet.&quot; The Ascending Sun passes for a brief instant. &quot;I was firmly of the opinion that the Sun thought me unworthy of a personal visit. That he sent you is definitely something I don't understand, yet I accept it. Besides, Shadow likes you. I have yet to meet someone Shadow likes that I can find fault with. Please tell the Sun I am grateful for all he has done and I will do more to live up to what he saw in me.&quot;<br /> <br /> The young Northerner will place the disc in a pocket, &quot;I believe I would like to challenge the other Lictors. I doubt they will challenge me to a test of blades, though. I may have my work cut out for me. I assume that should I fail I can always try again later.&quot; A wolfish grin spreads on his face. &quot;I should also like to challenge you again someday. In that form you just showed me. I promise Shadow will sit out again. We all know he's the stronger of us two.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 09-29-2014, 12:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T19:41:17-07:00","id":270538,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;Hmph,&quot; Feiro grunts while drinking a short glass of amber liquor, &quot;The Fates have smiled upon you; It seems to me that you may very well have passed the five trials already. Don't concern yourself with the 'holes in my roof'. They will be taken care of.&quot;<br /> <br /> Feiro leans forward, holding his now empty glass in the fingers of his right hand, &quot;Now, your first lesson. Take this glass from my hand.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T19:54:13-07:00","id":270540,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;If circumstances allow it, I will gladly spar with you again. Though you will likely be disappointed. I did not hold out on you. I merely limited my expenditure of essence. Which you did as well. <br /> <br /> &quot;I will relay your reply to our mutual patron. I imagine that he will be at least mildly pleased with it. As for my siblings,&quot; Helios continues with a flip of the wrist. &quot;My elder sister may challenge you to a contest of blades; she shares certain temperaments with your caste. My brothers definitely will not, and my younger sister...,&quot; Helios shrugs, &quot;I will let them know you challenge.&quot; <br /> <br /> Helios holds out his right hand, &quot;It was a pleasure, Sun-Warrior. Try not to get yourself killed when fighting the Fae.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T11:17:12-07:00","id":271656,"title":"","content":"Jensven shakes the offered hand, &quot;I don't believe I wanted to hold back. I just did. I might want to learn when I should and shouldn't do that.&quot; He begins to make preparations to leave. &quot;I will try not to get in over my head. I have a 'circle' with me. I believe that is what it is called. I also have Shadow.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Dawn rough houses the dog a little before continuing, &quot;I'll do my best. I will defend these people or die trying.&quot; He clenches a fist and smiles that same lupine smile, &quot;You can count me to make that last option as tough as possible for the Fae.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T12:20:37-07:00","id":276560,"title":"","content":"Yi smiled faintly with memory of other tests of this sort. Just in case, on the off chance it really was this easy, he reached out his hand as though to grasp the cup with his fingers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-17T18:29:33-07:00","id":285617,"title":"","content":"For the retcon will be any Tirien and Blossom based material starting from about here. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=182641#post182641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Thank you very much for your kindness and generosity. I look forward to seeing the prowess of the Vicruith on the battlefield,&quot; Tirien says, and bows. She then turns to Blossom.<br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize if I put you on the spot there. I do not have a head for spirit negotiation, nor sorcery, and Master Mejan told me all Stargazers have excellent training in both,&quot; Tirien mumbles, looking a bit relieved now that her bluff paid off.</div> </div> </div> </div>(Geherin)<br /> <br /> The mysterious stranger who assisted Tirien's audience with the chieftains disappears as as quickly as she came. Already, you can feel your memories of her blurring and becoming indistinct.<br /> <br /> Anyways, Tirien's ina woods. With some slightly unhinged barbarians, a predatory deity milf, a horse who is also a dude, and a tiny ninja. <br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-17T18:51:50-07:00","id":285623,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> The solar deity nods and turns wordlessly, a faint smile on his face. He walks off, and simply disappears upon entering an errant sunbeam, leaving Jensven and Shadow alone.<br /> <br /> (Yi)<br /> <br /> As you grasp the glass, the Chancellor nods, &quot;Good. Many of my students think I'm asking for some great sorcerous task. Maia spent almost a week trying to figure it out. This is the most important ting I can teach you: Sorcery is like a knife. It is a useful tool, and good for many tasks. But it cannot do everything. Do not try to use it for everything. Now, we begin in earnest.&quot;<br /> <br /> And so your sorcerous tutelage begins.<br /> <br /> (Novalesk)<br /> <br /> Time passes. Jensven learns much in the academy's library, and Yi studies at Feiro's feet. Anything else you want to do in this time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 10-18-2014, 12:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T14:33:24-07:00","id":286929,"title":"","content":"Jensven spends his mornings playing with Shadow in the woods and keeping his sword skills sharp, his afternoons studying about the History of Creation, and his evenings chatting with Cinder about all things artifact, gently steering the conversation toward more defensive artifice whenever he can.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T16:48:26-07:00","id":286995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=286929#post286929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jensven spends his mornings playing with Shadow in the woods and keeping his sword skills sharp, his afternoons studying about the History of Creation, and his evenings chatting with Cinder about all things artifact, gently steering the conversation toward more defensive artifice whenever he can.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cinder is happy to let you direct the conversation; since Hyuga and Vykos left the city some days ago, Jensven is the sole source of conversation for the tiny spirit. Though he is circuitous about it, often speaking of his magnificence and Maia's ... Appearance rating, Cinder is a veritable font of information on artificery. Especially what he calls &quot;Making Due With Subpar Materials.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You wouldn't know it,&quot; he said one night, &quot;but the facilities here are rather rudimentary. Oh, by the standards of most mortals nowadays, they're rather good. But most divine smiths wouldn't be caught dead here. Inadequate supply of magical materials and reagents. Mundane tools. They'd be mortified at that too,&quot; the fire spirit continues, indicating Jensven's artifact blade, &quot;Using iron as the primary construction material? They would never do that. <br /> <br /> &quot;Still, there's something to say about the staff's methods here. They make due with what they have, and you can't fault their ingenuity in finding a way to do what they need to with the materials on hand.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T17:04:42-07:00","id":287008,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> In his free time amidst Feiro's instruction, Yi is able to speak with Larissa about being adopted into Gens Origenon. She says that the process is rather simple. You must convince one of the elders to sponsor you into the Gens. You'll legally become a member of their household, with all of the mutual obligations this entails. Basically, this boils down to convincing them netting power on the sponsorship, which, with an Essence wielder like Yi is forgone conclusion. <br /> <br /> The issue with essence wielders though, is that they often have external motivations and loyalties. Most Elders will use sorcery to determine the true loyalties of prospective citizen-adoptees. This may pose an issue, as many may believe that Yi's anathema nature could throw the examination. <br /> <br /> Larissa says she'll start greasing the wheels for your adoption among the Gens as a whole, but Yi's going to have to court favor with one of the elders himself. She suggests speaking to her sister, Origenon Hollidane. As an exalt herself, she'll be most resistant to Yi's Anathema magics (at least in the eyes of the rest of the Gens).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T20:06:48-07:00","id":288177,"title":"","content":"&quot;Cinder, I guess what is happening here is happening all over Creation. It would seem that compared to how things were before the fall of those like me there were many, many more wonders to be seen and interacted with.&quot; Jensven mulls this over, while Shadow keeps his distance from Cinder. &quot;For me, this 'lesser' blade is very amazing. I have seen none like it. The local chieftain told us of a blade of copper used by a rival shaman in a battle I didn't take part in. It shattered iron and broke steel. I guess he did what you are explaining. Making due with what one has at hand.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I would like to be a able to craft wondrous things myself one day, but I am to be a warrior and a general first. That is my calling as one of the Ascendant Suns. I need to stop seeing myself as the Blacksmith's helper and start to see myself as a defender of the people. Although, I can craft better things than my old master now. I don't even have to try all that hard. I wonder what he would say if he could see me now.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jensven will try to ignore all comments about Maia's endowments. It's not that he doesn't find the lady attractive. He is just too wrapped up in himself to be concerned with such things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T18:07:31-07:00","id":289146,"title":"","content":"Tirien blinks. She recalls something about mutants and a mission, but this memory quickly passes and she orders another round of drinks. Clearly this place's Fae magic is getting to her. She then proceeds to schmooze with the Chieftains some more while she's here. May as well ingratiate her hosts, after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T19:05:06-07:00","id":290210,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;You doubt my knowledge of Creation's state!?!&quot; Cinder roars. When he continues, he is noticeably calmer, making you wonder whether he was actually enraged, or merely indulging his melodramatic streak, &quot;oh, I'm well aware. I'm just saying that most gods discount that type of ingenuity, is all.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T19:08:09-07:00","id":290212,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Tirien enters a conversation with Ciaran, the chieftain of Finn's clan, and Orin Dead-Eyes, a Terrestrial Skald, who is also blind. Evidently the Skald is prophetic and saw your coming to Vicruith.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T19:02:15-07:00","id":296379,"title":"","content":"As he prepared to depart the Academy Yi greeted master Feiro with a bow.<br /> <br /> &quot;Please accept my gratitude for your teachings master. Though Heaven may in time see fit to cause me to regret them, I will always be thankful toward you. If I may trouble you with a most impertinent request, might you know where I may learn the mastery of the demon summoning? I am still uncertain the Strategos' army will be sufficient to match the fey host. I have heard of a demon, the iron birds, who may be of use against them.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-04-2014, 09:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T17:37:20-07:00","id":297642,"title":"","content":"Tirien will converse with the Elders, giving her outline for her vision of the campaign and then giving her plan for integrating the veterans into Novalesk, thereby providing them with compensation and a chance for advancement outside of the traditional ways of the Vicriuth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T18:24:18-07:00","id":297664,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;The Summoning of Demons is a most dangerous art,&quot; Feiro says, &quot;And not just for the physical dangers. They pose a spiritual danger as well. I did not teach Vykos to summon the progeny of the yozis until such a time as I taught him how to banish them. If I teach you the same, the same stipulation would apply.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T18:32:27-07:00","id":297685,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> The chieftains are shocked by your revelation that that you intend for your warband to not return to the Vicruith forests, This may harm your recruitment drive quite a bit. <br /> <br /> Anything else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-31T16:40:32-07:00","id":298543,"title":"","content":"&quot;I apologize for this lack of information. I merely see an opportunity here. I foresee an opportunity for Novalesk and the Vicriuth to gain an alliance of blood The situation with Ordon will likely not get better, and I foresee Theros not appreciating the active and powerful spirit courts that your Nation Mother garners when the horizon clears of the Puissant Amethyst, being in the Immaculate Faith.To this end, fostering a good relationship with Novalesk is critical to your way of life. Who better to represent you than your own flesh and blood? Thus, those who wish to stay may do so, while those who choose to return will not be ostracized, being recognized as the proud, valorous soldiers they are. I also swear to you that as long as I draw breath ,I will do my best to foster your sons and daughters to be the proud valiant children of the Vicriuth. As I stated earlier, your warrior's tradition and immense confidence are valuable and sacred in the eyes of Luna. Why not spread it so that others may marvel at the legends and exploits of you and yours' ?&quot; Tirien says, explaining her reasoning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-01T09:27:15-07:00","id":298999,"title":"","content":"&quot;I must respectfully decline master, and seek this knowledge elsewhere. Time has set its hand against me; and sober reflection has revealed that my grasp may not yet equal even a single spell before the reckoning comes, much less two. If heaven grants, it will be eventually, and I will return to learn what I should now.&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC: Going looking for Origenes Hollidane now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-01-2014, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-01T19:25:42-07:00","id":299540,"title":"","content":"&quot;I have learned to not doubt many things, Cinder. I have a feeling that I will not have time to build anything of import in time to make it to the battle, but when I come back I may need to do some of that improvisation you talked about.&quot; Jensven looked around for a bit in thought, &quot;Hey, Cinder. I wonder what the odds are of me making a special sword before I go. How long would it take for me to be able to make an iron sword? Iron not steel like the ones I already have.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T14:42:57-08:00","id":300481,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> The chieftains seem to accept this explanation. Orin in particular thinks it to be a far-sightsee proposal; this lends a great deal of weight to Tirien's words, as the skald is rumored to have the second sight.<br /> <br /> After some more conversation, Ceryd walks up to Tirien and asks for a word in private. The Chiefs and Skalds back off, giving the deity and steward space. <br /> <br /> &quot;Some crazy golden lady just appeared outside the city, and is threatening my warriors. I would appreciate help dealing with the situation. <br /> <br /> Provided you go with Ceryd to the golden lady:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You see a strange blonde woman in ornate, gilded armor with a greenish humanoid behind her. She seems to be squaring off with the finest Geherin warriors. Perhaps they think she is a Fae?<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> (Amelia)<br /> Arg. It's so frustrating! You were on your way to Novalesk, and the you got turned around, and now dammit, you ended up in these woods, and then there was a tunnel full of tiny green men, and now you're here, and these half-naked barbarians are asking if you're a Fae, but you're just trying to get directions, arg, and now there's a barbarian woman in a silver-furred bear pelt and ...<br /> <br /> .... Wait, is that a Dynast?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T15:14:53-08:00","id":300491,"title":"","content":"(Yi) <br /> <br /> You find Origenon Hollidane in one of the poorer sections of the city. The young lady appears to be performing invasive surgery on an elderly man while dictating a message to someone. How she can multitask removing a tumorous mass while relaying news from &quot;her neck of the woods&quot; to a friend elsewhere, you cannot guess, save as a result of her Terrestrial nature. <br /> <br /> She notices Yi's entrance, and cuts off the secretary she was dictating the message to. <br /> <br /> &quot;So, my big sister's newest boy-toy has come to see me?&quot; the wood-aspect says, her focus still on the surgery, &quot;What do you want, my blessing upon your union?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T15:21:37-08:00","id":300497,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;How long would it take you to make a steel sword?&quot; Cinder says with a snort, &quot;though if that's all you want I can vomit one out in like two minutes flat. Forge god, man. It's what I do.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T17:24:09-08:00","id":300563,"title":"","content":"It's one of those days, when everything that could go wrong actually go wrong first they got lost, second they met strange little green men and last she met these guys who are looking for a fight when all she wants is direction. Well if it's a fight they want they will get it but only if they attack her first, after all she need to keep thing from escalating who knows how many more of them are in the region.<br /> <br /> &quot;For the last time guys I'm not a fae, I'm a sword of heaven ! Seriously this is getting ridiculous can you please just tell me how to get to Novalesk before this get violent.&quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia tries to keep a good distance from the geherin warriors but she doesn't seem to have any weapon on her. As Tirien and Ceryd comes into her field of vision she stops talking and take a step back from the geherin warriors something was not right, the barbarian woman is expected but the dynast is unexpected and unexpected can be dangerous.<br /> <br /> Amelia will adopt a more wait and see position for now to see what Tirien and Ceryd are gonna do first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 11-05-2014, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T12:41:07-08:00","id":301430,"title":"","content":"There was something about Hollidane's attitude that hit a nerve in Yi. Even the months since his &quot;retirement&quot; from Lookshy it was still a little raw. He knew, intellectually, that it wasn't meant in <i>quite</i> the same way it normally had been. Even so, his mouth proved faster than his brain.<br /> <br /> &quot;Noble one, I am sorry to hear you have been so misinformed about me. I am not a madman as I should be be to make a request so outrageously above my station. I merely wish your permission to assume the mantle of Archon that I might lead Novalesk into a time of glory such as has not been seen since the first age of the world came crashing down and all was given over to sorrow. Or become first slave of the state and work myself two-thirds to death trying to see it survives until Calibration. I am afraid I can offer no guarantees about the second though, I am but a man doing as best he is able.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T18:26:29-08:00","id":301643,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;So you <i>can</i> be self-flagellating and arrogant at the same time. Who knew?&quot; Hollidane says with a half-smile and raised brows. With a soft ahh, she reaches to a nearby set of tools, and grabs a set of wooden tongs. Sticking them into her patient, she extracts a fleshy mass the size of a small apple. An orderly steps in and begins the process of stitching up the patient as Hollidane walks over to a smoldering brazier. <br /> <br /> &quot;By the grace of Sextes Jylis, I cast you out!&quot; She exclaims as she drops the mass into the flame. Despite the low heat, the fleshy mass is consumed by the fire almost instantly. <br /> <br /> &quot;Now, if I were to believe that you would so selflessly take up the mantle of supreme leadership for our nation, and believe that you're sleeping with my sister, the former Archon, entirely coincidentally, &quot; she says, punctuating her point with the bloody tongs still in her hands, &quot;It still doesn't answer the question of why you're here to see me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 11-04-2014, 12:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T18:59:47-08:00","id":301679,"title":"","content":"<i>I suppose security from assassins does not protect against unverifiable rumors.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Only a citizen of Novalesk can become the Archon, and Origenes is the Gens most open to adopting foreigners of cultivated essence. Larissa suggested that your support would ease the fears of the other elders regarding the particular shade of aureolin I occasional tint the room.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-03-2014, 10:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T17:08:57-08:00","id":302761,"title":"","content":"Hollidane looks up from the sink where she is scrubbing blood off of her hands, &quot;Okaaay. There's so many things wrong with that statement, I'm going to have to make a list.<br /> <br /> &quot;One, you're a Lookshan. <br /> <br /> &quot;Two, that would put the Archon's blade in Origenon hands twice in a row. A large portion of what's let the Archon system work for so long is the unspoken agreement that the Gens that holds the Archon's blade will change every generation.<br /> <br /> &quot;Three, that would cause gross resentment of Gens Origenon; many consider us to not be a true Gens, and they would work tirelessly to revoke the handful of privileges we have, politically.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fourth, you're an Anathema, and aren't exactly hiding that fact. Letting you become Archon would be tantamount to burning our nation to the ground with Terrestrial Fire. <br /> <br /> &quot;Fifth, you're an Anathema, so it <i>would be illegal</i> for you to become Archon.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sixth, that would mean that if Artemia decided to try to kill you, I would be honor-bound to try to stop her. And usually that results in eviscerations. Those are bad, right, Patrolicles?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, ma'am,&quot; says a voice from behind Yi, &quot;very bad.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you, Patrolicles,&quot; Hollidane continues, &quot;Seventh, that would make your ... union with my sister illegal. We have quite strict laws against incest, you know. <br /> <br /> &quot;Eighth, that would require me, an eighteen-year old, to adopt you and uhuahuahua&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T18:22:21-08:00","id":302828,"title":"","content":"Yi look around for a chair to sit in, before catching himself with the knowledge that this wasn't Hollidane's office. The General staff might sometimes commission extremely competent carpenters to make their chairs uncomfortable without looking like they were designed that way, but at least they had them. Standing it was then, though it made him feel like a novice again.<br /> <br /> &quot;First, I was a metic. Any realistic chances of me actually being accepted as a member of the Legion are gone at this point.<br /> <br /> Second, I am fairly certain that particular issue will matter almost not at all. Everyone will recognize why it occurred. Furthermore, I must be up front that I consider my duty to be toward Novalesk as a whole rather than Gens Origenes in particular. I assume every Archon should, in theory, feel the same. If that is the case, Gens should not matter.<br /> <br /> Third, the Gens will be too busy make money hand over fist to bother. I have discussed my domestic policy with several of the representatives here in the city and they are all in favor of the mandates of prosperity I suggested.<br /> <br /> Fourth, neither the Realm nor Lookshy can effectively project power here. Even if they could, I don't think any of the thousand dooms they are dealing with are going anywhere. Their local proxies are never going to ally and even if they did, I have it on good authority that the Geherin will soon be entering a much stronger relationship with us. The balance of power will be maintained.<br /> <br /> Fifth, I am not clear exactly how. I remain human, as much as you or Artemia at any rate, and the only requirements I know of are non-divine and Citizen.<br /> <br /> Sixth, I am entirely confident that if Artemia decided to kill me that the legally obligated bodyguards, or your sister, would deal with her before you even heard of it. Assuming my winning personality and self-flagellating arrogance don't win her over first anyway.<br /> <br /> Seventh, if such a relationship develops between your sister and me that issue will be dealt with if and when it comes up.<br /> <br /> Eighth, that part of the process was not explained to me, and if it so great an issue you could merely offer your belief in my noble intentions to someone ho isn't the sister of my landlord. <span style=\"font-size:8px\">And I'm not that old...</span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-05-2014, 11:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T07:49:58-08:00","id":303267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=300563#post300563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's one of those days, when everything that could go wrong actually go wrong first they got lost, second they met strange little green men and last she met these guys who are looking for a fight when all she wants is direction. Well if it's a fight they want they will get it but only if they attack her first, after all she need to keep thing from escalating who knows how many more of them are in the region.<br /> <br /> &quot;For the last time guys I'm not a fae, I'm a sword of heaven ! Seriously this is getting ridiculous can you please just tell me how to get to Novalesk before this get violent.&quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia tries to keep a good distance from the geherin warriors but she doesn't seem to have any weapon on her. As Tirien and Ceryd comes into her field of vision she stops talking and take a step back from the geherin warriors something was not right, the barbarian woman is expected but the dynast is unexpected and unexpected can be dangerous.<br /> <br /> Amelia will adopt a more wait and see position for now to see what Tirien and Ceryd are gonna do first.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As Tirien approached the newcomer, she sighed inwardly. Things were going so well, and then this had to happen. Well, time to put her best foot forward, it seems.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Ledaal Monos Tirien, of the House of Ledaal, second child of Ragara Bellus and Ledaal Meisara. Might I have your name, Soldier of Gold?&quot; Tirien asks, extending her hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T08:31:31-08:00","id":303320,"title":"","content":"Jensven blinks a few times and then perks up as realization dawns on the Dawn. Shadow perks up nearly instantaneously in response to his master's excitement. &quot;Cinder, can you really make an iron sword that fast? How long until you can do it again? How many could you do in a row?&quot; The Solar fires the questions at the fire elemental in rapid succession, not waiting for a response until he hits the end of the inquest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T08:45:19-08:00","id":303328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=303267#post303267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> As Tirien approached the newcomer, she sighed inwardly. Things were going so well, and then this had to happen. Well, time to put her best foot forward, it seems.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Ledaal Monos Tirien, of the House of Ledaal, second child of Ragara Bellus and Ledaal Meisara. Might I have your name, Soldier of Gold?&quot; Tirien asks, extending her hand.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">After Tirien present herself Amelia smiles finally someone who seems civilized at leas they could talk without all the macho attitude, not that she complains about it but still very impolite</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot; My name is Amelia &quot; </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She gestures towards the green figure behind her. </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot;This is my travelling companion a wood elemental he will present himself if he wishes to do so.&quot; </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T09:39:03-08:00","id":303355,"title":"","content":"&quot;I presume from your attire and company that you are an Anathema...Erm, Solar as well? What may I do for you. then?&quot; Tirien asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T10:08:36-08:00","id":303372,"title":"","content":"Amelia facial expression shows a bit of anger for a moment at the mention of anathema. .<br /> <br /> &quot; I really hate that name may I ask you do not use it again and as for the what you can help me with I am trying to get to Novalesk but we seem to have lost our way... And what do you mean as well ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 11-05-2014, 01:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T10:26:03-08:00","id":303388,"title":"","content":"&quot;My apologies. I am from a Dynastic lineage, so I am still acclimating myself to a non-Immaculate perspective. I will endeavor to not use that word again. I mean Solar as well ude to the fact that I've met several Solars before. I am not of your number, being a Steward, a Lunar, but I have met several akin to you, in Novalesk, no less. I have a guide who will take me back to Novalesk in a few day's time. If you'd like, you can accompany us. I merely need to ready the warband that my hosts have so graciously called for me, and we can depart,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T10:35:17-08:00","id":303391,"title":"","content":"&quot; I would be honored to travel with you chosen of Luna. May I ask the name of the one who is with you and where I am ? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 11-05-2014, 01:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T11:09:50-08:00","id":303439,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Cinder waits until Jensven finishes to answer, &quot;Okay, I'm going to level with you. I can make an iron sword that fast. But I'm a sentient ball of disembodied fire, alright?&quot; The tiny fire-spirit floats around a bit to make his point, &quot;Anything I, me, make is going to take a lot out of me. Spiritually speaking. To maintain high levels of personal production, I need either a sizable cult to provide the necessary power, or I need a body to change the Censor's share of that spiritual heavily lifting and turn it into regular good old-fashioned heavily lifting. Got it?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T11:34:12-08:00","id":303490,"title":"","content":"&quot;This is Ceryd, the nation goddess of the land you're in. Currently, you're in the lands of the Viricuth clans. Somewhat. You did come out of a waypoint just now, so time and space are a little hazy right now,&quot; Tirien says, trying to recall what her master mentioned about the Wyld in all its tomfoolery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T11:49:14-08:00","id":303556,"title":"","content":"&quot; It is a pleasure to meet you goddess Ceryd. &quot; Amelia offer a slight head bow and shows some confusion at the mention of a waypoint &quot; Okay... I have no idea what you just said whats a waypoint ? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T11:51:24-08:00","id":303558,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Alamass and Ceryd are each about to speak up when they are cut off by the two Exalts. Several times.<br /> <br /> With that brief lull in the two Exalts' banter, Ceryd says &quot;a waypoint is the closest thing the Wyld has to a discrete physical location,&quot; before glancing to the wood elemental and asking, &quot;Is yours always like this?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;More or less, madam. And yours?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The same,&quot; Ceryd replies, bonding with the spirit over their shared experiences with Exalts.<br /> <br /> &quot;Since we have found ourselves here, if we might impose upon your hospitality...?&quot; Alamass inquires. Ceryd is somewhat taken aback, but, being a good host, agrees.<br /> <br /> This puts the warriors at ease.<br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T16:19:52-08:00","id":303839,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> As Yi looks around in search of a chair, he notices a red robed man clinging to the point where the wall meets the ceiling in the corner directly behind him. Yi locks eyes with the man and he shrugs (an impressive feat, considering he is currently attached to a wall).<br /> <br /> Post Yi's statement, Holly throws her hands up into the air. &quot;Fine! Fine! I'll draw up the paperwork and-&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Actually, I have everything filled out already ma'am,&quot; Says the voice identified as Patrolicles.<br /> <br /> The strange red-robed man leaps over Yi, and hands Holly a large scroll. &quot;I see my sister is as deviously efficient as ever,&quot; Holly says sourly. Taking a calligraphy pen from Patrolicles, she unrolls the scroll and begins reading it, signing her name in several places in flowingly ornate Old Realm script.<br /> <br /> &quot;How's your daughter, Patrolicles?&quot; She asks while continuing to sign and read the document.<br /> <br /> &quot;Very good, ma'am,&quot; the man replies, &quot;she took her first steps the last Marsday.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah,&quot; Holly says, not looking up from the documents, &quot;they grow up so fast. Treasure these moments; you watch them take their first step, and next thing you know, they're endowed with Celestial fire and running off to conquer sovereign nations. Treasure these moments.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hollidane hands the scroll and pen to Yi, and there is a single unsigned line.<br /> <br /> Will you sign the contract?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 11-05-2014, 07:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T17:10:04-08:00","id":303902,"title":"","content":"&quot;Right. Well, we're having a party if I recall right. Would it be alright if they joined us, Ceryd?&quot; Tirien asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T09:16:52-08:00","id":304665,"title":"","content":"Yi reached out his hands and firmly clasped the scroll and pen. He made no move to take them, but instead turned his face to heaven and began to swear a mighty oath. <br /> <br /> &quot;I call on Sol Incarnate, King of Heaven; Origines father of Novalesk; Asclepius, who has received my oath; Larissa, into whose provenance I now enter; the harvest gods of Novalesk; the weather gods of Novalesk; the Immaculate Dragons whose ways are the living world; and all the gods and courts of the Creation to witness this oath and deal harshly with me should I prove unfaithful. I will not bring shame upon this sacred Gens nor will I abandon my comrade-in-arms wherever I stand in the ranks. I will defend both the holy and the profane things. I will not hand on the nation smaller than I received it, but larger and better, so far as it lies in my power with the assistance of all the other citizens. I will obey the officials who govern wisely and the laws, both those which are already established and those which are wisely established in the future. If anyone attempts to destroy them, I will not allow it, so far as it lies in my power with the assistance of all the other citizens. I will hold in honor the ancestral sanctuaries and hold this blood to be my blood and the blood of my descendants so long as time is time and the Sun is Unconquered.&quot;<br /> <br /> Only then did he bring the implements to him and sign his name with deliberate care.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Prayer Roll to invoke the listed parties to witness this oath of citizenship (which is basically that of Athens). Second Performance Excellency to buy 4 successes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4707158/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4707158/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4707158/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4707158/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 3 successes + 4 =7<br /> Against difficult 7-1(priest) = 6<br /> Success<br /> <br /> Cost: 8 personal motes.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T13:06:13-08:00","id":304931,"title":"","content":"&quot;I would like everyone to maintain control of themselves if you are talking about controlling someone. I was just trying to reckon your ability to make swords. If you were able to just make them out of nothing, I wouldn't see why they wouldn't ask you to do it.&quot; Jensven will pause and then pull out the plain steel sword at his side. He will lay it on a workbench and motion Cinder over.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know you are know all about this. I can't draw up what I want like Hyuga so I will have to try and get my point across this way.&quot; The Dawn will point at various parts of the sword as he talks. It is clear he is having difficulty finding the words he wants. Whether this is because he is more at home speaking Skytongue, or because his vocabulary is lacking is not offered by him. It could very well be both. &quot;I believe this sword is three feet total. I would like to extend that by one foot. I don't want to have all that added to the blade. That would make it hard to use. We would need to make sure we add a little to the handle for every inch added to the blade so the finished larger sword looks like we just stretched the smaller one and made it of iron and not steel. Am I making sense?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jensven is trying to describe the Straight Bastard Sword we hashed out in the OOC thread. If I need to post the stats here or roll Linguistics to get my message across just let me know. Also should the blade suffer because it is made of iron and not steel, I will leave the stat modifications up to you.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T13:10:15-08:00","id":306074,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> &quot;I would hesitate to call an impromptu gathering of my people's leaders on the matter of war to be a 'party',&quot; Ceryd says, &quot;But the lawgiver is welcome to come, I suppose.&quot;<br /> <br /> Assuming you go to the 'party':<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ceryd leads you through the Vicruith metropolis back to the &quot;party&quot;. The chieftains are clearly surprised by the presence of the gilded warrior.<br /> <br /> Upon learning from Ceryd that this is a Lawgiver, they show Amelia no deference. The do, however, ask her of her epic deeds, specifically of the one that gained her Sun's Holy fire. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 11-07-2014, 04:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T15:44:08-08:00","id":306178,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> Holly takes the adoption contract and seals it, saying, &quot;take care of this, would you, Patroliciles?&quot; She then hands the document to the man, who bows curtly before marching out of the room.<br /> <br /> Holly turns back to Yi, clapping her hands together and saying in a sing-song voice a devious glint in her eyes, &quot;Now, mommy has a few more surgeries to perform today. You run along and play nice with the other children. Try not to burn down the city, and no running off to conquer nations, and if you hollow out anyone's souls I'll ground you for a month!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T18:05:30-08:00","id":306295,"title":"","content":"&quot;Before I go, there is one other matter. I have been sleeping on your sister's floor out of fear of knives in the dark. Would your floor be available for that purpose, or shall I continue stepping out of Creation as the Sun does?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T18:10:01-08:00","id":306296,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;I think I got it,&quot; Cinder says. he nods over towards a wall, &quot;Fetch me two kilos of iron dust; third row up, on the far left. And three of those logs over there. Big ones. This... is going to take a lot out of me.&quot;<br /> <br /> Once Jensven has procured the necessary materials, Cinder orders him first place the three logs into the furnace and then to pour the iron dust into the open flame. The dust disperses as it falls far more than it should have, and settles, suspended several inches above the now-burning logs, as if the fire were a viscous fluid. It is almost surreal how quiet the flame-spirit is as he works; a far cry from his usual chatty demeanor. <br /> <br /> Within the flame, the iron quickly melts in the fire, and flows together into a long, narrow shape. It takes several minutes (perhaps twice as long as the advertised two minutes), but the blade is quickly finished, and Cinder passes it out of the furnace through his mouth. <br /> <br /> The blade is long and broad, with a wavy, flame-like edge; a line of Old Realm Script flows along the center of the blade on both sides. The guard is formed of two sweeping aquiline wings, and the hand grip composed of a black carbon-glass. <br /> <br /> &quot;Done,&quot; the fire-spirit says, sounding tired, &quot;Now throw me another log. I'm all tuckered out.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T18:34:45-08:00","id":306303,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;You could come home to stay, but Auntie Artemia is staying in the guest room,&quot; Holly says, &quot;You'd have to sleep on the floor there, too.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T14:47:12-08:00","id":308525,"title":"","content":"Jensven grabs two logs and makes sure the fire is good and stoked. He is experienced at using wood for a forge, but he found that the Guild caravan he traveled with used coal. As he stokes he will admire the blade and offer praise to the forge elemental, &quot;Cinder, even if the blade isn't magical, it will share your name. I will use it to cut a bloody swath through the Fae that stand against Novalesk.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Dawn will dust his hands off and take the blade in hand, &quot;I wonder what these runes mean. I also think with enough training I will be able to use this thing one handed. I will have to use both hands for now, though. You are a great help, Cinder. If you don't mind, I will take Shadow and get a feel for the new 'Cinder'.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T19:35:58-08:00","id":308750,"title":"","content":"&quot;I, too, am curious about your exploits, Lawbringer. Tell us a tale of your bravery and spirit,&quot; Tirien says, lounging rather cavalierly considering she doesn't have any real authority here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T14:38:39-08:00","id":309467,"title":"","content":"&quot;You make a very tempting offer, 'hide from knives against the edge of a drawn sword.' I am afraid I must decline. Conveniently, sleeping on your sister's floor does wonders for delaying the onset of your nibling-grandchildren to the benefit of all involved I am sure. I am afraid I must bid you a good day.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that he exited backward, bowing as he went, with a slight smirk on his face.<br /> <br /> <i>The Gens will know of this as soon as their network of spies can run it to them, which promises both more assassination plots and the likely advancement of my ascension... I need to get back to the better part of town.</i><br /> <br /> With that thought Yi began the trek back toward the hall of the Boule. He had something in mind, an act of... empirical faith to put to the test.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T16:16:14-08:00","id":309557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=308750#post308750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I, too, am curious about your exploits, Lawbringer. Tell us a tale of your bravery and spirit,&quot; Tirien says, lounging rather cavalierly considering she doesn't have any real authority here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amelia looks at Tirien with a playful smile<br /> <br /> &quot; This will be a short story I'm afraid I haven't acomplish much but I can tell you of how I became a solar. I lived in a small farming town near Greyfall, one day a new cult moved in and they seemed pretty harmless but people started to dissapear until one day it was my turn. I'm still not sure how it happened but I was drugged and regained consciousness on an altar made of human bones. I was held in place by two man in strange robe while another was chanting over a green fire before an audience of two dozen people in the same strange robes.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot; It didn't take me long to realize in how much trouble I was, they where gonna sacrifice me or worse and I decided that I wasn't gonna go quietly. I started to kick and claw at the two holding me and before I knew it I wa glowing and holding a golden sword in my hand, I was so angry and full of rage at those who had kidnapped me and well you can guess how it ended for them that night. Other than the faifolk scout party we destroyed on our way here nothing much happened after that.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T20:04:42-08:00","id":309800,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Cinder vocalizes something non-verbally. He spreads over the logs you lay into his forge slowly, and gutters down to a small burn in a way that makes it seem like, were he a human, the tiny spirit is tucking himself into bed.<br /> <br /> He certainly won't object to you leaving.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T20:43:33-08:00","id":309842,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> The streets are slightly crowded on your way back towards the Academy grounds; you see several groups of soldiers in linen cuirasses carrying a vast plethora of weapons run by you. You can tell they're just raw recruits in training, mostly due to the hail of insults and cries to perform better from a handful of grizzled veterans running beside them. <br /> <br /> Recruitment seems to be going well.<br /> <br /> You arrive at the Academy. As a student, you've been granted access to the ground, though you must observe several rules. One, stay off the grass (it messes with the manse's geomancy). Two, obey any spirits that bear the Chancellor's brand. Three, stay off the grass. Four, no eating in the library. Five, stay off the grass. <br /> <br /> The academy ground are busy as well. A number of troops bearing the mon of Gens Nikoloi are guarding the perimeter and removing a number of carts of materials; presumably the first of the thaumaturgical wards.<br /> <br /> You see the first of Maia's iron golems walking the grounds, presumably to offer additional security. You also see a number of shapes flying around above the towers. A strange man, draped in a dazzling blue cloak is seen walking the grounds; he seems to be heading for the Chancellor's office.<br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 11-14-2014, 05:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T21:25:23-08:00","id":309853,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> The Geherin are pretty confused by the whole scenario. Except Orin Dead-Eyes, who raises a palm. &quot;Which green was it most like?&quot;<br /> <br /> The Terrestrial seer then proceedes to conjure several balls of fire. The first is a dull grey-green, the second a luminescent Viridian, the third a deep forest green, the fourth a bright warm red, the fifth a psychodelic scintillating green, and the sixth, a bright blue-green.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-12T06:21:23-08:00","id":310158,"title":"","content":"Amelia point to the fifth ball of fire <br /> <br /> &quot; It's this one. &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-12T12:35:01-08:00","id":310446,"title":"","content":"&quot;You sleep well, Cinder. I'll put a good word in for you with Maia.&quot; With that Jensven takes off at a brisk walk for the woods outside of Novalesk with Shadow in tow. The new blade, Cinder is strapped to his back with the as-yet unnamed 'klaive and standard steel straight sword strapped to either hip. He walks with a new confidence gained after mulling over the message delivered by Helios. The Dawn doesn't know where all this will take him, but he is determined to keep going in the direction that he sees directly in front of him and constantly improving in the things that he is good at or that interest him. Thus lost in thought the Northern Swordsman will buy some freshly seared meat for himself and the dog and then head into the woods.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T08:23:53-08:00","id":311291,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very interesting, very interesting. My exaltation story isn't nearly as daring, though....&quot;<br /> <br /> (I'm not nearly as martially inclined as you are, it seems)<br /> <br /> &quot;I was travelling the East, looking for lore and a sorcerous power, when disaster struck,&quot;<br /> <br /> (I was travelling with my entourage in the Threshold when the worst happened. An Anathema came upon us,&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Lunar Elder, Mejan Holof, came upon us, and....bested me in single combat.&quot;<br /> <br /> (He decapitated my yeddin, maimed my bodyguards, and I ran into the woods to escape being killed and eaten.)<br /> <br /> &quot;However, after I accepted this defeat, and sought to train for it, I found that Luna had blessed me with her Exaltation. Mejan then found me and took me under his tuteelage.&quot;<br /> <br /> (I sought to survive, becoming as a beast, losing all my niceties. However, I lived, even if I hated every minute of it. Because of my will to survive, I was granted Luna;s Blessing as I have now. When I was found by Mejan, He slapped sense back into me, and took me under his wing, refining the effete dueling and martial arts I had learned under my tutors back on my estates. Thus, I stand before you)<br /> <br /> &quot;See? Not at all that dramatic or interesting compared to your own,&quot; Tirien says nonchalantly.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T16:26:36-08:00","id":311721,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, well,&quot; Orin says, a hand upon his chin as the balls of fire dissipate into nothingness. <br /> <br /> &quot;Orin, you realize that one of those was red?&quot; one of the chieftains says.<br /> <br /> &quot;I was making sure he can actually see red, &quot; Orin retorts, turning in the chieftain's vague direction.<br /> <br /> &quot;The lawgiver is a she-,&quot; another begins before a bolt of lightning flashes inches from her head.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now, as I was saying before I was so rudely interupted,&quot; Orin continues nonchalantly, &quot;that reduces the possibilities considerably. Chances are, they were just a Wyld cult. Nothing to be concerned about.&quot;<br /> <br /> As Tirien tells of her exaltation story, the assembled chiefs just seem to be getting more confused. You mean you didn't slay entire armies single-handedly? Weird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T16:41:30-08:00","id":311730,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Jensven's journey to the woods is uneventful as before, and he soon finds himself at his previous location in the old-growth woods he did his training in before. <br /> <br /> So... why did you come here?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T16:58:00-08:00","id":311746,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, well, I am not at the point of slaying armies. I can do various other skills and tricks, though,&quot; Tirien says, and with a flourish, she assumes the form of a regal red-maned gazelle.<br /> <br /> &quot;I bested Reinhanz the King of Gazelles in single combat after three days and three nights. I have also defeated a Grojr with nothing but my fists and wits. I may not be at the level of my master, but I have done some deeds of note, I think,&quot; Tirien says, boasting, insofar as a gazelle can boast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T17:03:18-08:00","id":311751,"title":"","content":"(Tirien)<br /> <br /> The chieftains seem somewhat contented with that. Killing monsters is indeed an admirable start to a heroic career.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T16:30:32-08:00","id":312628,"title":"","content":"Yi made his way toward the chancellor's office. He really did have something to see the man about, even if snooping provided a wonderful motivation all its own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T18:53:19-08:00","id":312697,"title":"","content":"With a wave of his hand Jensven let's Shadow know he can run off and play with squirrels, rabbits, and other small animals. The shaggy, black sled dog dives under a large, exposed root and off to find his own brand of fun.<br /> <br /> The Dawn draws Cinder from the scabbard on his back. He examines it for a while, wondering at what possible message the runic script has. Then admiration comes next. Jensven marvels at the craftsmanship inherent in the blade. It is balanced enough and sturdy to boot. He gives it a few practice swings and even attempts to try it with either hand. Even though, he fares better with the right than the left, he is noticeably clumsy without the support of both hands on the extended hilt.<br /> <br /> &quot;Cinder has done me a great service by making this for me. I do not know why he went to all the trouble when I could have just banged on some iron myself to make it. I hear this metal has special properties against the Fae. I hope this is true. I will certainly put it to the test. The only thing I have to worry about is that iron is unbending. It doesn't have the give of steel. So it would break in instances where steel would bend and spring. I must keep that in mind when I draw this blade, and I must only draw it when I feel it is needed.&quot;<br /> <br /> He practices with this new blade until he starts to get sloppy with his swings. He will then sheathe it and draw the 'klaive given to him by Maia.<br /> <br /> &quot;I still have not named you. You need one.&quot; Jensven stands and looks at the blade for a long while lost in thought and memory. He doesn't even stir when Shadow pads up in front of him, sits, waits, and watches. He is only pulled from his revelry when a tear hits the blade. With a start he wipes the tears away from his eyes and the one from the blade.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have it...Raija's Tears.&quot; He solemnly sheathes the newly dubbed blade and starts to woodenly walk back the way he came. Shadow is already at his heals before the Lawgiver speaks, &quot;Come, Shadow. It is getting late.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T15:03:30-08:00","id":313316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=311746#post311746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Yes, well, I am not at the point of slaying armies. I can do various other skills and tricks, though,&quot; Tirien says, and with a flourish, she assumes the form of a regal red-maned gazelle.<br /> <br /> &quot;I bested Reinhanz the King of Gazelles in single combat after three days and three nights. I have also defeated a Grojr with nothing but my fists and wits. I may not be at the level of my master, but I have done some deeds of note, I think,&quot; Tirien says, boasting, insofar as a gazelle can boast.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amelia is surprise at the sudden transformation of Tirien but regains her composure after a few seconds.<br /> <br /> &quot; You have achieve much already steward but enough talking about past exploit let us speak of how we can make new ones with the exception of the oncomming horde of fairfolks are there any worthy challenge in the regions ? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 11-15-2014, 06:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T15:46:00-08:00","id":313329,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> It is easy enough for Yi to settle a decent ways behind the blue-cloaked man. Yi notices that he is tall, standing at least two meters tall, and sports a magnificent silver-white mane. He seems to have a heavy weapon belted to his right hip. <br /> <br /> The man indeed heads for the Chancellor's office, though he has already entered by the time you arrive. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T15:53:23-08:00","id":313332,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> As you are packing up to leave back into the city, a deep, oddly accented voice says, &quot;You're doing it wrong.&quot;<br /> <br /> As you turn to see a dark-skinned bald man with chiseled features, an axe, a hatchet, a chopping sword and a large bundle of chopped wood. From what you can gather, he is a woodcutter.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now, I don't know if you're trying to be a swordsman or a woodcutter, lad,&quot; he continues, &quot;but if you're trying to become a woodcutter, those are the wrong tools. And you should try to actually hit the trees.&quot;<br /> <br /> The man examines a nearby tree, and almost casually lops off several low-hanging branches as he continues, &quot;And if you're trying to be a swordsman, there are places in the city you can train. Salles and Dojos.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T16:09:57-08:00","id":313335,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> &quot;There's the squirrel-men,&quot; one of the chieftains says, &quot;They invade every summer. Should be coming in the next few weeks. But the Steward needs to be long gone before then.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Black Beast of Lost Tarhoon is said to have returned to the forests,&quot; Said another. <br /> <br /> &quot;And the White Boar-Giant has been sighted in the South,&quot; said one of the female chieftains. <br /> <br /> &quot;The land of the Singing Statues-&quot; Orin says with a smirk, before being cut off by Ceryd.<br /> <br /> &quot;You all forget the Fae with whom we war eternal,&quot; Ceryd says, &quot;And the technosorcerers of Ordon, and their metal men.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T16:42:35-08:00","id":314033,"title":"","content":"&quot;I did promise the Chieftians a boon to aid them next year. I don't see why you could not accompany me,&quot; Tirien says, turning to the gathered chieftains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T20:53:46-08:00","id":314177,"title":"","content":"Jensven is seemingly unsurprised that yet another person has stumbled upon him when he was out in the woods in what he thought was a secluded little clearing. &quot;Would any of those places allow me to keep the dog with me? If not, I'm not interested.&quot; He will then look to the dog in question as if asking him why he didn't warn him of the man's approach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T18:06:04-08:00","id":314975,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> The man shrugs and then hacks off another branch, &quot;I hear one of 'em's run by a dog. So, maybe. But if you keep coming here, the spirits'll expect a tithe.&quot;<br /> <br /> He keeps working, clearing underbrush and pruning trees as you look to Shadow. The Dog cocks his head and gives Jensven a grin, as if saying the man seems nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T20:40:42-08:00","id":315042,"title":"","content":"The Chancellor's office was not exactly on a high traffic route, but Yi did see one of the middle rank staff and motioned her over.<br /> <br /> &quot;If I might have a moment of your time.&quot; He said once she reached him, &quot;I am the commissioner of the thaumaturgic wards currently in production. The chancellor appears to have another appointment, so I wonder if you can't give me a update on the status of the project. There have been some less than ideal reports from the Archon's staff, and I want to confirm that our funding is being spent in the most productive and responsible manner. Changing our supplier so near the counter attack would be quite disruptive.<br /> <br /> As she launched into a hasty summery of things he already knew, Yi leaned back and proceeded to ignore her. With one ear cocked as though listening, his other was right against the chancellor's door where he did his best to hear what was being said.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Eavesdropping<br /> Perception 5 + Awareness 0 + Stunt 2 = 7<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4721570/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4721570/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4721570/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4721570/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 4 successes</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T21:39:00-08:00","id":315064,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;Are you sure?&quot; you hear Feiro say in Old Realm, his tone skeptical.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes,&quot; a resonant tenor replies in the same tongue, &quot;a man. Hollowian from his looks. Wearing priestly robes and a gilded guan.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;That's just one of my students, Hadad. Undoubtedly going about his academic business.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;He is sitting outside of this room, Feiro. I can see him.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You can see through walls?&quot; Feiro says with shocking his voice.<br /> <br /> &quot;You mean you cannot?&quot; Hadad responds equally shocked.<br /> <br /> You can hear shuffling, and Feiro opens the door to his office. Seeing you in the hallway, he beckons you in and waves off the hapless staffer.<br /> <br /> Your estimation of the man's height is low, he must be close to seven feet tall. He sports a full, close beard that flows into his silvery-white hair. A copper circlet sits upon his brow. Beneath his brilliant azure cloak you see a long kilt-like skirt of aquamarine silk and a crimson tunic of a similar material. <br /> <br /> His weapon, a Reaver Daiklaive with a bronzed hilt, sits sheathed next to the couch he is lounging upon. He says nothing, merely glazing at Yi with steely eyes as he drinks from a chalice of Feiro's brandy. <br /> <br /> Closing the door behind Yi, the diminutive Chancellor introduces Yi to Hadad, and vice versa, saying that Hadad is &quot;an important figure in the local spiritual community&quot;. <br /> <br /> With introductions out of the way, Feiro ever so gently inquires as to why you are here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T05:45:16-08:00","id":315296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=314033#post314033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;I did promise the Chieftians a boon to aid them next year. I don't see why you could not accompany me,&amp;quot; Tirien says, turning to the gathered chieftains.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amelia finds it hard to believe that so many threats exist so close to one another. It seems the sun chose to send her here for a good reason after all, soon her skills and ferocity would be put to the test. <br /> <br /> (Amelia will wait for the chieftains answer)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T09:10:11-08:00","id":315456,"title":"","content":"&quot;Chancellor, I am here in my capacity as a special assistant to the Strategoi. In the interest of marshaling all available resources, I had hopped to empower our divine allies with a greater instantaneous abundance of prayer than natural devotion can produce. To that end, I seek to construct an artifact capable of harmonizing disparate acts of veneration.<br /> <br /> My initial thought for for a great bell or chime. Orichalcum that its voice will be grand and silver to make it sweet. In form like a lotus of interwoven lames, fifty-five graven with sutras and eighty-nine with mantras in approximation of the golden ratio and in sum one hundred and forty-four, a number of great auspiciousness.<br /> <br /> With such an item it may perhaps be possible to approach the least portion of the adoration due to heaven and its king as well as Origenes Sosiethnos and all the gods and goddesses of Novalesk.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Basically, it is meant to expand or remove the cap on partial teamwork for prayer rolls. So if you got a giant crowd praying around it you could get obscene numbers of successes. It may or may not serve to supercharge a gods cult background, provide them a flood of essence like the hecatomb Ahlat used in the test fight with Octavian, or get them high as a kite from shooting of prayer up their essence.<br /> <br /> 55, 89, and 144 are all Fibonacci numbers.<br /> <br /> 144 is rather interesting: <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/144_(number\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/144_(number</a>)<br /> Not especially the perimeter of the New Jerusalem (Jade Pleasure Dome?), the 144th Psalm, and Sonnet 144. The last is sort of funny for Yi. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-18-2014, 12:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T16:52:57-08:00","id":315767,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;That would be a greater wonder,&quot; Feiro says with a raised brow, &quot;If our facilities can even construct such a thing, it would be the work of years, if not decades. And our artisans surely lack the skill or materials to make such a thing, especially in such short notice.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Smiths of the Underworld and Malfeas possess both the skill and facilities to perform this task,&quot; Hadad says with a toothy grin, &quot;and you may be able to find a similar item in either realm or on Ram-&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Do not speak of that place,&quot; Feiro says, cutting the spirit off.<br /> <br /> &quot;Very well,&quot; Hadad shrugs. &quot;Though,&quot; he haves vaguely with his chalice, &quot;I am aware of a device that may serve your needs. An altar of purest marble, encasing an endlessly flowing hourglass of crimson sands. It is said that by placing an effigy made of a magical substance upon the altar the power of prayer to that being is magnified tenfold.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T17:12:54-08:00","id":315773,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> &quot;Aye,&quot; Orin says &quot;and a might warrior such as the Sun-touched would be a welcome addition against the beastmen. But that future is Far. Your concern must be for the nearer future.&quot;<br /> <br /> Darmud nods in agreement, &quot;Aye. There are many would would want, nay, need tales of your Heroic exploits to prove your worth as leader of a warband. To embark on a quest now, even a short one would do naught but aid your cause. Fight the Wizard-Master of K'ord. Brave the Terrors of the Lost City of Moxe-Ulto. Travel to Bargat, city of the Wing People. Or simply travel into the Wyld to war upon its denizens.&quot;<br /> <br /> The other chieftains murmur in agreement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 11-18-2014, 09:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T18:06:32-08:00","id":315795,"title":"","content":"&quot; This sounds promising can you tell me more about these places and people ? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T19:59:19-08:00","id":315842,"title":"","content":"&quot;The mortal labor of half a decade is but a pair of seasons to the Sun-blessed artisans. Even so, I bow to the practical realities. Novalesk can ill afford to divert resources to such a project at this time.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning politely to Hadad he continued. &quot;I would be greatly honored if you would inform me still further of this object.&quot; His expression suggested it wasn't the only thing we wished to know more about. &quot;However, I would not wish to interrupt your own errand with the chancellor.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T21:38:50-08:00","id":315909,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> The collected chieftains and skalds swarm you with information, but it sums up to this;<br /> <br /> The Black Beast of Tarhoon is a terrifying monstrosity that can apparently move faster than sight, and is nigh impossible to see anyway. It has a cry so mournful that even the most jaded man cannot resist its sorrow, and it suffocates its prey.<br /> <br /> The White Boar-Giant is a huge man, over eight feet in height with skin pale as ivory, and he gives off a miasma of red-black and gold. His strength and stamina are nigh limitless; it is said that they are a boon from a Primeval boar-demon from the dawn of Creation.<br /> <br /> The Wizard-Master of K'ord is a Wyld sorcerer of no small skill. He resided to the Far East, on the cusp of the Middlemarches. He crafts behemoths and Oneiromantic charms, and casts them towards the center to wreak havoc.<br /> <br /> Moxe-Ulto was a thriving metropolis to the South-East of Geherin. It was home to an order of sorcerers who drew their magic from a powerful slumbering demon. One day the demon awoke and devoured the souls of the city's populace. The ruins gave been left empty since; many claim they are cursed.<br /> <br /> Bargat is a place of which the Geherin know little. Only fragmented tales of a city deep in the Wyld, inhabited by &quot;Wing-men&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T21:57:41-08:00","id":315914,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;So this is the fabled silver-tongued Sunchild? One of your students, Feiro?&quot; Hadad says to the Chancellor with a laugh, &quot;you seem to be collecting the sunchildren like they're behemoths.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So, little Sun,&quot; Hadad says to Yi, taking a sip from his chalice, &quot;I am a being with a great deal of resources, connections and personal power. Though I was not told the meaning of this meeting, I suspect it was for your teacher to convince me to throw in behind your little crusade. Am I correct?&quot;<br /> <br /> Feiro nods, a sour look on his face.<br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed,&quot; the spirit purrs, &quot;Now. Your master wants this of me. You want information from me, and will undoubtedly need a guide. That is three things you desire of me, and I cannot think of one I would want of you. I prize my privacy more than the measly offering of worship you can provide. I doubt you have any knowledge, relics, powers or connections I would prize. <br /> <br /> &quot;So tell me, Righteous One, why should I aid you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T07:22:21-08:00","id":316236,"title":"","content":"&quot;That city of Moxe-Ulto sounds interesting. Where is that?&quot; Tirien says, re-assuming her human shape.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T08:00:12-08:00","id":316284,"title":"","content":"&quot;You should aid me for the simple fact that I am going to win in the long run. Please do not mistake that statement for one of overweening pride. It may be that I should die in this task, yet another sun-blessed fool will take my place. It may be that I shall fail and Novalesk fall, yet I will live and grow stronger. In the first case you dice with Plentimon that my replacement will be more favorable to you and your privacy. In the second case you earn my enmity, unreasonable though I see it is with sober contemplation. I presume we are both experienced enough to know that is not a threat.<br /> <br /> However, the I that is before you know is a known quantity. If, when the current unpleasantness is ended, you wish your privacy I will respect that and will swear by Sol and Heaven or whatever else you wish to that effect. However, I do not think that will be the case. Solars do not stay young forever, and I will be a mighty friend to those who prove to be mine.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T10:35:40-08:00","id":316392,"title":"","content":"&quot;Spirits? I didn't think of looking for any of those.&quot; Jensven pauses for a moment allowing the sun to glint off the symbol of the Dawn in his forehead. A brief moment later a golden aura surrounds him and his gaze scans the clearing almost as if he were searching through a crowd for someone of import to him. &quot;I didn't mean any harm to them. I do get your point, though.&quot; The Northerner will suddenly snap his gaze back to the woodsman with his caste symbol shining brightly on his forehead. &quot;What do you mean, &quot;...if I keep coming here?&quot; How many times have you seen me here?&quot;<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will be spending three (3) motes to power Spirit-Detecting Glance for the rest of the scene. I will then crank six (6) motes to power my Awareness Essence Overwhelming in order to look around with Perception (3) + Awareness (3). This gives me a total roll of Perception (3) + Awareness (3) + Excellency (6) = twelve (12) dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4723045/\" target=\"_blank\">four successes.</a> I am specifically looking for any spirits that are sitting around immaterial. All of these nine (9) motes are taken from the peripheral pool. This leaves me with a peripheral pool of fifteen (15) motes.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T16:21:07-08:00","id":316609,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> Hadad chuckles, &quot;Your enmity would mean little to me. The Green and Yellow Suns both count me among the rolls of their Accursed. Your light adds little compared to theirs.&quot;<br /> <br /> The spirit continues, swirling around his glass, &quot;and would you be so ready to add me to the ranks of your allies when I was once the Expressive Soul of the Caliph of Winds, Fourteenth soul of the Divine Ignition?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 11-19-2014, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T16:30:44-08:00","id":316629,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> There are no immaterial spirits about. Or at least there are no immaterial spirits about that Jensven can see.<br /> <br /> &quot;I doubt you want to harm them. But those of us who use these woods must pay for the right. A court of mighty elementals rules this forest,&quot; the woodsman says, chuckling to himself, &quot;How else do you think there would be an old-growth forest so close to a city of that size?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;And I only saw you twice,&quot; the woodsman continues, tying the recently cut branches to his bundle, &quot;Some days ago, I saw you battling another warrior, one draped in red cloth. I thought not to interrupt a battle. And then today, of course.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T16:35:51-08:00","id":316633,"title":"","content":"(Geherin) <br /> <br /> &quot;It is found some ways Southeast from here,&quot; Ceryd says, &quot;You must either pass through the forests of the Squirrel-men, or over the Southern plains with its slavers. Or you can venture across a Way. A freehold, made by refugees from the Crusade, is built nearby the city. It was they who awoke the demon and destroyed the city. With appropriate magics, you can open a Way there, but such a Way may be treacherous, and will certainly be guarded.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T16:56:13-08:00","id":316640,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think that the Way would be quickest, if it is an option,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T17:24:03-08:00","id":316721,"title":"","content":"&quot;As I said, I make no threats. In return you need make no boasts. I am sure that neither will be called to the test.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi could think of a dozen terrible things such a spirit could suffer worse than death, and eventually he or some other Chosen would be powerful enough to do them to the likes of even Ligier Verdisol. Still, he understood the need not to show weakness in negotiation.<br /> <br /> &quot;As for that which you are, I seem to recall but a single reference to the Yozi you mention, which described it as, 'the mother of Creation, about whom nothing more is known.' I prefer to avoid judgments without knowledge.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T17:36:45-08:00","id":316725,"title":"","content":"&quot;How can we open this Way you speak of ? And what is a freehold ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 11-19-2014, 08:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T18:14:28-08:00","id":316785,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> &quot;The Stewards can learn such arts, but I doubt that Lady Tirien has that power at her disposal,&quot; Ceryd says, &quot;So I will offer to your service one of my Fae vassals. A Guide who can lead you along the Way.&quot;<br /> <br /> She reaches within her robes, and draws out a crystal sextant. She offers it to you two.<br /> <br /> &quot;To call the Guide you need only walk into the Wyld and call upon it. Teleri is it's name,&quot; Cery looks up to the moon before continuing, &quot;though the hour is late. I advise rest before embarking on this quest.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T18:44:35-08:00","id":316815,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed,&quot; Hadad says, &quot;That is an image SHE actively cultivates. HER essence is most ephimeral, the hardest to differentiate, because HER essence is defined by how it interacts with others. Even I know little else about HER, since she acts only in regards to HER peers and highest souls.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hadad sighs, &quot;Though, I am not a part of HER any longer. For reasons unknown, SHE excised the Caliph of Winds from HER self. I am an Orphaned Demon.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The technical term is a 'Druj',&quot; the Chancellor chimes in.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fine, I am a Druj,&quot; Hadad spits back, &quot;And I am here because I grew tired of every artificer in Malfeas asaulting me to render my Essence into a Greater Wonder. I am a King! A King dethroned by powers beyond me!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T19:29:13-08:00","id":316874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=316785#post316785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin)<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;The Stewards can learn such arts, but I doubt that Lady Tirien has that power at her disposal,&amp;quot; Ceryd says, &amp;quot;So I will offer to your service one of my Fae vassals. A Guide who can lead you along the Way.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> She reaches within her robes, and draws out a crystal sextant. She offers it to you two.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;To call the Guide you need only walk into the Wyld and call upon it. Teleri is it's name,&amp;quot; Cery looks up to the moon before continuing, &amp;quot;though the hour is late. I advise rest before embarking on this quest.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Yes it would be best to rest and begin our journey with our full strenght.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T21:42:21-08:00","id":316937,"title":"","content":"Though he had the propriety not to ask, Yi did wonder why Hadad was so insistant on proper gendered terms for something that almost definitionally lacked gender. He also avoided the potential insult of mentioning that a <i>mere</i> demon of the Second Circle likely wasn't sufficient for the greatest of wonders.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will not offer you a crown, I suspect it would mean nothing if you received it from another, yet I will say this. Whatever you were, you can be more. That is the same path I walk, though perhaps to another end.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T22:33:03-08:00","id":316955,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods and gestures around the clearing, &quot;I've been here every day since the bout with the other warrior. I prefer this to that...that city. I'm sure there is nothing wrong with it and things like the foundry, the library, and the artificery amaze me. I am more at home in woods and in a place that isn't this fickle in weather.&quot; He starts toward the city. &quot;Thank you for your work out here and your advice. I will look for the building where the dog trains warriors. Maybe he will teach my dog to warn me of those who come near.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T10:36:32-08:00","id":317543,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well. I has been a long day. Though, if any of our hosts wishes to join us tomorrow, their help would not be declined,&quot; Tirien says, retiring for the night. She'll let Dero have his fun tonight. She'll retrieve him tomorrow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T12:12:27-08:00","id":317617,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> You are shown to rooms in a large tree-house. It is a cozy home, and your pallets are covered with thick woolen blankets and many a large pelt.<br /> <br /> The next morning, you see much hustle and bustle, as the chieftains are setting off to their respective homes now that the moot is concluded. Tirien finds Dero in the same watering hole he was in earlier, though now he is wearing a clan tartan over his Novaleski street clothes. He is still hanging out with that young lady of approximate age as him.<br /> <br /> Amelia is approached by Alamass, who says, &quot;I have spoken with Lady Ceryd. She suggested that I stay behind, since your exploits would be seen as more impressive without my presence.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 11-20-2014, 03:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T13:54:22-08:00","id":317685,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> &quot;You are naive, little Sun,&quot; Hadad says, before downing the rest of his liquor, &quot;But I suppose aiding you in this will cost me little enough and earn me a future boon.&quot;<br /> <br /> The druj rises from his couch and throws aside his cup, &quot;Feiro summon for me one of the Seventy Beasts As One this evening. It will be able to confirm whether or not the Altar is still where it was when I left Hell.&quot;<br /> <br /> He looks to Yi while belting his daiklaive back on, &quot;Ready yourself and gather your allies, child. We leave for the Demon City at dawn.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hadad strides from the room. Feiro rubs his temples, an expression of exasperation and frustration on his face.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T13:56:12-08:00","id":317689,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> The man shrugs and continues his work, hefting his large bundle.<br /> <br /> Given that the man interrupted you when you were about to leave, I presume you are heading back to the city. but where in the city are you heading to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T15:34:33-08:00","id":317727,"title":"","content":"Once Hadad was gone Yi turned to Feiro. &quot;There is a great deal that was not said, most of which I do not but should know. I humbly request you slay such of my ignorance as you will.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T16:35:19-08:00","id":317768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=317617#post317617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Geherin)<br /> <br /> You are shown to rooms in a large tree-house. It is a cozy home, and your pallets are covered with thick woolen blankets and many a large pelt.<br /> <br /> The next morning, you see much hustle and bustle, as the chieftains are setting off to their respective homes now that the moot is concluded. Tirien finds Dero in the same watering hole he was in earlier, though now he is wearing a clan tartan over his Novaleski street clothes. He is still hanging out with that young lady of approximate age as him.<br /> <br /> Amelia is approached by Alamass, who says, &amp;quot;I have spoken with Lady Ceryd. She suggested that I stay behind, since your exploits would be seen as more impressive without my presence.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;It is understandable but you will be missed on this quest my friend. Do you know anything about this Moxe-Ulto ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T16:40:23-08:00","id":317770,"title":"","content":"(Geherin)<br /> <br /> Alamass shakes his featureless head, &quot;Sadly, no. It must have been a creation of the Shogunate era or of this Age.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T16:47:42-08:00","id":317775,"title":"","content":"Jensven heads back into Novalesk. He doesn't immediately seek out the building the woodsman suggested, but instead heads back to the Artificery. He looks for Maia because he had a question come to him and he really would like the answer to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T16:50:49-08:00","id":317792,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well. Let us get hence! Vicruith! We will now lead a valiant expedition to Moxe-Ulto and delve in its ancient secrets!&quot; Tirien yells, to no one in particular, more to pump herself up than anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T17:22:32-08:00","id":317812,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> Feiro sighs and pours himself a tall drink. As he sits onto a couch, the cup frosts over heavily in his grip. The perks of being an Air Dragon, I guess.<br /> <br /> &quot;About three hundred years ago, Hadad came to Novalesk. He was alone, tired and ragged, but Origenes noticed his presence. He and the present Chancellor waged an Epic battle with him, and bound him, body and spirit. They learned not only what he admitted to you today, but of why he had to flee Malfeas. <br /> <br /> &quot;Most of Hell's artificery is built around dissolving demons into Infernal Relics, but doing so with Second Circle souls is difficult not only for their power, but also for fear of offending their greater selves. Drujs are rare prizes indeed, and, as he claimed, the artisans of Hell were quick to snatch Hadad up. It was only a matter of time before the greatest of Hell's artisans learned that Cytherea had cast out one of her souls. Ligier wanted Hadad and his peers for himself, and dispatched a number of his apprentices to collect them. One of them was one of the Devil-Dragons. One of Hell's Exalted. <br /> <br /> &quot;The others fell to this force, but Hadad was a King, and his Domain stretched long a wide at it's height. Though only a shadow of its former glory, his armies felled many of the hunters, and Hadad swept the others away. In the end, Hadad faced the Exalt and in their battle, threw it across the face of Malfeas. And right into the Celestial Embassy.&quot;<br /> <br /> Feiro sighs, &quot;Needless to say, the Exalt did not survive. And so, for slaying his champion in such a spectacular and public fashion, Ligier added Hadad to the rolls of his accursed. His light would burn the druj just as it burned a mortal, and any who brought him to the Green Sun would be rewarded with the resulting wonder.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;By the time he ended up here, he had been fighting non-stop for nearly three years. While the Chancellor of the day proposed slaying him, Origenes was moved by his plight. Or didn't want a useful tool to slip from his fingers,&quot; Feiro shrugs, &quot;Or both. He's like that. Casting his sorceries, Origenes released Hadad from his bindings, but cut away his natural progenitive powers.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;He lost everything. His throne, his rights. He was spiritually castrated and his very essence was altered. He's built something of a new life here, selling his sorcerous knowledge and power. But what he wants is a return to his former station. And that is something he's not likely to have so long as he remains as an enemy of both Heaven and Hell.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T17:37:41-08:00","id":317816,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Jensven heads to the artificery and finds Maia there, a completed iron golem shell present. She has a great deal of sorcerous panoply with her. You deduce that she's probably going to summon a spirit to fuel the golem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T17:55:38-08:00","id":317823,"title":"","content":"(Geherin) <br /> <br /> You head to the Wyld zone within both Tirien and Amelia arrived at the Vicuith capital. Upon calling the name of Ceryd's Guide, you begin to hear some odd music:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;O! What are you seeking,<br /> And where are you making?<br /> The people are reeking,<br /> Their minds are a-ailing!<br /> O! tril-lil-lil-lolly<br /> the Wyld is jolly,<br /> Tra-la!&quot;</i><br /> <br /> An elfin figure in bulbous, garish clothing rides in upon a goat. The figure is sitting upon the goat backwards, and it is running backwards. Or the entire goat is backwards, and the figure is sitting upon it frontwards. <br /> <br /> The figure performs a neat bow and says in a sing-song voice, &quot;<i>Teleri, Guide of the Ways, at yon service</i>.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T18:10:26-08:00","id":317834,"title":"","content":"&quot;We seek the Way to Moxe-Ulto, sirrah. Guide us, if you will,&quot; Tirien says to the Fae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T09:17:59-08:00","id":318304,"title":"","content":"Shadow is the first to enter the Artificery and attempts to be a contained bundle of energy as he sits next to Maia wagging his tail rapidly back and forth. He fidgets occasionally until he is noticed. Once noticed he will bound playfully around in a somewhat circular pattern, making half groan, half whine noises.<br /> <br /> Jensven walks in behind the shaggy canine and admires Maia's handiwork for a moment while the dog gets the excitement out of his system. He stays prepared to reprimand his companion if Maia is flustered by him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T15:00:19-08:00","id":318528,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey-tri-li-lally!&quot; the Fae sings, leading Tirien, Amelia and Dero on. In mere moments you find yourself within a a forest of tin-leafed trees. It is completely and utterly unspectular. Time seems to stretch on: it is nigh impossible to tell the passage of time when the Sun and the Moon both hang from the sky from a string. <br /> <br /> Some indiscernible time later, you find yourselves around a boiling lake. You can barely make out an island at the center of the lake; Teleri sings that to continue on your journey, you must cross the lake. <br /> <br /> A squat humanoid who seems to exude an odor of raw revulsion sits in a rowboat not far the shore.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T15:06:28-08:00","id":318530,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, puppy,&quot; Maia says in a childish voice. She shifts her burden to her left (prosthetic) arm, and reaches down with her natural hand to pet the dog's head. She glances to Jensven and says (in her normal voice) hiking a thumb at the now banked Cinder, &quot;I take it you're the reason he's out?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T15:59:13-08:00","id":318549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=318528#post318528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Wyld)<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey-tri-li-lally!&quot; the Fae sings, leading Tirien, Amelia and Dero on. In mere moments you find yourself within a a forest of tin-leafed trees. It is completely and utterly unspectular. Time seems to stretch on: it is nigh impossible to tell the passage of time when the Sun and the Moon both hang from the sky from a string.<br /> <br /> Some indiscernible time later, you find yourselves around a boiling lake. You can barely make out an island at the center of the lake; Teleri sings that to continue on your journey, you must cross the lake.<br /> <br /> A squat humanoid who seems to exude an odor of raw revulsion sits in a rowboat not far the shore.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>As they reach the lake Amelia turns to Tirien &quot;Is it always like that in the Wyld ? It is very disorienting and confusing, this lake even more so.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T17:57:16-08:00","id":318588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=318549#post318549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As they reach the lake Amelia turns to Tirien &quot;Is it always like that in the Wyld ? It is very disorienting and confusing, this lake even more so.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>A bipedal zebra floats by, sipping a cup of tea while on a rocking chair. &quot;<a href=\"http://youtu.be/d9VU4vms89A?t=34s\" target=\"_blank\">Oh, it gets much stranger, Kevin</a>&quot;, it says before floating off into the distance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T10:01:58-08:00","id":319036,"title":"","content":"&quot;If I knew it would tire him out so much, I wouldn't have let him do it,&quot; Jensven will mention as he draws the other Cinder from his back. &quot;I told him that I would like to have an iron sword of a size that was different from others. My question was how long it would take me to do it. He did say it was going to be stressful for him, but I thought he was going to just be a little less chatty. I am sorry if you are having trouble because he is out of it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jensven admires the blade for a while as he continues, &quot;I doubt I could have made it as fast as he could, but I could do it faster than I used to make many of the simplest things. I also wouldn't be able to make it as intricately detailed. I probably would have just made a hunk of sharpened, balanced metal.&quot;<br /> <br /> Shadow gives a puppy grin as he is given the attention he asked for. He then finds a comfy corner to lay down in. Shortly after laying down he heaves a sigh as if all this talk without activity bores him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T20:11:08-08:00","id":319576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=318588#post318588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A bipedal zebra floats by, sipping a cup of tea while on a rocking chair. &quot;<a href=\"http://youtu.be/d9VU4vms89A?t=34s\" target=\"_blank\">Oh, it gets much stranger, Kevin</a>&quot;, it says before floating off into the distance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speechless at the apparition Amelia simply watches as the zebra flies away in the distance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T17:17:56-08:00","id":320258,"title":"","content":"&quot;Truth be told, I've not spent more than a day and a night in the WYld at once. Although, this seems par for the course, Amelia,&quot; Tirien says. She then turns around to the humanoid and salutes.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hail, Ser Fae. I wish to pass through. While I would be willing to use force to do so, I would prefer not to,&quot; she says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T21:31:32-08:00","id":320361,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, he's fine,&quot; Maia says, &quot;he's just a bit of a drama queen. As you no doubt noticed.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia takes a good look at the sword, and smiles, &quot;the little fire is a good smith, though I would hardly call him the 'Greatest Smith Under Heaven and Earth'.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T05:46:50-08:00","id":320644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=320258#post320258\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Truth be told, I've not spent more than a day and a night in the WYld at once. Although, this seems par for the course, Amelia,&quot; Tirien says. She then turns around to the humanoid and salutes.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hail, Ser Fae. I wish to pass through. While I would be willing to use force to do so, I would prefer not to,&quot; she says.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Well that's comforting.&quot; Amelia take's a look at Deros then at Tirien and points a thumb in his direction &quot;Can he handle himself in a fight ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T10:15:16-08:00","id":320868,"title":"","content":"&quot;This trip will take ten days at least, likely longer, and I am not sure that my political mechanizations, and the peace between the gens I brokered, will survive that without me. Things are in too much flux for the gens to leave things as they are. As for Hadad, his hopes are sufficiently frustrated to make him jaded, yet the suggestion of his restoration could be a tremendous lever for a very long time.&quot;<br /> <br /> He glanced at the chancellor and the look on his face. &quot;Did you suppose I hadn't read the Book of the Prince, the Autocrats Manual, or any of the other books on politics?&quot; He let out a sharp little laugh. &quot;I wrote commentary on them, at times berating them for not fully embracing their core thesis. I have practiced those methods and know they are effective. Yet I have also seen that they are empty, and change nothing for the better. That is why I chose not to follow them, even though virtue has made my life far more difficult.&quot;<br /> <br /> He was silent for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;Would it be possible for some situation to come up that prevents the summoning tonight? I should only require another day. Also, could I trouble you to have a sorcerer on staff dispatch one of the excellent infallible messengers to Jensven of the Dawn Shadow and Hyuga of the Twilight Sword? Message as follows, 'Yi, fellow servant of Creation, begs your accompaniment on a mission to Malfeas of vital import to the nation. He awaits at Origene's Temple tonight.' I do not know if they shall come, but I would welcome additional chosen and cannot justify weakening the existing power structure.<br /> <br /> I would also like to borrow one of the demon moths necessary for a mortal to survive the Miasma of Yozi, likely Jensven will desire to bring his hound.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-24-2014, 01:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T15:27:50-08:00","id":321111,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Dero indicates that he regularly fought half-starved dogs as a child. And once he stabbed a Fae noble. C'mon, country girl, Dero indicates, get out of that armor and he'll take you, strained arm or no.<br /> <br /> The figure in the boat is motionless, but you hear a mellodious voice echo from the craft. &quot;I am Stannwald of Tin, First Knight of Yttrus! By my Liege Lord's command, I must bar your passage. Three cups sit behind you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning around, you see a table on which three glasses. One holds a steaming liquid similar to the lake's. The second, a viscous green liquid. And the third, a fizzling pink liquid. <br /> <br /> &quot;Each glass may be poisoned. Drink of a poisoned glass and you shall never cross these waters. Choose a safe glass, and I will ferry you across!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T15:58:04-08:00","id":321136,"title":"","content":"(Yi) <br /> <br /> &quot;I can attempt to stall him,&quot; Feiro says, &quot;but I have no guarantees that he will not move ahead without the demon he demanded.&quot;<br /> <br /> The chancellor looks confused as he continues, &quot;Hyuga and Vykos left several days ago to investigate one of Ptreas Lykos's findings upriver. He came here with you. I assumed he let you know.The one called Jensven has been spending a great deal of time in the artificery, speaking with the forge spirits. Seek him there. If he is not, tell one of the forge spirits to send me a message, and I will see to it. &quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We are not so well endowed with Malfean paraphernalia to have those items. In the rare event that one of my staff ventures into the Demon city, we make use of an alchemical formula to protect ourselves. I'm sure that we have some in the Alchemy labs. Is the beast soul-bound to your companion? If it is, their joined essence will keep it safe.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T20:13:05-08:00","id":321344,"title":"","content":"&quot;He does seem to have a big head about things, doesn't he?&quot; Jensven will put the blade away. &quot;He also likes to talk about your backside. I don't see how one such as he is able to care about such things.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Dawn will move onto the purpose of his visit, &quot;Maia, I was wondering if there was a need to make sure these golems would need to be guarded on their way to the battle. I could do it if I am not needed sooner. I would hate to see anything happen to them before we could put them to use.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T11:05:00-08:00","id":323768,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh really?&quot; Maia laughs, &quot;his interest in such things is...&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia trails off as you hear murmuring from Cinder's furnace, &quot;Oh yeah... Tien Yu... Slather that jam... All over my toast. You beautiful goddess that lives in my province...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, that,&quot; Maia says waving a hand towards Cinder. She walks over towards his furnace and casually reaches in with her flesh hand, picking up the charred remains of a log, on which the fire-spirit is burning, &quot;I know you're awake! That timing was too good! Why are you trying to set me up with him?&quot;<br /> <br /> Cinder sparks to life. &quot;Cause he's nice, and likes making things and you're not gettin' any younger,&quot; Cinder says drowsily. <br /> <br /> Maia tosses Cinder back into his furnace and shrugs, looking somewhat embarrassed. She shakes her head as she launches into the second question, &quot;I don't think we'll have to worry about that. They're staying on academy grounds until the Stratos departs, and if the Fae want to get them here, they'll have to contend with several score minor demons and elementals. They would need a strike force of multiple Nobles with significant backup to destroy them, and they'd take significant losses. In which case they will ha e served their function.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T08:42:48-08:00","id":327055,"title":"","content":"Upon learning that not one but two Solars had skipped out when there was a war ongoing Yi muttered, a brief curse about his own, presumed, misdeeds in a past life. With a slow breath he calmed himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;This complicates things, though it seems every thing I learn and person I meet does the same. In case I do not see you before I leave, thank you for your efforts and for any time you are able to grant me.&quot; He gave a quick bow and departed for the tower of making Jensven was wont to frequent. He took in the presence of the forge-mistress and the Solar in a glance and dismissed any potential implications. It was none of his business.<br /> <br /> &quot;Holy one,&quot; he said bowing to Jensven. &quot;Mistress&quot; to Maia. &quot;I am afraid I must beg a mighty favor from the Ascending Sun. Circumstances call me to walk the path of desolation to Malfeas to seek a powerful relic. I believe that with its power the greatest strength of my grandfather Origenes can again be called to serve the nation, and even if I am wrong it will substantially empower our divine and exalted champions. However, the journey will be long and likely dangerous. Never would I claim the Sun had not given me strength enough for those tasks I must perform, but it is good to have a friend by your side when you walk to road to hell. If only to help you know when to turn back from it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T08:27:33-08:00","id":328232,"title":"","content":"&quot;All of them are poison, Stannwald. You never mentioned that we needed to drink them, although your hints imply that we should. Well played, but ultimately meangingless. That is my answer,&quot; Tirien says","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T18:48:46-08:00","id":328827,"title":"","content":"Jensven silently thanks Yi for the interruption to what could have been a very awkward line of discussion, &quot;You want help going somewhere Demons live and grab a magic something or other for the god of Novalesk? Since you were so amazing in that fight against the fae in the foundry I accept. Even if I didn't have that excuse, this seems to help against the fae. I am game for anything we can do to make it harder for the fae.&quot;<br /> <br /> Shadow pads as silently as he can up behind Yi and sits, wagging his tail idly. While he remembers Yi from before he is studying what is going on and hoping this will be more exciting than the talk of golems, forge gods, and eligible, bachelorette forge-mistresses. He longed to run, jump, and maybe even roughhouse something. Maybe that stinking mouse from before. It had escaped him and he had yet to find it again.<br /> <br /> The Ascending Sun indicates the sitting dog, &quot;You think we could take him along or would it be too dangerous for him? He isn't much more than a normal dog when swords start swinging. Although, he has fought a demon before. A blood ape, I think it was called, decided it wanted to make a snack of some of our girls. Our go...jarl had other plans. He led some of the reavers to hunt it down and brought the hunting dogs. Well, they tracked it down well enough. They ran when they saw it, though. Not Shadow. Shadow put himself between the girls and the demon. Had the reavers not used that moment to attack, the dog probably wouldn't be here.&quot;<br /> <br /> Despite being loquacious, Jensven seems to be melancholy. He pauses for a long while before speaking a short, simple phrase, &quot;With or without the dog, you have my sword.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T20:19:42-08:00","id":328857,"title":"","content":"Yi was generally used to long speeches being in the form of practiced rhetoric. This was uncomfortably close to smalltalk, which always made him uncomfortable.<br /> <br /> &quot;And glad am I to have it. Truly, I do not know about your companion. The chancellor seems to believe that it shall be preserved by virtue of its link to you though you may wish to ask him so that he may observe directly. We leave dawn tomorrow or the day after, depending on the plans of an ally I cannot easily account for. Here is probably the best place to meet to begin the journey.<br /> <br /> As for battle, I have heard tales of Anathema, who were accompanied into battle by beasts that were nearly demons themselves. I may be you could further cultivate your bond with him,&quot; he nodded toward shadow, &quot;and thereby ready him for greater conflicts.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T19:53:15-08:00","id":329817,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will have to go and see the chancellor now, then. I hope he doesn't mind Shadow coming along. You would be surprised how many people get angry when Shadow comes along. They act like he is dirty or contagion ridden or something.&quot; Jensven reaches down and ruffles Shadow around the head and shoulders as he speaks. &quot;I don't understand it. He isn't going to eat anyone.&quot;<br /> <br /> The north-eastern armorsmith turned warrior will then turn to Maia and address her awkwardly, &quot;We can talk about this later. When we return from the trip, perhaps?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T21:31:26-08:00","id":329863,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> You hear a tsking sound from the boat. &quot;I aknowledge your strength,&quot; you hear Stannwald say,&quot;you have defeated me, and will let you pass.&quot;<br /> <br /> The boat moves ever closer, until it reaches the shore of the lake. It has no obvious means of propulsion, and the figure in the boat (a shapeless form draped in rough, rotting clothing) is utterly motionless. <br /> <br /> Once then entire party is upon the boat (strange that you can all fit when it's only about the size of a two-man canoe), it begins to move landing you upon the shore of the island. Mist from the lake hangs low upon the ground; you can see only a couple of yards in each direction. As soon as you all step off the boat, it shoves off, seemingly on its own. It is mere moments before it and th figure within disappear from view. <br /> <br /> Teleri leads on. As you walk, the stony dirt beneath your feat slowly becomes a solid piece of ivory porcelain. You cannot tell one direction from another; the fog still stands heavily upon the ground. <br /> <br /> Some time later, you arrive at a chasm. You can neither discern the bottom or the other side. You see a bridge made of charred bones arching over the chasm, presumably to the other side.<br /> <br /> An elfin knight stands upon the bridge. He is garbed in heavy plate armor and a tall cylindrical headdress both made of a deep blue metal. He holds before himself a heavy barbed blade of the same material. <br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T22:04:42-08:00","id":329877,"title":"","content":"(Academy)<br /> <br /> Cinder perks up from Yi's talk of empowering the local Divinities, manifesting his spherical head form from the mass of his slowly burning furnace. <br /> <br /> &quot;Allow me to offer my services then, Champion,&quot; Cinder says in a solemn voice, &quot;For I am one of the gods of this nation, and a magnanimous god at that. I feel honor bound to aid those who would come to my service.&quot;<br /> <br /> Cinder hovers about the room, bobbing about to punctuate his points much like a human might do with their hands, &quot;Since I began my existence as a Need Fire, it is within my power to repel minor ghosts and demons. Also, I can cast out disease and curses from animals, protecting Jensven's cow,&quot; he pauses, &quot;No. wait. That's not right... Dog. Right?&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia purses her lips in thought. &quot;As much as I'm loathe to admit it,&quot; she says, &quot;Cinder has a point.&quot;<br /> <br /> She smiles faintly to Jensven, &quot;Of course. When you get back.&quot;<br /> <br /> Will you allow Cinder to come with? And what do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-05T12:11:35-08:00","id":331376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=329863#post329863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Wyld)<br /> <br /> An elfin knight stands upon the bridge. He is garbed in heavy plate armor and a tall cylindrical headdress both made of a deep blue metal. He holds before himself a heavy barbed blade of the same material.<br /> <br /> What do?</div> </div> </div> </div>As she see the armored figure on the bridge Amelia turns to both Tirien and Dero &quot;I'm gonna handle this one.&quot; She aproaches the bridge but stops before stepping on it and looks at the fae. &quot; Greeting, my companions and I wishes to cross this bridge will you let us pass without incident?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 12-05-2014, 05:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T10:07:23-08:00","id":333168,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Brandt of Cobalt. By my Oaths, you may pass my bridge-&quot; the armored figure says, thrusting his sword into the ground. A small army of squat humanoids, each the size of a child, emerges from the porcelain soil. They are made of the same ivory porcelain, but are covered in intricate blue swirls and designs. The features of the creatures seem to be a caricature of popular depictions of the Fae, with aquiline noses stretched into long bulbous hooks and long pointed ears stretched and fattened to the point that they are larger than the creatures' heads. They are wearing peasant garb and wielding weapons made of farming tools.<br /> <br /> As the army forms, the space between the bridge and the party stretches out to accommodate the new arrivals. You can see Brandt standing upon his bridge, arms crossed. &quot;- if you can reach it!&quot; The Fae finishes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-09T08:45:36-08:00","id":335228,"title":"","content":"&quot;Is that right? Well, then. I accept your challenge,&quot; Tirien says, snapping her fingers and erupting into a larger, furrier, and more talon-y version of herself. <br /> <br /> &quot;Jump on my back, lawgiver!&quot; she roars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T14:30:41-08:00","id":339441,"title":"","content":"&quot;As you wish steward.&quot; Amelia leaps onto the lunar's back and grab on &quot; But what about Dero ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T16:12:52-08:00","id":341312,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of course, he gets on your shoulders!&quot; Tirien yells, as she begins to charge ahead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-21T19:11:40-08:00","id":347103,"title":"","content":"<i>Well, that seems to be the best I can manage for assistance on this trip. The Strategoi should have the actual preparations for the offensive well enough handled without me. Larissa should be able to handle the representatives if something comes up. Which just leaves me.</i><br /> <br /> There was nothing for it. He would have to become Archon before he left.<br /> <br /> Once he had walked a ways away from anyone he began to pray. &quot;O Larissa, holy one into whose purview I am now come; o my shelter and my good counsel: I pray you call the Boule to gather and prepare a place for me before them. The times move about us and all is upset. All gain shall be loss unless we temper opportunity with haste.&quot;<br /> <br /> A familiar shiver passed through him as his words left him. Like a winged spirit all breath and light they flew faster than mortal sight, to find the goddess whose aid he most needed.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Invisible Castle appears to be down.<br /> Artifact activation: <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3165/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3165/view</a><br /> Prayer Roll: <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3166/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3166/view</a><br /> <br /> Artifact activates raising my charisma and since I am a priest the prayer succeeds. (Note to self, use gods as cellphone network <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i>Now comes the hard part, framing this such that it is not a lie. I am a liar, a fraud, and many things besides, but I will not lie about this. I will not profane the Sun who has given me this chance. I will not make his choice a vulgar thing. I will not!</i><br /> <br /> Then the answer came to him.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IJiHDmyhE1A\" target=\"_blank\">He began to sing. His voice rose up and echoed against the sky, until it filled all about him in a chorus at once of many voices and of one.</a><br /> <br /> Then he began to dance, and he did not hold himself back. He danced with all his might until one flesh could not contain it. From the merchant prince in the midst of his riches to the widow at her handmill the people rose up and followed him. Though no authorities remained, nothing was stolen from the places he passed; not the riches of the merchant or the last of the widows' flour, for even the thieves answered the call of the mighty one. They passed through the streets like a roaring river, until children ran across the awnings rooftops for there was no room on the ground.<br /> <br /> They entered the place before the Hall of the Boule with a great shout, and some of the guards threw down their weapons and fled for fear that am army had come against them.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Second Performance Excellency + Gathering the Congregation + Heartfelt Honorific Opportunity + Compassion Channel<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3167/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.rpnation.com/styles/rpnlogo12.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3167/view\" target=\"_blank\"> Oops! We ran into some problems. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3167/view\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3167/view </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 13 successes, my effective appearance is 6, and its unexpected.<br /> <br /> 23 m, 3 wp, caste mark is burning</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Hear O Novalesk, the Sun is Unconquered!&quot;<br /> <br /> So caught up in his energy the vast crowd again shouted so mightily that a hundred sheets of gilded silk caught fire in heaven. For an age the law concerning the prayers of the Sun had been forsaken, the sacred orichalc used to line the garments and pockets of those who should have known better. Now they remembered why their mandate forbid anything less than the imperishable hold the due of Sol and trembled at what it meant.<br /> <br /> &quot;I tell you now that the Wheel of Samsara has at last begun to turn. This age of brazen sorrows is at ending and deliverance is at hand!&quot;<br /> <br /> The people, cried out &quot;A Golden Age!&quot; and &quot;Praise the Shining One!&quot; It was in the midst of this riotous exuberance the representatives of the Boule came to the plaza to make their way to the Hall, summoned by the goddess who had been Archon.<br /> <br /> <i>At this rate I will be Archon by acclimation.</i> Putting his cynical thought aside Yi continued.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now comes the Zenith of Novalesk, the noontide of its power and glory. Already the people of the forest have heard the call of unity and answered. Already the gods prophesy that silver shall be as common as stone and ceder wood like the brush of the field. Already the spirits of sickness begin to bow their heads in submission. Hunger, fear, ignorance; all are passing away. I tell you the truth, before your children are old they shall call poverty what is now regarded as wealth. They will call short the life now called blessed with age. They will call small the cities and lands of Novalesk as now they are and shall stretch out their hands to a world vaster and more wonderful than is now upon Earth.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now at last comes the first and final piece in this beginning. For an age the Creation has been prey to the ravages of contagion, the murderous unmaking of the raksha, and the hateful envy of demons. This nation and its god remember these things, and carry still their scars. Yet the time has come for scars to heal. I will go forth, descend into hell itself, and bring back the power that is ours by right.&quot;\u200b<br /> <br /> <i>By right of power and conquest if nothing else. By right of my mandate if I have the power to enforce it.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Yet it is not enough that I go. Not enough I say!&quot;<br /> <br /> The response was mixed though still loud. He could work with loud, passion was clay in his hands. Indifference, now that was hard to shape.<br /> <br /> &quot;I must go for Novalesk and carry with me the authority of the nation that I should be more than a common thief.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Because when nations send people to steal things they call it espionage and the agents spies. Not that I meant definitions entirely.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I must go as the servant of the nation. Not as a retainer of the mighty or an agent of the powerful, but as the slave of all. I must go on behalf of all of Novalesk, not merely at the behest of any who might send me. It must be the nation, and my duty to the nation, that sends me forth.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>I certainly am not doing it for my health.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I must go forth O Novalesk, that I might return bearing with me our victory and lead us into the glorious new age!&quot;<br /> <br /> As he spoke the golden light on his brow flared out so brightly it was like the Sun himself stood before them. When the people took their hands from their eyes they were amazed. Above them the sky was a dome of lapis and sapphire bright as fire and the clouds were like a thousand splendors of gold. In the plaza the change was just as great. The bare earth blazed like ruby and quartz, the glass was as diamond, the cloth shimmered like silk and water, and the lines of age and care were washed away from every face. The little gods who would never know Yu-Shan wept, for such glory was equal to Heaven.<br /> <br /> Now for the finisher.<br /> <br /> &quot;O Novalesk, I am Origenes Yi Zhinan. Will you send me forth?&quot;<br /> <br /> And there it was. &quot;Archon!&quot; they shouted. &quot;Archon!&quot; the chant picked up until their could be no mistaking it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Lets bring this home:<br /> Second Socialize Excellency + Mastery of Small Manners + Heartfelt Honorific Opportunity + Wise-Eyed Courtier Technique + Compassion Channel. The belief is that I should be Archon, and I hope by the timing to have snagged several of the electors. I am rolling 3 dice for a stunt, and Noodle can decide what its actual rating is.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3168/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.rpnation.com/styles/rpnlogo12.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3168/view\" target=\"_blank\"> Oops! We ran into some problems. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3168/view\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3168/view </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 15 successes, 14 if it isn't a 3 dot stunt. My effective appearance is 7, and the social attack is unexpected.<br /> 17 m, 3 wp Anima flared totemic and is back down to bonfire.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 12-23-2014, 04:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T14:35:53-08:00","id":350916,"title":"","content":"&quot;Cinder, your second guess is right,&quot; The Dawn starts in as he reaches down and ruffles Shadow's fur. &quot;Shadow is a dog and he would eat a cow if I put it in front of him. I definitely don't have a problem with you coming along. I don't know if we can keep you safe, and I wonder if we would have to keep a supply of wood for you to sleep in. I think we should ask Yi if he is against it.&quot;<br /> <br /> As Yi leaves without addressing the issue, the Northerner will shrug at Cinder, &quot;We'll just have to get that answer for you later. Be ready, though.&quot;<br /> <br /> Maia's smile doesn't reassure him like he is sure she intends it to. His memory goes again to a calm evergreen forest as a gentle snowfall drifted lazily down. Shadow frolicked through the drifts of snow that had accumulated. The puppy had just reached that stage where he was all gangly legs, bright eyes, flicking ears, and a rapidly swishing tail. Jensven would have called his young companion to him, but he was distracted by something further off. Raven hair tied in a thick braid with large downy flakes resting in it.<br /> <br /> The commotion caused by Yi snaps him out of his reverie. He rushes out and does not get caught up with the crowd as he is afraid of the reaction that Shadow would cause. Standing a good way back, he is unable to make out what the Zenith is saying, for it is undoubtedly Yi judging from the flash of gold caused by the speaker. It is similar to the gold caused by Hyuga and himself. While the Lookshan's words don't quite carry to him as far away as he is, he can hear the responses from the crowd just fine. He wasn't sure exactly what an 'Archon' was, but the people were intent on making Yi that.<br /> <br /> &quot;Shadow, he is very good with a sword. His words are stronger still. I'm glad we can call him friend.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 12-27-2014, 12:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T22:30:34-08:00","id":351356,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> I assume Tirien is activating her war-form?<br /> <br /> Anyways, Dero hops onto Amelia's back. As you charge, the Fae close ranks, and use their farming implements as makeshift pikes. Tirien charges them, and breaks through their pike-wall, but takes 1L damage in doing so. But hey, Dero and Amelia are in melee range.<br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T23:23:59-08:00","id":351383,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> The adoration of the crowds are loud; it seems as if the whole city are present. Yet, seeing the Boule causes it to die down far faster than Yi could hope. As silence begins to fall, a voice pierces the crowds. It appears to originate from a priest whose stole is of woven orichalcum. <br /> <br /> &quot;By what right does this outlander wish to rule us?&quot; the priest shouts, &quot;No right! He claims mandate from the Lords of the Divine City, but so too did Odal Thousand-Fangs, and Karandros the Reaper! He is naught but words! Do not listen to him, sons of Novalesk, he will lead us to ruin!&quot;<br /> <br /> Some small murmuring arises from the crowds. The priest seems to have hit a Novlaski hot-button. He seems about to launch into another tirade when Holly launches herself into the open area surrounding Yi. Her landing is so hard that the stones crack beneath her feet. <br /> <br /> &quot;I know I did not hear that, Kaiphas,&quot; she says, &quot;I know you did not compare my son to two of the worst villians in our history. Otherwise, I would demand satisfaction for bismirching the nobliitiy of my household.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So it is true,&quot; the priest, Kaiphas says, &quot;You did adopt the Anathema. Very well. If he is your son, though, he is of age. He can speak for himself.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T12:24:46-08:00","id":352960,"title":"","content":"<i>Sol, but you are generous.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Peace mother. Pray give your son a moment to think on what has been said. For surely Kaiphas would not speak words without knowledge.&quot;<br /> <br /> He paused as though considering for a moment. When he began to speak his tone was contemplative but firm enough to carry.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anathema... a strange word put to strange purpose. In ancient meaning it meant that which was dedicated to the gods, what we now call sacrifice, and so not put to profane use. Yet if I am a sacrifice, to what am I dedicated? In later use it means that which is in opposition, that which is wholly against the nature of that to which it was compared. It was in that sense that the think it was meant now.&quot;<br /> <br /> He turned to the crowd and began to preach.<br /> <br /> &quot;In the immaculate text, those who shine as the lights of heaven are called the anathema. Yet it cannot be their actions which earns them this title, it is given er they do anything for good or ill. Moreover, are not the fey opposed to all shape, the dead to all life, the demons to all that is not hateful, and in like manner are many things in total opposition to the Creation. If the chosen deserved destruction they earned that fate by their own actions. Unless any here would say that Odal or Karandros did not bring their own doom by the things they did.<br /> <br /> What then are they anathema too? Do not the text say that they sought to change their station, to rise above their place, to refuse to accept the order of things? They are anathema then to the world that is. Yet who of conscious does not deserve the same? Did not they very day an infant die in its cradle? Did not children and elders succumb to hunger while all about them was food? Did not friends come to blows? Did not sickness claim those who could have been save had their been doctors to tend them? Did not ten thousand tragedies occur that did not need to? The world that now endures is a thing of horror. Do not the fey even now march against Novalesk and the oceans of the Wyld wear away the shore of Creation? Do not the shadowlands swell vast from their gluttonous feast upon the slain? Have you not heard of the doom of Thorns, that once great nation that fell in a single day to the unliving hosts?<br /> <br /> Who would accept such a world who did not reign in luxury while Creation burns about them? If this is what I am called wholly against I can think of few higher honors. Yet that cannot be all. For I see you O Novalesk, men and women who have made a life amid the vast circles of the earth, and I <i>know</i> you were meant for more than this. I see all mankind and know we were meant for so much more than this. I will not accept that the son of the farmer must toil in the fields until the work has ground him down because there are not other options for him or his family. I will not accept that the daughter of the weaver must marry and bear children until death or old age mean she can offer no more. I will not accept that we are no more than the product of our circumstances.<br /> <br /> If that is what it means to be anathema, to say that everyone, mortal and mighty, deserves the choice to decide their own future then I will proudly wear that title. Who could use it as an insult and not thereby claim to support all the evils that are now upon the earth?'<br /> <br /> He turned to Holly but still spoke so all could hear him. &quot;So you see mother, Kaiphas has done me a great honor.&quot;<br /> <br /> Then he seemed to consider again.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yet what of outlander? That seems a very odd thing to say? For none of Novalesk sprung up from this native clay. Nor did the gods fashion them and set this here. Indeed, the weight of scholars concur that all mankind has its origin in the far southeast. Is it not true that those who came here all came from elsewhere, that the twin troubles drove many from their homes to this place that is now Novalesk? I know few save Origenes Protogenos who may have claim to call any truly outlander. What then can he mean?<br /> <br /> By law and custom I have become Novaleski, have chosen this as my country. What more can be said of those ancestors who found no nation and cause one to be? Indeed, the child of novaleski born in distant places is still counted among the body of the people. So place of birth is not what it means to be of Novalesk.<br /> <br /> I confess I can think of nothing he could mean save that I bring new ideas which seems an oddly unspecific thing to say. Unless anyone would claim that my mother by choice is not also Origines daughter?&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning to Kaiphas one last time he said, &quot;As for ruling, I really have no desire for it. Governance is a matter of incredible work for little thanks. It requires accepting responsibility for all that occurs without recourse in heaven or earth. There is no aspect of human flourishing I could not possess far more easily without it. In fact, there are few people who actually rule that enjoy the job. Or did you think that the cushion on the chairs in the Boule were so comfortable as to be worth traipsing to Hell and lugging heavy objects across the endless desert for?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T16:22:57-08:00","id":353236,"title":"","content":"&quot;When you have friends, you have to support them,&quot; Jensven speaks in a low murmur as he strokes Shadow about his chest and shoulders. He weighs his options and decides that a show of support for his Zenith ally is more important than his concerns over how the crowd will react to the large dog that could easily be mistaken for a wolf. &quot;Go to Yi, Shadow. I'll be right behind.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that he stands and Shadow shoots through the crowd toward the Solar priest. His master will follow as quickly as he is able. The Dawn shoulders his way through the crowd excusing himself as he goes, gesturing to the 'escaped' canine and apologizing for the disruption at any signs of discontent from those he disturbs. It is his hope to reach Yi shortly and show his support silently if not with his simple and heartfelt words.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-01T11:46:17-08:00","id":356729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351356#post351356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Wyld)<br /> I assume Tirien is activating her war-form?<br /> <br /> Anyways, Dero hops onto Amelia's back. As you charge, the Fae close ranks, and use their farming implements as makeshift pikes. Tirien charges them, and breaks through their pike-wall, but takes 1L damage in doing so. But hey, Dero and Amelia are in melee range.<br /> <br /> What do?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is correct. <br /> <br /> Tirien will rake the attacking goblins with her claws. <br /> <br /> Erm, it seems invisible castle is down. I'll post the roll later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T12:46:58-08:00","id":361510,"title":"","content":"&quot; Why don't we give ourselves some breathing room I don't like crowds very much.&quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia extends her right hand in the air, a small sphere of solar light appears and quickly transform into a beautiful daiklave, both elegant and simple in design, with a double edge blade that glows with the warm light of the sun.<br /> <br /> Pointing her sword toward her enemies on the right side Amelia quickly attacks with a serie of four quick and precise stab with her daiklave.<br /> <br /> 1st : 12 dice<br /> 2nd: 11 dice<br /> 3rd: 10 dice<br /> 4th: 9 dice","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-06-2015, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T10:26:54-08:00","id":362619,"title":"","content":"Since Invisible castle is down still, I just rolled using the DnD online roller. I got 8 successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T15:58:35-08:00","id":362987,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> Kaiphas blanches under Yi's verbal assault. He is about to retaliate as Jensven reaches Yi. Seeing that he has not only been out maneuvered by Yi, but that he is also outnumbered by the three Exalted, he shuts his mouth without saying anything. <br /> <br /> A clicking sound coming from the Boule draws the attention of the crowds, saving the Heirophant some face. The boule parts, an a gangly man in simple black and red robes passes through a silver rod in his hand. He walks with a heavily limp and is using the rod as a walking stick (which you see is the source of the sound). He has a long narrow face, sunken beady eyes, and his salt-and-pepper hair (more salt than pepper) is oiled back, revealing a harsh widow's peak. Yi remembers Larissa identifying him in the Boule; he is Nikoloi Mari Vellus, Deputy Minister of Trade and Commerce, Nikoloi's candidate for the Archonship. <br /> <br /> &quot;The name's Vellus. Nikoloi Vellus,&quot; he says, handing Yi a scrap of vellum, &quot;I'm an honest man.&quot; <br /> <br /> And lo, looking at the vellum it's a business card which proclaims that Vellus is indeed an honest man. <br /> <br /> &quot;Now, I like the cut of your jib, kid. I'm willing to deputize you as a official member of my trade envoy corps. What do you say?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T16:03:02-08:00","id":362989,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Tirien and Amelia's efforts create a large dent in the kobold line. Dero stabs a few that he can reach. If you continue, you'll likely be surrounded, and there seems to be no real limit to the numbers of the fawn horde. What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T19:29:27-08:00","id":368172,"title":"","content":"&quot;I have engaged in commerce, and counted myself skilled in the art of the money-maker. I acquired wealth for myself and my masters and found no honor in it, save such honor as may be gained by any who engage in fair dealings and upright practices. There is no kleos to be had in the gaining of riches and in their possession, only in their use may glory be won; and that a poor sort of glory.<br /> <br /> Tim\u00ea is to me a poor thing to strive for, which may be given and taken arbitrarily. We are all held in a single honor, the brave with the weaklings. For my part I will be content with what Heaven sees fit to provide.<br /> <br /> As for kleos, such as might be won by he who has received such prizes of honor: I will cultivate virtue and have such kleos aphthiton as I earn by deeds alone. Neither shall I boast to increase it nor accumulate honors so as to be worthy of it.<br /> <br /> Therefore I must decline lord Nikoloi. I would not deprive you of tim\u00ea, for what could I gain that was not at your expense?&quot;<br /> <br /> It all sounded quite nice, though Yi was making a gamble. He hoped he had framed this as a quest of honor, perhaps even his aristeia. It may be he would shame Vellus, or gain his respect and the respect of the crowd. The gods would know how he had done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T11:38:13-08:00","id":369900,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> &quot;At my expense?&quot; Vellus says, confused, &quot;Everything I have done is for the good of this nation and its people. It is no expense if you, as you claim, are intending to better my homeland.&quot; <br /> <br /> With a devilish grin, the pinch-faced Deputy Minister turns to the assembled Boule and says, &quot;Now, I Nikoloi Vellus, in my office as the Deputy Minister of Trade and Commerce, am appointing this man, Origenon Yi, as a member of the Novalesk Trade Envoy corps. Who here approves of my decision?&quot;The Boule rumbles in agreement, though it is hesitant from the Zophyrus and Althea corners.<br /> <br /> Vellus turns back to Yi, winking at him, &quot;Now, citizen, do you have contention with the judgement of your Boule?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T16:45:51-08:00","id":371537,"title":"","content":"Jensven knows that he is out of his depth of understanding at this point. So, he will take a lesson from Shadow. He stays quiet and he observes. The Dawn will take mental notes for things that he would like to research later and potential questions to ask of his allies and acquaintances.<br /> <br /> When the conversation turns to the concept of money, he is reminded of his time with the Guild Caravan. He didn't understand the preoccupation with doing work where one traded coin for other coin and increasing the amount of coin one had in the end. It seemed much more efficient to be productive, make something of value, and then gain the coin from selling the results of your hard work. Then again, this was a relatively new concept to him. Perhaps if he learned more, he would come to see the value in it.<br /> <br /> Since Shadow didn't seem to distrust either of the fellows that were potentially opposing Yi, Jensven decides to not step in at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T11:24:17-08:00","id":373635,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> Before waiting for Yi's reply, Vellus turns to Jensven, &quot;You're remarkably quiet. I take it you're one of Yi's allies?&quot; He pauses a moment before snapping his fingers, &quot;you're the northerner that helped with that fiasco in the foundry.&quot;<br /> <br /> He examines Jensven up and down. &quot;I thought you would be larger. Your hound as well. I heard that you defeated a handful of minor Fae on your own,&quot; he says, his voice indicating clear interest, &quot;Have you too chosen this land as your home and joined the Gentes?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T19:45:13-08:00","id":373976,"title":"","content":"At the mention of the word, 'hound' Shadow yawns. It appears that Jensven reads the canine's assessment of that word and looks to the dog as they lock eyes for an instant. The northerner will look back to Vellus and address him directly.<br /> <br /> &quot;It seems Shadow doesn't like being called a 'hound'. He isn't used for hunting. Sometimes he will be okay with hauling a few things through snow, though.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I am one of the three Chosen of the Sun that took part in the fight at the foundry.&quot; Jensven holds up one finger. &quot;I claimed one kill. I would have had another if they wouldn't have run.&quot; He then gestures to Yi. &quot;It was Yi that got the kill that caused them to run from us.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I have not decided to settle here. I am ally to Yi. I aim to help him retrieve this item from the hell realm. I am not one of your citizens, belonging to your Gentes. That I have not earned.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T10:07:03-08:00","id":377308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=362989#post362989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Tirien and Amelia's efforts create a large dent in the kobold line. Dero stabs a few that he can reach. If you continue, you'll likely be surrounded, and there seems to be no real limit to the numbers of the fawn horde. What do?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot; We're not gonna make it if we just charge we need to clear the way ahead, Dero switch place with me. Tirien can you give me a boost I'll draw them to me this should give you some space to move foward and keep them off you two until you can catch up to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Amelia will try to use her war ability and her first excellency to add 7 dice (7 personnal mote) to figure out the best place to land by trying to predict the enemies movement and rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4755321/\" target=\"_blank\">7 sux</a>)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T08:20:09-08:00","id":381990,"title":"","content":"Yi gave the polite smile that in politics meant, &quot;Be sure to offer a generous sacrifice to whatever god you worship that it is not politically expedient for me to have you killed., but that was a nice move and we should have lunch some time.&quot; He didn't really mean it, but it was almost a reflex at this point. Virtue was a very difficult road to follow. Even when he did not feel virtuous, he was going to act like it until it because natural to him.<br /> <br /> With his mouth he said, &quot;I am but a humble servant of Novalesk, at the service of its people. Please prepare for my return, as I am given to understand that there may be some logistic difficulties involved.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T13:51:59-08:00","id":382249,"title":"","content":"Tirien hurls Amelia and Dero with all her might towards the bridge, digging with her claws into the earth beneath her, and tossing the duo like one would toss a cricket ball down the green. Arjuf Pride!<br /> <br /> She rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4760142/\" target=\"_blank\"> 5 suxx</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T15:57:52-08:00","id":382407,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> &quot;Not earned it?&quot; Vellus says with a raised brow, &quot;Membership in the Gentes is not something earned, it is granted. And even if it were, the fact that you trust yourself at our foes without promise of recompense is enough. Still,&quot; he shrugs, &quot;that choice is yours. If you reconsider, I have a second cousin in Gens Spyrus who would love to adopt such a warrior.&quot;<br /> <br /> With Yi's statement, Vellus' face breaks into a grin. &quot;Of course. I would do nothing else for an honorable servant of the state,&quot; he says. His face breaks into a knowing smile as he continues, &quot;of course, I shall have lunch ready for your return.&quot;<br /> <br /> What do? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T17:51:57-08:00","id":382514,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Dero is attempting to swap places with Amelia when Tirien lobs them both towards Brandt. The two sail through the air, and descend into a relatively thin part of the kobold force perhaps halfway between Tirien and Brandt. Dero, still on Amelia's back, lashes out with Vicruith war-axe (seriously, where did he get that?), creating a small patch of relative safety. <br /> <br /> What do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T15:25:32-08:00","id":385626,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hang on Dero and watch out!&quot;<br /> <br /> Clenshing her teeth Amelia rapidly strikes at two koblods directly in front of her and use the newfound space and their bodies (if they died) to boost her jump to cover the most distance with Dero on her back.<br /> <br /> First attack scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4763204/\" target=\"_blank\">4 sux</a> and second attack scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4763207/\" target=\"_blank\">5 sux</a>. Athletic roll scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4763208/\" target=\"_blank\">10 sux</a> !!!<br /> <br /> (Noodle I don't know if the Athletics roll has penalties after attacking adjust as you please <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-29-2015, 06:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T18:52:36-08:00","id":389229,"title":"","content":"Something clicks for Jensven. Vellus was attempting to gain some measure of power through the current exchange. He had seen it back home when rival chieftans would visit and attempt to gain the services of some of the reavers by commending them and then subtly suggesting they should come over to their service. The Dawn knows that watching Yi is the best idea at this point as Yi is the master of such interactions. Shadow just sits quietly and observes.<br /> <br /> &quot;The only payment I need is to see the Fae driven off. I have them to thank for the loss of friends and family from my home to the North and East of here.&quot; Jensven pauses. &quot;If your cousin is looking for warriors, they may have to look elsewhere. I do not mean to cause anger. I am merely new to this place and it's ways. I would like to ensure that I knew what I was doing before I commit to anything so important.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T15:25:47-08:00","id":394169,"title":"","content":"(Wyld) <br /> <br /> Amelia utterly smashes the two targeted Kobolds, and vaults over their bodies. A squad of Kobolds wielding scythes bear down on her as she makes he leap; luckily for her, Dero leaps off of her back, both lightening her load and intercepting the oncoming Fae. <br /> <br /> Amelia sails over the Fae, and has a clear shot for the bridge. Seeing this, Brandt withdraws his blade from the ground (causing the Kobolds to disappear into the ground) and lashes out at the leaping Solar. Amelia catches the strike, but it throws her off course away from the bridge. She lands a couple of yards from the bridge, in an area vacated by the Fae army.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T15:31:54-08:00","id":394173,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk) <br /> <br /> &quot;Of course, warrior of light,&quot; Vellus says, &quot;consider it a standing offer.&quot; He glances to Yi, &quot;I shall forward the traditional salary to your family. If you have need of anything, you have but to ask.&quot; <br /> <br /> With that, he departs. Intuiting that the exchange is over, the crowd and Boule begin to disperse.<br /> <br /> A group of youngsters, perhaps the same age as Dero are clustered together, however, and they take longer than the rest to begin to break off. Another young man with a broad-bladed sword is examining one of Yi's pronouncements, and is clearly putting a lot of thought into the placard. Jensven catches sight of a tall warrior with what looks to be a mighty golden-brown wolfhound. Yi catches sight of a vaguely humanoid green-brown shape upon a nearby building, but on closer inspection, he sees nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 02-05-2015, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T22:09:31-08:00","id":394485,"title":"","content":"&quot;You did well, that situation could easily have done much to delay real progress in this nation for decades. We are lucky to have come out of it having lost so little. Still... there will be even more ground to reclaim when we return.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi turned in the general direction of the young men, both together and alone and said, &quot;Those who do not seek cannot find and those who do not ask cannot be answered. After all, thing can always turn out better than you hope for.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T15:41:17-08:00","id":395518,"title":"","content":"Without any enemies to impede her, Tirien will vault forward, dashing over Amelia, grabbing Dero and swinging him towards the knight. <br /> <br /> &quot;HIT HIM WITH YOUR AXE, DERO!&quot; Tirien roars, completing this entirely too complex plan.<br /> <br /> Tirien will roll her Cha+War to construct the coordinated assault; She adds 4 dice to her roll using her 1st Cha Excellency, and rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4770298/\" target=\"_blank\">5 suxx</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T11:20:04-08:00","id":397821,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> The one of the youngsters, a girl of perhaps fifteen says, &quot; you're a strange man, mister!&quot; before they all run off laughing about something. Kids these days. <br /> <br /> The young man does not respond. It is likely that he did not register that Yi was speaking to him, as he completely engrossed in examining one of Yi's earlier messages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T12:09:00-08:00","id":397879,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Tirien grabs the hapless Dero, and swings the flailing young man at Brandt. The move was truly unexpected, and Dero's axe swing causes the noble to stagger backwards a step, which allows you to take a single step onto the charred-bone bridge. <br /> <br /> Brandt sighs and sheathes his blade, &quot;I acknowledge your strength. You have defeated me, and I will let you pass.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, he steps aside, leaving the bridge open for your passage. He seems to be struggling with something internally, and says, &quot;Be warned humans. My master has no love of your ilk. If you continue along this path, it may well lead to your doom.&quot; <br /> <br /> Provided you continue on: <br /> <br /> You walk across the massive bridge, which seems to arch into eternity. Some time later, the fog begins to thin, and the bone-bridge connects to a massive city wrought of a red-orange metal. It is seemingly empty of inhabitants, though you can see a massive spire of a crystalline citadel in the distance. <br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T20:21:38-08:00","id":398323,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods at Yi's compliment and comments, resolving to discuss the situation and what happened with him later. He felt that such a discussion would need to be held in private.<br /> <br /> Shadow notices the hound before his master and trots cautiously over to a safe distance from it. He is able to get a better look at it and test out it's demeanor while still keeping a safe distance and being somewhat near the Dawn. To his credit the Lawgiver will slowly stride half the distance to his cold weather loving companion and keep a watchful eye on both canines and the apparent master of the nearly golden dog.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T21:12:53-08:00","id":398381,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> The golden dog tilts its head and trots over to Shadow, its bushy tail wagging.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello, I am dog,&quot; it says in a child-like but rather human voice, &quot;I will sniff your butt now. You may sniff mine if you wish.&quot; <br /> <br /> Once canine interductions are out of the way, dog sits down, with its tail still wagging. &quot;I see you are from the northlands, new friend. I hear there is good running there. What brings you to the eastlands?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Brf. Err, yerr,&quot; Shadow replies.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, adventure. And you say that your name is Shadow?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Boof.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Very good,&quot; dog says. Dog looks over to Jensven, raising a paw, &quot;You are Shadow's people? I will shake your paw. I understand that is the polite thing to do when meeting a people.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-09T16:17:46-08:00","id":399500,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well this is an impressive sight.&quot;<br /> <br /> As she steps off the bridge Amelia will walk to the side of the fae guide before pointing the spire in the distance.<br /> <br /> &quot; Tell me Teleri where are we right now ? And do you know who lives there ?&quot; <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T19:59:53-08:00","id":401337,"title":"","content":"Jensven reaches down and shakes paws with the talking animal. If he is surprised he doesn't let it show.<br /> <br /> &quot;Greetings, Dog. You can talk to Shadow and me,&quot; the Dawn muses. &quot;I am impressed. Is that your people over there?&quot; He indicates the tall warrior with a gesture. &quot;I would meet them as well.&quot;<br /> <br /> He then turns to Shadow, &quot;If you have anything you want to tell me, I would do it now. This one can relate our words,&quot; the northerner smirks as he ruffles the fur on Shadow's head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T10:56:13-08:00","id":402092,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Teleri strums his instrument and sings a slow, dirge-like song:<br /> <br /> &quot;Yttrus the Blight,<br /> A Faen Knight,<br /> Of Sunlight and of Shadow,<br /> Had journeyed far,<br /> He did not tar,<br /> In search of Moxe-Ulto.<br /> <br /> But he grew bored-<br /> That Faery Lord-<br /> And o'er his Heart a shadow-<br /> Fell as he found<br /> No spot of ground<br /> That looked like Moxe-Ulto.<br /> <br /> His Will was spent,<br /> His Oathes a rent,<br /> And found a wander'n' hobo<br /> 'Hobo,' called he,<br /> 'Where can it be-<br /> This land of Moxe-Ulto?'<br /> <br /> 'O'er the Bridges<br /> Made of Bone,<br /> \u2018Cross the City built of Copper-<br /> Swim, run or walk,\u2019<br /> was the vagrant\u2019s talk,<br /> \u2018If you seek for Moxe-Ulto!\u2019&quot;<br /> <br /> with the Fae Guide's last chord you hear a faint echo of a voice saying, &quot;Ye can't take me taxes....&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T11:24:44-08:00","id":402155,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> Shadow tilts his head at Jensven as if saying <i>What are you talking about? We talk to each other all the time.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;The bond between dog and their people transcends the need for words,&quot; the warrior says, nodding to Jensven, &quot;I am Althea Solon.&quot; He is dressed in heavy bronze plate armor and carries two blades; one an unadorned two-handed sword, the other a wire-hilted sabre. <br /> <br /> &quot;He is my second people,&quot; dog says, &quot;Origenes is my first people. You are one of the Sun-dog's people?&quot; dog sniffs Jensven. He looks over to Shadow, &quot;Truly, you must be a mighty warrior.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Eryyyuun,&quot; Shadow replies with what looks like a large yawn and a flick of an ear.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, he let you keep your people.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Bf.&quot; Shadow retorts. <br /> <br /> &quot;No false modesty,&quot; dog responds, &quot;You must come to my dueling club. If you do not have a sabre, I can loan you one. You may bring your people, also, if you wish. Afterwards, there is a nice bakery nearby. The proprietress makes very excellent milk biscuits.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Arrurrurur,&quot; Shadow responds, before looking up to Jensven with a quizzical expression. You get the feeling that Shadow has deferred to you. <br /> <br /> How will you respond?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T20:29:50-08:00","id":402874,"title":"","content":"&quot;Shadow, we can go with them for a while,&quot; Jensven ruffles his canine companion's ears. &quot;Remember we must help Yi tomorrow. He needs to go get that item and it will be a dangerous trip. I think we should be there with him. He will have a better chance with us there.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Dawn extends a hand of greeting to Althea, intending to shake hands.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T19:22:14-08:00","id":404006,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very nice song Teleri so we need to cross this place to get to Mox-Ulto and who did who was that we heard just now ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T09:25:12-08:00","id":404540,"title":"","content":"&quot;We've done those things as well. We must be getting close, then,&quot; Tirien says,&quot; What do you think, Dero?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T14:51:10-08:00","id":408208,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> [Will Yi be going with Jensven?]<br /> <br /> Solon shakes Jensven's hand with a smile and a nod. <br /> <br /> Dog leads you to the upscale part of town, and to a rather large building. The building is a three-tiered, combination of salle, bar, gentleman's club and temple(?).<br /> <br /> Many warriors cease their sparring to salute to dog. Their blades are, for the most part lighter than the ones that Jensven is used to, though a handful are going through drills with larger, two handed swords of Solon's ilk. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T15:01:31-08:00","id":408223,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Teleri ceases his strumming and looks to Amelia quizically. &quot;I didn't hear anything,&quot; he says (not sings. Whoa). <br /> <br /> Dero indicates that he's like 95% certain that Yttrus is a name that both Stannwald and Brandt had mentioned? So he's probably their master?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T21:23:47-08:00","id":411017,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then I guess it's juste me hearing things.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without waiting for the fae to respond Amelia turns to Tirien and Dero with a confident look in her eyes.<br /> <br /> &quot;According to Brandt his master, Yttrus as Dero believe he is called, as no love for our kind either that is for all human or just to us exalted is something we will have to find out but it would be wise to stay together and to touch nothing. We don't know what awaits us here or in Moxe-Ulto, caution seems to be the best option but lets not loiter around too much.&quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia will take a few steps and turn to the rest of the group &quot; Well shall we go ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-22-2015, 02:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T17:53:46-08:00","id":427166,"title":"","content":"&quot;Indeed, let us get hence,&quot; Tirien says, readying her claws once more. She will retain her warform, ready to strike at a moment's notice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T20:40:26-08:00","id":427326,"title":"","content":"Shadow starts to bounce around excitedly as he enters the training area. He becomes a black and white blur as he darts around the place, taking it all in and hastily exploring it. After a short while, he comes loping back. His breathing is deep, but he is not fatigued. The canine has merely gained a sufficient head of steam. It appears he can keep going for a good, long while yet.<br /> <br /> &quot;You have many warriors here,&quot; Jensven states. &quot;There are more than the reavers from my home.&quot; The Dawn will stand and observe for now. He is eager to test himself against these warriors, but he does not wish to break any rules of protocol.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:44:59-08:00","id":430803,"title":"","content":"(Wyld) <br /> <br /> Teleri leads on, into the streets of the copper city. It is a veritable labyrinth down here, and it dawns on you that Teleri might be lost. At least, that is, until you come across a hulking red-brown figure sitting on the bowl of a silver-and-gold fountain. The figure looks to be a cross between a gorilla and a human covered in many tiny horns. How large exactly it is, you cannot quite tell, as it looks to be hunched over and is fiddling with something shiny and small. <br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:48:15-08:00","id":430806,"title":"","content":"Tirien will get closer to see what the figure is doing exactly. Do I need to roll anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T17:19:43-08:00","id":430859,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk - dog-dojo)<br /> <br /> Those small few warriors who were still fighting pause as Shadow darts about the room. They don't seem surprised. Instead, once they identify the source of the rapid motion, they sheathe their blades and an all of them begin to congregate around Dog, Solon and Jensven. <br /> <br /> Once Shadow had returned to Jensven, Solon says, &quot;This is Shadow, dog of the North, and Jensven, his person and a warrior of the Sun. Our master will be welcoming Shadow personally. If anyone wishes to engage Jensven in a bout, follow the normal rules of protocol. That is all.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, many warriors begin to return to their places on the floor, and resume their duels. They leave the central ring open, however, and dog trots over to it. Solon retrieves a pair of blunted practice sabers from a rack of blades. These two have oddly flattened hilts that suggest that they were not made for a human hand. He places them on the floor, one before dog, and one before Shadow. <br /> <br /> Will Shadow learn the art of the blade from dog?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T17:26:29-08:00","id":430867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=430806#post430806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien will get closer to see what the figure is doing exactly. Do I need to roll anything?</div> </div> </div> </div>As Tirien edges closer to the figure, it growls and reveals two rows of long canines. It presses the item to it's chest with one taloned hand, but you can glimpse that the object is vaguely humanoid in shape. A doll, perhaps?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T18:07:39-08:00","id":430950,"title":"","content":"Amelia will stay on the ready should the creature attack them but will not get closer for now. Turning to Teleri &quot;Do you know who or what this creature is Teleri ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T13:19:19-08:00","id":431702,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> The creature itself answers Amelia's question. &quot;Ciprus,&quot; it says, &quot;Am Ciprus. Am nnn-night?&quot; <br /> <br /> The creature's voice is rough, and it's words halting, as if it is having difficulty thinking of the right words. It taps the object in its hand, &quot;Am Argentus.&quot; The beast then slides along the lip of the fountain, trying to get some distance from the circle while remaining seated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T21:30:11-08:00","id":432229,"title":"","content":"It would appear that it is time for Jensven to stand aside and let Shadow be trained. The Rising Sun will watch as his faithful companion tries his mettle against the talking dog. It would be interesting to see how fast the dog could learn and whether he would be able to develop useful techniques. He would have to make sure that he knew what Shadow would be capable of after this. Working with Shadow in a fight was the one thing he knew he could count on and he wanted to make sure he would be able to facilitate any new abilities on the part of the canine.<br /> <br /> As far as trying his own skill in this place, he would wait to issue challenge until after Shadow as trained or until one of the other warriors got curious and issued a challenge to him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T09:33:54-07:00","id":432672,"title":"","content":"<i>Well that is a bit disapointing I expected a fae knight.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Are you alright ? You seem like one who has drank too much.&quot; <br /> <br /> Amelia will come a bit closer to Ciprus with a somewhat concerned look on her face.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T12:11:22-07:00","id":432910,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> It takes some cajoling from dog (which sounds a lot like two tea kettles arguing with each other), but Shadow picks up the proffered blade and begins to duel dog. <br /> <br /> It goes slowly at first, it Shadow takes to it like a fish to water. It takes sometime for Jensven to notice, but it seems that Shadow is imitating his own low, minimalistic fighting style, rather than taking cues from dog's higher, more flamboyant style. <br /> <br /> &quot;Your dog is special,&quot; Solon says with wide eyes, &quot;He's tried this a number of times, but never with any success.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T21:32:38-07:00","id":435235,"title":"","content":"Jensven watches the exchange between Dog and Shadow very intently. If he is concerned for his canine companion he shows no signs. His arms are crossed and his stance wide. The only muscles he moves are the ones that are required for him to watch the training session. He faces forward, but it is apparent that he is addressing Solon when he finally speaks.<br /> <br /> &quot;I knew he was special when I got him. He was a pup, smallest of his brothers and sisters,&quot; The Dawn muses. &quot;The breeder said he couldn't be used for the sleds. I saw that he had heart. He was smaller, but he fought to be the best. I made a deal with the breeder. I could have the dog for some work I did for him for free. I had to accept lower wages for a moon cycle to pay for the bronze I used. I was able to train him to pull a small sled to help me move metal. With his help I was able to move three times the goods at once.&quot;<br /> <br /> There is only a slight change in his voice as he relates more of his tale, &quot;When the Sun chose me, Shadow became even more special. He is able to talk with me more than ever. I understand him. We act as if we were born brothers and I the older. It is not that I am man and he is dog anymore.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jensven fights the urge to shout advice at the furry animal. He knows that Shadow has the endurance of his breed, but the climate is warmer, which could wear him down faster. Also, there was no telling what sort of supernatural endurance one such as Dog could have been blessed with. He decides that he should only step in should the unlikely happen and Shadow be injured more than a scratch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T16:54:03-07:00","id":437713,"title":"","content":"&quot;Amelia, stay back!&quot; Tirien will try and shield her comrade, suspecting foul play from this new duo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T17:46:59-07:00","id":439141,"title":"","content":"Yi left the Dawn enjoy himself. He knew what was coming, had read the reports and heard the stories<br /> <br /> Noise, endless noise, of the beating of man-skin drums and the high, wailing drone of leaden flutes until all reason was drown in the mad revelry beneath an angry sun. Eternal, shadowless noon in the city well named Damnation, where the very world was at war with the fragile minds of men while the alien seductions of the Damned exalted every vice and put every dear-held value to the test. Mortals had thrown themselves to the Silent Wind for a moment of rapturous peace or surrendered their reason and joined the dance before Ligier's mocking gaze. It was no fancy of rhetoric that named it Hell.<br /> <br /> As for himself, Yi had a promise yet unfulfilled. One oath, though broken in faith, hung over him so that each day brought a new shame. To deny his heart's accusation he kept his other promises all the more strongly. He would not leave another city while this task remained undone. As he had many times before he began to walk toward the poorer portion of the city. As he did he passed many who looked at him with an expectant awe. Some he beckoned to follow with a wordless nod. Others did the same unbidden. When they came upon a field full of exhausted clay pits and the stink of rancid oil from discarded pots.<br /> <br /> &quot;Whose is this place and for what purpose is it used?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It belongs to no one master, it is useless. The clay is poor for pots and bricks and the land is no good for building.&quot; The man had the look of an apprentice. He was young, his garb was much mended, and he was quick to answer with 'Master'. Dried clay was on his cracked hands and clothing, and he frequently glanced over his shoulder to an older man not his father.<br /> <br /> Yi Zhinan was silent for a time. Then he said, &quot;Let us see what might be done with the uselessness of man.&quot;<br /> <br /> He walked as he spoke, searching the ground as though he had dropped something.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell me, why should we keep our oaths?&quot; He turned back to the Apprentice.<br /> <br /> The question seemed to catch the boy off-guard. He spurted out, &quot;Well... that is... people depend on you, on you doing what you say.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, that is important. Yet when circumstances beyond our control prevent us from doing as we said it is not held a moral failing. <br /> <br /> Now he spoke to the man he took for a master potter. &quot;What say you?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Why do you think oaths are held sacred?&quot;<br /> <br /> The man seemed to have expected the question and answered, &quot;Because the gods and the powerful command it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi smiled. &quot;That is very true, yet we tend to do what we have sworn to even when we could get away with breaking them. There seems to be something else at work than fear of the mighty.&quot;<br /> <br /> As he rooted around the broken shard he noticed a child, a girl literally clutching her mother\u2019s apron strings. The look of utter trust brought a pang to his heart. Once more he asked, &quot;Why do you think we should keep our promises?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;cause then you would be a liar. And that's bad!&quot;<br /> <br /> Her mother was just about to speak up and apologize when Yi seemed find what he was looking for.<br /> <br /> &quot;Just so!&quot; He said, as he reached down and pulled an egg from a muddy pool. He broke it open with one hand, scattering the pieces, and seemed entranced by whatever had been inside.<br /> <br /> &quot;An oath is written on the heart. To break it is to do a terrible wound to yourself. For at their heart, all promises depend on a more universal feature of our character. 'What I do is what shall be.' To break an oath then, is to deny your own right and power to change the world. It makes you an automaton of circumstances, a beast driven by passion of pragmatism. Mankind is meant to be more than that.&quot;<br /> <br /> He brought up his hand to eye level, and those near him saw a tiny snake, no bigger than a worm, tangled around his fingers.<br /> <br /> &quot;Keeping our oaths does not make us weak, it gives us the authority to endure where we alone are insufficient. Now think for a moment, about your lives. Here in this unpleasant place, consider why you are thankful and why you suffer. Weigh the good and ill of your lives. Think about the choices you have made and how they have affected that good and that ill. Be ready, for this day we shall do a great thing, such as has not been done for an age. Observe, and know that what you behold is not beyond you, but of you. You are the part of the power that will move the earth.&quot;<br /> <br /> Then he began to chant, holding his hands out as if in supplication or expectation. Though none had noticed while he spoke the snake had bitten him. Even as it drunk from the wound, a thin stream of solar ichor pooled in his hands before falling to the ground through his fingers.<br /> Yi left the Dawn enjoy himself. He knew what was coming, had read the reports and heard the stories<br /> <br /> Noise, endless noise, of the beating of man-skin drums and the high, wailing drone of leaden flutes until all reason was drown in the mad revelry beneath an angry sun. Eternal, shadowless noon in the city well named Damnation, where the very world was at war with the fragile minds of men while the alien seductions of the Damned exalted every vice and put every dear-held value to the test. Mortals had thrown themselves to the Silent Wind for a moment of rapturous peace or surrendered their reason and joined the dance before Ligier's mocking gaze. It was no fancy of rhetoric that named it Hell.<br /> <br /> As for himself, Yi had a promise yet unfulfilled. One oath, though broken in faith, hung over him so that each day brought a new shame. To deny his heart's accusation he kept his other promises all the more strongly. He would not leave another city while this task remained undone. As he had many times before he began to walk toward the poorer portion of the city. As he did he passed many who looked at him with an expectant awe. Some he beckoned to follow with a wordless nod. Others did the same unbidden. When they came upon a field full of exhausted clay pits and the stink of rancid oil from discarded pots.<br /> <br /> &quot;Whose is this place and for what purpose is it used?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It belongs to no one master, it is useless. The clay is poor for pots and bricks and the land is no good for building.&quot; The man had the look of an apprentice. He was young, his garb was much mended, and he was quick to answer with 'Master'. Dried clay was on his cracked hands and clothing, and he frequently glanced over his shoulder to an older man not his father.<br /> <br /> Yi Zhinan was silent for a time. Then he said, &quot;Let us see what might be done with the uselessness of man.&quot;<br /> <br /> He walked as he spoke, searching the ground as though he had dropped something.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell me, why should we keep our oaths?&quot; He turned back to the Apprentice.<br /> <br /> The question seemed to catch the boy off-guard. He spurted out, &quot;Well... that is... people depend on you, on you doing what you say.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, that is important. Yet when circumstances beyond our control prevent us from doing as we said it is not held a moral failing. <br /> <br /> Now he spoke to the man he took for a master potter. &quot;What say you?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Why do you think oaths are held sacred?&quot;<br /> <br /> The man seemed to have expected the question and answered, &quot;Because the gods and the powerful command it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi smiled. &quot;That is very true, yet we tend to do what we have sworn to even when we could get away with breaking them. There seems to be something else at work than fear of the mighty.&quot;<br /> <br /> As he rooted around the broken shard he noticed a child, a girl literally clutching her mother\u2019s apron strings. The look of utter trust brought a pang to his heart. Once more he asked, &quot;Why do you think we should keep our promises?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;cause then you would be a liar. And that's bad!&quot;<br /> <br /> Her mother was just about to speak up and apologize when Yi seemed find what he was looking for.<br /> <br /> &quot;Just so!&quot; He said, as he reached down and pulled an egg from a muddy pool. He broke it open with one hand, scattering the pieces, and seemed entranced by whatever had been inside.<br /> <br /> &quot;An oath is written on the heart. To break it is to do a terrible wound to yourself. For at their heart, all promises depend on a more universal feature of our character. 'What I do is what shall be.' To break an oath then, is to deny your own right and power to change the world. It makes you an automaton of circumstances, a beast driven by passion of pragmatism. Mankind is meant to be more than that.&quot;<br /> <br /> He brought up his hand to eye level, and those near him saw a tiny snake, no bigger than a worm, tangled around his fingers.<br /> <br /> &quot;Keeping our oaths does not make us weak, it gives us the authority to endure where we alone are insufficient. Now think for a moment, about your lives. Here in this unpleasant place, consider why you are thankful and why you suffer. Weigh the good and ill of your lives. Think about the choices you have made and how they have affected that good and that ill. Be ready, for this day we shall do a great thing, such as has not been done for an age. Observe, and know that what you behold is not beyond you, but of you. You are the part of the power that will move the earth.&quot;<br /> <br /> Then he began to chant, holding his hands out as if in supplication or expectation. Though none had noticed while he spoke the snake had bitten him. Even as it drunk from the wound, a thin stream of solar ichor pooled in his hands before falling to the ground through his fingers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:55:47-07:00","id":440501,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> &quot;No... ! No drank. Mind tok. Take? Took?&quot; Ciprus says. To articulate his point, he removes the top of his head, and shows the empty cavity inside, &quot;Aurem have mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> When putting the top of his head back on, it slips and falls to the ground. Ciprus dives after it, dropping Argentum in the process. <br /> <br /> Argentum, which looks like your average threshold child's rag-doll, but of silver-weave, is within the circle's easy reach as Ciprus dives for the top of his head. <br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T15:54:03-07:00","id":440542,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> The pace of the dog-fighting picks up until dog disarms Shadow, the blade in his mouth skittering off into a corner. Shadow falls overs and rolls to the side, exposing his belly; the universal canine symbol of surrender.<br /> <br /> A wave of applause erupts at dog's victory. Dog trots over to Shadow and nudges him with his nose. Shadow gets up, and with a large grin on his face, begins to run about with dog.<br /> <br /> &quot;You may be a dog-god, Alopekis,&quot; Solon mutters with a chuckle, &quot;but you're still a dog.&quot;<br /> <br /> Solon turns to Jensven, &quot;They'll be a while. Care for a bout?&quot;<br /> <br /> To simplify things, if you're going to take Solon up on his offer roll (Dex+Melee) in a contested roll; you get +1 circumstantial if you use your 'klave.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 03-13-2015, 07:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T17:14:00-07:00","id":440650,"title":"","content":"(Yi)<br /> <br /> The blood fell to the ground, pooling on the clay surface. Though but a few drops of ichor have fallen upon the Earth, the blood wells into thick veins that seem to crack the surface. Yi's feels his Essence permeating into the earth, reaching out through the Dragon lines for what he seeks.<br /> <br /> <i>Doom.</i><br /> <br /> A deep thud echoes through the land, as much felt as heard. <br /> <br /> <i>Doom.</i><br /> <br /> Again it echoes, louder than before. <br /> <br /> <i>Doom. Doom. <b>Doom. </b></i><br /> <br /> The noise comes faster and louder until-<br /> <br /> <i>It's right beneath you. </i><br /> <br /> Yi knows it's coming, but still he flinches as the massive gemstone Wyrm pierces through the soil before him. It rears up and screams a subsonic blast of rage and pain. Yi and the elemental engage in a contest of wills; though it holds up for a few moments, the elemental's beastial mind buckles before the heroic will of the Exalt before him. It slides back into the earth, until naught but it's head and gaping maw are visible. <br /> <br /> OOC: Yi's Summon elemental spell was successful on the second round of the contest of wills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T21:39:20-07:00","id":440866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=440501#post440501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Wyld)<br /> <br /> &quot;No... ! No drank. Mind tok. Take? Took?&quot; Ciprus says. To articulate his point, he removes the top of his head, and shows the empty cavity inside, &quot;Aurem have mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> When putting the top of his head back on, it slips and falls to the ground. Ciprus dives after it, dropping Argentum in the process.<br /> <br /> Argentum, which looks like your average threshold child's rag-doll, but of silver-weave, is within the circle's easy reach as Ciprus dives for the top of his head.<br /> <br /> What do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Amelia fights the urge to regurgitate at the sight of the empty cranium of Ciprus but quickly recover. Still the wyld is full of strange things but the creature seems pitiful and something in her stir an ancient feeling of wanting to help the helpless. Before she had blink her eyes twice she had come to a decision.<br /> <br /> &quot; Tirien should we help him ? I don't know why but I find it sad to see a creature in this state.I feel we should help him don't ask me why though.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-16-2015, 12:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T20:20:10-07:00","id":443675,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods his assent and follows Solon to a ring of his choosing. The Dawn's choice of blade is not really a choice at all. The 'klaive, Raija's Tears stays put. This is a demonstration, a test of skill. That blade is only for those times when winning could mean the difference between putting innocents in danger or ensuring their safety. Cinder stays home as well. He will reserve this blade for the Fae. The simple, unadorned steel blade of his own forging is the one that he will use for this bout.<br /> <br /> As he settles in to give his all to the task ahead of him, he decides that he will use the visions of the Dawn that was to guide his steps and his blade. The more reckless style of combat he learned at home could score a quick win, but his more analytical, logical nature lends itself better to the measured, practiced style he had learned more recently. Give ground only when necessary and push the opponent back. Strike only when an opening is sure. Defensive spacing and giving every effort to deflecting blows will ensure that he can remain standing longer than the ones aligned against him. With that the blade is raised and the match is joined.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will be rolling Dexterity (4) + Melee (3) in order to see if I can best Solon in the match. Since I am using my steel straight sword, I do not get the bonus for the 'klaive. I am not claiming a stunt because I don't feel this is anything the character hasn't done before and therefore isn't impressive enough for a stunt. So, I have seven (7) dice = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4797377/\" target=\"_blank\">one (1) success</a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T17:06:13-07:00","id":448505,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well, let's retrieve Ciprus' mind, Amelia,&quot; Tirien concedes, eyeing the dropped doll warily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T22:41:14-07:00","id":451318,"title":"","content":"As his will strove against the elemental Yi lost himself. Reason and time dissolved into a storm of emotion and sensation without context. He did not fall to the edge of total dissolution, some precipice of no return, for those concepts had no place in that sea of mind.<br /> <br /> <i>Hunger\u2026 Loss\u2026 Isolation\u2026 Pain\u2026 Loneliness\u2026 Fear\u2026 Longing\u2026</i><br /> <br /> At the center of it all rested a single shining point, a pearl of awareness on which to stand firm. Yi had never truly understood what it meant for something to be alien, yet this was that. The mark of humanity was on it, though ancient and scoured of all that was not eternal. About it his mind crystalized in the midst of madness. Only as his first, all-consuming, thought rise to consciousness did he recognize it as compassion.<br /> <br /> <i>Nothing deserves this.</i><br /> <br /> Gently, with only the slightest hesitation, he laid first his hand and then his head against the creature.<br /> <br /> \u201cRest a moment little-maker. You will have from me something better than leavings.\u201d<br /> <br /> Straightening he turned back to the shocked onlookers. Many were still picking themselves up from where they had fallen. He gave them a slight smile, and hopped it was reassuring. Or rather he would have, had the motions of \u201creassuring smile\u201d not been ground deep into the memory of his muscles.<br /> <br /> \u201cFrom the abundance of the heart does the mouth speak. It is for that reason I asked you to meditate on thankfulness. Seeing your uncertainty, now it seems better to fill up your hearts further.\u201d<br /> <br /> He turned slowly, meeting every eye he found.<br /> <br /> \u201cMany of you are thinking, and there is no magic in the knowing, that you do not deserve to be here. There is fear that perhaps I am the demon you have been taught. There is doubt that I can deliver on the endless stream of promises I make. Most honestly, there is questioning that you are good enough to be part of these things.<br /> <br /> Let me correct you on that last point at least. I swear before Heaven and its king that these words I am about to utter are true. I stand here in awe of each of you. In every union of your ancestors since the Creation one, and only one, has been chosen from among a multitude vaster than all who now live. Every moment has shaped these ones into a soul unique in all the circles of world and time. So it has been every generation until you, each of you, only you, are before me now. We are grown too cynical from familiarity, yet we are, each of us, a miracle. The finesse by which we were shaped is greater than all the works of the Chosen\u2019s hands. Compared to the vast gulf of time that lie behind us, the odds that we, and only we, would be distilled from the endless chaos of life are so long that not every grain of sand on every shore in the world are sufficient as the weight against.<br /> <br /> So\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> This smile was not practiced.<br /> <br /> \u201c\u2026 let me hear you.\u201d<br /> <br /> Turning away he began to dance. As he did so the ground shifted below him, taking on whirls and rises as he went about his motions. The front ranks of the crowd stepped after him only to see the same happen for them. With the sudden realization smiles came to their own faces and they threw themselves into the song that was even now rising from a hundred throats.<br /> <br /> It began with clay and water, writhing like serpents to lift the deep places and level the high. Then a true writhing began as a feast of many hymns fell into the maw of the worm, sending shivers of simple pleasure through its body. With a great molting crack the bracken of earth and stone fell away, the flash of alabaster and green stone replacing them.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VRJxcVvg_30&amp;index=10&amp;list=PL06939460D46369F7\" target=\"_blank\">Above the chaunt of a thousand prayers Yi\u2019s voice rose, spinning the dance around him like the piper at a festival.</a><br /> <br /> \u201cGreat Esculapius, skill'd to heal mankind,<br /> All-ruling P\u00e6an, and physician kind;<br /> Whose arts medic'nal, can alone assuage<br /> Diseases dire, and stop their dreadful rage:<br /> Strong lenient God, regard my suppliant pray'r,<br /> Bring gentle Health, adorn'd with lovely hair;<br /> Convey the means of mitigating pain,<br /> And raging, deadly pestilence restrain.<br /> O pow'r all-flourishing, abundant, bright,<br /> Apollo's honor'd offspring, God of light;<br /> Husband of blameless Health, the constant foe<br /> Of dread Disease the minister of woe:<br /> Come, blessed saviour, and my health defend,<br /> And to my life afford a prosp'rous end.\u201d<br /> <br /> For hours they danced: Exalt, elemental, and ecstatics, in great windings about the pits of clay. Grassy hillocks rose behind them, encircling courtyards of mosaic paths and shaded by the branches of fragrant trees. Brightly windowed rooms, full of air and light, spiraled up them like the whirls of some ancient shell. Many tiered seating girded the amphitheater, pleasant lodging for the sick looked out on green and the music of fountains, storerooms and places of instruction waited for physician-priests, and the golden kindly-faced statue of Asclepius stood in the many-pillared sanctuary of the gleaming temple. Before the great open doors of bronze, in the eyes of the god, Yi Zhinan spoke a secret prayer to the earth and a jade python rose up, twinned with a staff of gold.<br /> <br /> In the stunned silence that followed, as participants and onlookers alike marveling at Asclepeion and its splendors, the Zeneith, bright as noon at midnight, said with satisfaction. \u201cThat will do.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-24-2015, 01:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T09:07:00-07:00","id":451586,"title":"","content":"(Wyld) <br /> <br /> Ciprus grunts has he reattaches his the top of his head. He glances to his hand, and, seeing that he dropped Argentum as well, launches himself to grab the doll again. Grasping the toy, he pulls himself back up to the lip of the fountain and repeats, &quot;Aurem have mine mind&quot;. But this time he points down the well, and moves over, allowing you to approach. Looking down the well, you see the bright glint of gold in the depths.<br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T09:33:28-07:00","id":451610,"title":"","content":"(Jensven) <br /> <br /> [That's a one die stunt].<br /> <br /> Solon and Jensven take their places on the floor, occupying the spot vacated by the dog and the dog-god. Solon draws his large blade. Another of Alopekis' warriors takes the role of referee, and the two warriors begin their duel. Solon clearly knows his weapon's advantages and disadvantages, keeping it high so to add the weight to his force, and attempting to keep Jensven at an appropriate distance to take advantage of his superior reach. <br /> <br /> The Warriors are evenly matched; roll Stamina+Resistance to see who tires first!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T21:38:30-07:00","id":455370,"title":"","content":"The Dawn that shared his power from long ago has gifted him with no incites for how he would improve his endurance beyond the economy of movement that Jensven has already employed. Perhaps it was time to dig down and bring forth the things he had learned in his life to the point of his golden awakening. Hours spent at the forge, or tramping through woods, hunting, cutting lumber, and the little training he did when it was thought he could have been one of the reavers. These are the memories he draws on as he presses to give Solon a good match at the very least. He knows his fatigue is something he needs to work on. So, like he has many times since his life changed, he just focuses on the rhythm of the dance of blades and tries not to think of how tired he was getting. His arms were not lead. His feet are light when he needs to shift them or lift them, steel when he needs to press the advantage.<br /> <br /> Block. Step back. Shift. Thrust. Advance. Block. Push back. Advance.<br /> <br /> So it goes for what seems to be an eternity. Time slows to a crawl as his senses are heightened and his blood rushes through his body. The Dawn was in the battle now. He didn't use his golden power, but he was a better warrior just as a side effect of having been chosen of the sun. His arm had more strength and his blade was more skillful. It was almost not fair to Solon, but it was as fair as he could make it. Besides, a good mortal warrior could best him if he held back the sun within.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jensven only has two (2) Stamina and one (1) Resistance. This means he only has three dice to roll for this one without any stunts. So Stamina (2) + Resistance (1) = Three (3) dice = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4804020/\" target=\"_blank\">two successes.</a> Not bad at all, if you consider the odds were that there would be only one success there.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T13:34:59-07:00","id":457256,"title":"","content":"[Jensven]<br /> <br /> (That's a two-die stunt, and rolling the dice you get +1 success. As long as you say most anything IC you can take a one-die at the least). <br /> <br /> Solon and Jensven both begin the feel the weight of their blades as the contest drags on. Their breath is heavy, and the only sounds in the building are those of their contest; all others have come to watch the contest between experts. <br /> <br /> Minutes drag on. The Warriors are too well matched. <br /> <br /> It reaches a critical point. Solon attempts a downward slash to overpower Jensven's defense before exhaustion takes him. His attack is just a little too clumsy, though, and Jensven bats it aside. The weight of Solon's heavier weapon works against him as Jensven steps inside his guard and swiftly cuts upwards, taping his blade on Solon's armor just below his right armpit; had this been a real fight Jensven could have easily removed the Althea's arm. <br /> <br /> Solon lets go of his blade and stumbles back a few steps before falling to the ground. Alopekis rushes over to his people, licking the reclining warrior's face.<br /> <br /> &quot;I yield,&quot; Solon croaks, laughter in his voice. The stunned crowd beings applauding Jensven's success. Shadow rushes over to Jensven, his bushy tail wagging so hard that it is difficult for him to walk straight. <br /> <br /> What do?<br /> <br /> OOC: Jensven's three successes defeats Solon's two on his Stamina + Resistance roll. Solon's probably going to be trying to find a spirit willing to teach him a Resistance excellency now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 03-25-2015, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T14:29:05-07:00","id":457284,"title":"","content":"[Yi]<br /> <br /> The wyrm dances, its shell casting off bronze and topaz and limestone, powered by the prayer of Solar and worker. The cast-off shell forms into the massive temple-hospice, sanctified by the Light of the Zenith's soul.<br /> <br /> One thing is conspicuously absent; an altar. There remains a place for it, but none was formed. Was that Yi's intent, or perhaps an oversight? Mayhaps he was thinking ahead, if only subconsciously, to the task ahead....<br /> <br /> (Meanwhile, elsewhere)<br /> <br /> Yu Shan was clouded in misty darkness. The sky above glistened with stars, and the emerald star of secrets gleamed Ascendant. An auspicious sign, given the nature of Origenes' meeting today.<br /> <br /> His sorceries had quickened the journey to the Celestial city. Even with the wealth of ambrosia his sizable cult afforded him, it was insufficient to grease the wheels of the celestial bureaucracy to mobilize a divine force in Novalesk's defense.<br /> <br /> As expected. Now, to turn to his other task.<br /> <br /> It took some bribery, calling in some favors, and even promising a few more, including one to a Terrestrial in service to the Bureau of Nature (and someone else as well, if the silver whirls on the exalt's arm were any indication), but he'd found out what he could about the ex-Lookshan solar who had offered him service. Even better, he'd found another spirit, a minor deity of healing in the Bureau of Humanity, who'd had dealings with the Zenith before.<br /> <br /> The meeting was in the slums of the Eastern Districts, but the healer-god's reputation was immaculate. Origenes sat across a marble table from the bearded deity in a snake-skin robe.<br /> <br /> &quot;It seems the solar built you a Temple in my city,&quot; Origenes said without preamble.<br /> <br /> Asclepius' eyebrows rose, &quot;That changes the nature of this meeting.&quot;<br /> <br /> Origenes created a steeple with his fingers, &quot;Indeed. I'm sure we can come to an equitable arrangement.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":".  Fixing grammatical errors 03-26-2015, 03:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T17:28:15-07:00","id":457503,"title":"","content":"Tirien will slowly climb down, looking around, not only for good handholds, but also for any signs of trouble.<br /> <br /> &quot;I swear, I feel like I've done this before,&quot; she muttered to no one in particular.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T20:56:35-07:00","id":457715,"title":"","content":"The Dawn ruffles the fur about the withers of his canine friend, &quot;You did good, Shadow. You will be a sword dog soon!&quot; He then straightens and walks over to Solon to offer him a hand up, &quot;You almost had me. I won by luck. Our skill is matched.&quot; When Solon stands, Jensven will gesture to him in an effort to heap some of the praise of the other swordsmen upon him, even beginning to clap and holler in an effort to encourage the small crowd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T08:10:29-07:00","id":458063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=457503#post457503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tirien will slowly climb down, looking around, not only for good handholds, but also for any signs of trouble.<br /> <br /> &quot;I swear, I feel like I've done this before,&quot; she muttered to no one in particular.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Having followed Tirien down Amelia smiled a little at her comment before puting on her helmet sealing the solar in a shell of orichalcum with a small hissing sound.<br /> <br /> &quot;You have to admit that this is exciting Tirien&quot;<br /> <br /> her voice sounds confined behind her helmet, Amelia will use her glorious solar saber to illuminate their way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-26-2015, 11:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T16:22:18-07:00","id":458480,"title":"","content":"[Wyld]<br /> <br /> Amelia, Tirien and Dero climb down the fountain, Teleri levitating down beside you. They travel deeper and deeper into the bowels of the earth. Some ways down, the silvery walls break into gilt and you all lose your grip, falling down into a large cavern, the illuminated by both Amelia's Solar Saber and the firelight of a monstrous forge of gold and copper. Therein is a veritable horde of identical figures. They are short, squat humanoids nearly as wide as they are tall. They are seemingly formed of some type of yellow-white lustrous stone. Though the shape of their bodies and features are similar to those of humanity, something about their proportions gives them an insectoid cast. <br /> <br /> These figures are working their forge, drawing forth tools and ornaments of all shapes and sizes from its blazing depths. Works of bronze, tin, silver, and gold abound, and many a worker stands over a gilt anvil rhythmically hammering ruby, sapphire and diamond into red-hot metal. The two rhythms of the hammering join with three strains of horn-like (singing? grunting?) originating from the throats of the workers to produce a hard, bouncing song that sets the pace of the labors.<br /> <br /> Finished works are placed upon massive carts, which are then pushed deeper into the bowels of the earth. Despite seeing dozens of carts shipped down in the moments since your arrival, you have seen nothing come up, save that of a man draped in gaudy silks and copper bangles. <br /> <br /> High above the workers, in front of a massive door of gold, sits a great ruby throne, on which an equally impressively sized gold figure sits. <br /> <br /> (Saffron) <br /> <br /> Your quest into the Wyld, has hitherto been unsuccessful. In fact, you're fairly certain that you're lost. You'd heard tales of a nameless dread in the Far East, a black beast whose songs strike terror in the hearts of all. But that damnedable Guildsman left you to rot in the Wyld after taking your money. Luckily, a small lizard-porcupine whose quills were are swords helpfully pointed you in the right direction. Either it was mistaken or lying, because this golden forge-cavern isn't a city of copper. <br /> <br /> Damn it, you'll never make it to Lost Tarhoun at this rate. <br /> <br /> Taking stock of your situation, you notice a quartet of figures, one in gilt armor, one in silver robes, a third in a ragged and tattered brown cloak, and the last a flamboyantly dressed troubadour atop a backwards goat. They look almost as out of place here as you do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T16:39:48-07:00","id":458486,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Solon takes Jensven's hand and allows himself to be helped to his feet. <br /> <br /> &quot;Luck?&quot; Solon chuckles, his voice still rough from the exertion, &quot;Kokage smiled upon the better warrior.&quot; But he accepts a measure of the accolades from the surrounding warriors. <br /> <br /> As the applause dies down, you hear one of the warriors ask another, &quot;How could he have fought Solon to a standstill? He's a citizen!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;He is a people of the Sun-dog,&quot; Alopekis says with a wide grin.<br /> <br /> &quot;So <i>he's</i> the one that's been causing all the ruckus about the war?&quot; Shock, awe, and a trace of alarm are evident in the speaker's voice.<br /> <br /> &quot;No, that is another Sun-dog person,&quot; Alopekis says, &quot;I saw them both today. They look to be friends.&quot;<br /> <br /> The crowd is awed; they clearly did not expect this. A pregnant silence falls over the salle; perhaps they expect you to speak out in favor of the war effort?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T13:06:02-07:00","id":459304,"title":"","content":"Interesting. Saffron took a moment to consider his actions. A quartet of individuals wandering the Wyld almost certainly wasn't mundane, unless they were to fulfill some tragic story of innocents being crushed by a Wyld-monster or success against all odds. Whatever story it had planned, really. If they were mortal, they might be of use for a little while. If not, allies, perhaps against the Guildsman or the lizard-porcupine.<br /> <br /> <br /> His thoughts were useless, as Saffron's legs had been carrying him towards the band the entire time. He deliberately shifted his gait to light, springing steps, stopping in front of the Wyld-wanderers with an embellished bow that made bangles and beaded locs jangle. &quot;I ask that you forgive my unbecoming boldness, love,&quot; he said, letting them work out for themselves who he meant, &quot;but I'm woefully, pitifully lost.&quot; He glanced at the troubadour, turning on his most winning smile. &quot;Perhaps I could beg your sacred hospitality, love? Travel with you gracious people for a time and offer you my poor services until we must part?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T21:07:16-07:00","id":460648,"title":"","content":"The Dawn looks around the salle at the warriors gathered around. They were expecting him to say something. He had always believed that it is best to tell the truth, especially when people were relying on you to give them guidance of some sort. He sees no reason to not follow that ideal now.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yi is an ally of mine. He fought with me and two others to defend a 'foundry' I believe it is called,&quot; Jensven starts his explanation simply. There is no need to embellish the tale. It has enough impact on its own. &quot;I claimed a kill of one of the Fae creatures. Yi claimed one of their nobles. This strike was the one that caused the Fae to flee the foundry. It also served to defend the life of one of Origenes' daughters and my Shadow here.&quot; He gestures to the dog as this point is mentioned.<br /> <br /> &quot;At dawn, I go with Yi to the Hell Realm. We will return with an item of value to Origenes. I will not ask any of you to go with me.&quot; The Northerner looks over those gathered. &quot;I wish to tell you how good Yi is. The man I believe he is.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I have hammered out shells for large suits of armor that the artificers will animate for the battle ahead. I did this because I have heard of a large Fae force headed this way. There are Novalesk warriors that are fighting these Fae now. I built the armor in order to help them.&quot; The Ascendent Sun pauses for effect. &quot;I intend to go myself and help them with my blade, Cinder.&quot; He touches the blade in question as he speaks it's name. &quot;This is iron. Fae fear it. I know. I had to defend my home from ones and twos of Fae with our clan's reavers. I know what they can do to people. I have seen it. I won't let it happen here.&quot; Another pause for effect. &quot;I will die first.&quot; His gaze falls to the floor and he is quiet for a long moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;I believe Yi would die with me.&quot; A quick glance at Shadow, and Jensven's head snaps up, &quot;I won't ask any of you to go with me there either.&quot; The Bronze Tiger's gaze slowly scans the faces looking at him. &quot;I would be glad of any that would come. I know you know what can happen if the Novalesk Warriors lose. Stay, go to fight, leave here for a safer place. The choice is yours. I will not fault any who won't go to fight. What a test for your strength, to fight the Fae.&quot; A glint of excitement is seen in his eyes and a lupine grin spreads across his face.<br /> <br /> &quot;What do you say, warriors? Will you fight, will you stay here, or will you leave for other lands? The choice is yours. You have my respect any way you choose.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will activate Presence Essence Overwhelming using two (2) personal and two (2) peripheral motes for a total of four (4) motes spent on the activation. This leaves me with ten (10) motes in my personal pool and twenty five (25) motes in my peripheral pool. This allows me to add four (4) dice to my Charisma (3) + Presence (1) roll to attempt to convince these warriors that I am a decent fellow and my judgement of Yi is sound. I will assume a one die stunt and use the reward of two (2) motes to bring my personal pool back up to twelve (12) motes.<br /> <br /> This means my total roll is Charisma (3) + Presence (1) + Excellency (4) + Stunt (1) = Nine (9) dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4808770/\" target=\"_blank\">six successes</a>. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T10:27:37-07:00","id":462416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HeavenlyThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=459304#post459304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting. Saffron took a moment to consider his actions. A quartet of individuals wandering the Wyld almost certainly wasn't mundane, unless they were to fulfill some tragic story of innocents being crushed by a Wyld-monster or success against all odds. Whatever story it had planned, really. If they were mortal, they might be of use for a little while. If not, allies, perhaps against the Guildsman or the lizard-porcupine.<br /> <br /> <br /> His thoughts were useless, as Saffron's legs had been carrying him towards the band the entire time. He deliberately shifted his gait to light, springing steps, stopping in front of the Wyld-wanderers with an embellished bow that made bangles and beaded locs jangle. &quot;I ask that you forgive my unbecoming boldness, love,&quot; he said, letting them work out for themselves who he meant, &quot;but I'm woefully, pitifully lost.&quot; He glanced at the troubadour, turning on his most winning smile. &quot;Perhaps I could beg your sacred hospitality, love? Travel with you gracious people for a time and offer you my poor services until we must part?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <i>Ah great another weirdo,</i> thought Amelia yet in the wyld everything was weird so might as well play along for now. She takes a step toward the stranger in front of them. <br /> <br /> &quot;You wish to travel with us yet you don't offer your name, you are a suspicious stranger and if you wish to come with give us your name and your purpose here ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T07:05:04-07:00","id":463473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=462416#post462416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <i>Ah great another weirdo,</i> thought Amelia yet in the wyld everything was weird so might as well play along for now. She takes a step toward the stranger in front of them. <br /> <br /> &amp;quot;You wish to travel with us yet you don't offer your name, you are a suspicious stranger and if you wish to come with give us your name and your purpose here ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Saffron blinked. Names? Ah, yes, those. Funny how rarely he'd had to learn or give them in this place where archetypes often became all a person was. &quot;My dearest apologies, madam. In my usual line of work, names are usually eschewed. Effusive Saffron Crystal, lover of all Creation, wandering teller of tales, courtesan, dancer without peer, and adventurer at your service. Truly, a thousand pardons, madam sword-saint.&quot; Certainly not mortals, these, not being eager to seize on anything remotely familiar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T16:44:13-07:00","id":465340,"title":"","content":"&quot;This Fae seems to know his proper place, being as genteel as possible,&quot; Tirien says, crossing her bepawed arms,&quot;Where are you headed, Entertainer? Or are you an Eshu?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T08:58:54-07:00","id":466173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=465340#post465340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;This Fae seems to know his proper place, being as genteel as possible,&amp;quot; Tirien says, crossing her bepawed arms,&amp;quot;Where are you headed, Entertainer? Or are you an Eshu?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Fae? So she thought he was raksha? Well, no need to disabuse her now. When they came to blows, as inevitably they would, his capabilities would surprise her. &quot;I was told of a grand metropolis of the finest copper, Moon-Blessed. Magnificent tales have been told of it and I thought perhaps to gather inspiration and spin a few of my own.&quot; Saf tossed his head, setting the shinies within his hair to jingling and glinting in the forge-light. &quot;And yourself? What business could such exotic travelers have in such outlands?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T16:46:12-07:00","id":467972,"title":"","content":"&quot;We are here on a quest to find the legendary city of Moxe-Ulto, said to be lost to the predations of the Wyld. We do it, not only for glory, but to prove our honor to the people of the Vicriuth Geherin,&quot; Tirien says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T21:25:44-07:00","id":468115,"title":"","content":"Saffron batted his lashes at her. &quot;Not only for glory, love? Does anything else really matter? Myself, I find honor overrated. But who are these... Vicriuth Geherin, you said? I'll have to take their name down for my tale.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T12:19:40-07:00","id":470307,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> Several warriors nod in agreement with Jensven's sentiments, though some seem bitter. Most of those in support appear to be those like Solon, who appear to be actual warriors, rather than the others who are more duelists. <br /> <br /> With Jensven's speech concluded, Alopekis trots towards Jensven and Shadow. He motions you to follow him off the dueling floor.<br /> <br /> &quot;Shadow told me he wants his own sword,&quot; the dog-god says, &quot;A short, broad, curving sword. I'm going to get some milk biscuits now. Will you come with?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T12:22:03-07:00","id":470308,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Dero indicates that he thinks this Fae doesn't belong here. It doesn't match the area's aesthetics at all. He indicates that it may be working for the Padishah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T18:22:15-07:00","id":471918,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods and follows after the dog without saying a word. He is curious why some of the warriors would be bitter about the prospect of going to war, but that is a question that he will ask at a later time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T08:33:28-07:00","id":474329,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HeavenlyThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=468115#post468115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saffron batted his lashes at her. &quot;Not only for glory, love? Does anything else really matter? Myself, I find honor overrated. But who are these... Vicriuth Geherin, you said? I'll have to take their name down for my tale.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;you can see them for yourself if you come with us. Tirien we should move, we don't have that much time before we need leave with the Geherin.&quot;<br /> <br /> After taking in the view of the place Amelia will approach one of the worker and gently gesture for his attention, we don't want to get into a fight... at least not right away.<br /> <br /> &quot;I seek Aurem can you take me to him ?.&quot; <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T08:51:01-07:00","id":480280,"title":"","content":"&quot;You may be right, Dero, but what matter does it make? Fae are bound to their narratives. If he is the sultry tempter, then he will die a bloody death like all those who take that role,&quot; Tirien shrugs, &quot;I agree. We must move. What say you, Fae. Will you join us?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T05:00:37-07:00","id":481272,"title":"","content":"Saffron grinned. The mask of the Fae was a beautiful, dangerous thing to wear and the masquerade it accompanied bizarre and deadly. &quot;But of course, love. I'll spin the most fantastic tales from your adventures.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T16:12:23-07:00","id":484935,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> You follow Solon and Alopekis to the bakery the dog-god had mentioned. It is a small but prosperous establishment, run by a young woman in her late twenties or early thirties. She flirts shamelessly with Solon, who is rather flustered by the ordeal. Nevertheless, he purchased a large basket of freshly baked fluffy biscuits. <br /> <br /> Solon takes the basket, and follows Alopekis to a secluded, mildly wooded park. It s surrounded on all sides by large buildings; there is no way that you would have found it without having been led there. Solon, still tired from his fight with Jensven, quickly collapses onto a large, flat stone that his been carved into a rough approximation of a bench. <br /> <br /> Solon feeds Alopekis and Shadow the biscuits, both of whom wolf them down with relish.<br /> <br /> You now have an opportunity to talk to Alopekis and Solon. Otherwise, we can move on so Jensven and Yi can go on thier Malfean Safari.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T17:22:18-07:00","id":484948,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> At mention of Aurem, the workers all cease their labors and singing. A shrill buzz echoes from the throat of the Worker Amelia addressed. Several others join in in an ascending harmony that fills you with apprehension. Those with hammers begin pounding with a heavy staccato beat. The remaining workers start a descending baritone glissando as the figure on the ruby throne descends. <br /> <br /> As it approaches, you see the figure is of the same build, proportions and cast as the workers, but stands over eight feet tall. He is draped in a purple silk toga, and is seemingly made of gold. A too-large toothy grin sits upon his face.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Aurem, knight of Yttrus,&quot; he says, &quot;what wishes to thou of me?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-20T08:54:04-07:00","id":486439,"title":"","content":"Amelia got closer to Aurem facing him with her glowing blade in her hand ready for action, as she introduce herself her caste mark begins to glow brightly through her helmet as she begin to somewhat circle Aurem like a predator circling her prey while looking around the cave keeping the worker in sight.<br /> <br /> &quot;Greeting Aurem, we seek the way to Mox-Ulto, I however, I am here for the mind of Ciprus, will you give it to me ?.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-21T21:20:33-07:00","id":487950,"title":"","content":"The Dawn has a seat next to Shadow and strokes his fur idly, &quot;Dog, why would those warriors not want to fight? It is what they do. If one can fight, why not fight to keep something safe?&quot; His gaze is centered on a middle distance and unfocused. The question hangs and it doesn't seem that Jensven needs an answer. The Northerner seems to be thinking out loud as much as talking to anyone that would hear. He is only half listening, but any answer that is offered will be heard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T15:35:36-07:00","id":507287,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> &quot;Moxe-Ulto?&quot; Aurem says, the toothy grin still resting on his face, &quot;Why seekest thou the dazzling city?&quot; Before you are able to respond he swipes his hand cutting off any potential response, &quot;Ne'ermind. There are more important matters at stake.&quot;<br /> <br /> Aurem points to the great gilded door behind his ruby throne, &quot;Therein lies the item you seek. None, Yea, none save the greatest of kings may open the Way. Since thou wish to aid mine boon companion, were the choice mine, I would open the Way for thee with nary a second thought. Howe'er the mantle of mine kingship hast been stolen away from me, and is hidden deep below. A great and terrible beast guards my scepter and I am forbidden by my oaths to seek it out myself. If thou retrieve mine scepter, I swear upon mine self and nine Heart to aid you in the recovery of Ciprus' mind.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":".  Correcting an error. 05-09-2015, 12:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T16:00:36-07:00","id":507302,"title":"","content":"(Jensven)<br /> <br /> &quot;Because,&quot; Solon says, an uncharacteristic anger seeping into his voice, &quot;They are NOT warriors.&quot;<br /> <br /> Alopekis says nothing, chewing on a crunchy biscuit as Solon continues, his tone bitter, &quot;They're duelists. They make a show of fighting without actually doing it. they're cowards, to afraid to risk their life and limb for any save themselves.&quot;<br /> <br /> Alopekis looks up from his snack and says, &quot;My temple is a place where anyone, man, beast or spirit, can learn to fight. How they use that knowledge is not our place to judge.&quot;<br /> <br /> The dog-spirit's tone is almost sagacious there for a minute.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T19:09:41-07:00","id":507484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=507287#post507287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Wyld)<br /> <br /> &quot;Moxe-Ulto?&quot; Aurem says, the toothy grin still resting on his face, &quot;Why seekest thou the dazzling city?&quot; Before you are able to respond he swipes his hand cutting off any potential response, &quot;Ne'ermind. There are more important matters at stake.&quot;<br /> <br /> Aurem points to the great gilded door behind his ruby throne, &quot;Therein lies the item you seek. None, Yea, none save the greatest of kings may open the Way. Since thou wish to aid mine boon companion, were the choice mine, I would open the Way for thee with nary a second thought. Howe'er the mantle of mine kingship hast been stolen away from me, and is hidden deep below. A great and terrible beast guards my crown, and I am forbidden by my oaths to seek it out myself. If thou retrieve mine scepter, I swear upon mine self and nine Heart to aid you in the recovery of Ciprus' mind.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot;Seems fair, alright you have yourself a deal Aurem I will retrive your scepter but tell me about the beast and why do you have Ciprus mind if he is your friend ?&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T20:35:06-07:00","id":508670,"title":"","content":"Time to stick his nose in where it wasn't wanted. &quot;Yes, love, I was hoping you could answer that as well. By my own heart, I can't stand to have any plot threads left hanging. Leaves the children wondering, you know,&quot; Saffron said, flashing a toothy grin and tossing his gilded head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T09:32:51-07:00","id":509054,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Aurem ignores Saffron, facing Amelia squarely as he says, &quot;Ciprus is forgetful, and lost his mind quite frequently. He put it there himself, afore my mantle was stolen, for safekeeping. After-all, a mind is a terrible thing to waste&quot;. <br /> <br /> &quot;I know little of the guardian beast,&quot; he continues, his grin subsiding a bit, &quot;After Yttrus defeated me and forced me to swear fealty, he bound me with Oaths to not delve deeper into the ground, or to order any of my servants to do so. It was then that he sent down a sacrifice, carrying a wooded egg that was coated with frigid hatred,&quot; Aurem holds his hands about a foot and a half apart and says, &quot;It was nearly spherical, and of about this size. That is all I know.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T10:40:26-07:00","id":509094,"title":"","content":"The Solar considers the words of both of his hosts carefully before formulating his response, &quot;I think they should be free to choose. I will not force them to be warriors. The Fae may not give them that choice. I know they didn't give me that choice back home. Every man able to lift an axe was asked to be always ready. The village could need defending. The reavers went out to raid and a different group of reavers attacked. I had to fight. I picked up my smith's hammer and fought.&quot;<br /> <br /> He pauses while he remembers the events of that day. Eventually, he will stand and Shadow with him, &quot;Thank you for your hospitality, Dog. I will be back with Shadow so we can train later. I must go and help Yi. Maybe with him and the rest we can ensure that those 'duelists' won't be forced to become warriors.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that the Dawn will leave and attempt to find Yi. He realizes it might be as simple as finding the largest crowd in the city.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T10:49:29-07:00","id":509099,"title":"","content":"A vision of Ciprus top head flashes in Amelia's head and chuckles a bit at the mention that he lost his mind (literaly) frequently. &quot;I can see why he would give it to you for safe keeping. Now then who stole your crown and why ? I apologies I know this is a lot of questions but I like to know the facts before going into an underground tunnel to fight a fearsome monster.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-09-2015, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T14:56:08-07:00","id":511183,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> Jensven seeks out to find Yi, using as his guide the levels of commotion in the city. It is scarcely less than an hour later that he finds himself in the midst of a large crowd. They are milling about a large building formed of limestone, bronze and topaz. A massive jeweled worm rises unto the heavens nearby.<br /> <br /> And, as expected, in the midst of it all, is Yi. <br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T15:00:15-07:00","id":511188,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Aurem cocks his head, but his grin deepens, &quot;Ytrrus stole my scepter. He desired mighty vassals, and so bested me in the trials of our people. As a monarch can accept to lord or master, he striped me of the tokens of mine kingship. And that is why he set sentinel a guardian, lest I recover mine mantle and become his vassal no more.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T12:18:23-07:00","id":512197,"title":"","content":"&quot;And should you be his vassal no more what will you do ? From what I understood we will face Yttrus on our journey to Mox-Ulto, I would like to know what will be your intentions after you are free.&quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia turns to her companions &quot;You have no obligation to follow me to face the creature, should you wish to stay behind or continue I will understand.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-12-2015, 03:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T15:50:48-07:00","id":512376,"title":"","content":"Smarting from Aurem's indifference, Saffron didn't hesitate when the swordswoman turned to him and to her other companions. &quot;And miss an adventure worthy of epics, love? Surely not. What little aid this humble one may be of, this one offers.&quot; He shrugged, setting his wrist bangles to jangling as he grinned. &quot;And if I perish tragically, so be it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T21:40:13-07:00","id":513785,"title":"","content":"Jensven skirts the crowd looking for easier paths to get closer to Yi. Shadow follows with him, but is stopped frequently by excited children who absolutely have to pet him. One even exclaims that he is 'SO FLUFFY!' before attempting to ride him. The Dawn appears amused by this and waves away an apology by the embarrassed parents as they retrieve their child. Shadow, for his part appears to be only slightly annoyed, but the antics cause him no harm.<br /> <br /> He will finally approach the new construction and marvel at it. &quot;I have not become used to the large buildings here. Do you know who built this one, Yi?&quot; Jensven continues to look the building over and the canine yawns. Shadow wants to lay down, but does not for fear that he will get jumped on by more of the excited children who are obviously fascinated with a dog like none they have seen before. He contents himself with sitting next to his Exalt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-15T17:35:11-07:00","id":515628,"title":"","content":"&quot;This entire tale reeks of Fae melodrama, but if this sovereign is allied with the Padishah, then striking a blow against him would serve our purposes. Anyways, if he requires a king to open the vaults, then we have a kin in the eyes of Heaven here with us,&quot; Tirien says, crossing her arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T10:45:49-07:00","id":525591,"title":"","content":"The Zenith laughed at the Dawn's question, a little thing rather than one meant for mocking, before spreading his arms to indicate the crowd. &quot;For some reason I suspect you guess the answer. Here are the architects, if you care to question them.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sobers after he makes the statement.<br /> <br /> &quot;In all seriousness, we need to make ready to depart soon. We leave at first light and there are still many supplies to gather. I suspect my new supervisor can be relied upon to provision us, but there are other preparations that must be made.&quot;<br /> <br /> He led his fellow Exalt away from the crowd a ways.<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you know what to expect when we reach the demon city?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-24T20:58:03-07:00","id":527314,"title":"","content":"Jensven nods in silent acknowledgement of Yi's proclamation that the people here were the builders. They had the look of laborers and Yi's words, while hard to follow at times were never false.<br /> <br /> After leaving the crowd behind, the Dawn addresses the question candidly, &quot;I do not know anything of the demon city. I only know of the demons I told you of before, the ones Shadow faced down when the other dogs fled.&quot;<br /> <br /> The canine pricks his ears at the mention of his name, but otherwise makes no other movements. It is apparent he is relieved to be free of the crowd from his relaxed lounging.<br /> <br /> &quot;I had come to you so we could prepare. I have heard demons take as many forms as you can think of and more. I think we will need to be very wary.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T06:09:42-07:00","id":527584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=515628#post515628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;This entire tale reeks of Fae melodrama, but if this sovereign is allied with the Padishah, then striking a blow against him would serve our purposes. Anyways, if he requires a king to open the vaults, then we have a kin in the eyes of Heaven here with us,&quot; Tirien says, crossing her arms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amelia cock her head to the right in interrogation as she looks at the group &quot; A kin in the eyes of heaven huh ? And who would that be Tirien ?&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T17:22:05-07:00","id":529423,"title":"","content":"&quot;I meant &quot;king&quot;, and I mean you, Amelia. You're a king in the eyes of Heaven. Well, that at least is what Master Mejan told me,&quot; Tirien says, crossing her arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T14:20:21-07:00","id":530313,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then listen, and prepare yourself.&quot;<br /> <br /> By now they had reached one of the many sheltered asides in the great garden at the heart of the new temple's great cloister. <br /> <br /> Once they were there a look came over Yi's face, one he had long practiced. He had been a teacher, from time to time, and was not entirely unskilled in that art.<br /> <br /> &quot;I speak now from the account of Narak, who wrote the Brazen Book of Hell; of Shes'a'shes, who compiled the Dozakhzi; and from the glass scrolls of forbidden wisdom that only fools and sages seek.<br /> <br /> Five days we shall travel, as the sky turns black. Five days we shall travel as the moon turns to blood. Five days we shall travel until the green sun rises. Then we shall be in hell. As we pass through the black stone gates we shall be judged. Thrones are set up there, some empty and some filled. Some held by their owners, or the proxies of their owners, and some by pretenders. Do not inquire which is which, for it is a dangerous game they all play.<br /> <br /> If we are found weak, or vulnerable, we will be killed. Each alone makes that judgement. What the lone courtesan on the red beast decides is not binding upon the pack of bloody, chattering apes. Each must be impressed, or each will seek our blood; by spear or club or poisoned drink. We must be ready at once to do great violence and must present no illusions about it.<br /> <br /> When the demons of the threshold see not enough gain by force, for they always take pleasure in pain, they will seek to profit from us in other means. They will ply their trades to us, offering things desired and feared. Secret wants, that you would never dare speak for shame, and hateful secrets that will lie rotting at the center of your heart. They will freely offer cups of the Hegra's wine, yet a single taste and you will be drunk forever. The harlots will offer you strong sons and daughters, delivered that very day, and they speak the truth. Yet they will have their price.<br /> <br /> You could learn from them the devil crafts, to smelt blood and voices into treasures, to string the harp of time or beat your fear into armor. They know all these things and could teach them to you, and your craftsmanship would have no equal on Earth. They will offer you everything you want, and they are able to give it to you.<br /> <br /> That is why you must refuse them. Not because they lie, though they do in a thousand truthful ways, but because they do not. They offer you the easy way, the effortless path, and it leads to damnation. They have no wisdom to offer, save the poisonous wisdom of the indolent. To gain these things without your own effort forever prevents you from earning them. Your spirit with wither, your enlightenment will be stunted, and you will be good for nothing but to while away the ages in decadence.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yi fell silent and his hands thoughtlessly worked through Immaculate mudras; shuni for patient endurance, surya for confidence and industry, and prithvi to resist temptation. It was a perfectly normal and pious habit, for an immaculate, and it gave him something to do with his hands instead of fidget while he considered things he did not say. Then he continued.<br /> <br /> &quot;The nomes of Malfeas are a place of sensation. They will not constantly assault you with a single offer, for the hearts of men are quick to callus. They will feign they care nothing for you, going about their business as though they cared not at all. For all that their actions are unchanged, know that you are always in their hearts. We are not of Hell. The scent of clean air and the flush of the yellow sun are on us. The pearl of envy and self-loathing accrete around the memories of us until we are hateful to them regardless of our deeds. They may show us every courtesy, call us friend genuinely, even love us unrestrainedly. Yet they will always hate us. For they hate themselves and that hate is ever before their eyes until all they see is degraded enough to deserve them.<br /> <br /> There is no calm there, no rest, no peace. Silence is the enemy, flee it if it finds you. Every shadow watches you, never trust them. Sleep is a snare, practice it lightly or not at all. After a fortnight beneath the green sun your throat will feel as though it is full of sand and hot ashes. Yet do not accept even a cup of water, for it is offered to make you receptive. The wealth of Hell is endless, and they are patient. What is a drink, no matter the cost of its import, or ten, or a hundred, or a thousand. If you say yes but once they have traded a a stone for a mountain. No one does anything without seeing their own gain in it. That is the little law of hell.<br /> <br /> The greater law is your shield, that alone which permits us to enter. 'And they be strong, they may do as they will.' is the whole of the Law. We are mighty, princes of the earth. Yet there are things mightier still and many of them dwell in the infernal city. This is another temptation. There are many weaker than you, and you can work your will upon them without consequence. That is a heady drug. They will come to you, and offer themselves to you. They will offer themselves as slaves and sages and soldiers; recognizing your might. Yet that road does not end. Always in Malfeas' gates are those who want what you have and always there are those with things you can take. It is a plane of conquest that does not end, and no ambition is too great beneath the demon sun.&quot;<br /> <br /> He had been a little animate during his lecture, but now he turned toward his fellow Solar. &quot;Please don't dismiss what I just said because it was spoken oddly. I had to memorize much of that verbatim. I haven't been to Malfeas, but I have spoken with those who have. Some of the stories are exaggerated, some fall short of the truth. But all agree, that it is dangerous.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T15:15:06-07:00","id":532378,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> Aurem says nothing in regards to the revelation that Amelia is one of the Sun-Kings of Old. His toothy grin, however, becomes quite hollow. <br /> <br /> [if Amelia or Saffron want to attempt to exercise their rights as the radiant Solar Princes of the Earth, now's your chance. Otherwise...]<br /> <br /> Aurem calls over one of the yellow-stone workers with a series of brassy whistles, and the worker responds in kind. It leads you down the path into the bowels of the Earth. You follow one of the great carts laden with the works of Faen artifice, until it stops suddenly. The workers pushing the cart casually lift it, despite it being several times their combined size even without mass of metal and gemstone within them. They dump their load down a dark shaft, and it spirals out of sight. As they pass you on their way back, they point past the hole, to a large spiral staircase heading down below. <br /> <br /> Descending into the earth reveals the wealth of nations in gemstone, metal and artifice. Coin, weapon, and goods and heaped in massive piles, with neither rhyme nor reason guiding them. No living thing can be seen now.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T10:28:01-07:00","id":534580,"title":"","content":"The Dawn listens intently and silently to the monologue Yi recites. He gives no other sign of emotion save respect for and interest in the wisdom the former Lookshan is imparting to him. The canine yawns and curls up near Jensven as if he believes it is past time to be to sleep.<br /> <br /> The Ascending Sun finally responds after letting the information settle in, &quot;Got it. It is dangerous. Trust no one but you, Cinder, and Shadow. Accept no offers. Only make demands and back those with steel.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you know of any metal that hurts these demons more than others? I don't think Cinder has the power to make a sword of it and I don't have the time. I would like to know, though. Perhaps I could make one after we come back.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T17:23:43-07:00","id":534966,"title":"","content":"Saf, being the greedy little shit he is, smiles widely and wildly. These Fae may not have the tales he seeks, but these will make fine inspiration for tales with which to regale mortals. Tapping the beat to a half-remembered song with his walking staff, he strides forward down the steps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T20:46:31-07:00","id":540480,"title":"","content":"&quot;I see... let's save this discussion for later Tirien we have a guardian to find.&quot; It seemed there was more to this solar thing than Alamass explained though she had decided to depart despite his objection to learn more about her new status before travelling. Maybe it would have been a good thing to have listened now. These thought kept her silent on the way down until she sees the swa of wealth before them. &quot;Tirien is this real ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T23:15:16-07:00","id":543489,"title":"","content":"Yi raised his eyebrow as though surprised.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh no, that attitude would see you and the rest of us dead inside of an hour. I am a poor instructor if that was what you took away.&quot;<br /> <br /> He had expected it, it had been his own first conclusion as well.<br /> <br /> &quot;Consider for a moment what behavior like that would mean. You would become hopelessly lost, unable to accept directions from anyone. You would die of thirst, because not even we can carry enough for both crossings and our time there. Worse, you would eventually give insult to someone to whom steel is no threat.<br /> <br /> No, you must trust. That is the most dangerous part. Rather, you must be cleaver. Remember that there is always an ulterior motive. Always consider what it could be and take steps to protect yourself. You will fail to take all precautions because you cannot anticipate all desires. So you must be prepared for that which you cannot prepare for. Some of these things will be relatively benign. Some, the young or innocent and there are some even in the heart of hell, will only want to spend time in your presence. Some, the lewd and the wanton, will only want to spend time in your presence in the hope that you will seek more. The first will hurt you more than the second, and both may be the chosen weapon of something more devious. In Malfeas, as on the plane of Earth, the best tools are often people. In hell that is always the first recourse.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sighed.<br /> <br /> &quot;The mistake you will make, as will I and everyone who first ventures there, is that Malfeas is the realm of evil. There is no greater error. When you label a thing evil you shape it to conform to a pattern already known to you. You expect certain things from it, react in a certain way to it, believe certain things about it. Malfeas is a place first of strangeness. No conception of evil, no matter how broad, is vast enough to contain it. If you believe it is evil you will blind yourself to the greater portion of it. It is the weakness the dwellers there are most ready to exploit.<br /> <br /> To think it evil gives it a power over you. Malfeas has enough power already to destroy us, it needs no more. There is evil there, I would be the worst sort of fool to say otherwise, but there is also goodness. There are acts so selfless they would earn a mortal divinity. There is compassion so great it would shatter all the minds of men to experience such pity. There is generosity, magnanimity, honor, love, hospitality, and every worthy virtue. Yet always there is something foul mixed in.<br /> <br /> There is a tale... but I have taken up enough time already. I am sorry...&quot;<br /> <br /> Sitting down heavily he finished wearily,<br /> <br /> <i>OOC: If he wants to hear the story</i><br /> &quot;Most likely, I am making things more difficult than they need to be. Most of this never matters to people, except in the ephemera of sorcery when it is vital to know the inconsistencies of the demonic character. Perhaps it is all wrong as well, and I am only fooling myself. In truth I have not been to the Demon City, and speak from the same inexperience in which you question me.<br /> <br /> To answer the easy question, no; there is no metal of special harmfulness to demons. Only sacred arts, such as the Golden Janissaries make use of, or, I suspect, the sun has granted to us are of such use.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;The Sage Humble Before Heaven once heard tell of a pack of the troublemakers in the countryside. They slew livestock, defiled shrines, and carried off men and women to cruel fates. Vowing to deliver the people he hunted them until he came across a canyon of bare rock. A river flowed through and the stone was slick with mist day and night. He found the ruffians there and watched them three days and nights.<br /> <br /> The first night he saw one gnawing on bones until another beat him and stole the cracked and dry morsels. 'Have I not done my share? Did I not slay the fat thing and haul it and its bones here? I have been hungry for fifty days, ever since we came here. Let me eat.' he cried and the one who beat him answered, 'You dog, to speak of fifty days hunger! Speak to me when you have hungered fifty years, since first I crawled from a dirty hole and screamed. I too killed a fat thing and hauled it here, and I had but a mouthful of it. I eat what I will'<br /> <br /> The second night he saw them huddled against themselves and shivering, for the rock was cold and wet and they had no fire. The one who had taken the bone slunk to a pile who clung together for heat and said, 'I am cold, and the nights here are long. Take this morsel and let me share some of your heat.' Instead they beat him, took the bone, and left him on the ground to shiver. When he had recovered a little he said, 'Why did you do that? I would have given it to you, and had said as much. You could have kept me on the outside and had more heat than you do now.' The leader of the bunch said, 'When I joined the boss he beat me bloody every night so that I could barely stand in the morning. When I asked him why he said he would trust me to stand at his back when I could stand there on my own. Offer warmth when you have some to give. Promises are lies you tell yourself first.'<br /> <br /> On the third night they were all very hungry and made to sneak out and do more mischief. The sage met them at the entrance to the canyon. He beat them, one by one, in combat until they lay at his feat begging for mercy. Then he offered them a better way, the peace of the five steps and the security of the community of believers. The people of the region found his body floating down the river with a bone stuck through his chest.<br /> <br /> The troublemakers were demons, some of the Erymanthoi. Do you think the sage a fool to do as he did? I do not need an answer, but think first if they had been humans. Imagine youths raised in violence and poverty, who have never known affection or peace. Would they have been any different? The point is not to feel sorry for demons, but to attempt to understand them. Even the greatest of demon slayers know this, that even the sins of those most deserving of death are balanced, if only the smallest amount, by circumstance. None are wholly evil, even if they cannot be good. The little bit of good can destroy you more easily than all of their evil. Yet it is still good, and to call it otherwise is to demean all that is good everywhere.<br /> <br /> Guard your heart and mind, but do not close them. None can save you then, whether you are in Hell or not.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-08-2015, 03:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T08:56:51-07:00","id":545364,"title":"","content":"Jensven is unable to hide the fact that he is admonished, yet he says nothing and does not interrupt. Nor does he refuse to listen. He knows that having any and all information available about the demon realm will assist him later. He is unlearned in this regard and he realizes he needs to learn about it and fast.<br /> <br /> All through the descriptions and advice his gaze is averted, but he is listening. The Dawn does not nod or give any sign of assent. His only movement is that necessary for the intake of breath, the occasional blink, and a fingering of the hilt of his steel blade. What is readily apparent is that his mind is working feverishly to disseminate the information that is being told to him and reconcile it with the information he already has. In effect, he is rationalizing, comparing, and contrasting in an effort to achieve some level of understanding.<br /> <br /> At the end of the explanation the former smith finally speaks, &quot;You do not need to be sorry, Sun Priest....Sun Brother.&quot; He smiles a little at the second title. &quot;I have time for learning. I almost always do. Time spent making sure you know things, is time spent well.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You should rest. I will. I will be up early and I will get Cinder ready.&quot; As the Bronze Tiger starts to move, the canine jumps up to move with him, &quot;As you can see, Shadow is always ready when I am.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 06-09-2015, 10:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T11:39:50-07:00","id":545585,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> As if in response to Amelia's question, a giant vaguely avian monstrosity crawls over one of the piles of wealth. Supported by the claw-hands at the end of it's half-dozen wings, it stands nearly nine feet tall at the shoulder. Seven emerald orbs gaze from its two heads with alien intelligence and all-consuming hatred. Acid-rime coats its wooded scales and leafy feathers, and drips from the razor-sharp needle-teeth lining its narrow, beaky maws. <br /> <br /> The beast says nothing, and makes no move to attack.<br /> <br /> What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T12:16:59-07:00","id":545613,"title":"","content":"<i>So the prey comes to the hunter then again this is the guardian of this place, maybe they were the prey this time? </i><br /> <br /> Amelia will say nothing at first but fix her gaze on the guardianuntil her voice can be heard. &quot;Can you understand me ?&quot; She is a bit trouble by his appearance his wood nature reminded her of Alamass, even though she went on this little expedition without him, she still missed her friend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 06-08-2015, 07:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T13:12:45-07:00","id":545705,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> [Meanwhile, Elsewhere]<br /> <br /> A mighty citadel of verdigrised copper and rusted iron floats upon a turbulent sea, beneath an ever-raging raging storm. Nestled in the formless void, the towering citadel is a realm of bizarre geometries and physics as alien as the will of the mad exile-king who wrought it from the formless aether. <br /> <br /> The citadel is empty. It has been since its creation. The sole resident of its damned halls are its architect, its king: Baal-Hadad, Sovereign of Sea and Sky.<br /> <br /> Hadad sits upon his throne, a tremendous and terrible chair, as gnarled and twisted as the halls it sits within. Within his hand sits a vitreous glass bowl, filled with a liqueur of earthly make. Though it would pride any manufacturer among mankind, the beverage is cheap to the tongue of one who has drunk deep of the wells of dream and prayer. Occult power thrums within his soul, and mere boundaries of space do not stay his hand or vision. <br /> <br /> Now, he gazes upon a throng of witless manlings as they follow in lock-step behind a child who plays at being a god. He idly runs his hand through his beard, as Yi's warning and parable reach his ear. <br /> <br /> And he laughs. Soon he shall teach this upstart the true shape of the world.<br /> <br /> [Meanwhile, Novalesk]<br /> <br /> (So, end of the day now?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T13:46:42-07:00","id":545735,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> The beast's starboard head bobs up and down once. It <i>could </i>be a nod, perhaps. Maybe. <br /> <br /> While doing so, it situates itself more stably atop the horde of wealth it crawled over.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T16:11:43-07:00","id":545940,"title":"","content":"&quot;I have come for Aurem scepter will you let me take it ? Or will I need to walk over your corpse to take it ? I do not wish to kill you, you serve a master and there is no fault in that but he stands in my way and by extension so do you.&quot; Amelia will begin to walk toward the guardian.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T09:24:56-07:00","id":547144,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> It may be your words, or perhaps that you're advancing on it, but the avian monster before you lets out a frighteningly loud roar with both heads in response.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T18:35:23-07:00","id":547850,"title":"","content":"Saffron plants his staff in front of Amelia, abruptly serious\u2014for him. &quot;Perhaps we should attempt negotation, milady swordswoman? I've no wish to meet such my end now, noble as it would be. It doesn't seem to speak, but I understand that a favor for a favor passes as payment in the grandest of stories.&quot; He looks up at the monster, beaming. &quot;Hello up there, love! You know my companions seek Aurem's scepter. You appear to be a guardian of wealth, so let us make a deal. We take the scepter and in return bring you a piece of treasure of equal worth. And as a bonus, I would include you in my tales forevermore, making your narrative stronger.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-10T11:52:09-07:00","id":549105,"title":"","content":"(Novalesk)<br /> <br /> A new day dawns upon the city of Novalesk. The burning sun-disk rises over the horizon and into the azure heights of the Celestial Vault. <br /> <br /> Larissa laughed at Yi for being adopted by her teenage sister before beginning her evening tasks. <br /> <br /> As per Yi's request, Chancellor Fiero put off summoning one of the Seventy-Beasts-As-One for an evening. Hadad, seemed to know this, and has not arrived to whisk you off to the Demon City. <br /> <br /> So, how will you occupy this last day of preparation before beginning your odyssey?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-10T12:21:04-07:00","id":549144,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> The beast recoils, and the starboard head glances over the port, which tilts it's head quizzically. Clearly, it didn't expect <i>this</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-10T13:43:46-07:00","id":549246,"title":"","content":"Amelia will stay behind Saffron at the ready to step in the front in case things turn ugly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T18:29:11-07:00","id":552432,"title":"","content":"Saffron spreads his arms, letting flame-and-rose-colored silk glint in the faintly gold light of the treasure. His copper wrist bangles glint and chime, appealing to the beast's nature as a guardian of great wealth. His smile, previously wry and mischievous, broadens and seems to take on new qualities of magnanimity, sincerity, and helpfulness. To look at Saffron, one would think that butter wouldn't melt in his mouth. Though his anima remained subdued, he seemed radiant, a creature of splendor and glamour. The Night Caste extended a purely symbolic hand to the avian creature.<br /> <br /> &quot;O great defender of these Wyld riches, we know that it is far beneath you to treat with us. But we also know that you are wise, a being who sees that the great narrative which controls us all will turn in your favor if you aid a heroic quest. You are nigh-forgotten, languishing beneath this earth to protect vast vaults from miscreants who rarely come. This one swears to you by the scepter which we seek that this one and this one's companions are not of such a foul nature. Milady swordswoman is correct in that we have no wish to kill such a noble protector as yourself. Were we the blackguards which you perhaps expect, we would not have any such reservations. The pact which this one proposes to you is one which would raise you to a place unworthy of this menial task. Any mere mortal may spread her name for a time, but we of longer nature know that true greatness comes when one's name and deeds are told of in the lays and legend of every land. This one is an entertainer, nay, a courtesan famed throughout the world and beyond the world. this one can grant you immortality in my ballads and dances. And no doubt we are to encounter artifacts which, though they will no doubt be of lesser quality than that which you guard, may prove adequate for your hoard. When the horde of enemies sure to assault our noble troupe has been beaten off, this one will bring back to you treasures in return for your generosity. All we ask in this moment is Aurem's scepter. Will you grant us this boon?&quot;<br /> <br /> (Much as I'd love to add a spoiler and make this more convenient, I can't find it, so I'll let you know that if the proper roll was Presence+Manipulation+(Presence Specialty)Persuasion+2 stunt dice, I rolled 7 successes. If Presence+Manipulation+(Presence Specialty)Persuasion+Appearance... an improbable 11.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5005,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","user":"HeavenlyThunder","date":".  Added in stunt??? 06-12-2015, 09:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T20:07:26-07:00","id":553678,"title":"","content":"Tirien will strike a pose, and flare her anima, the undulating dragons and dancing marsupial lion adding a flare of majestic light to the display. Using her grace and aplomb to boost her ally's attempts to tame the beast, it just <i>felt </i>right. Deep within her mind, flashes of memories, hazier than the vague recollections of where she left her favorite books back home, <br /> <br /> &quot;Linnsia the Ivory Fang of Sun Clown Ookapaskal's Armored Squad! We meet you, Lady Kestrel's Special Fighting Force, in glorious duel for honor and glory!&quot; she hears, as a vision of a posing pale woman in ostentatious lamellar flashes before her eyes for but a moment.<br /> <br /> [I'll make an assist action to aid Saffron's social attack. Do I need to roll anything?]<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> We making <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ezrbyf6t9mY\" target=\"_blank\"> this happen, Noodle.</a> We doin' this, mang! </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T13:09:04-07:00","id":555956,"title":"","content":"(Wyld)<br /> <br /> The beast squawks and hops off of its perch to another pile, where it sits itself down, shuffling a bit. The starboard head chews its port-front armpit a bit as the port head watches you intently. <br /> <br /> What do? If you want to seek out the scepter in the piles of wealth, make a (Perception + Investigation) roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":